text: ['({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {U}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', 'Afflict 1 (Whenever this creature becomes blocked, defending player loses 1 life.)', "Afflict 2 (Whenever this creature becomes blocked, defending player loses 2 life.)\\nWhenever Eternal of Harsh Truths attacks and isn't blocked, draw a card.", 'Afflict 2 (Whenever this creature becomes blocked, defending player loses 2 life.)\\n{1}{R}: Frontline Devastator gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Afflict 2 (Whenever this creature becomes blocked, defending player loses 2 life.)\\n{2}{B}, Discard a card: Merciless Eternal gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Afflict 3 (Whenever this creature becomes blocked, defending player loses 3 life.)\\nAt the beginning of your postcombat main phase, add {R} for each 1 life your opponents have lost this turn.', 'Afflict 3 (Whenever this creature becomes blocked, defending player loses 3 life.)\\nManticore Eternal attacks each combat if able.', 'Afflict 3 (Whenever this creature becomes blocked, defending player loses 3 life.)\\nWhenever an opponent casts a spell, put a -1/-1 counter on Ammit Eternal.\\nWhenever Ammit Eternal deals combat damage to a player, remove all -1/-1 counters from it.', "Afflict 4 (Whenever this creature becomes blocked, defending player loses 4 life.)\\nWhenever Wildfire Eternal attacks and isn't blocked, you may cast an instant or sorcery spell from your hand without paying its mana cost.", 'All creatures lose indestructible until end of turn. Hour of Devastation deals 5 damage to each creature and each non-Bolas planeswalker.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, put a -1/-1 counter on a creature you control.\\nDestroy target creature.', 'As long as a creature has a -1/-1 counter on it, Tenacious Hunter has vigilance and deathtouch.', 'As long as you control a Desert or there is a Desert card in your graveyard, Sidewinder Naga gets +1/+0 and has trample.', "At the beginning of combat on your turn, you may exile a creature card from your graveyard. If you do, create a token that's a copy of that card, except it's a 4/4 black Zombie. It gains haste until end of turn.", "At the beginning of your upkeep, each opponent loses X life and you scry X, where X is the number of Zombies you control.\\n{2}{U}{B}: Exile target creature card from a graveyard. Create a token that's a copy of it, except it's a 4/4 black Zombie.\\nWhen The Scarab God dies, return it to its owner's hand at the beginning of the next end step.", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, put a -1/-1 counter on Magmaroth.\\nWhenever you cast a noncreature spell, remove a -1/-1 counter from Magmaroth.', "Chandra's Defeat deals 5 damage to target red creature or red planeswalker. If that permanent is a Chandra planeswalker, you may discard a card. If you do, draw a card.", 'Choose one —\\n• Abrade deals 3 damage to target creature.\\n• Destroy target artifact.', 'Choose one —\\n• Counter target spell unless its controller pays {3}.\\n• Look at the top four cards of your library. Put one of them into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.', 'Choose one —\\n• Target opponent exiles a creature they control.\\n• Target opponent reveals their hand. You choose a nonland card from it. Exile that card.', 'Cinder Barrens enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {B} or {R}.', 'Counter target blue spell. If it was a Jace planeswalker spell, scry 2.', 'Counter target spell unless its controller pays {1} for each card in your graveyard.\\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', "Create a 5/4 green Snake creature token. Lands you control don't untap during your next untap step.", "Creatures target opponent controls attack this turn if able. During that player's next untap step, creatures they control don't untap.\\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)", "Creatures you control gain trample until end of turn. (A creature with trample can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)\\nDraw a card.", 'Creatures you control get +2/+2 and gain trample until end of turn.', 'Cycling {B} ({B}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', "Deathtouch\\nWhen Ruin Rat dies, exile target card from an opponent's graveyard.", 'Defender\\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Defender\\n{T}: Wall of Forgotten Pharaohs deals 1 damage to target player or planeswalker. Activate only if you control a Desert or there is a Desert card in your graveyard.', 'Desert of the Fervent enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {R}.\\nCycling {1}{R} ({1}{R}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Desert of the Glorified enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {B}.\\nCycling {1}{B} ({1}{B}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Desert of the Indomitable enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {G}.\\nCycling {1}{G} ({1}{G}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Desert of the Mindful enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {U}.\\nCycling {1}{U} ({1}{U}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Desert of the True enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {W}.\\nCycling {1}{W} ({1}{W}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', "Destroy all creatures. Lands you control don't untap during your next untap step.", 'Destroy target Forest, green enchantment, or green planeswalker. If that permanent was a Nissa planeswalker, draw a card.', 'Destroy target attacking or blocking creature.', 'Destroy target black creature or black planeswalker. If that permanent was a Liliana planeswalker, her controller loses 3 life.', "Double strike\\nEternalize {3}{W}{W} ({3}{W}{W}, Exile this card from your graveyard: Create a token that's a copy of it, except it's a 4/4 black Zombie Cat with no mana cost. Eternalize only as a sorcery.)", "Draw two cards. Then discard a card unless you return a land you control to its owner's hand.", "Enchant creature\\nWhen Desert's Hold enters the battlefield, if you control a Desert or there is a Desert card in your graveyard, you gain 3 life.\\nEnchanted creature can't attack or block, and its activated abilities can't be activated.", "Enchant creature\\nWhen Unquenchable Thirst enters the battlefield, if you control a Desert or there is a Desert card in your graveyard, tap enchanted creature.\\nEnchanted creature doesn't untap during its controller's untap step.", 'Enchant player\\nAt the beginning of each end step, enchanted player mills X cards, where X is the number of cards put into their graveyard from anywhere this turn.', "Enchant player\\nAt the beginning of enchanted player's upkeep, that player loses 3 life unless they sacrifice a nonland permanent or discard a card.", "Enchant player\\nCreatures enchanted player controls lose all abilities and have base power and toughness 1/1.\\nEnchanted player can't activate abilities that aren't mana abilities or loyalty abilities.", 'Equipped creature gets +2/+0 and has afflict 1. (Whenever it becomes blocked, defending player loses 1 life.)\\nEquip {2} ({2}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)', "Eternalize {4}{U}{U} ({4}{U}{U}, Exile this card from your graveyard: Create a token that's a copy of it, except it's a 4/4 black Zombie Human Warrior with no mana cost. Eternalize only as a sorcery.)", "Exile X target creature cards from your graveyard. For each card exiled this way, create a token that's a copy of that card, except it's a 4/4 black Zombie.", 'Exile target creature. If that creature was a God, its controller reveals their hand and exiles all cards from it with the same name as that creature.', "Exile target white creature that's attacking or blocking. If it was a Gideon planeswalker, you gain 5 life.", 'First strike\\n{1}{R}, Discard a card: Burning-Fist Minotaur gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'Flash\\nEnchant creature you control\\nWhen Saving Grace enters the battlefield, all damage that would be dealt this turn to you and permanents you control is dealt to enchanted creature instead.\\nEnchanted creature gets +0/+3.', 'Flash\\nFlying', "Flash\\nFlying\\nCycling {2}{U} ({2}{U}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)\\nWhen you cycle Nimble Obstructionist, counter target activated or triggered ability you don't control.", 'Flying', 'Flying, trample\\nPay 2 life, Sacrifice another creature: Search your library for a card, put that card into your hand, then shuffle.', "Flying, vigilance\\n{2}{W}, {T}: Exile another target creature. Return that card to the battlefield under its owner's control at the beginning of the next end step.\\n{2}{W}, {T}, Exert Angel of Condemnation: Exile another target creature until Angel of Condemnation leaves the battlefield. (An exerted creature won't untap during your next untap step.)", "Flying\\nApocalypse Demon's power and toughness are each equal to the number of cards in your graveyard.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, tap Apocalypse Demon unless you sacrifice another creature.", 'Flying\\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Flying\\nProwess (Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, this creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\\nWhen Bloodwater Entity enters the battlefield, you may put target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard on top of your library.', 'Flying\\nSphinx spells you cast cost {2} less to cast.\\nWhenever Unesh, Criosphinx Sovereign or another Sphinx enters the battlefield under your control, reveal the top four cards of your library. An opponent separates those cards into two piles. Put one pile into your hand and the other into your graveyard.', 'Flying\\nWhen Aven of Enduring Hope enters the battlefield, you gain 3 life.', 'Flying\\nWhenever Aerial Guide attacks, another target attacking creature gains flying until end of turn.', 'Flying\\nWhenever Dauntless Aven attacks, untap target creature you control.', 'Flying\\nWhenever you cast a Bolas planeswalker spell, you may sacrifice Wasp of the Bitter End. If you do, destroy target creature.', 'Flying\\nWhenever you cycle or discard a card, target creature an opponent controls gets -2/-0 until end of turn.', "Flying\\nWhenever you draw a card, create a 1/1 blue and red Insect creature token with flying and haste.\\n{2}{U}{R}: Draw a card, then discard a card.\\nWhen The Locust God dies, return it to its owner's hand at the beginning of the next end step.", 'Flying\\n{3}{G}{U}: You gain 2 life and draw a card.', "Gain control of target artifact, creature, or enchantment. Lands you control don't untap during your next untap step.", "Haste\\nWhen Earthshaker Khenra enters the battlefield, target creature with power less than or equal to Earthshaker Khenra's power can't block this turn.\\nEternalize {4}{R}{R} ({4}{R}{R}, Exile this card from your graveyard: Create a token that's a copy of it, except it's a 4/4 black Zombie Jackal Warrior with no mana cost. Eternalize only as a sorcery.)", "Hexproof (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities your opponents control.)\\nCycling {U} ({U}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)", 'Imminent Doom enters the battlefield with a doom counter on it.\\nWhenever you cast a spell with mana value equal to the number of doom counters on Imminent Doom, Imminent Doom deals that much damage to any target. Then put a doom counter on Imminent Doom.', 'Inferno Jet deals 6 damage to target opponent or planeswalker.\\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Lifelink (Damage dealt by this creature also causes you to gain that much life.)', 'Look at the top three cards of your library. Put one of them into your hand and the rest into your graveyard.', "Majestic Myriarch's power and toughness are each equal to twice the number of creatures you control.\\nAt the beginning of each combat, Majestic Myriarch gains flying until end of turn if you control a creature with flying. The same is true for first strike, double strike, deathtouch, haste, hexproof, indestructible, lifelink, menace, reach, trample, and vigilance.", "Marauding Boneslasher can't block unless you control another Zombie.", 'Menace\\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', "Menace\\nWhenever Dreamstealer deals combat damage to a player, that player discards that many cards.\\nEternalize {4}{B}{B} ({4}{B}{B}, Exile this card from your graveyard: Create a token that's a copy of it, except it's a 4/4 black Zombie Human Wizard with no mana cost. Eternalize only as a sorcery.)", "Menace\\nYou may exert Khenra Scrapper as it attacks. When you do, it gets +2/+0 until end of turn. (An exerted creature won't untap during your next untap step.)", 'Open Fire deals 3 damage to any target.', 'Other Horses you control have indestructible.\\nAt the beginning of each end step, if you gained life this turn, create a 5/5 white Horse creature token.', "Players can't get counters.\\nCounters can't be put on artifacts, creatures, enchantments, or lands.", "Pride Sovereign gets +1/+1 for each other Cat you control.\\n{W}, {T}, Exert Pride Sovereign: Create two 1/1 white Cat creature tokens with lifelink. (An exerted creature won't untap during your next untap step.)", 'Prowess (Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, this creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\\nAfflict 2 (Whenever this creature becomes blocked, defending player loses 2 life.)', "Prowess (Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, this creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\\nThorned Moloch has first strike as long as it's attacking.", 'Puncturing Blow deals 5 damage to target creature. If that creature would die this turn, exile it instead.', 'Put a -1/-1 counter on each of up to two target creatures.', "Put a -1/-1 counter on target creature. Blur of Blades deals 2 damage to that creature's controller.", 'Put three -1/-1 counters on target creature. Its controller loses 3 life unless they sacrifice another nonland permanent or discards a card.', 'Reach\\nWhenever Obelisk Spider deals combat damage to a creature, put a -1/-1 counter on that creature.\\nWhenever you put one or more -1/-1 counters on a creature, each opponent loses 1 life and you gain 1 life.', "Refuse deals damage to target spell's controller equal to that spell's mana value.", 'Repeat the following process X times. Each opponent loses 3 life unless that player sacrifices a nonland permanent or discards a card.', 'Return any number of target permanents you own to your hand.', 'Return target creature card with mana value 2 or less from your graveyard to the battlefield.', "Return target creature to its owner's hand.", "Return target nonland permanent to its owner's hand.", 'Sandblast deals 5 damage to target attacking or blocking creature.', 'Scry 3.', 'Search your library and graveyard for a card named Forest, a card named Brambleweft Behemoth, and a card named Nissa, Genesis Mage. Reveal those cards, put them into your hand, then shuffle.', 'Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.\\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Search your library for a card, put that card into your hand, then shuffle.\\nCycling {B} ({B}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Search your library for up to X creature cards with different names that each have mana value X, reveal them, put them into your hand, then shuffle.', 'Search your library for up to two land cards, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle. Then if you control three or more Deserts, create two 2/2 black Zombie creature tokens.', "Shuffle your library, then exile the top four cards. You may cast any number of spells with mana value 5 or less from among them without paying their mana costs. Lands you control don't untap during your next untap step.", 'Solitary Camel has lifelink as long as you control a Desert or there is a Desert card in your graveyard. (Damage dealt by this creature also causes you to gain that much life.)', 'Struggle deals damage to target creature equal to the number of lands you control.', 'Sunset Pyramid enters the battlefield with three brick counters on it.\\n{2}, {T}, Remove a brick counter from Sunset Pyramid: Draw a card.\\n{2}, {T}: Scry 1.', 'Tap up to two target creatures.\\nCycling {W} ({W}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Target creature gets +1/+0 and gains first strike until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +3/+3 and gains flying until end of turn.\\nWhenever a Zombie enters the battlefield under your control, you may pay {W}. If you do, return Unconventional Tactics from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Target creature gets +3/+3 and gains reach until end of turn.', 'Target creature you control gains indestructible until end of turn. (Damage and effects that say "destroy" don\'t destroy it. If its toughness is 0 or less, it\'s still put into its owner\'s graveyard.)\\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Target creature you control gets +1/+0 until end of turn. It deals damage equal to its power to target creature an opponent controls.', "This spell costs {2} less to cast for each card you've cycled or discarded this turn.\\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)", 'This spell costs {3} less to cast if there are ten or more nonland permanents on the battlefield.\\nDestroy all nonland permanents.', "Trample (This creature can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)", 'Trample\\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', "Trample\\nWhen Sifter Wurm enters the battlefield, scry 3, then reveal the top card of your library. You gain life equal to that card's mana value.", 'Untap target creature. It gets +2/+2 until end of turn and can block an additional creature this turn.', 'Until end of turn, creatures you control gain trample and "Whenever this creature deals combat damage to a player, draw a card."', 'Until end of turn, target creature gains trample and gets +X/+X, where X is the number of creatures you control.', 'Vigilance, reach', 'Vigilance, reach, trample\\nRamunap Hydra gets +1/+1 as long as you control a Desert.\\nRamunap Hydra gets +1/+1 as long as there is a Desert card in your graveyard.', "Vigilance\\nEternalize {4}{W}{W} ({4}{W}{W}, Exile this card from your graveyard: Create a token that's a copy of it, except it's a 4/4 black Zombie Human Cleric with no mana cost. Eternalize only as a sorcery.)", 'Vigilance\\nWhen Djeru, With Eyes Open enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a planeswalker card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.\\nIf a source would deal damage to a planeswalker you control, prevent 1 of that damage.', 'Vile Manifestation gets +1/+0 for each card with cycling in your graveyard.\\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'When Banewhip Punisher enters the battlefield, you may put a -1/-1 counter on target creature.\\n{B}, Sacrifice Banewhip Punisher: Destroy target creature that has a -1/-1 counter on it.', "When Champion of Wits enters the battlefield, you may draw cards equal to its power. If you do, discard two cards.\\nEternalize {5}{U}{U} ({5}{U}{U}, Exile this card from your graveyard: Create a token that's a copy of it, except it's a 4/4 black Zombie Naga Wizard with no mana cost. Eternalize only as a sorcery.)", 'When Chaos Maw enters the battlefield, it deals 3 damage to each other creature.', 'When Crypt of the Eternals enters the battlefield, you gain 1 life.\\n{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Add {U}, {B}, or {R}.', "When Disposal Mummy enters the battlefield, exile target card from an opponent's graveyard.", 'When Feral Prowler dies, draw a card.', 'When Quarry Beetle enters the battlefield, you may return target land card from your graveyard to the battlefield.', "When Resilient Khenra enters the battlefield, you may have target creature get +X/+X until end of turn, where X is Resilient Khenra's power.\\nEternalize {4}{G}{G} ({4}{G}{G}, Exile this card from your graveyard: Create a token that's a copy of it, except it's a 4/4 black Zombie Jackal Wizard with no mana cost. Eternalize only as a sorcery.)", 'When Sand Strangler enters the battlefield, if you control a Desert or there is a Desert card in your graveyard, you may have Sand Strangler deal 3 damage to target creature.', "When Sunscourge Champion enters the battlefield, you gain life equal to its power.\\nEternalize—{2}{W}{W}, Discard a card. ({2}{W}{W}, Discard a card, Exile this card from your graveyard: Create a token that's a copy of it, except it's a 4/4 black Zombie Human Wizard with no mana cost. Eternalize only as a sorcery.)", 'When Visage of Bolas enters the battlefield, you may search your library and/or graveyard for a card named Nicol Bolas, the Deceiver, reveal it, and put it into your hand. If you search your library this way, shuffle.\\n{T}: Add {U}, {B}, or {R}.', 'When Vizier of the Anointed enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a creature card with eternalize or embalm, put that card into your graveyard, then shuffle.\\nWhenever you activate an eternalize or embalm ability, draw a card.', 'When Wretched Camel dies, if you control a Desert or there is a Desert card in your graveyard, target player discards a card.', "Whenever Gilded Cerodon attacks, if you control a Desert or there is a Desert card in your graveyard, target creature can't block this turn.", "Whenever Graven Abomination attacks, exile target card from defending player's graveyard.", "Whenever a creature with a -1/-1 counter on it dies, draw a card.\\n{1}{B}{R}: Put a -1/-1 counter on another target creature.\\nWhen The Scorpion God dies, return it to its owner's hand at the beginning of the next end step.", 'Whenever another Zombie enters the battlefield under your control, Mummy Paramount gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Whenever you cast a blue, black, or red spell, you gain 1 life.', 'Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, Firebrand Archer deals 1 damage to each opponent.', 'Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, you may have Riddleform become a 3/3 Sphinx creature with flying in addition to its other types until end of turn.\\n{2}{U}: Scry 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put that card on the bottom of your library.)', 'Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, you may copy that spell. You may choose new targets for the copy.', "Whenever you cycle or discard a card, Cunning Survivor gets +1/+0 until end of turn and can't be blocked this turn.", 'Whenever you cycle or discard a card, Grisly Survivor gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'Woodland Stream enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {G} or {U}.', 'You gain 4 life. If a creature died this turn, you gain 8 life instead.', "You may cast spells that have a cycling ability from your graveyard.\\nIf a card that has a cycling ability would be put into your graveyard from anywhere and it wasn't cycled, exile it instead.", "You may exert Oketra's Avenger as it attacks. When you do, prevent all combat damage that would be dealt to it this turn. (An exerted creature won't untap during your next untap step.)", "You may exert Resolute Survivors as it attacks. (It won't untap during your next untap step.)\\nWhenever you exert a creature, Resolute Survivors deals 1 damage to each opponent and you gain 1 life.", "You may exert Rhonas's Stalwart as it attacks. When you do, it gets +1/+1 until end of turn and can't be blocked by creatures with power 2 or less this turn. (An exerted creature won't untap during your next untap step.)", "You may exert Vizier of the True as it attacks. (It won't untap during your next untap step.)\\nWhenever you exert a creature, tap target creature an opponent controls.", 'You may play lands from your graveyard.', "Your life total becomes equal to your starting life total. Lands you control don't untap during your next untap step.", '[+1]: Up to one target creature gains double strike until end of turn.\\n[−2]: Samut, the Tested deals 2 damage divided as you choose among one or two targets.\\n[−7]: Search your library for up to two creature and/or planeswalker cards, put them onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', '[+2]: Target opponent exiles cards from the top of their library until they exile a nonland card. Until end of turn, you may cast that card without paying its mana cost.\\n[+1]: Each opponent exiles two cards from their hand.\\n[−4]: Nicol Bolas, God-Pharaoh deals 7 damage to target opponent, creature an opponent controls, or planeswalker an opponent controls.\\n[−12]: Exile each nonland permanent your opponents control.', '[+2]: Untap up to two target creatures and up to two target lands.\\n[−3]: Target creature gets +5/+5 until end of turn.\\n[−10]: Look at the top ten cards of your library. You may put any number of creature and/or land cards from among them onto the battlefield. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.', '[+3]: Each opponent loses 3 life unless that player sacrifices a nonland permanent or discards a card.\\n[−3]: Destroy target creature. Draw a card.\\n[−11]: Nicol Bolas, the Deceiver deals 7 damage to each opponent. You draw seven cards.', "{1}, Sacrifice Traveler's Amulet: Search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.", '{1}, Tap an untapped Desert you control: You gain 1 life.', '{1}, {T}: Exile target card from a graveyard.\\n{1}, Exile Crook of Condemnation: Exile all graveyards.', "{1}, {T}: Untap target land.\\n{1}, {T}, Exert Hope Tender: Untap two target lands. (An exerted creature won't untap during your next untap step.)", '{1}{B}: Target attacking Zombie gains indestructible until end of turn. (Damage and effects that say "destroy" don\'t destroy it. If its toughness is 0 or less, it\'s still put into its owner\'s graveyard.)', '{1}{G}: Frilled Sandwalla gets +2/+2 until end of turn. Activate only once each turn.', '{1}{W}: Target attacking Zombie gains lifelink until end of turn.\\n{1}{B}: Target attacking Zombie gains deathtouch until end of turn.', '{2}: Mirage Mirror becomes a copy of target artifact, creature, enchantment, or land until end of turn.', '{4}{G}: Target creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', '{4}{R}: Zealot of the God-Pharaoh deals 2 damage to target opponent or planeswalker.', "{T}, Exert Steward of Solidarity: Create a 1/1 white Warrior creature token with vigilance. (An exerted creature won't untap during your next untap step.)", '{T}: Add one mana of any color.', "{T}: Add one mana of any color.\\n{T}, Exert Oasis Ritualist: Add two mana of any one color. (An exerted creature won't untap during your next untap step.)", '{T}: Add {C}.\\nWhen Dunes of the Dead is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token.', "{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}, Exile a land card from your graveyard: Hostile Desert becomes a 3/4 Elemental creature until end of turn. It's still a land.", '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifice a Desert: Exile all graveyards.', "{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Exile target creature you control.\\n{4}, {T}, Sacrifice Endless Sands: Return each creature card exiled with Endless Sands to the battlefield under its owner's control.", '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}, Pay 1 life: Add {B}.\\n{2}{B}{B}, {T}, Sacrifice a Desert: Put two -1/-1 counters on target creature an opponent controls. Activate only as a sorcery.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}, Pay 1 life: Add {G}.\\n{1}{G}{G}, {T}, Sacrifice a Desert: Target creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn. Activate only as a sorcery.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}, Pay 1 life: Add {R}.\\n{2}{R}{R}, {T}, Sacrifice a Desert: Ramunap Ruins deals 2 damage to each opponent.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}, Pay 1 life: Add {U}.\\n{1}{U}, {T}, Sacrifice a Desert: Target player mills four cards.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}, Pay 1 life: Add {W}.\\n{2}{W}{W}, {T}, Sacrifice a Desert: Creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn. Activate only as a sorcery.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}, Tap an untapped creature you control: Add one mana of any color.', '{T}: Add {G} or {U}. If you control a Nissa planeswalker, you gain 2 life.', "{T}: Fervent Paincaster deals 1 damage to target player or planeswalker.\\n{T}, Exert Fervent Paincaster: It deals 1 damage to target creature. (An exerted creature won't untap during your next untap step.)", '{U}, {T}, Discard a card: Target player mills three cards.', "{U}: Sinuous Striker gets +1/-1 until end of turn.\\nEternalize—{3}{U}{U}, Discard a card. ({3}{U}{U}, Discard a card, Exile this card from your graveyard: Create a token that's a copy of it, except it's a 4/4 black Zombie Naga Warrior with no mana cost. Eternalize only as a sorcery.)"]
flavor: ['"All can\'t be lost. Nissa has shown me that."', '"All the power you have gathered for yourself, Liliana, I can take away."\\n—Nicol Bolas', '"Bolas remade this place in his image. He has the advantage here. We must approach carefully."\\n—Jace Beleren', '"Bolas\'s power on this plane can\'t be absolute. Look around you."\\n—Nissa Revane', '"Everyone here is a honed fighter. We\'ll respond the only way we know how."', '"Everything here exists or perishes at my whim. Including you, Gatewatch."\\n—Nicol Bolas', '"Fire? Is that your only trick, Chandra?"\\n—Nicol Bolas', '"Forward! Until the horizon is ours!"\\n—Khemses, charioteer', '"Gideon, how easy it must be to play the protector when you think yourself untouchable. How wrong you are."\\n—Nicol Bolas', '"Give me some room."', '"I do as I choose with what is mine. And it is all mine."\\n—Nicol Bolas', '"I had hoped for more from you, Jace. But I expected as much."\\n—Nicol Bolas', '"I was promised an afterlife, not this. Samut was right. The God-Pharaoh lied."\\n—Djeru, former Tah-crop initiate', '"If I die, it will not be alone."', '"If creating the Eternals was Bolas\'s plan here, what is his plan for the Eternals?"\\n—Jace Beleren', '"If you believe the God-Pharaoh tests you, charge with me to prove yourself. If you believe he betrayed us all, join with me to fight for tomorrow!"\\n—Samut, former Tah-crop initiate', '"It appears some mummies have begun to observe a hierarchy all their own."\\n—Elekh, vizier of embalming', '"It is evidence that some pure corner of the world must still exist."\\n—Djeru, former Tah-crop initiate', '"It\'s a cruel thing to give such a sad song to such a colorful creature."\\n—Sana, former Ahn-crop initiate', '"It\'s not wise to keep glory waiting."', '"It\'s only the end if we allow it."', '"Kefnet taught us to turn obstacles into advantages."\\n—Neponem, vizier of Kefnet', '"My work here is complete. The people have done everything required of them."\\n—Nicol Bolas', '"Neither the false God-Pharaoh nor his bugs will decide our fate."\\n—Samut, former Tah-crop initiate', '"Oketra\'s arrow is my spear, and her love my shield."', '"On every plane, there are those who run toward danger."\\n—Gideon Jura', '"Our best chance against the Eternals will be tactics they\'ve never seen and styles they\'ve never trained in."', '"Remember, brother, the eyes are always vulnerable."\\n"I never forgot."', '"Respect is earned through deeds—or the capacity to bite someone in half."\\n—Sana, former Ahn-crop initiate', '"Rhonas\'s monument belongs to the wurms now. Look elsewhere for refuge."\\n—Arnun, vizier of the menagerie', '"Spent a lifetime learning from predators. Picked up a few tricks."', '"That one\'s not mine. Run!"\\n—Nissa Revane', '"The blood ritual is complete. The end approaches."', '"The ruin of the past is the topsoil of the future."\\n—Sokar, former Nef-crop initiate', '"The soul of this world is gone, Nissa, and I would gladly kill it again."\\n—Nicol Bolas', '"The truth? It\'s been here all along. The Hours as we understood them are lies."', '"There is no afterlife. Not for me, and not for you. So think again before getting in my way."', '"There is no tomorrow, so hold nothing back."', '"They were once our brothers and sisters."\\n—Etha, former Rhet-crop initiate', '"This is the final trial! Rejoice, for the God-Pharaoh soars among us!"', '"This is what glory looks like."\\n—Nicol Bolas', '"This place has outlived its usefulness."\\n—Nicol Bolas', '"This storm will calm. We must believe that."', '"This world was once so much more than the confines of Naktamun."', '"Those who embrace the harsh land rather than fight it find they have a powerful ally."\\n—Nissa Revane', '"Though the afterlife, the city, and even the God-Pharaoh himself were one great deception, the ideals championed by the gods remain true."\\n—Djeru, former Tah-crop initiate', '"We are crops no longer. Reap elsewhere."', '"We are no longer in control."\\n—Elekh, vizier of embalming', '"We have to get out of the city, Djeru. All of us! Gather as many as you can."\\n—Samut, former Tah-crop initiate', '"What greater testament can there be to Rhonas\'s lessons?"', '"What will happen to us?" they asked. The vizier paused. "I think . . . I think that\'s up to us now."', '"When the whole world is crazy, it\'s important to find something you can rely on."', '"Why wander in search of a new home when the path is laid out before you?"\\n—Pytamun, former Nef-crop initiate', '"Your God-Pharaoh has returned."', 'A word of vengeance, and her arrows awaken in flame.', 'Although long since dead, the banished dissenters finally took their vengeance.', "Amonkhet's desiccated land thirsts for blood.", 'As the Second Sun glided into its final position in the sky, a chorus of wings sounded to herald the return of Nicol Bolas.', 'Before the monuments, before the first trials, before Naktamun itself, Bolas culled the plane of its adults in order to rebuild it for his own designs.', 'Buildings crumbled and monuments fell. The river bled and the sky wept tears of fire. All the while, servants silently continued their work, oblivious to it all.', 'Decades to build. Hours to demolish.', 'Deserts are inhospitable, not uninhabitable.', "For many years, servant mummies toiled in the mines to extract lazotep. The emergence of the Eternals revealed the sacred substance's true purpose.", 'From every shadow came the dull scratch of teeth on bones.', 'In his final moments, Kefnet reached into the minds of those around him, desperate for logic within the consuming chaos.', 'In the chaos brought by the new gods, swift-winged aven served as pathfinders, leading the last of the people away from the ruins of Naktamun.', 'In the first moments, the gate to the afterlife opened, and the people were prostrate in the light of the God-Pharaoh.', 'In the midst of disaster, heroic acts became almost ordinary, and ordinary warriors became heroes.', 'Initiates once believed defeat was the worst fate possible—a sentiment they quickly abandoned.', 'Initiates who had been through the Trial of Knowledge learned to see everything as pieces of a larger puzzle.', 'Ironically, the statues had been constructed as a warning.', "It basks atop the rubble of Rhonas's monument, which still pulses with latent power.", 'Life will find a way, or it will make one.', 'Like a carpet unrolling for their god, the scarabs poured out from the necropolis.', "Liliana always knew Jace's illusions would come in handy.", 'Liliana insisted on coming to Amonkhet to confront one of the two remaining demons to whom she is bound.', 'Most mirrors show your reflection. Others show your potential.', 'No cartouches to earn. No afterlife to enter. Only the glory of a well-struck blow and the growing pile of felled enemies at her feet.', 'Once favored companions, many cats were left to fend for themselves.', 'Outnumbered, but not outmatched.', 'Perfectly adapted to cross the wastes in life, they bring the wastes with them in death.', 'Rhonas continued to fight until his last breath and even beyond.', "Samut battled her way through the hordes, shouting the names of those who'd died in her crop and those she hoped yet to save.", 'Sand into glass and flesh into ash—such are the markers of its domain.', 'She trusts that the potent poisons of her darts will reach the enemy before the enemy reaches her.', 'Skills mastered by initiates are preserved within cartouches, so Eternals remain adept at their preferred combat styles.', 'Some khenra archers fashion their arrows with a personal touch.', 'Some refused to leave their shattered homes, vowing to rebuild at any cost.', 'The Curse of Wandering permeated Amonkhet long before Nicol Bolas. He simply harnessed it.', 'The Eternals had long since mastered every technique taught during the trials.', "The God-Pharaoh's angels stripped former initiates of their cartouches and the fortifying magic they provided.", "The God-Pharaoh's benevolence concealed the factory he created to produce an army of Eternals.", "The God-Pharaoh's most devoted took it upon themselves to follow his example.", "The Locust God's children were numberless, relentlessly eating away every trace of the city's protection.", "The Scorpion God's sting sends venom strong enough to poison blood, bone, and spirit.", 'The angels did not deceive. From the start, they were clear their allegiance was to the God-Pharaoh and to him alone.', 'The arrival of the God-Pharaoh marked a betrayal of both gods and mortals.', 'The banished have come home to roost.', 'The bombardment of sand disorients, chokes, and ultimately tenderizes its prey.', 'The crocodiles of the Broken Lands, long used to feeding on undead flesh, eagerly flooded into Naktamun for a taste of something fresher.', 'The dead entered as worthy. They exited as Eternals.', 'The dead that swept across Naktamun came in all shapes and sizes.', 'The denizens of the Luxa River woke angry on the currents of blood.', 'The desert had once been a place of endless horror. It was now the last refuge as the city of Naktamun fell.', 'The desert is a voracious beast, devouring both flesh and stone.', "The destruction of Rhonas's monument released his collection upon the city.", 'The embodiment of yearning, forever drifting the deserts to find what had once made it whole.', "The food chain doesn't end at sandwurms.", 'The glyphs writhed and twisted, spewing out dark, vengeful magic.', 'The gods of the trials also faced the opportunity to prove themselves worthy.', 'The minotaur stared at the Eternal bearing down on him—the embodiment of deadly skill he had aspired to become.', 'The plating of its horns is a token of honor from Hazoret, who favors creatures with great hearts.', 'The sands of Amonkhet can be as much a boon as a bane. It depends entirely on which way the wind blows.', 'The sphinxes began to speak only after the Second Sun aligned. They whispered dire warnings, though no one listened.', "There were those who saw the death of the gods and the city's collapse as a final test of worth. Some believed it meant the God-Pharaoh had been killed. Only a few realized they had been deceived.", 'Those who fled the destruction of the city stumbled into the territory of their prickly neighbors.', 'Those wound tightest are first to unravel.', "Though Kefnet's followers feverishly searched his last words for some final riddle, they found only the gurgles of a dying god.", "Though buried and muffled, nature's whisper still called to Nissa.", 'To serve as an Eternal is the afterlife granted to the worthy.', 'To the end, all Oketra did was for others.', "To the last, Bontu wanted only to be first among the God-Pharaoh's subjects.", 'When Rhonas fell, his followers stirred with newfound strength—a final gift from a god they thought indomitable.', 'When the last scrap of flesh is scoured away, the Curse of Wandering ends. Then the dead may sleep.', "While most Eternals were initiates who completed the trials, Bolas had plans for some of Amonkhet's other denizens.", 'With the Hekma breached and its protection removed, the deserts swept in.', 'With the Hekma destroyed, the wandering dead that sought entrance to Naktamun had free rein to lay waste to the city.', 'Without the viziers to oversee their actions, some anointed went to extreme lengths to fulfill their directives.', 'Yell for help, and that may answer.']
artist: ['Aaron Miller', 'Adrian Majkrzak', 'Alayna Danner', 'Aleksi Briclot', 'Alex Konstad', 'Anna Steinbauer', 'Anthony Palumbo', 'Bastien L. Deharme', 'Ben Maier', 'Ben Wootten', 'Bram Sels', 'Chris Rahn', 'Chris Rallis', 'Christine Choi', 'Clint Cearley', 'Craig J Spearing', 'Daarken', 'Dan Murayama Scott', 'Daniel Ljunggren', 'Darek Zabrocki', 'David Palumbo', 'E. M. Gist', 'Eric Deschamps', 'Even Amundsen', 'Filip Burburan', 'Florian de Gesincourt', 'Gabor Szikszai', 'Greg Opalinski', 'Grzegorz Rutkowski', 'Howard Lyon', 'Igor Kieryluk', 'Izzy', 'Jakub Kasper', 'James Paick', 'James Ryman', 'Jason A. Engle', 'Jason Felix', 'Jason Kang', 'Jason Rainville', 'Jeremy Wilson', 'Jesper Ejsing', 'Johann Bodin', 'John Stanko', 'Jonas De Ro', 'Joseph Meehan', 'Josh Hass', 'Josu Hernaiz', 'Jung Park', 'Karl Kopinski', 'Kev Walker', 'Kieran Yanner', 'Lars Grant-West', 'Lius Lasahido', 'Lucas Graciano', 'Magali Villeneuve', 'Marco Nelor', 'Mark Behm', 'Mark Poole', 'Mark Zug', 'Mathias Kollros', 'Matt Stewart', 'McLean Kendree', 'Mike Bierek', 'Mike Burns', 'Min Yum', 'Nils Hamm', 'Noah Bradley', 'Piotr Jabłoński', 'Randy Vargas', 'Raymond Swanland', 'Richard Wright', 'Ryan Alexander Lee', 'Ryan Pancoast', 'Ryan Yee', 'Sara Winters', 'Scott Murphy', 'Seb McKinnon', 'Shreya Shetty', 'Sidharth Chaturvedi', 'Simon Dominic', 'Slawomir Maniak', 'Steve Argyle', 'Steven Belledin', 'Svetlin Velinov', 'Titus Lunter', 'Tomasz Jedruszek', 'Tommy Arnold', 'Tyler Jacobson', 'Victor Adame Minguez', 'Viktor Titov', 'Volkan Baǵa', 'Winona Nelson', 'YW Tang', 'Yeong-Hao Han', 'Yohann Schepacz', 'Yongjae Choi', 'Zack Stella', 'Zezhou Chen', 'Zoltan Boros']
