rulings: ["[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If there are fewer than three cards in your library, you look at all of them, put one of them into your hand, and put the rest into your graveyard.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2012-07-01\', \'text\': "Giving a creature first strike after creatures with first strike deal combat damage doesn\'t prevent that creature from dealing combat damage."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "A spell with aftermath cast from a graveyard will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, it\'s countered, or it leaves the stack in some other way."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "All split cards have two card faces on a single card, and you put a split card onto the stack with only the half you\'re casting. The characteristics of the half of the card you didn\'t cast are ignored while the spell is on the stack. For example, if an effect prevents you from casting green spells, you can cast Destined of Destined // Lead, but not Lead."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'Each split card has two names. If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose one, but not both.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Each split card is a single card. For example, if you discard one, you\'ve discarded one card, not two. If an effect counts the number of instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard, Destined // Lead counts once, not twice."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from a graveyard, you may cast either half. If you cast the half that has aftermath, you\'ll exile the card if it would leave the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from any zone other than a graveyard, you can\'t cast the half with aftermath."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If you cast the first half of a split card with aftermath during your turn, you\'ll have priority immediately after it resolves. You can cast the half with aftermath from your graveyard before any player can take any other action if it\'s legal for you to do so."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Split cards with aftermath have a new frame treatment—the half you can cast from your hand is oriented the same as other cards you\'d cast from your hand, while the half you can cast from your graveyard is a traditional split card half. This frame treatment is for your convenience and has no rules significance."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "While not on the stack, the characteristics of a split card are the combination of its two halves. For example, Destined // Lead is a green and black card, it is both an instant card and a sorcery card, and its mana value is 6. This means that if an effect allows you to cast a card with mana value 2 from your hand, you can\'t cast Destined. This is a change from the previous rules for split cards."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'If a player has no cards in their graveyard when Survive resolves, that player just shuffles their library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Once you\'ve started to cast a spell with aftermath from your graveyard, the card is immediately moved to the stack. Opponents can\'t try to stop the ability by exiling the card with an effect such as that of Crook of Condemnation."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Desert is a land subtype with no special meaning. It doesn\'t grant the land an intrinsic mana ability. Other cards may care about which lands are Deserts."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Dunes of the Dead\'s second ability doesn\'t allow you to sacrifice it whenever you\'d like. You must find another way to get Dunes of the Dead into the graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "If you sacrifice Dunes of the Dead to pay the activation cost of an ability, you\'ll create the Zombie token before that activated ability resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Desert is a land subtype with no special meaning. It doesn\'t grant the land an intrinsic mana ability. Other cards may care about which lands are Deserts."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "If Hostile Desert becomes a creature the same turn it enters the battlefield, you can\'t attack with it or tap it for mana."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Desert is a land subtype with no special meaning. It doesn\'t grant the land an intrinsic mana ability. Other cards may care about which lands are Deserts."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'If a Desert has an ability with a cost of "Sacrifice a Desert," you can sacrifice that Desert to pay the cost for its own ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'The sacrificed Desert will be in your graveyard to be exiled by the last ability of Scavenger Grounds.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Desert is a land subtype with no special meaning. It doesn\'t grant the land an intrinsic mana ability. Other cards may care about which lands are Deserts."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'If a Desert has an ability with a cost of "Sacrifice a Desert," you can sacrifice that Desert to pay the cost for its own ability.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Desert is a land subtype with no special meaning. It doesn\'t grant the land an intrinsic mana ability. Other cards may care about which lands are Deserts."}]', "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'A spell with aftermath cast from a graveyard will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, it’s countered, or it leaves the stack in some other way.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'All split cards have two card faces on a single card, and you put a split card onto the stack with only the half you’re casting. The characteristics of the half of the card you didn’t cast are ignored while the spell is on the stack. For example, if an effect prevents you from casting green spells, you can cast Destined of Destined // Lead, but not Lead.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Each split card has two names. If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose one, but not both.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Each split card is a single card. For example, if you discard one, you’ve discarded one card, not two. If an effect counts the number of instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard, Destined // Lead counts once, not twice.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from a graveyard, you may cast either half. If you cast the half that has aftermath, you’ll exile the card if it would leave the stack.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from any zone other than a graveyard, you can’t cast the half with aftermath.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If you cast the first half of a split card with aftermath during your turn, you’ll have priority immediately after it resolves. You can cast the half with aftermath from your graveyard before any player can take any other action if it’s legal for you to do so.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Split cards with aftermath have a new frame treatment—the half you can cast from your hand is oriented the same as other cards you’d cast from your hand, while the half you can cast from your graveyard is a traditional split card half. This frame treatment is for your convenience and has no rules significance.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'While not on the stack, the characteristics of a split card are the combination of its two halves. For example, Destined // Lead is a green and black card, it is both an instant card and a sorcery card, and its converted mana cost is 6. This means that if an effect allows you to cast a card with converted mana cost 2 from your hand, you can’t cast Destined. This is a change from the previous rules for split cards.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Cooperate can copy any instant or sorcery spell, not just one with targets.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, include the value chosen for that X when determining the converted mana cost of that spell.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If the spell has damage divided as it was cast (like Chandra’s Pyrohelix), the division can’t be changed (although the targets receiving that damage still can).'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If the spell that’s copied has an X whose value was determined as it was cast (like Torment of Hailfire does), the copy will have the same value of X.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If the spell that’s copied is modal (that is, it says “Choose one —” or the like), the copy will have the same mode. A different mode can’t be chosen.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If you copy a spell, you control the copy. It will resolve before the original spell does.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Once you’ve started to cast a spell with aftermath from your graveyard, the card is immediately moved to the stack. Opponents can’t try to stop the ability by exiling the card with an effect such as that of Crook of Condemnation.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'The controller of a copy can’t choose to pay any alternative or additional costs for the copy. However, effects based on any alternative or additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'The copy is created on the stack, so it’s not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'The copy will have the same targets as the spell it’s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, you can’t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal).'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'A spell with aftermath cast from a graveyard will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, it’s countered, or it leaves the stack in some other way.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'All split cards have two card faces on a single card, and you put a split card onto the stack with only the half you’re casting. The characteristics of the half of the card you didn’t cast are ignored while the spell is on the stack. For example, if an effect prevents you from casting green spells, you can cast Destined of Destined // Lead, but not Lead.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Each split card has two names. If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose one, but not both.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Each split card is a single card. For example, if you discard one, you’ve discarded one card, not two. If an effect counts the number of instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard, Destined // Lead counts once, not twice.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from a graveyard, you may cast either half. If you cast the half that has aftermath, you’ll exile the card if it would leave the stack.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from any zone other than a graveyard, you can’t cast the half with aftermath.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If you cast the first half of a split card with aftermath during your turn, you’ll have priority immediately after it resolves. You can cast the half with aftermath from your graveyard before any player can take any other action if it’s legal for you to do so.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Split cards with aftermath have a new frame treatment—the half you can cast from your hand is oriented the same as other cards you’d cast from your hand, while the half you can cast from your graveyard is a traditional split card half. This frame treatment is for your convenience and has no rules significance.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'While not on the stack, the characteristics of a split card are the combination of its two halves. For example, Destined // Lead is a green and black card, it is both an instant card and a sorcery card, and its converted mana cost is 6. This means that if an effect allows you to cast a card with converted mana cost 2 from your hand, you can’t cast Destined. This is a change from the previous rules for split cards.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Driven and Despair each affect only creatures you control at the time it resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won’t gain the keyword ability or the triggered ability.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If you resolve multiples of Driven or of Despair in one turn, your creatures have that many instances of the appropriate triggered ability. Each instance triggers separately.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Multiple instances of trample or menace are redundant.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Once you’ve started to cast a spell with aftermath from your graveyard, the card is immediately moved to the stack. Opponents can’t try to stop the ability by exiling the card with an effect such as that of Crook of Condemnation.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'A spell with aftermath cast from a graveyard will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, it’s countered, or it leaves the stack in some other way.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'All split cards have two card faces on a single card, and you put a split card onto the stack with only the half you’re casting. The characteristics of the half of the card you didn’t cast are ignored while the spell is on the stack. For example, if an effect prevents you from casting green spells, you can cast Destined of Destined // Lead, but not Lead.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Each split card has two names. If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose one, but not both.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Each split card is a single card. For example, if you discard one, you’ve discarded one card, not two. If an effect counts the number of instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard, Destined // Lead counts once, not twice.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from a graveyard, you may cast either half. If you cast the half that has aftermath, you’ll exile the card if it would leave the stack.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from any zone other than a graveyard, you can’t cast the half with aftermath.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If you cast the first half of a split card with aftermath during your turn, you’ll have priority immediately after it resolves. You can cast the half with aftermath from your graveyard before any player can take any other action if it’s legal for you to do so.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Split cards with aftermath have a new frame treatment—the half you can cast from your hand is oriented the same as other cards you’d cast from your hand, while the half you can cast from your graveyard is a traditional split card half. This frame treatment is for your convenience and has no rules significance.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'While not on the stack, the characteristics of a split card are the combination of its two halves. For example, Destined // Lead is a green and black card, it is both an instant card and a sorcery card, and its converted mana cost is 6. This means that if an effect allows you to cast a card with converted mana cost 2 from your hand, you can’t cast Destined. This is a change from the previous rules for split cards.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'For Believe, you put the top card of your library into your hand if you don’t put it onto the battlefield for any reason, whether it’s not a creature card or whether you just didn’t want to put it onto the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If you don’t put the top card of your library onto the battlefield, you don’t reveal it before putting it into your hand.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Once you’ve started to cast a spell with aftermath from your graveyard, the card is immediately moved to the stack. Opponents can’t try to stop the ability by exiling the card with an effect such as that of Crook of Condemnation.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'A spell with aftermath cast from a graveyard will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, it’s countered, or it leaves the stack in some other way.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'All split cards have two card faces on a single card, and you put a split card onto the stack with only the half you’re casting. The characteristics of the half of the card you didn’t cast are ignored while the spell is on the stack. For example, if an effect prevents you from casting green spells, you can cast Destined of Destined // Lead, but not Lead.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Each split card has two names. If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose one, but not both.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Each split card is a single card. For example, if you discard one, you’ve discarded one card, not two. If an effect counts the number of instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard, Destined // Lead counts once, not twice.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from a graveyard, you may cast either half. If you cast the half that has aftermath, you’ll exile the card if it would leave the stack.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from any zone other than a graveyard, you can’t cast the half with aftermath.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If you cast the first half of a split card with aftermath during your turn, you’ll have priority immediately after it resolves. You can cast the half with aftermath from your graveyard before any player can take any other action if it’s legal for you to do so.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Split cards with aftermath have a new frame treatment—the half you can cast from your hand is oriented the same as other cards you’d cast from your hand, while the half you can cast from your graveyard is a traditional split card half. This frame treatment is for your convenience and has no rules significance.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'While not on the stack, the characteristics of a split card are the combination of its two halves. For example, Destined // Lead is a green and black card, it is both an instant card and a sorcery card, and its converted mana cost is 6. This means that if an effect allows you to cast a card with converted mana cost 2 from your hand, you can’t cast Destined. This is a change from the previous rules for split cards.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If one of Dust’s target creatures loses its -1/-1 counters, leaves the battlefield, or otherwise becomes an illegal target before the spell resolves, it won’t be exiled, but the remaining legal targets will be exiled.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Once you’ve started to cast a spell with aftermath from your graveyard, the card is immediately moved to the stack. Opponents can’t try to stop the ability by exiling the card with an effect such as that of Crook of Condemnation.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'You can’t target the same creature twice with Grind to give it two -1/-1 counters.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'A spell with aftermath cast from a graveyard will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, it’s countered, or it leaves the stack in some other way.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'All split cards have two card faces on a single card, and you put a split card onto the stack with only the half you’re casting. The characteristics of the half of the card you didn’t cast are ignored while the spell is on the stack. For example, if an effect prevents you from casting green spells, you can cast Destined of Destined // Lead, but not Lead.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Each split card has two names. If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose one, but not both.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Each split card is a single card. For example, if you discard one, you’ve discarded one card, not two. If an effect counts the number of instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard, Destined // Lead counts once, not twice.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from a graveyard, you may cast either half. If you cast the half that has aftermath, you’ll exile the card if it would leave the stack.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from any zone other than a graveyard, you can’t cast the half with aftermath.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If you cast the first half of a split card with aftermath during your turn, you’ll have priority immediately after it resolves. You can cast the half with aftermath from your graveyard before any player can take any other action if it’s legal for you to do so.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Split cards with aftermath have a new frame treatment—the half you can cast from your hand is oriented the same as other cards you’d cast from your hand, while the half you can cast from your graveyard is a traditional split card half. This frame treatment is for your convenience and has no rules significance.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'While not on the stack, the characteristics of a split card are the combination of its two halves. For example, Destined // Lead is a green and black card, it is both an instant card and a sorcery card, and its converted mana cost is 6. This means that if an effect allows you to cast a card with converted mana cost 2 from your hand, you can’t cast Destined. This is a change from the previous rules for split cards.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Once you’ve started to cast a spell with aftermath from your graveyard, the card is immediately moved to the stack. Opponents can’t try to stop the ability by exiling the card with an effect such as that of Crook of Condemnation.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'You are a permanent’s owner if the card representing it began the game in your deck, or if it’s a token that entered the battlefield under your control. Leave can target a permanent you own but don’t control.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'A spell with aftermath cast from a graveyard will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, it’s countered, or it leaves the stack in some other way.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'All split cards have two card faces on a single card, and you put a split card onto the stack with only the half you’re casting. The characteristics of the half of the card you didn’t cast are ignored while the spell is on the stack. For example, if an effect prevents you from casting green spells, you can cast Destined of Destined // Lead, but not Lead.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Each split card has two names. If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose one, but not both.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Each split card is a single card. For example, if you discard one, you’ve discarded one card, not two. If an effect counts the number of instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard, Destined // Lead counts once, not twice.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from a graveyard, you may cast either half. If you cast the half that has aftermath, you’ll exile the card if it would leave the stack.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from any zone other than a graveyard, you can’t cast the half with aftermath.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If you cast the first half of a split card with aftermath during your turn, you’ll have priority immediately after it resolves. You can cast the half with aftermath from your graveyard before any player can take any other action if it’s legal for you to do so.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Split cards with aftermath have a new frame treatment—the half you can cast from your hand is oriented the same as other cards you’d cast from your hand, while the half you can cast from your graveyard is a traditional split card half. This frame treatment is for your convenience and has no rules significance.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'While not on the stack, the characteristics of a split card are the combination of its two halves. For example, Destined // Lead is a green and black card, it is both an instant card and a sorcery card, and its converted mana cost is 6. This means that if an effect allows you to cast a card with converted mana cost 2 from your hand, you can’t cast Destined. This is a change from the previous rules for split cards.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Once you’ve started to cast a spell with aftermath from your graveyard, the card is immediately moved to the stack. Opponents can’t try to stop the ability by exiling the card with an effect such as that of Crook of Condemnation.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'A spell with aftermath cast from a graveyard will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, it’s countered, or it leaves the stack in some other way.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'All split cards have two card faces on a single card, and you put a split card onto the stack with only the half you’re casting. The characteristics of the half of the card you didn’t cast are ignored while the spell is on the stack. For example, if an effect prevents you from casting green spells, you can cast Destined of Destined // Lead, but not Lead.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Each split card has two names. If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose one, but not both.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Each split card is a single card. For example, if you discard one, you’ve discarded one card, not two. If an effect counts the number of instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard, Destined // Lead counts once, not twice.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from a graveyard, you may cast either half. If you cast the half that has aftermath, you’ll exile the card if it would leave the stack.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from any zone other than a graveyard, you can’t cast the half with aftermath.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If you cast the first half of a split card with aftermath during your turn, you’ll have priority immediately after it resolves. You can cast the half with aftermath from your graveyard before any player can take any other action if it’s legal for you to do so.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Split cards with aftermath have a new frame treatment—the half you can cast from your hand is oriented the same as other cards you’d cast from your hand, while the half you can cast from your graveyard is a traditional split card half. This frame treatment is for your convenience and has no rules significance.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'While not on the stack, the characteristics of a split card are the combination of its two halves. For example, Destined // Lead is a green and black card, it is both an instant card and a sorcery card, and its mana value is 6. This means that if an effect allows you to cast a card with mana value 2 from your hand, you can’t cast Destined. This is a change from the previous rules for split cards.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Once you’ve started to cast a spell with aftermath from your graveyard, the card is immediately moved to the stack. Opponents can’t try to stop the ability by exiling the card with an effect such as that of Crook of Condemnation.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'The value of X is determined only as Appeal begins to resolve. It won’t change later in the turn if the number of creatures you control changes.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'You may cast Authority without choosing any target creatures. Creatures you control will still gain vigilance until end of turn. However, if you choose any targets and each of those targets become illegal before Authority resolves, the spell won’t resolve and your creatures won’t gain vigilance.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'A spell with aftermath cast from a graveyard will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, it’s countered, or it leaves the stack in some other way.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'All split cards have two card faces on a single card, and you put a split card onto the stack with only the half you’re casting. The characteristics of the half of the card you didn’t cast are ignored while the spell is on the stack. For example, if an effect prevents you from casting green spells, you can cast Destined of Destined // Lead, but not Lead.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Each split card has two names. If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose one, but not both.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Each split card is a single card. For example, if you discard one, you’ve discarded one card, not two. If an effect counts the number of instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard, Destined // Lead counts once, not twice.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from a graveyard, you may cast either half. If you cast the half that has aftermath, you’ll exile the card if it would leave the stack.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from any zone other than a graveyard, you can’t cast the half with aftermath.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If you cast the first half of a split card with aftermath during your turn, you’ll have priority immediately after it resolves. You can cast the half with aftermath from your graveyard before any player can take any other action if it’s legal for you to do so.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Split cards with aftermath have a new frame treatment—the half you can cast from your hand is oriented the same as other cards you’d cast from your hand, while the half you can cast from your graveyard is a traditional split card half. This frame treatment is for your convenience and has no rules significance.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'While not on the stack, the characteristics of a split card are the combination of its two halves. For example, Destined // Lead is a green and black card, it is both an instant card and a sorcery card, and its mana value is 6. This means that if an effect allows you to cast a card with mana value 2 from your hand, you can’t cast Destined. This is a change from the previous rules for split cards.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Once you’ve started to cast a spell with aftermath from your graveyard, the card is immediately moved to the stack. Opponents can’t try to stop the ability by exiling the card with an effect such as that of Crook of Condemnation.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'All cards in the Amonkhet set that let you exert a creature let you do so as you declare it as an attacking creature, as do some of the cards in the Hour of Devastation set. You can’t do so later in combat, and creatures put onto the battlefield attacking can’t be exerted. Any abilities that trigger on exerting an attacking creature will resolve before blockers are declared.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If a creature has a targeted triggered ability that triggers when you exert it, you can exert it even if there isn’t a legal target for that triggered ability.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If an exerted creature is already untapped during your next untap step (most likely because it had vigilance or an effect untapped it), exert’s effect preventing it from untapping expires without having done anything.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If you gain control of another player’s creature until end of turn and exert it, it will untap during that player’s untap step.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Some cards have abilities that trigger whenever you exert any creature. These abilities trigger when you exert that creature or any other creature you control.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'You can’t exert a creature unless an effect allows you to do so. Similar effects that “tap and freeze” a creature (such as that of Decision Paralysis) don’t exert that creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'All cards in the Amonkhet set that let you exert a creature let you do so as you declare it as an attacking creature, as do some of the cards in the Hour of Devastation set. You can’t do so later in combat, and creatures put onto the battlefield attacking can’t be exerted. Any abilities that trigger on exerting an attacking creature will resolve before blockers are declared.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If an exerted creature is already untapped during your next untap step (most likely because it had vigilance or an effect untapped it), exert’s effect preventing it from untapping expires without having done anything.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If you gain control of another player’s creature until end of turn and exert it, it will untap during that player’s untap step.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Some cards have abilities that trigger whenever you exert any creature. These abilities trigger when you exert that creature or any other creature you control.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'You can’t exert a creature unless an effect allows you to do so. Similar effects that “tap and freeze” a creature (such as that of Decision Paralysis) don’t exert that creature.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Resolute Survivors’s last ability causes it to deal a total of 2 damage to the opposing team and you gain 1 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'All cards in the Amonkhet set that let you exert a creature let you do so as you declare it as an attacking creature, as do some of the cards in the Hour of Devastation set. You can’t do so later in combat, and creatures put onto the battlefield attacking can’t be exerted. Any abilities that trigger on exerting an attacking creature will resolve before blockers are declared.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If an exerted creature is already untapped during your next untap step (most likely because it had vigilance or an effect untapped it), exert’s effect preventing it from untapping expires without having done anything.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If you gain control of another player’s creature until end of turn and exert it, it will untap during that player’s untap step.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'You can’t exert a creature unless an effect allows you to do so. Similar effects that “tap and freeze” a creature (such as that of Decision Paralysis) don’t exert that creature.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Once a creature with power 3 or greater has blocked an exerted Rhonas’s Stalwart, changing the power of the blocking creature won’t cause Rhonas’s Stalwart to become unblocked.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'All cards in the Amonkhet set that let you exert a creature let you do so as you declare it as an attacking creature, as do some of the cards in the Hour of Devastation set. You can’t do so later in combat, and creatures put onto the battlefield attacking can’t be exerted. Any abilities that trigger on exerting an attacking creature will resolve before blockers are declared.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If an exerted creature is already untapped during your next untap step (most likely because it had vigilance or an effect untapped it), exert’s effect preventing it from untapping expires without having done anything.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If you gain control of another player’s creature until end of turn and exert it, it will untap during that player’s untap step.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'You can’t exert a creature unless an effect allows you to do so. Similar effects that “tap and freeze” a creature (such as that of Decision Paralysis) don’t exert that creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'An ability that triggers whenever you discard a card doesn’t give you permission to discard cards. You’ll need another effect that instructs or allows you to discard them.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'An ability that triggers whenever you “cycle or discard” a card triggers only once if you cycle a card. The ability “Whenever you discard a card” is functionally identical to this ability; cycling is mentioned for clarity.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If a player discards a card during their cleanup step due to having too many cards in hand, any appropriate abilities that trigger on discarding that card trigger. If this happens, those triggered abilities are put onto the stack and players receive priority in that cleanup step to cast spells or activate abilities (normally, no players may take actions during a cleanup step). Another cleanup step is created following that one.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Some cards have an ability that triggers whenever you cycle any card. These triggered abilities resolve before you draw from the cycling ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Desert is a land subtype with no special meaning. It doesn’t grant the land an intrinsic mana ability. Other cards may care about which lands are Deserts.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If a Desert has an ability with a cost of “Sacrifice a Desert,” you can sacrifice that Desert to pay the cost for its own ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Desert is a land subtype with no special meaning. It doesn’t grant the land an intrinsic mana ability. Other cards may care about which lands are Deserts.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If you exile a creature that isn’t a creature card with the second ability of Endless Sands (such as a token creature or a land that has become a creature), the third ability won’t return that token or card from exile.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'The last ability of Endless Sands returns only creature cards exiled by that card. If Endless Sands leaves the battlefield before you activate that ability, the exiled creatures are lost in the dunes forever.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Desert is a land subtype with no special meaning. It doesn’t grant the land an intrinsic mana ability. Other cards may care about which lands are Deserts.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'To activate the last ability, you may tap any untapped creature you control, including one you haven’t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn. (Note that tapping the creature doesn’t use {T} [the tap symbol].)'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Desert is a land subtype with no special meaning. It doesn’t grant the land an intrinsic mana ability. Other cards may care about which lands are Deserts.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If a creature with wither or infect deals damage to a creature, the controller of the creature with wither or infect puts that many -1/-1 counters on the second creature.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until it’s removed as the turn ends, the counter Obelisk Spider’s first triggered ability puts on a creature may cause previously marked damage to become lethal.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If Obelisk Spider deals combat damage to a creature at the same time Obelisk Spider is dealt lethal damage, its first triggered ability will put a -1/-1 counter on the other creature. However, because Obelisk Spider has left the battlefield before that ability resolves, its last ability won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If Obelisk Spider deals combat damage to a creature but that creature isn’t on the battlefield as Obelisk Spider’s first triggered ability resolves, most likely because Obelisk Spider killed that creature already, that ability won’t put a -1/-1 counter on it.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If you put one or more -1/-1 counter on each of multiple creatures at the same time, Obelisk Spider’s last ability triggers once for each of those creatures.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Obelisk Spider’s last ability causes the opposing team to lose 2 life and you gain 1 life.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Obelisk Spider’s first triggered ability puts only one -1/-1 counter on the creature, no matter how much combat damage it dealt.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If an exerted creature is already untapped during your next untap step (most likely because it had vigilance or an effect untapped it), exert’s effect preventing it from untapping expires without having done anything.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If you gain control of another player’s creature until end of turn and exert it, it will untap during that player’s untap step.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'You can’t exert a creature unless an effect allows you to do so. Similar effects that “tap and freeze” a creature (such as that of Decision Paralysis) don’t exert that creature.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Auras attached to the exiled creature will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Any Equipment will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled permanent will cease to exist.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If Angel of Condemnation leaves the battlefield before its first activated ability resolves, the target creature is still exiled. That card returns to the battlefield even if Angel of Condemnation has left the battlefield before the next end step.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If Angel of Condemnation leaves the battlefield before its last ability resolves, the target creature won’t be exiled.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If a creature token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won’t return to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Some cards in the Hour of Devastation set let you exert a creature as a cost to activate one of its abilities. You can exert it to pay that cost even if you’ve already exerted it earlier in the turn. Exerting it multiple times will keep it tapped only during your next untap step.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Tapping Angel of Condemnation to activate either of its abilities while it’s attacking doesn’t remove it from combat.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'The card exiled with Angel of Condemnation’s last ability returns to the battlefield immediately after Angel of Condemnation leaves the battlefield. Nothing happens between the two events, including state-based actions.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If an exerted creature is already untapped during your next untap step (most likely because it had vigilance or an effect untapped it), exert’s effect preventing it from untapping expires without having done anything.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If you gain control of another player’s creature until end of turn and exert it, it will untap during that player’s untap step.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'You can’t exert a creature unless an effect allows you to do so. Similar effects that “tap and freeze” a creature (such as that of Decision Paralysis) don’t exert that creature.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until it’s removed as the turn ends, the damage Pride Sovereign takes during combat may become lethal if other Cats you control leave the battlefield later in the turn.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Some cards in the Hour of Devastation set let you exert a creature as a cost to activate one of its abilities. You can exert it to pay that cost even if you’ve already exerted it earlier in the turn. Exerting it multiple times will keep it tapped only during your next untap step.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If an exerted creature is already untapped during your next untap step (most likely because it had vigilance or an effect untapped it), exert’s effect preventing it from untapping expires without having done anything.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If you gain control of another player’s creature until end of turn and exert it, it will untap during that player’s untap step.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'You can’t exert a creature unless an effect allows you to do so. Similar effects that “tap and freeze” a creature (such as that of Decision Paralysis) don’t exert that creature.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Some cards in the Hour of Devastation set let you exert a creature as a cost to activate one of its abilities. You can exert it to pay that cost even if you’ve already exerted it earlier in the turn. Exerting it multiple times will keep it tapped only during your next untap step.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Some cards with cycling have an ability that triggers when you cycle them. These triggered abilities resolve before you draw from the cycling ability.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Triggered abilities from cycling a card and the cycling ability itself aren’t spells. Effects that interact with spells (such as that of Cancel) won’t affect them.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'You can cycle a card even if it has a triggered ability from cycling that won’t have a legal target. This is because the cycling ability and the triggered ability are separate. This also means that if either ability doesn’t resolve (due to being countered with Disallow, for example, or if the triggered ability’s targets have become illegal), the other ability will still resolve.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Abilities that create replacement effects, such as a permanent entering the battlefield tapped or with counters on it, can’t be targeted. Abilities that apply “as [this creature] enters the battlefield” are also replacement effects and can’t be targeted.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Activated abilities are written in the form “Cost: Effect.” Some keyword abilities, such as equip and eternalize, are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder texts.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If you counter a delayed triggered ability that triggers at the beginning of the “next” occurrence of a specified step or phase, that ability won’t trigger again the following time that phase or step occurs.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Mana abilities can’t be targeted. An activated mana ability is one that adds mana to a player’s mana pool as it resolves, doesn’t have a target, and isn’t a loyalty ability. A triggered mana ability is one that adds mana to a player’s mana pool and triggers on an activated mana ability.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Triggered abilities use the word “when,” “whenever,” or “at.” They’re often written as “[Trigger condition], [effect].” Some keyword abilities, such as prowess and afflict, are triggered abilities and will have “when,” “whenever,” or “at” in their reminder text.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "A token permanent with cycling will go to your graveyard before ceasing to exist. It won\'t be exiled. Similarly, a nontoken permanent that lost cycling while it was on the battlefield will also go to your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Abandoned Sarcophagus doesn\'t grant you permission to do anything with those cards except cast them. For example, you can\'t cycle nonland cards with cycling from your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Certain older cards have variants of cycling, such as basic landcycling or Wizardcycling. Abandoned Sarcophagus\'s effect lets you cast these cards and exiles them if they weren\'t discarded for their cycling variant\'s ability."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "If you cycle an instant card, you may cast it from your graveyard right away before any player may take any other action. If you do, that spell will resolve before the cycling ability. If you cycle a noninstant card without flash, you can\'t cast it until after the cycling ability has resolved."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Accursed Horde\'s ability can target itself while it\'s attacking."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'The target Zombie gains indestructible for the rest of the turn, even after it stops being an attacking creature.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Afflict causes the defending player to lose life; it\'s not damage or combat damage."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Afflict resolves before combat damage is dealt. If this loss of life brings a player to 0 life or less, that player loses the game immediately. A blocking creature with lifelink won\'t deal combat damage in time to save that player."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Because it triggers at the beginning of a phase, Neheb\'s last ability isn\'t a mana ability. It uses the stack and can be countered by effects that interact with triggered abilities, such as that of Nimble Obstructionist."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'Damage dealt to a player causes that player to lose that much life.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "If an opponent loses life and subsequently loses the game before your postcombat main phase, Neheb\'s last ability counts that loss of life."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "If an opponent loses life but Neheb leaves the battlefield before your postcombat main phase begins, its last ability doesn\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'If multiple creatures block a creature with afflict, afflict triggers only once.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "If you somehow have more than two main phases in a turn, each main phase after your first one is a postcombat main phase, and Neheb\'s last ability triggers at the beginning of each of them."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Neheb\'s ability checks only how much life opponents lost during the turn, not by how much their life total decreased compared to the start of the turn. For example, if an opponent lost 2 life and then gained 8 life before your postcombat main phase, you\'ll add {R}{R} to your mana pool."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "You get a postcombat main phase even if no creatures attacked during a turn. Neheb\'s last ability will trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "If a creature is attacking a planeswalker, that planeswalker\'s controller is the defending player. If a creature is attacking a battle, that battle\'s protector is the defending player."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Counters can be put on cards that aren\'t on the battlefield. Notably, suspended cards will still get time counters."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'Damage from a source with infect has no effect on creatures or players. No -1/-1 counters are put on creatures, and no damage is marked on them. Players don’t get poison counters and they don’t lose life. The damage is still dealt for purposes of effects that care about damage, such as lifelink.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'Damage from a source with wither has no effect on creatures. No -1/-1 counters are put on them, and no damage is marked on them. The damage is still dealt for purposes of effects that care about damage, such as lifelink.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'If a creature with tribute is entering the battlefield, the chosen opponent can’t pay tribute even if they want to.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'If a replacement effect allows a player to modify or replace an event by putting counters on an artifact, creature, enchantment, or land, that player may apply that replacement effect. Counters won’t be put on the object, but if the original event is entirely replaced (such as by applying Soul-Scar Mage’s replacement effect), the original event won’t happen.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'If an artifact, creature, enchantment, or land would enter the battlefield with counters on it at the same time that Solemnity enters the battlefield, Solemnity doesn’t stop it from getting those counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'If the cost of an ability or an additional cost of a spell requires putting counters on an artifact, creature, enchantment, or land, that cost can’t be paid. If a resolving spell or ability says that a player may put counters on one of those objects, that player can’t choose to do so.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'Solemnity doesn’t remove any counters players or permanents already have.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'Solemnity stops counters from being put on an artifact, creature, enchantment, or land as it enters the battlefield, as well as stopping counters from being put on them later.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'While resolving a cumulative upkeep trigger of a permanent, you’ll fail to put a counter on that permanent, then you may pay for the age counters already on it. If it has no age counters on it, you may pay {0}.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Each token copies exactly what was printed on the original card and nothing else, except the characteristics it specifically modifies. It doesn\'t copy any information about the object the card was before it was put into your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "If a card copied by one of the tokens had any “when [this permanent] enters the battlefield” abilities, then the token also has those abilities and will trigger them when it\'s created. Similarly, any “as [this permanent] enters the battlefield” or “[this permanent] enters the battlefield with” abilities that the token has copied will also work."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'The tokens are Zombies instead of their other types (unlike Zombies created by an eternalize ability) and are black instead of their other colors. Their power and toughness are 4/4. These are copiable values of the tokens that other effects may copy.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Unlike the tokens created by an eternalize ability, the tokens have the mana cost and thus mana value of the cards they\'re copying."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': \'There are many important moments in the story, but the most crucial—called “story spotlights”—are shown on cards. These cards have the Planeswalker symbol in their text box; this symbol has no effect on gameplay. You can read more about these events in the official Magic fiction at http://www.mtgstory.com.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Fraying Sanity\'s triggered ability counts the number of cards that were put into the enchanted player\'s graveyard during the turn, even if Fraying Sanity wasn\'t on the battlefield at the time those cards were put there, and even if those cards have left that graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "The value of X is determined only as Fraying Sanity\'s triggered ability resolves. For example, if three Fraying Sanity Auras are attached to one player who had four cards put into their graveyard this turn, X will be four for the first ability to resolve, eight for the second, and sixteen for the third."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "If Mirage Mirror becomes a copy of a legendary permanent you control, you\'ll put one of them into your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "If Mirage Mirror becomes a copy of an Aura, it\'s put into its owner\'s graveyard unless it\'s somehow attached to an appropriate object or player already. If it becomes a copy of an Equipment and is attached to a creature, it\'ll become unattached when it becomes a non-Equipment artifact again."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "If Mirage Mirror becomes a creature the same turn it enters the battlefield, you can\'t attack with it or use any of its {T} abilities (if it gains any) unless it has haste."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "If Mirage Mirror copies a permanent that\'s copying something else, it will become whatever the target is copying."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "If an effect begins to apply to Mirage Mirror before it becomes a copy of another permanent, that effect will continue to apply. For example, if Mirage Mirror is activated twice in response to itself targeting first Rampaging Hippo then Frilled Sandwalla, the ability it has while it\'s a copy of Frilled Sandwalla can be activated and its effect will continue to apply while Mirage Mirror is a copy of Rampaging Hippo."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "If you activate Mirage Mirror\'s ability multiple times in a turn in response to itself, then each time one of those abilities resolves, it will overwrite whatever Mirage Mirror is copying. Mirage Mirror will wind up as a copy of the permanent targeted by the last ability to resolve. When the turn ends, all instances of the ability will wear off at the same time."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Mirage Mirror copies the printed values of the target permanent, plus any copy effects that have been applied to it. It won\'t copy counters on that permanent or effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on. Notably, it won\'t copy effects that made the target permanent become a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Once Mirage Mirror\'s ability resolves, it no longer has that ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability causes you to put cards into your hand without specifically using the word “draw,” The Locust God\'s first triggered ability won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'If this creature dies but leaves your graveyard before the next end step, it will remain in its new zone.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "The “next end step” refers to the next end step that occurs, not the end step of the next turn. If this creature dies before a turn\'s end step (for example, during combat), it will be returned to its owner\'s hand at the beginning of that turn\'s end step."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Ramunap Excavator doesn\'t allow you to activate activated abilities (such as cycling) of land cards in your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Ramunap Excavator doesn\'t change the times when you can play those land cards. You can still play only one land per turn, and only during your main phase when you have priority and the stack is empty."}]', "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'A creature with a -1/-1 counter on it controlled by any player satisfies Tenacious Hunter’s ability.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If Tenacious Hunter loses vigilance after attacking, it will remain untapped.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'A pile can have no cards in it. In this case, you’ll choose whether to put all the revealed cards into your hand or into your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'In multiplayer games, you choose an opponent to separate the cards when the ability resolves. This doesn’t target that opponent. Because the cards are revealed, all players may see the cards and offer opinions.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a Sphinx spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The converted mana cost of the creature remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Unesh’s cost-reduction ability doesn’t reduce the cost to cast itself.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'You (not your opponent) choose which pile to put into your hand and which to put into your graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Activated abilities contain a colon. They’re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keyword abilities (such as equip and eternalize) are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text. Triggered abilities (starting with “when,” “whenever,” or “at”) of noncreature permanents are unaffected by the last ability of Overwhelming Splendor.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'An activated mana ability is one that produces mana as it resolves, not one that costs mana to activate. A loyalty ability is an ability of a planeswalker whose cost specifies how many loyalty counters to give or remove.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Effects that modify a creature’s power and/or toughness, such as the effect of Titanic Growth, will apply to the creatures no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for any counters that change their power and/or toughness.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If Overwhelming Splendor leaves the battlefield at the same time as a creature enchanted player controls, any “when [this creature] [dies or leaves the battlefield]” abilities of that creature won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If a noncreature permanent becomes a creature, it will lose all abilities it has. However, if the effect that makes that permanent a creature grants it an ability, it will continue to have that ability. For example, the enchanted player’s Riddleform will have flying once it becomes a creature.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If an effect grants a creature an ability after Overwhelming Splendor has become attached to its controller, that creature won’t lose that ability.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Overwhelming Splendor overwrites all previous effects that set a creature’s base power and toughness to specific values. Any power- or toughness-setting effects that start to apply to a creature after Overwhelming Splendor becomes attached to its controller will overwrite this effect. For example, the enchanted player’s Riddleform will become a 3/3 creature if player casts a noncreature spell.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'While the enchanted player can still activate mana abilities and loyalty abilities, creatures that player controls won’t normally have any of those abilities to be activated.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'If a creature enters the battlefield under enchanted player’s control, any “when [this creature] enters the battlefield” abilities of that creature won’t trigger. Any “as [this creature] enters the battlefield” or “[this creature] enters the battlefield with” abilities won’t be applied. This is a change from previous rulings.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Activated abilities contain a colon. They’re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keyword abilities are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text. Triggered abilities (starting with “when,” “whenever,” or “at”) are unaffected by the last ability of Desert’s Hold.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'For abilities that trigger only if you control a Desert or there is a Desert card in your graveyard, one condition must be true as the ability triggers and one must be true as the ability resolves. They don’t have to be the same condition, though. For example, you could sacrifice your only Desert after the ability triggers but before it has resolved.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If an ability checks whether you control a Desert or there is a Desert card in your graveyard, having more than one doesn’t matter. Controlling one is the same as controlling five. There is also no extra bonus for both controlling one and having one in your graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Afflict causes the defending player to lose life; it’s not damage or combat damage.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Afflict resolves before combat damage is dealt. If this loss of life brings a player to 0 life or less, that player loses the game immediately. A blocking creature with lifelink won’t deal combat damage in time to save that player.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Ammit Eternal’s middle ability will resolve before the spell that caused it to trigger. The ability will resolve even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If a creature is attacking a planeswalker, that planeswalker’s controller is the defending player.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If multiple creatures block a creature with afflict, afflict triggers only once.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Afflict causes the defending player to lose life; it’s not damage or combat damage.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Afflict resolves before combat damage is dealt. If this loss of life brings a player to 0 life or less, that player loses the game immediately. A blocking creature with lifelink won’t deal combat damage in time to save that player.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when something “attacks and isn’t blocked” triggers in the declare blockers step after blockers are declared if (1) that creature is attacking and (2) no creatures are declared to block it. It will trigger even if that creature was put onto the battlefield attacking rather than having been declared as an attacker in the declare attackers step.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If a creature is attacking a planeswalker, that planeswalker’s controller is the defending player.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If multiple creatures block a creature with afflict, afflict triggers only once.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t pay any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Tormenting Voice, those must be paid to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Wildfire Eternal’s second ability resolves before combat damage is dealt, and you must cast a spell at that time if you wish to cast one without paying its mana cost. You can cast a sorcery during the declare blockers step this way.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Afflict causes the defending player to lose life; it’s not damage or combat damage.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Afflict resolves before combat damage is dealt. If this loss of life brings a player to 0 life or less, that player loses the game immediately. A blocking creature with lifelink won’t deal combat damage in time to save that player.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when something “attacks and isn’t blocked” triggers in the declare blockers step after blockers are declared if (1) that creature is attacking and (2) no creatures are declared to block it. It will trigger even if that creature was put onto the battlefield attacking rather than having been declared as an attacker in the declare attackers step.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If a creature is attacking a planeswalker, that planeswalker’s controller is the defending player.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If multiple creatures block a creature with afflict, afflict triggers only once.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Afflict causes the defending player to lose life; it’s not damage or combat damage.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Afflict resolves before combat damage is dealt. If this loss of life brings a player to 0 life or less, that player loses the game immediately. A blocking creature with lifelink won’t deal combat damage in time to save that player.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If a creature has multiple instances of afflict, each triggers separately.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If a creature is attacking a planeswalker, that planeswalker’s controller is the defending player.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If multiple creatures block a creature with afflict, afflict triggers only once.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Afflict causes the defending player to lose life; it’s not damage or combat damage.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Afflict resolves before combat damage is dealt. If this loss of life brings a player to 0 life or less, that player loses the game immediately. A blocking creature with lifelink won’t deal combat damage in time to save that player.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If a creature is attacking a planeswalker, that planeswalker’s controller is the defending player.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If multiple creatures block a creature with afflict, afflict triggers only once.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If, during your declare attackers step, Manticore Eternal is tapped or is affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t attack, then it doesn’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having it attack, you aren’t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t have to attack in that case either.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Afflict causes the defending player to lose life; it’s not damage or combat damage.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Afflict resolves before combat damage is dealt. If this loss of life brings a player to 0 life or less, that player loses the game immediately. A blocking creature with lifelink won’t deal combat damage in time to save that player.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If a creature is attacking a planeswalker, that planeswalker’s controller is the defending player.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If multiple creatures block a creature with afflict, afflict triggers only once.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'All attackers are chosen at once. You can’t attack with Dauntless Aven, untap a tapped creature, and then attack with that creature.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Untapping an attacking creature doesn’t remove it from combat.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Avid Reclaimer’s ability is a mana ability. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to. You’ll immediately add mana to your mana pool and gain 2 life, if applicable.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'You can activate Avid Reclaimer’s ability even if you don’t have anything to spend that mana on. You’ll still gain 2 life if you control a Nissa planeswalker.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Because state-based actions aren’t performed while Torment of Venom is resolving, the target creature is still on the battlefield while its controller is tormented. If that creature has an Aura attached to it, that Aura can be sacrificed.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Torment of Venom resolves, the entire spell doesn’t resolve. The creature’s controller won’t be tormented.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'While resolving Torment of Venom, the creature’s controller chooses a card to be discarded without revealing it, chooses a nonland permanent to be sacrificed, or chooses to do neither. Then that player discards that card, sacrifices that permanent, or loses 3 life. That player can always choose to lose 3 life, even if they have cards to discard or nonland permanents to sacrifice.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Casting the card exiled with Nicol Bolas’s first ability follows the normal timing rules for casting that card. For example, if the card is a creature card, you can cast that card only during your main phase while the stack is empty.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs, such as emerge costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Tormenting Voice, you must pay those to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If you don’t cast the card exiled by Nicol Bolas’s first ability that turn, it will remain exiled.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, any spell or permanent cards you control from Nicol Bolas’s first ability are exiled.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'The cards exiled by Nicol Bolas’s first and second abilities are exiled face up.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'While resolving Nicol Bolas’s second ability, each opponent chooses which cards to exile from their hand. Any opponent with two or fewer cards exiles their entire hand.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'You may cast the nonland card exiled by Nicol Bolas’s first ability that turn even if Nicol Bolas is no longer on the battlefield or under your control.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Certain older cards have variants of cycling, such as basic landcycling or Wizardcycling. Vile Manifestation’s effect counts these cards.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Vile Manifestation’s first ability applies only while it’s on the battlefield. In all other zones, its power is 0.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Vile Manifestation’s first ability counts only the cards with cycling abilities in your graveyard. It doesn’t care whether or not they were cycled to get there.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Count the number of cards in your graveyard as Countervailing Winds resolves to determine how much mana the controller of the target spell must pay to avoid the spell being countered. Countervailing Winds is still on the stack at this time and won’t count toward this number.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Creatures with indestructible that enter the battlefield after Hour of Devastation resolves will still have indestructible.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Once Hour of Devastation begins to resolve, no player may take actions until it’s done. Notably, players can’t try to give a creature indestructible again to save it from the damage.'}, {'date': '2018-01-19', 'text': 'There are many important moments in the story, but the most crucial—called “story spotlights”—are shown on cards. These cards have the Planeswalker symbol in their text box; this symbol has no effect on gameplay. You can read more about these events in the official Magic fiction at http://www.mtgstory.com.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Crested Sunmare’s triggered ability cares only whether you gained life in the turn, even if Crested Sunmare wasn’t on the battlefield when that happened. It doesn’t care how much you gained, whether you also lost life, or even whether you lost more life than you gained.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Crested Sunmare’s triggered ability won’t trigger unless you’ve gained life in the turn before the end step began. It can’t be satisfied by another triggered ability causing you to gain life during that end step.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If a creature has been dealt damage, that damage remains marked on it until the cleanup step. If another Horse you control has been dealt lethal damage, and later in the turn Crested Sunmare leaves the battlefield, that Horse will be destroyed.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Each individual spell you cast this way must have converted mana cost 5 or less. Their total converted mana cost could be greater.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If a spell you cast this way targets another spell, it may target a spell you cast earlier during the resolution of Hazoret’s Undying Fury. It may target Hazoret’s Undying Fury as well, but Hazoret’s Undying Fury will be put into your graveyard soon afterwards and the spell’s target will become illegal.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If any abilities trigger as you cast any of those cards, they won’t be put on the stack until after you’re done casting them. They’ll resolve before any of those spells.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If more than one spell says that lands you control don’t untap during your next untap step, the effects will all wear off during that untap step. You’ll untap lands you control during your untap step after that one.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs, such as emerge costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Tormenting Voice, you must pay those to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If you cast any of those cards, you do so as part of the resolution of Hazoret’s Undying Fury. You can’t wait to cast them later in the turn.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'No lands that you control will untap during your next untap step, even lands that aren’t tapped as this spell resolves. This includes lands that enter the battlefield after this spell resolves.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'No player may take any actions between the time you shuffle your library and the time you exile the top four cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Each repetition through this process is done separately. If an opponent sacrifices a creature with an ability that triggers when another creature dies, for example, it will see creatures that are sacrificed before it, but not those are sacrificed after it.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If X is 0, Torment of Hailfire resolves with no effect.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Torment of Hailfire causes both opponents to sacrifice a nonland permanent, discard a card, or lose 3 life X times. Your opponents can choose the same torment or different ones each time.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, each opponent in turn order makes their choice once, then all of the actions occur simultaneously, then they repeat this process if it hasn’t been done X times yet. Opponents will know choices made by earlier opponents when making their choices, although a card chosen to be discarded this way isn’t revealed until it’s discarded.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'State-based actions aren’t checked in between repetitions of this process, so the game state may be a little unusual while making the choice. For example, a player may sacrifice a creature and then later sacrifice an Aura that was attached to that creature.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'While resolving Torment of Hailfire, your opponent chooses a card to be discarded without revealing it, chooses a nonland permanent to be sacrificed, or chooses to do neither. Then that player discards that card, sacrifices that permanent, or loses 3 life, then repeats this process if it hasn’t been done X times yet. Your opponent can always choose to lose 3 life, even if they have cards to discard or nonland permanents to sacrifice.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Firebrand Archer’s ability will resolve before the spell that caused it to trigger. The ability will resolve even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Firebrand Archer’s ability causes it to deal a total of 2 damage to the opposing team.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'For abilities that trigger only if you control a Desert or there is a Desert card in your graveyard, one condition must be true as the ability triggers and one must be true as the ability resolves. They don’t have to be the same condition, though. For example, you could sacrifice your only Desert after the ability triggers but before it has resolved.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If an ability checks whether you control a Desert or there is a Desert card in your graveyard, having more than one doesn’t matter. Controlling one is the same as controlling five. There is also no extra bonus for both controlling one and having one in your graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'For cards in your library with {X} in their mana costs, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If you cast Uncage the Menagerie with X as 0, you’ll search your library and shuffle it, but you won’t be able to find any cards.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'For each card with eternalize, a corresponding game play supplement token can be found in some Hour of Devastation booster packs. These supplements are not required to play with cards with eternalize; you can use the same items to represent an eternalized token as you would any other token.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "If a creature card with eternalize is put into your graveyard during your main phase, you\'ll have priority immediately afterward. You can activate its eternalize ability before any player can try to exile it, such as with Crook of Condemnation, if it\'s legal for you to do so."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "If the card copied by the token had any “when [this permanent] enters the battlefield” abilities, then the token also has those abilities and will trigger them when it\'s created. Similarly, any “as [this permanent] enters the battlefield” or “[this permanent] enters the battlefield with” abilities that the token has copied will also work."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Once you\'ve activated an eternalize ability, the card is immediately exiled. Opponents can\'t try to stop the ability by exiling the card with an effect such as that of Crook of Condemnation."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "The token copies exactly what was printed on the original card and nothing else, except the characteristics specifically modified by eternalize. It doesn\'t copy any information about the object the card was before it was put into your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'The token is a Zombie in addition to its other types and is black instead of its other colors. Its base power and toughness are 4/4. It has no mana cost, and thus its mana value is 0. These are copiable values of the token that other effects may copy.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Use Champion of Wits\'s power as the first ability resolves to determine if you want to use the ability and how many cards you draw if you do. If you use the ability, you discard two cards regardless of how many cards you draw. If Champion of Wits leaves the battlefield before that ability resolves, use its last known power."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'For each card with eternalize, a corresponding game play supplement token can be found in some Hour of Devastation booster packs. These supplements are not required to play with cards with eternalize; you can use the same items to represent an eternalized token as you would any other token.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "If a creature card with eternalize is put into your graveyard during your main phase, you\'ll have priority immediately afterward. You can activate its eternalize ability before any player can try to exile it, such as with Crook of Condemnation, if it\'s legal for you to do so."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Once you\'ve activated an eternalize ability, the card is immediately exiled. Opponents can\'t try to stop the ability by exiling the card with an effect such as that of Crook of Condemnation."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "The token copies exactly what was printed on the original card and nothing else, except the characteristics specifically modified by eternalize. It doesn\'t copy any information about the object the card was before it was put into your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'The token is a Zombie in addition to its other types and is black instead of its other colors. Its base power and toughness are 4/4. It has no mana cost, and thus its mana value is 0. These are copiable values of the token that other effects may copy.\'}]', "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'For each card with eternalize, a corresponding game play supplement token can be found in some Hour of Devastation booster packs. These supplements are not required to play with cards with eternalize; you can use the same items to represent an eternalized token as you would any other token.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If Resilient Khenra leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, use its power as it last existed on the battlefield to determine the value of X.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If Resilient Khenra’s power is negative as its triggered ability resolves, X is considered to be 0. (This is a change from previous rules.)'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If a creature card with eternalize is put into your graveyard during your main phase, you’ll have priority immediately afterward. You can activate its eternalize ability before any player can try to exile it, such as with Crook of Condemnation, if it’s legal for you to do so.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If the card copied by the token had any “when [this permanent] enters the battlefield” abilities, then the token also has those abilities and will trigger them when it’s created. Similarly, any “as [this permanent] enters the battlefield” or “[this permanent] enters the battlefield with” abilities that the token has copied will also work.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Once you’ve activated an eternalize ability, the card is immediately exiled. Opponents can’t try to stop the ability by exiling the card with an effect such as that of Crook of Condemnation.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'The token copies exactly what was printed on the original card and nothing else, except the characteristics specifically modified by eternalize. It doesn’t copy any information about the object the card was before it was put into your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'The token is a Zombie in addition to its other types and is black instead of its other colors. Its base power and toughness are 4/4. It has no mana cost, and thus its converted mana cost is 0. These are copiable values of the token that other effects may copy.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'The value of X is determined only as Resilient Khenra’s triggered ability resolves. Once that happens, the value of X won’t change later in the turn even if Resilient Khenra’s power changes.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'For each card with eternalize, a corresponding game play supplement token can be found in some Hour of Devastation booster packs. These supplements are not required to play with cards with eternalize; you can use the same items to represent an eternalized token as you would any other token.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If Sunscourge Champion leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, use its power as it last existed on the battlefield to determine how much life to gain. If that number is negative, you don’t gain any life and you don’t lose any life.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If a creature card with eternalize is put into your graveyard during your main phase, you’ll have priority immediately afterward. You can activate its eternalize ability before any player can try to exile it, such as with Crook of Condemnation, if it’s legal for you to do so.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If the card copied by the token had any “when [this permanent] enters the battlefield” abilities, then the token also has those abilities and will trigger them when it’s created. Similarly, any “as [this permanent] enters the battlefield” or “[this permanent] enters the battlefield with” abilities that the token has copied will also work.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Once you’ve activated an eternalize ability, the card is immediately exiled. Opponents can’t try to stop the ability by exiling the card with an effect such as that of Crook of Condemnation.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Several cards have an eternalize cost that includes “Discard a card.” You can’t discard the card with eternalize to pay its own cost because the card has to be in your graveyard to begin activating its eternalize ability.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'The amount of life you gain is determined as Sunscourge Champion’s triggered ability resolves. Players may respond to the ability by attempting to change its power.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'The token copies exactly what was printed on the original card and nothing else, except the characteristics specifically modified by eternalize. It doesn’t copy any information about the object the card was before it was put into your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'The token is a Zombie in addition to its other types and is black instead of its other colors. Its base power and toughness are 4/4. It has no mana cost, and thus its converted mana cost is 0. These are copiable values of the token that other effects may copy.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'For each card with eternalize, a corresponding game play supplement token can be found in some Hour of Devastation booster packs. These supplements are not required to play with cards with eternalize; you can use the same items to represent an eternalized token as you would any other token.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If a creature card with eternalize is put into your graveyard during your main phase, you’ll have priority immediately afterward. You can activate its eternalize ability before any player can try to exile it, such as with Crook of Condemnation, if it’s legal for you to do so.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If the card copied by the token had any “when [this permanent] enters the battlefield” abilities, then the token also has those abilities and will trigger them when it’s created. Similarly, any “as [this permanent] enters the battlefield” or “[this permanent] enters the battlefield with” abilities that the token has copied will also work.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Once you’ve activated an eternalize ability, the card is immediately exiled. Opponents can’t try to stop the ability by exiling the card with an effect such as that of Crook of Condemnation.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Spells, activated abilities, and triggered abilities can’t raise Earthshaker Khenra’s power before you have to choose a target for its ability. Static abilities, such as that of Lord of the Accursed, will raise its power in time to let you target a larger creature.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'The target creature’s power is checked when you target it with Earthshaker Khenra’s ability and when that ability resolves. Once the ability resolves, if the creature’s power increases or Earthshaker Khenra’s power decreases, the target creature will still be unable to block.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'The token copies exactly what was printed on the original card and nothing else, except the characteristics specifically modified by eternalize. It doesn’t copy any information about the object the card was before it was put into your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'The token is a Zombie in addition to its other types and is black instead of its other colors. Its base power and toughness are 4/4. It has no mana cost, and thus its converted mana cost is 0. These are copiable values of the token that other effects may copy.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'For each card with eternalize, a corresponding game play supplement token can be found in some Hour of Devastation booster packs. These supplements are not required to play with cards with eternalize; you can use the same items to represent an eternalized token as you would any other token.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If a creature card with eternalize is put into your graveyard during your main phase, you’ll have priority immediately afterward. You can activate its eternalize ability before any player can try to exile it, such as with Crook of Condemnation, if it’s legal for you to do so.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If the card copied by the token had any “when [this permanent] enters the battlefield” abilities, then the token also has those abilities and will trigger them when it’s created. Similarly, any “as [this permanent] enters the battlefield” or “[this permanent] enters the battlefield with” abilities that the token has copied will also work.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Once you’ve activated an eternalize ability, the card is immediately exiled. Opponents can’t try to stop the ability by exiling the card with an effect such as that of Crook of Condemnation.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'The token copies exactly what was printed on the original card and nothing else, except the characteristics specifically modified by eternalize. It doesn’t copy any information about the object the card was before it was put into your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'The token is a Zombie in addition to its other types and is black instead of its other colors. Its base power and toughness are 4/4. It has no mana cost, and thus its converted mana cost is 0. These are copiable values of the token that other effects may copy.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'For each card with eternalize, a corresponding game play supplement token can be found in some Hour of Devastation booster packs. These supplements are not required to play with cards with eternalize; you can use the same items to represent an eternalized token as you would any other token.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If a creature card with eternalize is put into your graveyard during your main phase, you’ll have priority immediately afterward. You can activate its eternalize ability before any player can try to exile it, such as with Crook of Condemnation, if it’s legal for you to do so.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Once you’ve activated an eternalize ability, the card is immediately exiled. Opponents can’t try to stop the ability by exiling the card with an effect such as that of Crook of Condemnation.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Several cards have an eternalize cost that includes “Discard a card.” You can’t discard the card with eternalize to pay its own cost because the card has to be in your graveyard to begin activating its eternalize ability.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'The token copies exactly what was printed on the original card and nothing else, except the characteristics specifically modified by eternalize. It doesn’t copy any information about the object the card was before it was put into your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'The token is a Zombie in addition to its other types and is black instead of its other colors. Its base power and toughness are 4/4. It has no mana cost, and thus its converted mana cost is 0. These are copiable values of the token that other effects may copy.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'For each card with eternalize, a corresponding game play supplement token can be found in some Hour of Devastation booster packs. These supplements are not required to play with cards with eternalize; you can use the same items to represent an eternalized token as you would any other token.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If a creature card with eternalize is put into your graveyard during your main phase, you’ll have priority immediately afterward. You can activate its eternalize ability before any player can try to exile it, such as with Crook of Condemnation, if it’s legal for you to do so.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Once you’ve activated an eternalize ability, the card is immediately exiled. Opponents can’t try to stop the ability by exiling the card with an effect such as that of Crook of Condemnation.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'The token copies exactly what was printed on the original card and nothing else, except the characteristics specifically modified by eternalize. It doesn’t copy any information about the object the card was before it was put into your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'The token is a Zombie in addition to its other types and is black instead of its other colors. Its base power and toughness are 4/4. It has no mana cost, and thus its converted mana cost is 0. These are copiable values of the token that other effects may copy.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'For your life total to become your starting life total (normally 20), you gain or lose the appropriate amount of life. For example, if your life total is 4 when Oketra’s Last Mercy resolves, it will cause you to gain 16 life; alternatively, if your life total is 25 when it resolves, it will cause you to lose 5 life. Other cards that interact with life gain or life loss will interact with this effect accordingly.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If more than one spell says that lands you control don’t untap during your next untap step, the effects will all wear off during that untap step. You’ll untap lands you control during your untap step after that one.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Oketra’s Last Mercy causes the team’s life total to become the team’s starting life total (normally 30), but only you actually gain or lose life.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'No lands that you control will untap during your next untap step, even lands that aren’t tapped as this spell resolves. This includes lands that enter the battlefield after this spell resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Gaining control of a creature doesn’t cause you to gain control of any Auras or Equipment attached to it. They’ll remain attached, but an Aura’s effect that affects “you” still affects its controller rather than you, the controller of an Equipment can move it during their next main phase, and so on.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If more than one spell says that lands you control don’t untap during your next untap step, the effects will all wear off during that untap step. You’ll untap lands you control during your untap step after that one.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If the target permanent is an illegal target by the time Kefnet’s Last Word resolves, the entire spell doesn’t resolve. Your lands will untap during your next untap step as normal.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well, and any effects that give the player control of permanents immediately end.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'No lands that you control will untap during your next untap step, even lands that aren’t tapped as this spell resolves. This includes lands that enter the battlefield after this spell resolves.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'The control-change effect of Kefnet’s Last Word lasts indefinitely. It doesn’t wear off during the cleanup step.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If Nicol Bolas’s third ability causes each opponent to have 0 or less life, but it also causes you to try to draw more cards than you have in your library, the game ends in a draw.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If the target of Nicol Bolas’s second ability becomes illegal, the ability doesn’t resolve and you won’t draw a card. If that target is legal but can’t be destroyed, most likely because it has indestructible, you still draw a card.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, each opponent in turn order makes their choice for Nicol Bolas’s first ability, then all of the actions occur simultaneously. Opponents will know choices made by earlier opponents when making their choices, although a card chosen to be discarded this way isn’t revealed until it’s discarded.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'While resolving Nicol Bolas’s first ability, your opponent chooses a card to be discarded without revealing it, chooses a nonland permanent to be sacrificed, or chooses to do neither. Then that player discards that card, sacrifices that permanent, or loses 3 life. Your opponent can always choose to lose 3 life, even if they have cards to discard or nonland permanents to sacrifice.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If Ruin Rat dies at the same time as another creature, most likely because they were in combat together, its triggered ability can exile that other card.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If Samut’s second ability has two targets and one becomes an illegal target, the remaining target is dealt 1 damage, not 2.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'While resolving Samut’s last ability, all of the creatures and planeswalkers put onto the battlefield this way enter at the same time. If any have triggered abilities that trigger on something else entering the battlefield, they’ll see each other.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'You divide the damage as you activate Samut’s second ability, not as it resolves. Each target must be assigned at least 1 damage. In other words, as you activate the ability, you choose whether to have it deal 2 damage to a single target, or deal 1 damage to each of two targets.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If Saving Grace leaves the battlefield during the turn its triggered ability resolved, damage will continue to be redirected to the creature it enchanted before it left the battlefield. If the creature Saving Grace was last attached to isn’t on the battlefield or isn’t a creature at the time damage would be dealt, it won’t be redirected.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If you have more than one Saving Grace enter the battlefield in one turn, all damage that would be dealt at once to you and/or permanents you control is dealt to one of the enchanted creatures of your choice. It’s not dealt to all of them, and you can’t split the damage between them.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'More damage can be redirected to the enchanted creature than it has toughness, as long as that damage is all dealt at once (like combat damage is).'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Saving Grace’s ability has no effect on damage already dealt earlier in the turn.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Saving Grace’s redirection effect doesn’t change the source of the damage or whether the damage is combat damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If a creature gains one of the listed abilities before Majestic Mryiarch’s triggered ability resolves, perhaps due to another ability that triggered at the beginning of combat, Majestic Myriarch will gain that ability.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Majestic Myriarch’s first ability applies in all zones. While it’s on the battlefield, it counts itself, so it’ll be at least 2/2.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Majestic Myriarch’s second ability triggers at the beginning of each combat, not just combat on your turn, whether or not any creatures you control have any of the listed abilities.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Multiple instances of any of the abilities Majestic Myriarch can gain are redundant.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Which abilities Majestic Myriarch gains is determined as the ability resolves. They won’t change even if every other creature that has the abilities leaves the battlefield or if creatures enter the battlefield or gain abilities.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If a creature with a -1/-1 counter on it dies at the same time as The Scorpion God does, you’ll draw a card. The same is true if The Scorpion God dies with a -1/-1 counter on it.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If this creature dies but leaves your graveyard before the next end step, it will remain in its new zone.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'The “next end step” refers to the next end step that occurs, not the end step of the next turn. If this creature dies before a turn’s end step (for example, during combat), it will be returned to its owner’s hand at the beginning of that turn’s end step.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'You’ll draw only one card when a creature with more than one -1/-1 counter on it dies.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, include the value chosen for that X when determining the converted mana cost of that spell.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Imminent Doom’s triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. The ability will resolve even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'The amount of damage Imminent Doom’s triggered ability deals is the number of counters it had on it as the ability triggered. For example, if you cast Shock and then respond to Imminent Doom’s triggered ability with a second Shock, both abilities cause Imminent Doom to deal 1 damage and Imminent Doom will end up with three doom counters on it.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If an ability checks whether you control a Desert or there is a Desert card in your graveyard, having more than one doesn’t matter. Controlling one is the same as controlling five. There is also no extra bonus for both controlling one and having one in your graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If more than one spell says that lands you control don’t untap during your next untap step, the effects will all wear off during that untap step. You’ll untap lands you control during your untap step after that one.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'No lands that you control will untap during your next untap step, even lands that aren’t tapped as this spell resolves. This includes lands that enter the battlefield after this spell resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If multiple sources would deal damage to one or more planeswalkers you control at once (for example, several attacking creatures), 1 damage from each of those sources to each of those planeswalkers is prevented.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If the card copied by the token had any “when [this permanent] enters the battlefield” abilities, then the token also has those abilities and will trigger them when it’s created. Similarly, any “as [this permanent] enters the battlefield” or “[this permanent] enters the battlefield with” abilities that the token has copied will also work.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'The ability of God-Pharaoh’s Gift doesn’t target the creature card you’ll exile. You choose one as the ability resolves. No player may take actions between the time you choose a creature card to exile and the time you create the token.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'The token copies exactly what was printed on the original card and nothing else, except the characteristics it specifically modifies. It doesn’t copy any information about the object the card was before it was put into your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'The token is a Zombie instead of its other types (unlike Zombies created by an eternalize ability) and is black instead of its other colors. Its power and toughness are 4/4. These are copiable values of the token that other effects may copy.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Unlike the tokens created by an eternalize ability, this token has the mana cost and thus converted mana cost of the card it’s copying.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If the creature you control leaves the battlefield before Ambuscade resolves, Ambuscade has no effect and no damage is dealt. If the creature an opponent controls leaves the battlefield instead, the creature you control gets +1/+0 even though it won’t deal any damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If the opponent exerts any creatures they control, exert and the effect from Imaginary Threats stopping them from untapping both apply in the same untap step. Those creatures will untap as normal in the player’s subsequent untap step.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If, during that player’s declare attackers step, a creature that player controls is tapped or is affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t attack, then it doesn’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having a creature attack, its controller isn’t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t have to attack in that case either.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'No creatures that player controls will untap during their next untap step, even creatures that don’t attack. This includes creatures that enter the battlefield or become tapped after this spell resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If the spell has damage divided as it was cast (like Chandra’s Pyrohelix), the division can’t be changed (although the targets receiving that damage still can).'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If the spell that’s copied has an X whose value was determined as it was cast (like Torment of Hailfire does), the copy will have the same value of X.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If the spell that’s copied is modal (that is, it says “Choose one —” or the like), the copy will have the same mode. A different mode can’t be chosen.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Swarm Intelligence can copy any instant or sorcery spell, not just one with targets.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Swarm Intelligence can copy the spell even if it’s countered before Swarm Intelligence’s triggered ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'The controller of a copy can’t choose to pay any alternative or additional costs for the copy. However, effects based on any alternative or additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'The copy is created on the stack, so it’s not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell (such as Swarm Intelligence’s own ability) won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'The copy will have the same targets as the spell it’s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, you can’t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal).'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Hour of Glory resolves, the entire spell doesn’t resolve. No player reveals their hand or exiles cards from it.'}, {'date': '2018-01-19', 'text': 'There are many important moments in the story, but the most crucial—called “story spotlights”—are shown on cards. These cards have the Planeswalker symbol in their text box; this symbol has no effect on gameplay. You can read more about these events in the official Magic fiction at http://www.mtgstory.com.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If the targeted creature is an illegal target by the time Blur of Blades resolves, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. Blur of Blades won’t deal damage to any player.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'If this creature dies but leaves your graveyard before the next end step, it will remain in its new zone.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "The “next end step” refers to the next end step that occurs, not the end step of the next turn. If this creature dies before a turn\'s end step (for example, during combat), it will be returned to its owner\'s hand at the beginning of that turn\'s end step."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, The Scarab God\'s first ability causes the opposing team to lose life equal to twice the number of Zombies you control, although you scry only equal to the number of Zombies you control."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "The number of Zombies you control is counted as The Scarab God\'s first ability resolves. Players can try to change that number in response to the ability (perhaps by activating its second ability)."}]', "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If you activate an eternalize or embalm ability, you’ll draw a card before that ability resolves, but after you’ve paid all of the costs for that ability. If an eternalize ability requires a discard to activate, you’ll need to have another card available to discard.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If you cast a spell that’s two or more of these colors, you gain only 1 life.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'The triggered ability of God-Pharaoh’s Faithful will resolve before the spell that caused it to trigger. The ability will resolve even if that spell is countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If you choose Doomfall’s first mode, the target opponent chooses which creature to exile. That creature isn’t targeted, so a creature with hexproof can be exiled this way.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If you choose Doomfall’s second mode, you must exile a nonland card from that player’s hand if able. If you can’t, most likely because that player’s hand contains only land cards, nothing happens. That player won’t exile a creature they control instead.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If you don’t control any creatures or can’t put any -1/-1 counters on any creature you control, you can’t cast Lethal Sting.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Magmaroth’s second ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. The ability will resolve even if that spell is countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Most nonbasic lands that produce green mana aren’t Forests. For example, Desert of the Indomitable isn’t a Forest. Some nonbasic lands (such as Sheltered Thicket from the Amonkhet set) do have basic land types printed on the type line and may be Forests.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Multiple instances of lifelink and deathtouch are redundant.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'The target Zombie will still have lifelink or deathtouch even after combat when it stops being an attacking creature.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Unraveling Mummy’s abilities can target itself while it’s attacking.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Nissa’s Encouragement can’t be used to find a card with the land type Forest that isn’t also named Forest (such as Sheltered Thicket from the Amonkhet set).'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'You can find any or all of the cards listed with Nissa’s Encouragement. You could even find none, but that wouldn’t be very encouraging.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Puncturing Blow’s replacement effect will exile the target creature if it would die this turn for any reason, not just due to lethal damage. It applies to the target creature even if Puncturing Blow deals no damage to it (due to a prevention effect) or Puncturing Blow deals damage to a different creature (due to a redirection effect).'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Quarry Beetle’s ability doesn’t count as playing a land. It can return a land card to the battlefield even if you’ve already played as many lands as able this turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'The ability that defines Apocalypse Demon’s power and toughness works in all zones, not just the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'The other Zombie doesn’t have to block.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Whether you control another Zombie is checked only as you declare blockers. Marauding Boneslasher won’t stop blocking if you don’t control one later.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Unlike other cards in this set that care only whether you control a Desert or there is a Desert card in your graveyard, Ramunap Hydra’s abilities reward you for meeting both conditions. If you control one or more Deserts and have one or more Desert cards in your graveyard, it’ll get +2/+2.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'When Hour of Promise checks the number of Deserts you control, it includes any Deserts you found earlier with Hour of Promise.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': \'There are many important moments in the story, but the most crucial—called "story spotlights"—are shown on cards. These cards have the Planeswalker symbol in their text box; this symbol has no effect on gameplay. You can read more about these events in the official Magic fiction at http://www.mtgstory.com.\'}]', "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'While resolving Nissa’s last ability, all creatures and lands put onto the battlefield this way enter at the same time. If any have triggered abilities that trigger on something else entering the battlefield, they’ll see each other.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'You can activate Nissa’s first ability with fewer than four targets. For example, you could target one creature and two lands, or no creatures and two lands. You could even choose no targets at all.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'While resolving the triggered ability of Torment of Scarabs, the enchanted player chooses a card to be discarded without revealing it, chooses a nonland permanent to be sacrificed, or chooses to do neither. Then that player discards that card, sacrifices that permanent, or loses 3 life. That player can always choose to lose 3 life, even if they have cards to discard or nonland permanents to sacrifice.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'You can’t tap a single untapped Desert both to pay {1} and also to pay “Tap an untapped Desert you control.”'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'You choose a target for Wasp of the Bitter End’s triggered ability right after casting a Bolas planeswalker spell, but you don’t choose whether to sacrifice Wasp of the Bitter End or not until that ability resolves. If the creature becomes an illegal target, the entire ability doesn’t resolve and you can’t sacrifice Wasp of the Bitter End.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'You determine the cost to cast Hour of Revelation before you pay any of that cost. For example, if the only nonland permanents on the battlefield are Tezzeret the Schemer and nine Etherium Cells he’s given you, Hour of Revelation costs {W}{W}{W} to cast. You may sacrifice three Etherium Cells to pay this cost, even though there are no longer ten or more nonland permanents after you produce {W}{W}{W}.'}, {'date': '2018-01-19', 'text': 'There are many important moments in the story, but the most crucial—called “story spotlights”—are shown on cards. These cards have the Planeswalker symbol in their text box; this symbol has no effect on gameplay. You can read more about these events in the official Magic fiction at http://www.mtgstory.com.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'You don’t choose which land to return to its owner’s hand or whether to discard a card instead until you see the two cards you draw.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'Act of Heroism can target an untapped creature. It still gets +2/+2 and can block an additional creature.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'The effects of Act of Heroism are cumulative. If multiples resolve targeting the same creature, that creature can block that many additional creatures this turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "Untapping an attacking creature doesn\'t remove it from combat."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "You can cast Act of Heroism even if the target creature won\'t be able to block right away, perhaps because you\'re the attacking player."}]', "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'Overcome affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won’t get +2/+2 or gain trample.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Crash Through affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won\'t gain trample."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "You may cast Crash Through even if you control no creatures. If you control no creatures as the spell resolves, you\'ll just draw a card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If Riddleform becomes a creature the same turn it enters the battlefield, you can\'t attack with it unless it gains haste."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Riddleform\'s first ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger but after targets for that spell are chosen. It will resolve even if that spell is countered."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "You won\'t gain more than 8 life if more than one creature died this turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'For cards in your library with {X} in their mana costs, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Once Sifter Wurm\'s triggered ability begins to resolve, no player may take other actions until it\'s done. Notably, opponents can\'t try to change your library after you scry but before you reveal the top card of your library."}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Hollow One’s cost is reduced even if the cards you’ve cycled or discarded aren’t in your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Hollow One’s first ability doesn’t give you permission to discard cards. You’ll need another effect that instructs or allows you to discard them, such as a cycling ability.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Once you’ve discarded three cards during one turn, Hollow One costs {0} to cast. It won’t stop at {1} or cost negative amounts of mana.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Hollow One). The mana value of the spell is determined by only its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast that spell was.'}]"]
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': "Rhonas\' Getreue", \'text\': "Du kannst Rhonas\' Getreue erschöpfen, sowie sie angreift. Wenn du dies tust, erhält sie +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges und kann in diesem Zug von Kreaturen mit Stärke 2 oder weniger nicht geblockt werden. (Eine erschöpfte Kreatur enttappt nicht während deines nächsten Enttappsegments.)", \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Macht mal Platz."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431021&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b5a40dc-44c2-4c3f-bb02-8ec96834a791\', \'multiverseId\': 431021}, \'multiverseid\': 431021}, {\'name\': \'Fornida de Rhonas\', \'text\': \'Puedes espolear a la Fornida de Rhonas en cuanto ataque. Cuando lo hagas, obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno y no puede ser bloqueada por criaturas con fuerza de 2 o menos este turno. (Una criatura espoleada no se enderezará durante tu próximo paso de enderezar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Hazme sitio".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431220&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2349f34d-b40b-4f7e-8f1f-8f6a63cbff1b\', \'multiverseId\': 431220}, \'multiverseid\': 431220}, {\'name\': \'Vaillante de Rhonas\', \'text\': "Vous pouvez surmener la Vaillante de Rhonas au moment où elle attaque. Quand vous faites ainsi, elle gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour et ne peut pas être bloquée par des créatures de force inférieure ou égale à 2 ce tour-ci. (Une créature surmenée ne se dégage pas pendant votre prochaine étape de dégagement.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'« Reculez un peu. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431419&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fd568f2-a412-4e31-830f-70d84901ab89\', \'multiverseId\': 431419}, \'multiverseid\': 431419}, {\'name\': \'Temeraria di Rhonas\', \'text\': \'Puoi stremare la Temeraria di Rhonas mentre attacca. Quando lo fai, prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno e non può essere bloccata da creature con forza pari o inferiore a 2 in questo turno. (Una creatura stremata non STAPpa durante il tuo prossimo STAP.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Lasciatemi spazio."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431618&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0d7f954-e45b-4b7f-aaf0-dd1f070266a2\', \'multiverseId\': 431618}, \'multiverseid\': 431618}, {\'name\': \'ロナスの重鎮\', \'text\': \'ロナスの重鎮が攻撃するに際し、あなたはこれを督励してもよい。そうしたとき、ターン終了時まで、これは＋１/＋１の修整を受けるとともに、このターン、これはパワーが２以下のクリーチャーによってはブロックされない。（督励されたクリーチャーは、あなたの次のアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「そこ、どいて！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431817&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56d28d66-3b24-4e09-9875-e4888aec37e5\', \'multiverseId\': 431817}, \'multiverseid\': 431817}, {\'name\': \'로나스의 숙련병\', \'text\': \'당신은 로나스의 숙련병으로 공격을 선언하면서 로나스의 숙련병을 분전시킬 수 있다. 그렇게 할 때, 로나스의 숙련병은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받고 이 턴에 공격력이 2 이하인 생물에게 방어될 수 없다. (분전한 생물은 당신의 다음 언탭단에 언탭되지 않는다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 전사\', \'flavor\': \'"좀 비켜봐."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432016&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5826233c-7e72-4038-bec9-31b765470142\', \'multiverseId\': 432016}, \'multiverseid\': 432016}, {\'name\': \'Destemida de Rhonas\', \'text\': \'Você pode exaurir Destemida de Rhonas conforme ela ataca. Quando você faz isso, ela recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno e não pode ser bloqueada por criaturas com poder igual ou inferior a 2 neste turno. (Uma criatura exaurida não será desvirada durante sua próxima etapa de desvirar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Abram espaço."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432215&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f4a2945-d9ec-43b1-9c47-e5a67dc3b09e\', \'multiverseId\': 432215}, \'multiverseid\': 432215}, {\'name\': \'Поборница Ронаса\', \'text\': \'Вы можете подстегнуть Поборницу Ронаса в момент ее атаки. Когда вы это делаете, она получает +1/+1 до конца хода и не может быть заблокирована существами с силой 2 или меньше в этом ходу. (Подстегнутое существо не разворачивается во время вашего следующего шага разворота.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Воин\', \'flavor\': \'«Отойди в сторонку».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432414&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'163c3823-f819-4b57-8055-62fea6831ad7\', \'multiverseId\': 432414}, \'multiverseid\': 432414}, {\'name\': \'罗纳斯的大力士\', \'text\': \'你可以于罗纳斯的大力士攻击时耗竭之。当你如此作时，它得+1/+1直到回合结束，且本回合不能被力量等于或小于2的生物阻挡。（已耗竭的生物于你的下一个重置步骤中不能重置。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「别挡道。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432613&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bb682aa-1087-4f46-9c24-c2a2094fa2f3\', \'multiverseId\': 432613}, \'multiverseid\': 432613}, {\'name\': \'羅納斯的大力士\', \'text\': \'你可以於羅納斯的大力士攻擊時耗竭之。當你如此作時，它得+1/+1直到回合結束，且本回合不能被力量等於或小於2的生物阻擋。（已耗竭的生物於你的下一個重置步驟中不能重置。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'「別擋道。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432812&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b7a9076-9e09-4efd-800d-03801abf470e\', \'multiverseId\': 432812}, \'multiverseid\': 432812}]', '[{\'name\': "Rhonas\' letztes Aufbäumen", \'text\': \'Erzeuge einen 5/4 grünen Ophis-Kreaturenspielstein. Länder, die du kontrollierst, enttappen nicht während deines nächsten Enttappsegments.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': "Rhonas\' unbezwingbarer Wille lebt in seinen Geschöpfen weiter.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431020&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c732a54-03b3-4f62-ac4b-2baecd6c2a4f\', \'multiverseId\': 431020}, \'multiverseid\': 431020}, {\'name\': \'Último esfuerzo de Rhonas\', \'text\': \'Crea una ficha de criatura Víbora verde 5/4. Las tierras que controlas no se enderezarán durante tu próximo paso de enderezar.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Rhonas siguió luchando hasta su último aliento e incluso más allá de él.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431219&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5d86769-10bf-4b8d-9411-d042c3021a3b\', \'multiverseId\': 431219}, \'multiverseid\': 431219}, {\'name\': \'La dernière bataille de Rhonas\', \'text\': \'Créez un jeton de créature 5/4 verte Serpent. Les terrains que vous contrôlez ne se dégagent pas pendant votre prochaine étape de dégagement.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Rhonas continua à se battre jusqu\'à son dernier souffle, et même encore après.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431418&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d212be9-4979-4dc3-8063-41a41f7fd052\', \'multiverseId\': 431418}, \'multiverseid\': 431418}, {\'name\': \'Ultima Resistenza di Rhonas\', \'text\': \'Crea una pedina creatura Serpente 5/4 verde. Le terre che controlli non STAPpano durante il tuo prossimo STAP.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Rhonas continuò a combattere fino all\'ultimo respiro e persino oltre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431617&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c6c7216-4181-4773-b67e-138569281e57\', \'multiverseId\': 431617}, \'multiverseid\': 431617}, {\'name\': \'ロナス最後の抵抗\', \'text\': \'緑の５/４の蛇・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。あなたがコントロールする土地は、あなたの次のアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ロナスは最後の瞬間を越えて戦い続けた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431816&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab5428b2-c7aa-44b1-9b65-6b21fecb411c\', \'multiverseId\': 431816}, \'multiverseid\': 431816}, {\'name\': \'로나스의 최후의 저항\', \'text\': \'5/4 녹색 뱀 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다. 당신이 조종하는 대지들은 당신의 다음 언탭단에 언탭되지 않는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'로나스는 마지막 숨결을 내뱉은 후에도 계속해서 싸웠다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432015&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ee38937-f0ce-420a-967b-a3b3348871f3\', \'multiverseId\': 432015}, \'multiverseid\': 432015}, {\'name\': \'Último Embate de Rhonas\', \'text\': \'Crie uma ficha de criatura verde 5/4 do tipo Cobra. Os terrenos que você controla não são desvirados durante sua próxima etapa de desvirar.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Rhonas continuou a lutar até o último suspiro, e até mesmo além.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432214&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b712e8a0-74b4-4a0c-bd7d-762f1613e4c1\', \'multiverseId\': 432214}, \'multiverseid\': 432214}, {\'name\': \'Последний Бой Ронаса\', \'text\': \'Создайте фишку существа 5/4 зеленая Змея. Земли под вашим контролем не разворачиваются во время вашего следующего шага разворота.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Ронас продолжал сражаться до последнего вздоха — и после.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432413&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d62fddd-238e-4676-aefd-2dd454039507\', \'multiverseId\': 432413}, \'multiverseid\': 432413}, {\'name\': \'罗纳斯临终奋击\', \'text\': \'派出一个5/4绿色的蛇衍生生物。由你操控的地于你的下一个重置步骤中不能重置。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'罗纳斯奋战到了最后一刻，死亦不休。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432612&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3514722c-d441-4db0-8917-57eb8df9ee30\', \'multiverseId\': 432612}, \'multiverseid\': 432612}, {\'name\': \'羅納斯臨終奮擊\', \'text\': \'派出一個5/4綠色的蛇衍生生物。由你操控的地於你的下一個重置步驟中不能重置。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'羅納斯奮戰到了最後一刻，死亦不休。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432811&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'328bec46-c417-4c08-a0c1-70c99a47893e\', \'multiverseId\': 432811}, \'multiverseid\': 432811}]', "[{'name': 'Aaskreischer', 'text': 'Fliegend', 'type': 'Kreatur — Zombie, Vogel', 'flavor': 'Man sieht sich immer zweimal im Leben.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=430949&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7ba65374-46a8-414c-b847-6169378eadb3', 'multiverseId': 430949}, 'multiverseid': 430949}, {'name': 'Chirriante carroñero', 'text': 'Vuela.', 'type': 'Criatura — Ave zombie', 'flavor': 'Los desterrados regresaron como pájaros de mal agüero.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431148&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '19bf935e-608d-41c7-a071-77d4b7780da8', 'multiverseId': 431148}, 'multiverseid': 431148}, {'name': 'Crisseur charognard', 'text': 'Vol', 'type': 'Créature : zombie et oiseau', 'flavor': 'Les bannis sont de retour au bercail.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431347&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e24e5181-0e7f-49fe-939d-2debdbf5e6b3', 'multiverseId': 431347}, 'multiverseid': 431347}, {'name': 'Necrofago Gracchiante', 'text': 'Volare', 'type': 'Creatura — Uccello Zombie', 'flavor': 'Gli esiliati sono tornati in tempo per cena.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431546&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'da111969-6ffc-4791-ae18-a67716212b8a', 'multiverseId': 431546}, 'multiverseid': 431546}, {'name': '屍肉の金切り声上げ', 'text': '飛行', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・鳥', 'flavor': '追放されていたものが、ねぐらに戻って来た。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431745&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f9cc0851-9fdb-4bda-abe7-49a3460e2c00', 'multiverseId': 431745}, 'multiverseid': 431745}, {'name': '시체 비명꾼', 'text': '비행', 'type': '생물 — 좀비 조류', 'flavor': '추방된 자들이 원래 보금자리로 돌아왔다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431944&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9f7fa2fe-b932-4b04-8afb-059bf018dd96', 'multiverseId': 431944}, 'multiverseid': 431944}, {'name': 'Guinchador Carniceiro', 'text': 'Voar', 'type': 'Criatura — Zumbi Ave', 'flavor': 'Os banidos voltaram em tempo para o jantar.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432143&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a8d44df7-967a-4e9b-ad65-41860f03410e', 'multiverseId': 432143}, 'multiverseid': 432143}, {'name': 'Падальный Крикун', 'text': 'Полет', 'type': 'Существо — Зомби Птица', 'flavor': 'Изгнанные вернулись домой, чтобы свить гнезда.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432342&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8bb40346-66a4-4d59-8d32-3781915d07c2', 'multiverseId': 432342}, 'multiverseid': 432342}, {'name': '食腐鸣鸟', 'text': '飞行', 'type': '生物～灵俑／鸟', 'flavor': '遭逐者已归乡筑巢。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432541&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '694d6546-25bb-4d2f-a53e-d97fd29da9e2', 'multiverseId': 432541}, 'multiverseid': 432541}, {'name': '食腐鳴鳥', 'text': '飛行', 'type': '生物～殭屍／鳥', 'flavor': '遭逐者已歸鄉築巢。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432740&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c887f73c-750b-4acf-b1a0-ed5f55a661dc', 'multiverseId': 432740}, 'multiverseid': 432740}]", "[{'name': 'Abwehrende Winde', 'text': 'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl, es sei denn, sein Beherrscher zahlt {1} für jede Karte in deinem Friedhof.\\nUmwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'Die Verewigten haben alle Kampftechniken gemeistert, die für die Prüfungen gelehrt wurden.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=430920&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2b86949e-b61e-4197-a8d7-0b90bf7674c8', 'multiverseId': 430920}, 'multiverseid': 430920}, {'name': 'Vientos opositores', 'text': 'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo a menos que su controlador pague {1} por cada carta que haya en tu cementerio.\\nCiclo {2}. ({2}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': 'Hacía mucho que los eternos dominaban cada una de las técnicas que se enseñaban durante las pruebas.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431119&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cd62cd7d-adca-4c10-8e7c-7a3074715a14', 'multiverseId': 431119}, 'multiverseid': 431119}, {'name': 'Vents contraires', 'text': 'Contrecarrez le sort ciblé à moins que son contrôleur ne paie {1} pour chaque carte dans votre cimetière.\\nRecyclage {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': 'Les Éternels maîtrisaient depuis longtemps toutes les techniques enseignées au cours des épreuves.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431318&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fa65d815-bc42-4c75-b25a-7611fd7d216b', 'multiverseId': 431318}, 'multiverseid': 431318}, {'name': 'Venti Contrastanti', 'text': 'Neutralizza una magia bersaglio a meno che il suo controllore non paghi {1} per ogni carta nel tuo cimitero.\\nCiclo {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': 'Gli Eterni avevano padroneggiato da tempo ognuna delle tecniche insegnate durante le ordalie.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431517&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9aed30ac-98e4-4199-a008-f34d5f1d7f6f', 'multiverseId': 431517}, 'multiverseid': 431517}, {'name': '相殺の風', 'text': '呪文１つを対象とする。それのコントローラーがあなたの墓地にあるカード１枚につき{1}を支払わないかぎり、それを打ち消す。\\nサイクリング{2}（{2}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '永遠衆は試練を通じてあらゆる技術を習得したが、それから長い年月が経っている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431716&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ee21621c-4c50-4910-b4be-6e7eb5706bf6', 'multiverseId': 431716}, 'multiverseid': 431716}, {'name': '상쇄하는 바람', 'text': '주문을 목표로 정한다. 그 주문의 조종자가 당신의 무덤에 있는 카드 한 장당 {1}을 지불하지 않으면 그 주문을 무효화한다.\\n순환 {2} ({2}, 이 카드를 버린다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.)', 'type': '순간마법', 'flavor': '영생자들은 시험을 거치며 배운 모든 기술을 오래전에 통달했다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431915&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'da12bf78-7a0b-45c1-a664-fab19dab6c69', 'multiverseId': 431915}, 'multiverseid': 431915}, {'name': 'Ventos Contrários', 'text': 'Anule a mágica alvo, a menos que seu controlador pague \\\\\\\\{1}\\\\\\\\ para cada card em seu cemitério.\\nReciclar {2} ({2}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': 'Os Eternos haviam dominado fazia muito tempo todas as técnicas ensinadas durante as provas.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432114&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9b3e7e35-93e9-49a6-905b-6f141a969220', 'multiverseId': 432114}, 'multiverseid': 432114}, {'name': 'Противостоящий Ветер', 'text': 'Отмените целевое заклинание, если только контролирующий его игрок не заплатит {1} за каждую карту на вашем кладбище.\\nЦикл {2} ({2}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)', 'type': 'Мгновенное заклинание', 'flavor': 'Вековечные давным-давно в совершенстве освоили все приемы, которым учат во время испытаний.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432313&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'abb94d73-35e8-409e-a835-50a981da9024', 'multiverseId': 432313}, 'multiverseid': 432313}, {'name': '抵消狂风', 'text': '除非目标咒语的操控者为每张在你坟墓场的牌支付{1}，否则反击之。\\n循环{2}（{2}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '永生者早已掌握了祀炼中所教授的每一项技巧。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432512&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '961c92fd-4a58-4d59-9fcb-04ed5fe6637d', 'multiverseId': 432512}, 'multiverseid': 432512}, {'name': '抵消狂風', 'text': '除非目標咒語的操控者為每張在你墳墓場的牌支付{1}，否則反擊之。\\n循環{2}（{2}，棄掉此牌：抽一張牌。）', 'type': '瞬間', 'flavor': '永生者早已掌握了祀煉中所教授的每一項技巧。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432711&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'af5fbe2a-3b1b-4ac2-8bdc-55319291c0bf', 'multiverseId': 432711}, 'multiverseid': 432711}]", '[{\'name\': \'Amulett des Reisenden\', \'text\': \'{1}, opfere das Amulett des Reisenden: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, zeige sie offen vor und nimm sie auf deine Hand. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Folge deinem Herzen und du wirst dich nie verlaufen. Oder folge einfach diesem Amulett." —Pytamun, ehemaliger Geweihter der Nef-Saat\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431055&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a73a752-d895-4a65-b48b-5eb4f922191e\', \'multiverseId\': 431055}, \'multiverseid\': 431055}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto del viajero\', \'text\': \'{1}, sacrificar el Amuleto del viajero: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, muéstrala y ponla en tu mano. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Por qué vagar en busca de un nuevo hogar cuando el camino a seguir se abre ante ti?" —Pytamun, antiguo iniciado de la simiente Nef\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431254&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d24e62d9-af74-4c15-9422-17cef918b9cb\', \'multiverseId\': 431254}, \'multiverseid\': 431254}, {\'name\': \'Amulette du voyageur\', \'text\': "{1}, sacrifiez l\'Amulette du voyageur : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, révélez-la et mettez-la dans votre main. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Pourquoi errer en quête d\'un nouveau foyer quand le chemin s\'étend devant vous ? » —Pytamon, ancien adepte de la moisson Nef", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431453&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'333b2ac6-2bcf-4b74-aa09-9db76e30108a\', \'multiverseId\': 431453}, \'multiverseid\': 431453}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto del Viaggiatore\', \'text\': "{1}, Sacrifica l\'Amuleto del Viaggiatore: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Perché vagare in cerca di una nuova patria quando il cammino è già tracciato di fronte a voi?" —Pytamun, ex iniziato della messe Nef\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431652&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a420e418-a81d-4746-af51-7bcdb6b0af9c\', \'multiverseId\': 431652}, \'multiverseid\': 431652}, {\'name\': \'旅行者の護符\', \'text\': \'{1}, 旅行者の護符を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、それを公開してあなたの手札に加える。その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「新たな故郷を求めてさまよう必要はない。道は用意されている。」 ――ネフ一門の元修練者、ピタムン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431851&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c097e285-87df-4617-84af-4ddb044ea2e6\', \'multiverseId\': 431851}, \'multiverseid\': 431851}, {\'name\': \'여행자의 부적\', \'text\': \'{1}, 여행자의 부적을 희생한다: 당신의 서고에서 기본 대지 카드 한 장을 찾아 공개한 후 당신의 손으로 가져간다. 그 후 당신의 서고를 섞는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'"당신 앞에 길이 놓여 있는데, 왜 새로운 집을 찾아 방황하지?" —전 네프 입문자 입회자 피타문\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432050&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac9469dc-cc0f-40cf-9435-6c20a645521d\', \'multiverseId\': 432050}, \'multiverseid\': 432050}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto do Viajante\', \'text\': \'{1}, sacrifique Amuleto do Viajante: Procure um card de terreno básico em seu grimório, revele-o e coloque-o em sua mão. Depois, embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Por que vagar em busca de um novo lar quando o caminho se evidencia diante de você?" — Pitamon, ex-iniciado da safra Nef\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432249&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6b78f69-55ac-4f1c-9a09-3b6da27ee70d\', \'multiverseId\': 432249}, \'multiverseid\': 432249}, {\'name\': \'Амулет Путешественника\', \'text\': \'{1}, пожертвуйте Амулет Путешественника: найдите в вашей библиотеке карту базовой земли, покажите ее и положите в вашу руку. Затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'«Зачем скитаться в поисках нового дома, когда путь проложен перед каждым?» — Питамун, бывший послушник снопа Неф\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432448&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1798cc9-4548-4e63-8e33-8ec896a55b5a\', \'multiverseId\': 432448}, \'multiverseid\': 432448}, {\'name\': \'旅人护身符\', \'text\': \'{1}，牺牲旅人护身符：从你的牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，展示该牌，并将它置于你手上。然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「通往新家园的道路已摆在面前，何必还去四处找寻？」 ～原奈法祀群祀徒拜塔蒙\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432647&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25694e48-f5f4-4ab2-bea2-ef35c67066d2\', \'multiverseId\': 432647}, \'multiverseid\': 432647}, {\'name\': \'旅人護身符\', \'text\': \'{1}，犧牲旅人護身符：從你的牌庫中搜尋一張基本地牌，展示該牌，並將它置於你手上。然後將你的牌庫洗牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「通往新家園的道路已擺在面前，何必還去四處找尋？」 ～原奈法祀群祀徒拜塔蒙\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432846&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9b8972f-1133-492f-86b7-f7b273537ceb\', \'multiverseId\': 432846}, \'multiverseid\': 432846}]', "[{'name': 'Anheimfallen // Vergessenheit', 'text': 'Bringe eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist, auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Anheimfallen', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431037&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '99e3156f-8acd-4ba0-aa7a-1c4733e16df1', 'multiverseId': 431037}, 'multiverseid': 431037}, {'name': 'Relegar // Olvido', 'text': 'Regresa el permanente objetivo que no sea tierra a la mano de su propietario.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Relegar', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431236&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a1798e09-9ab0-45eb-a6c3-523fa3663453', 'multiverseId': 431236}, 'multiverseid': 431236}, {'name': 'Reléguer // Oubliettes', 'text': 'Renvoyez le permanent non-terrain ciblé dans la main de son propriétaire.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Reléguer', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431435&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7b8ebe65-3ceb-45d5-981b-885b07869bbe', 'multiverseId': 431435}, 'multiverseid': 431435}, {'name': 'Relegare // Oblio', 'text': 'Fai tornare un permanente non terra bersaglio in mano al suo proprietario.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Relegare', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431634&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7f531650-0c7d-4920-8e96-72f7ed5d4970', 'multiverseId': 431634}, 'multiverseid': 431634}, {'name': '徙家 // 忘妻', 'text': '土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とし、それをオーナーの手札に戻す。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': '徙家', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431833&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b324d383-b00b-4873-b5b7-6c18a8394e8b', 'multiverseId': 431833}, 'multiverseid': 431833}, {'name': '위탁 // 망각', 'text': '대지가 아닌 지속물을 목표로 정한다. 그 지속물을 소유자의 손으로 되돌린다.', 'type': '순간마법', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': '위탁', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432032&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '46768f23-b092-42e2-95d4-8f83a48c5d82', 'multiverseId': 432032}, 'multiverseid': 432032}, {'name': 'Enviar // Oblívio', 'text': 'Devolva a permanente alvo que não seja um terreno para a mão de seu dono.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Enviar', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432231&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6452139b-efd4-4eb5-b039-ea9033c3d1b7', 'multiverseId': 432231}, 'multiverseid': 432231}, {'name': 'Обречь // На Забвение', 'text': 'Верните целевой не являющийся землей перманент в руку его владельца.', 'type': 'Мгновенное заклинание', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Обречь', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432430&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd1956a51-3d9a-4723-82d1-74a703408dfe', 'multiverseId': 432430}, 'multiverseid': 432430}, {'name': '托诸 // 东流', 'text': '将目标非地永久物移回其拥有者手上。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': '托诸', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432629&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7e53aed7-79d6-4b96-b50e-95565587916c', 'multiverseId': 432629}, 'multiverseid': 432629}, {'name': '托諸 // 東流', 'text': '將目標非地永久物移回其擁有者手上。', 'type': '瞬間', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': '托諸', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432828&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd0506226-6c07-49a6-85b5-0e8e43295ab9', 'multiverseId': 432828}, 'multiverseid': 432828}]", "[{'name': 'Anspruch // Ruhm', 'text': 'Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl mit umgewandelten Manakosten von 2 oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Anspruch', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431038&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cd378b62-9f42-4579-a019-9fbbb0844de2', 'multiverseId': 431038}, 'multiverseid': 431038}, {'name': 'Solicitar // Fama', 'text': 'Regresa la carta de criatura objetivo con coste de maná convertido de 2 o menos de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Solicitar', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431237&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f2ce48ee-1c90-4551-bda9-ac86e1056bed', 'multiverseId': 431237}, 'multiverseid': 431237}, {'name': 'Ambition // Gloire', 'text': 'Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière une carte de créature ciblée avec un coût converti de mana inférieur ou égal à 2.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Ambition', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431436&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '29fc05f6-3fec-40df-809e-44f520c25504', 'multiverseId': 431436}, 'multiverseid': 431436}, {'name': 'Ritorno // Gloria', 'text': 'Rimetti sul campo di battaglia una carta creatura bersaglio con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore a 2 dal tuo cimitero.', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Ritorno', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431635&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '471525cf-8ff1-4065-b4c4-7bdffdf2078e', 'multiverseId': 431635}, 'multiverseid': 431635}, {'name': '立身 // 出世', 'text': 'あなたの墓地から点数で見たマナ・コストが２以下のクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それを戦場に戻す。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': '立身', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431834&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '305b2328-1194-4e66-92ab-82d4448cc1b4', 'multiverseId': 431834}, 'multiverseid': 431834}, {'name': '요구 // 명성', 'text': '당신의 무덤에 있는 전환마나비용이 2 이하인 생물 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 전장으로 되돌린다.', 'type': '집중마법', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': '요구', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432033&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1cd3e741-7b0e-412e-8fc1-51f8867704d5', 'multiverseId': 432033}, 'multiverseid': 432033}, {'name': 'Reivindicar // Fama', 'text': 'Devolva o card de criatura alvo com custo de mana convertido igual ou inferior a 2 de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha.', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Reivindicar', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432232&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '344eb7ca-ee1f-4b5c-80be-f8c34f98a6c9', 'multiverseId': 432232}, 'multiverseid': 432232}, {'name': 'Притязания // На Славу', 'text': 'Верните целевую карту существа с конвертированной мана-стоимостью не более 2 из вашего кладбища на поле битвы.', 'type': 'Волшебство', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Притязания', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432431&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f15db892-fff2-49bc-829e-49d05d0b4b36', 'multiverseId': 432431}, 'multiverseid': 432431}, {'name': '夺回 // 名誉', 'text': '将目标总法术力费用等于或小于2的生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': '夺回', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432630&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6b716ad0-a767-4ffa-8ffc-9c4a9ea2a896', 'multiverseId': 432630}, 'multiverseid': 432630}, {'name': '奪回 // 名譽', 'text': '將目標總魔法力費用等於或小於2的生物牌從你的墳墓場移回戰場。', 'type': '巫術', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': '奪回', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432829&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd4367b24-84a3-41ae-a293-752f8b40ee3c', 'multiverseId': 432829}, 'multiverseid': 432829}]", '[{\'name\': \'Antlitz des Bolas\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Antlitz des Bolas ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Bibliothek und/oder deinen Friedhof nach einer Karte namens Nicol Bolas, der Täuscher, durchsuchen, sie offen vorzeigen und auf deine Hand nehmen. Falls du auf diese Weise deine Bibliothek durchsuchst, mische sie danach.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {U}, {B} oder {R}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432897&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad9198e1-0174-4952-876c-1dcb1fafce03\', \'multiverseId\': 432897}, \'multiverseid\': 432897}, {\'name\': \'Semblante de Nicol Bolas\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Semblante de Nicol Bolas entre al campo de batalla, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca y/o cementerio una carta llamada Nicol Bolas, el Embaucador, mostrarla y ponerla en tu mano. Si buscas en tu biblioteca de esta manera, barájala.\\n{T}: Agrega {U}, {B} o {R} a tu reserva de maná.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432907&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab2f4e45-9122-4e77-98d0-0509a5c17b77\', \'multiverseId\': 432907}, \'multiverseid\': 432907}, {\'name\': \'Visage de Bolas\', \'text\': \'Quand le Visage de Bolas arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque et/ou votre cimetière une carte appelée Nicol Bolas, le manipulateur, la révéler et la mettre dans votre main. Si vous avez cherché dans votre bibliothèque de cette manière, mélangez-la.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U}, {B} ou {R} à votre réserve.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432917&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2b77e4f-dbb5-4068-becc-baeae128d623\', \'multiverseId\': 432917}, \'multiverseid\': 432917}, {\'name\': \'Volto di Bolas\', \'text\': "Quando il Volto di Bolas entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio e/o il tuo cimitero per una carta chiamata Nicol Bolas, l\'Ingannatore, rivelarla e aggiungerla alla tua mano. Se passi in rassegna il tuo grimorio in questo modo, rimescolalo.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U}, {B} o {R} alla tua riserva di mana.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432927&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c8bca84-3de7-44b5-85e5-f6178bca825b\', \'multiverseId\': 432927}, \'multiverseid\': 432927}, {\'name\': \'ボーラスの肖像\', \'text\': \'ボーラスの肖像が戦場に出たとき、あなたはあなたのライブラリーやあなたの墓地から「欺瞞の主、ニコル・ボーラス」という名前のカード１枚を探し、それを公開してあなたの手札に加えてもよい。あなたがこれによりあなたのライブラリーからカードを探したなら、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{U}か{B}か{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432937&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebd123e0-2b56-483e-b36e-f08f75ec89ac\', \'multiverseId\': 432937}, \'multiverseid\': 432937}, {\'name\': \'볼라스의 얼굴\', \'text\': \'볼라스의 얼굴이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 당신의 서고 그리고/또는 무덤에서 이름이 기만자, 니콜 볼라스인 카드 한 장을 찾아 공개한 후 당신의 손으로 가져갈 수 있다. 당신이 이런 식으로 당신의 서고를 찾아보았다면, 당신의 서고를 섞는다.\\n{T}: {U}, {B} 또는 {R}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432947&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3631c8e3-0ce4-4c5e-aad8-8b4e127acd51\', \'multiverseId\': 432947}, \'multiverseid\': 432947}, {\'name\': \'Face de Nicol Bolas\', \'text\': \'Quando Face de Nicol Bolas entra no campo de batalha, você pode procurar em seu grimório e/ou cemitério um card com o nome Nicol Bolas, o Enganador, revelá-lo e colocá-lo em sua mão. Se procurar em seu grimório desta maneira, embaralhe-o.\\n{T}: Adicione {U}, {B} ou {R} à sua reserva de mana.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432957&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e3dab2f-d564-48ec-b53d-34d769d795aa\', \'multiverseId\': 432957}, \'multiverseid\': 432957}, {\'name\': \'Лик Боласа\', \'text\': \'Когда Лик Боласа выходит на поле битвы, вы можете найти в вашей библиотеке и (или) на вашем кладбище карту с именем Никол Болас, Обманщик, показать ее и положить в вашу руку. Если вы ищете таким образом в вашей библиотеке, перетасуйте ее.\\n{T}: добавьте {U}, {B} или {R} в ваше хранилище маны.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432967&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9df91889-8c6e-404f-a370-f06f701674e7\', \'multiverseId\': 432967}, \'multiverseid\': 432967}, {\'name\': \'波拉斯尊容\', \'text\': \'当波拉斯尊容进战场时，你可以从你的牌库和／或坟墓场中搜寻一张名称为欺瞒神龙尼可波拉斯的牌，展示该牌，并将它置于你手上。如果你以此法搜寻你的牌库，则将它洗牌。\\n{T}：加{U}，{B}或{R}到你的法术力池中。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432977&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e466830c-1eb8-4ac6-a1d9-b2ca39d5c232\', \'multiverseId\': 432977}, \'multiverseid\': 432977}, {\'name\': \'波拉斯尊容\', \'text\': \'當波拉斯尊容進戰場時，你可以從你的牌庫和／或墳墓場中搜尋一張名稱為欺瞞神龍尼可波拉斯的牌，展示該牌，並將它置於你手上。如果你以此法搜尋你的牌庫，則將它洗牌。\\n{T}：加{U}，{B}或{R}到你的魔法力池中。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432987&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6f60438-789d-4ffb-b4a3-f042354497d9\', \'multiverseId\': 432987}, \'multiverseid\': 432987}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufscheuern\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Aufscheuern fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\\n• Zerstöre ein Artefakt deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Die Wüste ist eine hungrige Bestie, die sowohl Fleisch als auch Knochen verschlingt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=430971&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d8eed86-22f9-4659-96c5-950fa0a135a2\', \'multiverseId\': 430971}, \'multiverseid\': 430971}, {\'name\': \'Erosionar\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• Erosionar hace 3 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo.\\n• Destruye el artefacto objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'El desierto es una bestia voraz que devora tanto carne como roca.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431170&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e96fc0f-9901-41ec-a822-58387ea27c52\', \'multiverseId\': 431170}, \'multiverseid\': 431170}, {\'name\': \'Fissuration\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• La Fissuration inflige 3 blessures à la créature ciblée.\\n• Détruisez l\'artefact ciblé.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'Le désert est une bête vorace, tout autant avide de chair que de pierre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431369&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'568e191d-2594-41de-948e-dcf18d3c1d60\', \'multiverseId\': 431369}, \'multiverseid\': 431369}, {\'name\': \'Abrasione\', \'text\': "Scegli uno —\\n• L\'Abrasione infligge 3 danni a una creatura bersaglio.\\n• Distruggi un artefatto bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Il deserto è una belva famelica che divora carne e pietra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ab88ff8-6027-42bd-a038-e1a2b0332f52\', \'multiverseId\': 431568}, \'multiverseid\': 431568}, {\'name\': \'削剥\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• クリーチャー１体を対象とする。削剥はそれに３点のダメージを与える。\\n• アーティファクト１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'砂漠の食欲は底無しで、肉も石も貪り尽くす。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431767&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89510f57-3027-4cee-aa6d-0f779e856f8d\', \'multiverseId\': 431767}, \'multiverseid\': 431767}, {\'name\': \'마멸\', \'text\': \'하나를 선택한다 —\\n• 생물을 목표로 정한다. 마멸은 그 생물에게 피해 3점을 입힌다.\\n• 마법물체를 목표로 정한다. 그 마법물체를 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'사막은 생물과 암석을 모두 집어삼키는 탐욕스러운 야수다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431966&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97a5ba83-f6da-4366-9cab-69d923ef9867\', \'multiverseId\': 431966}, \'multiverseid\': 431966}, {\'name\': \'Abrasão\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• Abrasão causa 3 pontos de dano à criatura alvo.\\n• Destrua o artefato alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'O deserto é uma fera voraz, pois devora tanto a carne quanto as pedras.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432165&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ef475d0-c455-42da-848e-83e62aacb997\', \'multiverseId\': 432165}, \'multiverseid\': 432165}, {\'name\': \'Истирание\', \'text\': \'Выберите одно —\\n• Истирание наносит 3 повреждения целевому существу.\\n• Уничтожьте целевой артефакт.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Пустыня — прожорливая тварь, поглощающая и плоть, и камни.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432364&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'659e95c3-4920-4dde-9b06-cc57faa5b603\', \'multiverseId\': 432364}, \'multiverseid\': 432364}, {\'name\': \'风化侵蚀\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•风化侵蚀对目标生物造成3点伤害。\\n•消灭目标神器。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'沙漠是一头贪餍的野兽，能将骨肉砂石悉数吞没。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432563&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'644bf8a9-1bcc-4070-a71e-67b53a8c7710\', \'multiverseId\': 432563}, \'multiverseid\': 432563}, {\'name\': \'風化侵蝕\', \'text\': \'選擇一項～\\n‧風化侵蝕對目標生物造成3點傷害。\\n‧消滅目標神器。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'沙漠是一頭貪饜的野獸，能將骨肉砂石悉數吞沒。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432762&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6521c9a-cada-4a21-a15d-868cd3e760b0\', \'multiverseId\': 432762}, \'multiverseid\': 432762}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausgehungerter Streuner\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Ausgehungerte Streuner stirbt, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze\', \'flavor\': \'Manchmal bleibt einem nichts anderes übrig, als die Hand zu fressen, die einen fütterte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431003&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd5bf46c-3bf4-4038-94dd-01a094283119\', \'multiverseId\': 431003}, \'multiverseid\': 431003}, {\'name\': \'Rondador salvaje\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Rondador salvaje muera, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': \'Muchos gatos, que antaño fueron los compañeros favoritos, tuvieron que aprender a valerse por sí mismos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431202&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'085cf134-fd48-44d4-b608-737e7a7ea3bf\', \'multiverseId\': 431202}, \'multiverseid\': 431202}, {\'name\': \'Rôdeur sauvage\', \'text\': \'Quand le Rôdeur sauvage meurt, piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature : chat\', \'flavor\': "Compagnons privilégiés d\'autrefois, de nombreux chats furent soudain livrés à eux-mêmes.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431401&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a74c1cde-f5ac-449d-b46a-184880a632f5\', \'multiverseId\': 431401}, \'multiverseid\': 431401}, {\'name\': \'Predatore Feroce\', \'text\': \'Quando il Predatore Feroce muore, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': \'Un tempo coccolati come compagni di vita, molti gatti furono abbandonati a loro stessi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431600&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab50be98-ce11-4428-a5e4-876224c53b5c\', \'multiverseId\': 431600}, \'multiverseid\': 431600}, {\'name\': \'残忍な野猫\', \'text\': \'残忍な野猫が死亡したとき、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫\', \'flavor\': \'かつて猫は相棒として人気があった。その多くが取り残されて、自活を迫られている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431799&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e88cf6f4-c726-4948-8c10-0f0c86480b16\', \'multiverseId\': 431799}, \'multiverseid\': 431799}, {\'name\': \'야생의 배회자\', \'text\': \'야생의 배회자가 죽을 때, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 고양이\', \'flavor\': \'한때 사랑받던 반려묘였던 수많은 고양이가 주인을 잃고 스스로 살아남아야 했다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431998&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72ea315e-bec8-4b41-a599-1bde2ebf9de7\', \'multiverseId\': 431998}, \'multiverseid\': 431998}, {\'name\': \'Espreitador Feral\', \'text\': \'Quando Espreitador Feral morrer, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': \'Outrora companheiros preferidos, muitos gatos foram abandonados à própria sorte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432197&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b90c5a3-545c-442f-b907-db56d9f6bd72\', \'multiverseId\': 432197}, \'multiverseid\': 432197}, {\'name\': \'Одичавшая Охотница\', \'text\': \'Когда Одичавшая Охотница умирает, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кошка\', \'flavor\': \'Кошкам, многие из которых были верными спутниками горожан, теперь приходилось выживать самостоятельно.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432396&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6f553cc-df15-4bc0-8ed2-8b6d69e186ae\', \'multiverseId\': 432396}, \'multiverseid\': 432396}, {\'name\': \'野性游掠者\', \'text\': \'当野性游掠者死去时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～猫\', \'flavor\': \'猫曾是许多人的钟爱同伴，如今大多只能自谋生路。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432595&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f7ec2fa-7667-48c2-a2f9-1e55552a26e2\', \'multiverseId\': 432595}, \'multiverseid\': 432595}, {\'name\': \'野性遊掠者\', \'text\': \'當野性遊掠者死去時，抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～貓\', \'flavor\': \'貓曾是許多人的鍾愛同伴，如今大多只能自謀生路。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432794&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'498eab7e-9092-401f-aa04-76b479caebbc\', \'multiverseId\': 432794}, \'multiverseid\': 432794}]', '[{\'name\': \'Avior der ewigen Hoffnung\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Avior der ewigen Hoffnung ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'„Auch dieser Sturm wird vorübergehen, solange wir nur die Hoffnung nicht aufgeben."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=430893&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12f2e505-82c9-4bcf-9ea1-bd3b7de06fc4\', \'multiverseId\': 430893}, \'multiverseid\': 430893}, {\'name\': \'Aven de esperanza inquebrantable\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Aven de esperanza inquebrantable entre al campo de batalla, ganas 3 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo ave\', \'flavor\': \'"Esta tormenta se calmará. Debemos creerlo".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431092&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4521632-a81f-4624-9e42-cf8ba9412c3e\', \'multiverseId\': 431092}, \'multiverseid\': 431092}, {\'name\': "Avemain de l\'espoir perpétuel", \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand l\'Avemain de l\'espoir perpétuel arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 3 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau et clerc\', \'flavor\': \'« Cette tempête prendra fin. Nous devons y croire. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431291&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8850aa42-4ccb-4e3e-a241-c65819c4e96d\', \'multiverseId\': 431291}, \'multiverseid\': 431291}, {\'name\': \'Aviana della Speranza Incrollabile\', \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando l\'Aviana della Speranza Incrollabile entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 3 punti vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Uccello\', \'flavor\': \'"Questa tempesta si placherà. Dobbiamo crederlo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431490&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0a8c0f2-111f-4dbf-be36-88bf0f45c15b\', \'multiverseId\': 431490}, \'multiverseid\': 431490}, {\'name\': \'尽きぬ希望のエイヴン\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n尽きぬ希望のエイヴンが戦場に出たとき、あなたは３点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'「この嵐も必ず静まる。そう信じるしかありません。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431689&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a84e5071-e0b5-43c9-a860-5e9ce2f6b40b\', \'multiverseId\': 431689}, \'multiverseid\': 431689}, {\'name\': \'영속적인 희망의 에이븐\', \'text\': \'비행\\n영속적인 희망의 에이븐이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 생명 3점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 조류 성직자\', \'flavor\': \'"이 폭풍은 가라앉을 거야. 우린 그렇게 믿어야 해."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431888&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0edc7656-e9f4-4bc6-8ea2-3c3f29f1c65d\', \'multiverseId\': 431888}, \'multiverseid\': 431888}, {\'name\': \'Aviana da Esperança Duradoura\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Aviana da Esperança Duradoura entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 3 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave Clérigo\', \'flavor\': \'"Esta tempestade passará. Precisamos acreditar nisso."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432087&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fc255fb-798b-481b-b5ba-44f7d13652c6\', \'multiverseId\': 432087}, \'multiverseid\': 432087}, {\'name\': \'Авен Неугасимой Надежды\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Авен Неугасимой Надежды выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете 3 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Птица Священник\', \'flavor\': \'«Эта буря утихнет. Мы должны верить».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432286&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da84b5b3-5ee7-44bc-a48c-22ee3ae38f5e\', \'multiverseId\': 432286}, \'multiverseid\': 432286}, {\'name\': \'美愿艾文\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当美愿艾文进战场时，你获得3点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～鸟／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'「风暴终歇，信心勿弃。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432485&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72eb6b21-30d0-4ec8-b615-492bdb4481ba\', \'multiverseId\': 432485}, \'multiverseid\': 432485}, {\'name\': \'美願艾文\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當美願艾文進戰場時，你獲得3點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～鳥／僧侶\', \'flavor\': \'「風暴終歇，信心勿棄。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432684&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75675384-9350-41fe-b847-2a462b0a1d8e\', \'multiverseId\': 432684}, \'multiverseid\': 432684}]', "[{'name': 'Begraben von Sand', 'text': 'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische dann deine Bibliothek.\\nUmwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': 'Nissa konnte das Flüstern das Landes noch hören, auch wenn es schwach und kraftlos war.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=430999&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '658cec86-c71b-4ec9-9fd3-89d0198f6180', 'multiverseId': 430999}, 'multiverseid': 430999}, {'name': 'Bajo las arenas', 'text': 'Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, ponla en el campo de batalla girada y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\\nCiclo {2}. ({2}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': 'Aunque enterrado y amortiguado, el susurro de la naturaleza aún llamaba a Nissa.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431198&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '990eb7bf-d23f-4fb0-ac2b-4885d571e54a', 'multiverseId': 431198}, 'multiverseid': 431198}, {'name': 'Sous le sable', 'text': 'Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.\\nRecyclage {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': 'Le murmure de la nature, même enfoui et étouffé, appelait toujours Nissa.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431397&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c996b055-f366-405f-aea5-71d308243587', 'multiverseId': 431397}, 'multiverseid': 431397}, {'name': 'Sotto le Sabbie', 'text': 'Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, mettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\\nCiclo {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': 'Per quanto sepolto e soffocato, il sussurro della natura chiamava il nome di Nissa.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431596&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7b167f19-72de-4ab1-838b-f8f93bd79a62', 'multiverseId': 431596}, 'multiverseid': 431596}, {'name': '砂の下から', 'text': 'あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、それをタップ状態で戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\\nサイクリング{2}（{2}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '埋もれ弱っていたが、自然のささやき声がニッサを呼んだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431795&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0a04a69e-1eb1-49e8-a858-a209b5d09bcc', 'multiverseId': 431795}, 'multiverseid': 431795}, {'name': '모래 아래', 'text': '당신의 서고에서 기본 대지 카드를 찾아 그 카드를 전장에 탭된 채로 놓는다. 그 후 당신의 서고를 섞는다.\\n순환 {2} ({2}, 이 카드를 버린다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.)', 'type': '집중마법', 'flavor': '땅에 묻히고 모래에 뒤덮인 상태에서도 자연의 속삭임은 니사를 불렀다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431994&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6f86b5bd-bdf9-4f59-9535-cc85bcae17a3', 'multiverseId': 431994}, 'multiverseid': 431994}, {'name': 'Sob as Areias', 'text': 'Procure um card de terreno básico em seu grimório, coloque-o no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhe seu grimório.\\nReciclar {2} ({2}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': 'Embora enterrado e abafado, o sussurro da natureza ainda chamava por Nissa.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432193&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7c7744bd-3ccb-4e37-925c-5f8807803299', 'multiverseId': 432193}, 'multiverseid': 432193}, {'name': 'Под Песками', 'text': 'Найдите в вашей библиотеке карту базовой земли, положите ее на поле битвы повернутой, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\\nЦикл {2} ({2}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)', 'type': 'Волшебство', 'flavor': 'Глубоко закопанный и приглушенный, шепот природы все же доносился до Ниссы.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432392&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '934aa726-b63b-477f-b5e0-da35ff805de8', 'multiverseId': 432392}, 'multiverseid': 432392}, {'name': '扬砂复碧', 'text': '从你的牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，将之横置放进战场，然后将你的牌库洗牌。\\n循环{2}（{2}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '虽自然已遭黄砂深埋掩盖，妮莎仍能听闻其低语。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432591&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7d0640ae-9de7-4b2d-b90e-fd72d93b3b9a', 'multiverseId': 432591}, 'multiverseid': 432591}, {'name': '揚砂復碧', 'text': '從你的牌庫中搜尋一張基本地牌，將之橫置放進戰場，然後將你的牌庫洗牌。\\n循環{2}（{2}，棄掉此牌：抽一張牌。）', 'type': '巫術', 'flavor': '雖自然已遭黃砂深埋掩蓋，妮莎仍能聽聞其低語。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432790&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fda22571-d940-4ff6-9ac2-c898aa1b3027', 'multiverseId': 432790}, 'multiverseid': 432790}]", '[{\'name\': \'Beharrlicher Jäger\', \'text\': \'Solange eine Kreatur mindestens eine -1/-1-Marke auf sich liegen hat, hat der Beharrliche Jäger Wachsamkeit und Todesberührung.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Krokodil\', \'flavor\': \'Die Krokodile der Splitterwüste, lange Zeit nur untotes Fleisch gewohnt, strömten auf der Suche nach frischer Beute nach Naktamun.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431024&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'806b1627-2be3-4254-b8b2-eb2d2f4acf5d\', \'multiverseId\': 431024}, \'multiverseid\': 431024}, {\'name\': \'Cazador perseverante\', \'text\': \'Mientras una criatura tenga un contador -1/-1 sobre ella, el Cazador perseverante tiene las habilidades de vigilancia y toque mortal.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Cocodrilo\', \'flavor\': \'Los cocodrilos de las Tierras Desoladas, acostumbrados a alimentarse de la carne de los muertos vivientes, invadieron con ansia Naktamun en busca de algo más fresco.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431223&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1f97254-5e66-445c-9b87-71cb58bcc4d6\', \'multiverseId\': 431223}, \'multiverseid\': 431223}, {\'name\': \'Chasseur acharné\', \'text\': "Tant qu\'une créature a un marqueur -1/-1 sur elle, le Chasseur acharné a la vigilance et le contact mortel.", \'type\': \'Créature : crocodile\', \'flavor\': \'Les crocodiles des Terres brisées, longtemps habitués à manger des morts-vivants, déferlèrent avidement sur Naktamon pour y trouver une chair plus fraîche.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431422&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67646587-63ad-4ec9-9d75-41f385630f8c\', \'multiverseId\': 431422}, \'multiverseid\': 431422}, {\'name\': \'Cacciatore Tenace\', \'text\': \'Fintanto che una creatura ha un segnalino -1/-1, il Cacciatore Tenace ha cautela e tocco letale.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Coccodrillo\', \'flavor\': \'I coccodrilli delle Terre Spezzate, da tempo abituati a cibarsi di carne non morta, si riversarono famelici su Naktamun in cerca di un pasto più fresco.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431621&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6619a98-2260-4bdd-8907-b5d639657d32\', \'multiverseId\': 431621}, \'multiverseid\': 431621}, {\'name\': \'強靭な狩り手\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーの上に－１/－１カウンターが置かれているかぎり、強靭な狩り手は警戒と接死を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — クロコダイル\', \'flavor\': \'長くアンデッドの肉をエサにしていた遺棄地のクロコダイルが、新鮮な味わいを求めてナクタムンに雪崩れ込んだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431820&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31891972-3b7c-4b5e-a499-84d60ea373b3\', \'multiverseId\': 431820}, \'multiverseid\': 431820}, {\'name\': \'집요한 사냥꾼\', \'text\': \'생물이 -1/-1 카운터를 가지고 있는 한, 집요한 사냥꾼은 경계와 치명타를 가진다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 악어\', \'flavor\': \'오래전부터 망자의 육체를 먹는 데 익숙해진 망가진 땅의 악어들이 좀 더 신선한 먹잇감을 찾아 나크타문으로 밀려들었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432019&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45166cc0-9926-46ed-9abf-ac90e8a8cb72\', \'multiverseId\': 432019}, \'multiverseid\': 432019}, {\'name\': \'Caçador Tenaz\', \'text\': \'Enquanto uma criatura tiver um marcador -1/-1, Caçador Tenaz terá vigilância e toque mortífero.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Crocodilo\', \'flavor\': \'Os crocodilos das Terras Partidas, há muito acostumados a se alimentar apenas de carne morta-viva, rapidamente invadiram Nactamon para provar algo mais fresco.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432218&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c68f855-e684-496f-a789-221149c71fb8\', \'multiverseId\': 432218}, \'multiverseid\': 432218}, {\'name\': \'Упорный Охотник\', \'text\': \'Пока на каком-либо существе есть жетон -1/-1, Упорный Охотник имеет Бдительность и Смертельное касание.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Крокодил\', \'flavor\': \'Привыкшие питаться мертвечиной крокодилы из Смятенных Земель с готовностью отправились в Нактамун поохотиться на свежую добычу.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432417&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6542139-3894-436f-837e-be5279794add\', \'multiverseId\': 432417}, \'multiverseid\': 432417}, {\'name\': \'顽强捕食鳄\', \'text\': \'只要某生物上有-1/-1指示物，顽强捕食鳄便具有警戒与死触异能。\', \'type\': \'生物～鳄鱼\', \'flavor\': \'生于荒土的鳄鱼习以亡者腐肉为食，如今蜂拥至拿塔蒙城，争啖鲜肉滋味。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432616&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b165ec42-e3cc-4205-915a-95558efb577b\', \'multiverseId\': 432616}, \'multiverseid\': 432616}, {\'name\': \'頑強捕食鱷\', \'text\': \'只要某生物上有-1/-1指示物，頑強捕食鱷便具有警戒與死觸異能。\', \'type\': \'生物～鱷魚\', \'flavor\': \'生於荒土的鱷魚習以亡者腐肉為食，如今蜂擁至拿塔蒙城，爭啖鮮肉滋味。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432815&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d09eccc2-d7be-496d-a35b-4b920522555d\', \'multiverseId\': 432815}, \'multiverseid\': 432815}]', '[{\'name\': \'Berufung // Autorität\', \'text\': \'Bis zum Ende des Zuges verursacht eine Kreatur deiner Wahl Trampelschaden und erhält +X/+X, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Kreaturen ist, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Berufung\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431040&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3bee0cd8-996a-4ab6-a121-7bc99331482d\', \'multiverseId\': 431040}, \'multiverseid\': 431040}, {\'name\': \'Apelar // Autoridad\', \'text\': \'Hasta el final del turno, la criatura objetivo gana la habilidad de arrollar y obtiene +X/+X, donde X es la cantidad de criaturas que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Apelar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431239&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8de016f8-2d82-4010-a6b1-1eda125466f0\', \'multiverseId\': 431239}, \'multiverseid\': 431239}, {\'name\': \'Appel // Autorité\', \'text\': "Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, la créature ciblée acquiert le piétinement et gagne +X/+X, X étant le nombre de créatures que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Appel\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431438&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'929621cb-05f6-4077-a213-64af47f48878\', \'multiverseId\': 431438}, \'multiverseid\': 431438}, {\'name\': \'Appello // Autorità\', \'text\': \'Fino alla fine del turno, una creatura bersaglio ha travolgere e prende +X/+X, dove X è il numero di creature che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Appello\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431637&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9342cbeb-e812-4aa2-9fad-0f5f2f39d6c2\', \'multiverseId\': 431637}, \'multiverseid\': 431637}, {\'name\': \'旗幟 // 鮮明\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それはトランプルを得るとともに＋Ｘ/＋Ｘの修整を受ける。Ｘはあなたがコントロールするクリーチャーの総数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'旗幟\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431836&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fec3e7c-f7d1-43ca-944f-43431f5e1bc9\', \'multiverseId\': 431836}, \'multiverseid\': 431836}, {\'name\': \'호소 // 권위\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 돌진을 얻고 +X/+X를 받는다. X는 당신이 조종하는 생물의 개수다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'호소\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432035&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3437338-250f-4233-b749-2f084b3afe0d\', \'multiverseId\': 432035}, \'multiverseid\': 432035}, {\'name\': \'Apelar // Autoridade\', \'text\': \'Até o final do turno, a criatura alvo ganha atropelar e recebe +X/+X, sendo X o número de criaturas que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Apelar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432234&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee457d96-430a-4033-b056-01996c408cd5\', \'multiverseId\': 432234}, \'multiverseid\': 432234}, {\'name\': \'Обращение // Авторитетам\', \'text\': \'До конца хода целевое существо получает Пробивной удар и +X/+X, где X — количество существ под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Обращение\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432433&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bcd0827-ec11-469a-be7f-e8ed2a82a205\', \'multiverseId\': 432433}, \'multiverseid\': 432433}, {\'name\': \'吸引 // 权威\', \'text\': \'直到回合结束，目标生物获得践踏异能且得+X/+X，X为由你操控的生物数量。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'吸引\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432632&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0a0020e-ff3d-47b8-be42-c5f70e6e24af\', \'multiverseId\': 432632}, \'multiverseid\': 432632}, {\'name\': \'吸引 // 權威\', \'text\': \'直到回合結束，目標生物獲得踐踏異能且得+X/+X，X為由你操控的生物數量。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'吸引\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432831&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f18423c5-9389-4df8-b580-62fd6261d5f9\', \'multiverseId\': 432831}, \'multiverseid\': 432831}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bewahrerin der Hoffnung\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Enttappe ein Land deiner Wahl.\\n{1}, {T}, erschöpfe die Bewahrerin der Hoffnung: Enttappe zwei Länder deiner Wahl. (Eine erschöpfte Kreatur enttappt nicht während deines nächsten Enttappsegments.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'Nicht jeder war gewillt, sein Heim zu verlassen. Egal, wie wenig davon übrig war.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431007&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8bf9849-2301-4872-98bc-696c638a7658\', \'multiverseId\': 431007}, \'multiverseid\': 431007}, {\'name\': \'Cuidadora de la esperanza\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Endereza la tierra objetivo.\\n{1}, {T}, espolear a la Cuidadora de la esperanza: Endereza dos tierras objetivo. (Una criatura espoleada no se enderezará durante tu próximo paso de enderezar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida humano\', \'flavor\': \'Hubo quienes se negaron a abandonar sus hogares destruidos y juraron reconstruirlos a cualquier precio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431206&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8dfeaad6-10cd-4c42-aba2-5e68d332908c\', \'multiverseId\': 431206}, \'multiverseid\': 431206}, {\'name\': "Marraine de l\'espoir", \'text\': "{1}, {T} : Dégagez le terrain ciblé.\\n{1}, {T}, surmenez la Marraine de l\'espoir : Dégagez deux terrains ciblés. (Une créature surmenée ne se dégage pas pendant votre prochaine étape de dégagement.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et druide\', \'flavor\': "Certains refusèrent d\'abandonner leurs maisons détruites, jurant de reconstruire à tout prix.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431405&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3164dadc-7981-46f8-bf71-3d93d88b08a9\', \'multiverseId\': 431405}, \'multiverseid\': 431405}, {\'name\': \'Custode della Speranza\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: STAPpa una terra bersaglio.\\n{1}, {T}, Strema la Custode della Speranza: STAPpa due terre bersaglio. (Una creatura stremata non STAPpa durante il tuo prossimo STAP.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Alcuni rifiutarono di abbandonare le loro case ridotte in macerie e giurarono di ricostruirle a qualsiasi costo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431604&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3f2cafb-8b23-4e60-9065-7917d40c71d8\', \'multiverseId\': 431604}, \'multiverseid\': 431604}, {\'name\': \'希望守り\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：土地１つを対象とし、それをアンタップする。\\n{1}, {T}, 希望守りを督励する：土地２つを対象とし、それらをアンタップする。（督励されたクリーチャーは、あなたの次のアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'家が粉々になってもそこを離れようとしない人々もいた。どれだけ苦労しても再建しようというのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431803&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87192e54-c46c-4d04-ad62-84d347a7687c\', \'multiverseId\': 431803}, \'multiverseid\': 431803}, {\'name\': \'희망 관리인\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: 대지를 목표로 정한다. 그 대지를 언탭한다.\\n{1}, {T}, 희망 관리인을 분전시킨다: 대지 두 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 대지들을 언탭한다. (분전한 생물은 당신의 다음 언탭단에 언탭되지 않는다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 드루이드\', \'flavor\': \'어떤 이들은 떠나기를 거부하고 산산이 조각난 집을 기필코 재건하겠다고 다짐했다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432002&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b05161f-577e-4201-9155-c6db3f4b5fbd\', \'multiverseId\': 432002}, \'multiverseid\': 432002}, {\'name\': \'Cuidadora da Esperança\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Desvire o terreno alvo.\\n{1}, {T}, exaura Cuidadora da Esperança: Desvire dois terrenos alvo. (Uma criatura exaurida não será desvirada durante sua próxima etapa de desvirar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Druida\', \'flavor\': \'Alguns se recusaram a deixar seus lares despedaçados, jurando reconstruí-los a qualquer preço.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432201&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c4d3c6b-b13e-452c-b666-ce84a6eb7f4b\', \'multiverseId\': 432201}, \'multiverseid\': 432201}, {\'name\': \'Хранительница Надежды\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: разверните целевую землю.\\n{1}, {T}, подстегните Хранительницу Надежды: разверните две целевые земли. (Подстегнутое существо не разворачивается во время вашего следующего шага разворота.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Друид\', \'flavor\': \'Нашлись те, кто отказался покинуть разрушенные дома, поклявшись любой ценой отстроить их заново.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432400&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aeb58313-81ec-43f9-894f-353452953b9e\', \'multiverseId\': 432400}, \'multiverseid\': 432400}, {\'name\': \'育望师\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：重置目标地。\\n{1}，{T}，耗竭育望师：重置两个目标地。（已耗竭的生物于你的下一个重置步骤中不能重置。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'有些人拒绝离开自己破碎的家园，誓言不惜代价重建。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432599&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bb74f44-273f-45b6-a064-d80bc71f5437\', \'multiverseId\': 432599}, \'multiverseid\': 432599}, {\'name\': \'育望師\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：重置目標地。\\n{1}，{T}，耗竭育望師：重置兩個目標地。（已耗竭的生物於你的下一個重置步驟中不能重置。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／德魯伊\', \'flavor\': \'有些人拒絕離開自己破碎的家園，誓言不惜代價重建。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432798&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23429289-4951-469a-96a3-e1e96a323833\', \'multiverseId\': 432798}, \'multiverseid\': 432798}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bitterbogen-Scharfschützen\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit, Reichweite\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Schakal, Bogenschütze\', \'flavor\': \'„Vergiss nicht, Bruder, ihre Schwachstelle sind die Augen." „Ich habe es nicht vergessen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431000&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e82ce37d-1c7d-4900-98d0-be57a92a3240\', \'multiverseId\': 431000}, \'multiverseid\': 431000}, {\'name\': \'Tiradores de arcoamargo\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia, alcance.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Arquero chacal\', \'flavor\': \'"Recuerda, hermano, que los ojos siempre son vulnerables". "Nunca lo olvidé".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431199&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5eb1be1-7543-4c60-bc9f-649e493c6ec6\', \'multiverseId\': 431199}, \'multiverseid\': 431199}, {\'name\': \'Francs-tireurs cinglarc\', \'text\': \'Vigilance, portée\', \'type\': \'Créature : chacal et archer\', \'flavor\': "« Souviens-toi, mon frère, que les yeux sont toujours vulnérables. » « Je ne l\'ai jamais oublié. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431398&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5169b5a1-e13b-47f7-80a8-58e257e2d9fe\', \'multiverseId\': 431398}, \'multiverseid\': 431398}, {\'name\': \'Tiratori Scelti Asprodardo\', \'text\': \'Cautela, raggiungere\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Arciere Sciacallo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ricorda, fratello, gli occhi sono sempre vulnerabili." "Non l\\\'ho mai scordato."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431597&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5435f696-c2c8-4ff2-b4df-0bcc56c3d39c\', \'multiverseId\': 431597}, \'multiverseid\': 431597}, {\'name\': \'苦弓の名射手\', \'text\': \'警戒、到達\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ジャッカル・射手\', \'flavor\': \'「思い出して、兄さん。目が弱点よ。」 「大丈夫。忘れてないよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431796&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6d9ce81-934d-46c7-bcf6-9d1a0e113034\', \'multiverseId\': 431796}, \'multiverseid\': 431796}, {\'name\': \'고통활 명사수\', \'text\': \'경계, 대공\', \'type\': \'생물 — 자칼 궁수\', \'flavor\': \'"기억해, 눈은 언제나 약점이라는 걸." "한 번도 잊은 적이 없어."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431995&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1748268-a71f-488e-a4be-1e4ee98dde72\', \'multiverseId\': 431995}, \'multiverseid\': 431995}, {\'name\': \'Atiradores do Arcoamargo\', \'text\': \'Vigilância, alcance\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chacal Arqueiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Lembre-se, irmão, os olhos são sempre vulneráveis." "Eu nunca esqueci."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432194&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c9106c0-bef6-4606-9164-c2c1581160c1\', \'multiverseId\': 432194}, \'multiverseid\': 432194}, {\'name\': \'Жалящие Лучники\', \'text\': \'Бдительность, Захват\', \'type\': \'Существо — Шакал Лучник\', \'flavor\': \'— Помни, брат: глаза всегда самые уязвимые. — Я никогда не забываю об этом.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432393&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1434c5aa-e2dc-4dd5-be89-9f47b1566736\', \'multiverseId\': 432393}, \'multiverseid\': 432393}, {\'name\': \'刺骨弓神射手\', \'text\': \'警戒，延势\', \'type\': \'生物～豺狼／弓箭手\', \'flavor\': \'「弟弟，记住，眼睛是弱点。」 「忘不了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432592&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9899c31-e4fc-4c66-832a-ace3a642403e\', \'multiverseId\': 432592}, \'multiverseid\': 432592}, {\'name\': \'刺骨弓神射手\', \'text\': \'警戒，延勢\', \'type\': \'生物～豺狼／弓箭手\', \'flavor\': \'「弟弟，記住，眼睛是弱點。」 「忘不了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432791&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08a7a2cc-c19e-4b7b-8313-bd5a85e6ab7d\', \'multiverseId\': 432791}, \'multiverseid\': 432791}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutstromwesen\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nBravour (Immer wenn du einen Nichtkreatur-Zauberspruch wirkst, erhält diese Kreatur +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.)\\nWenn das Blutstromwesen ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof oben auf deine Bibliothek legen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431026&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73dca8f5-aef6-4aea-907d-13f1ea44e6b0\', \'multiverseId\': 431026}, \'multiverseid\': 431026}, {\'name\': \'Entidad del agua sangrienta\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nDestreza. (Siempre que lances un hechizo que no sea de criatura, esta criatura obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.)\\nCuando la Entidad del agua sangrienta entre al campo de batalla, puedes poner la carta de instantáneo o de conjuro objetivo de tu cementerio en la parte superior de tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431225&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7fe555c-fc66-4539-a076-fbea28c30a88\', \'multiverseId\': 431225}, \'multiverseid\': 431225}, {\'name\': \'Entité des eaux sanguines\', \'text\': "Vol\\nProuesse (À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort non-créature, cette créature gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)\\nQuand l\'Entité des eaux sanguines arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez mettre une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel ciblée depuis votre cimetière au-dessus de votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431424&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b26c633-ae6f-426b-9ee0-015276237908\', \'multiverseId\': 431424}, \'multiverseid\': 431424}, {\'name\': \'Entità delle Acque di Sangue\', \'text\': "Volare\\nProdezza (Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia non creatura, questa creatura prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.)\\nQuando l\'Entità delle Acque di Sangue entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi mettere una carta istantaneo o stregoneria bersaglio dal tuo cimitero in cima al tuo grimorio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431623&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ab288e4-949b-421e-b1f9-c42edbe12247\', \'multiverseId\': 431623}, \'multiverseid\': 431623}, {\'name\': \'血水の化身\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n果敢（あなたがクリーチャーでない呪文を１つ唱えるたび、ターン終了時まで、このクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。）\\n血水の化身が戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地からインスタントかソーサリーであるカード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれをあなたのライブラリーの一番上に置いてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431822&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2233e8dd-ff8d-4189-b89a-1c50949b6b42\', \'multiverseId\': 431822}, \'multiverseid\': 431822}, {\'name\': \'핏물의 존재\', \'text\': \'비행\\n기량 (당신이 생물이 아닌 주문을 발동할 때마다, 이 생물은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받는다.)\\n핏물의 존재가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신의 무덤에 있는 순간마법 또는 집중마법 카드를 목표로 정한다. 당신은 그 카드를 당신의 서고 맨 위에 놓을 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 정령\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432021&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'298d2b0a-5ef6-4308-8c48-7bb4509230b0\', \'multiverseId\': 432021}, \'multiverseid\': 432021}, {\'name\': \'Entidade da Água Sangrenta\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nDestreza (Toda vez que você conjura uma mágica que não seja de criatura, esta criatura recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.)\\nQuando Entidade da Água Sangrenta entra no campo de batalha, você pode colocar o card de mágica instantânea ou feitiço alvo de seu cemitério no topo de seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432220&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6e16896-ef58-4a6f-a631-60b6db9e58d2\', \'multiverseId\': 432220}, \'multiverseid\': 432220}, {\'name\': \'Тварь Кровавой Воды\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nИскусность (Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете не являющееся существом заклинание, это существо получает +1/+1 до конца хода.)\\nКогда Тварь Кровавой Воды выходит на поле битвы, вы можете положить целевую карту мгновенного заклинания или волшебства из вашего кладбища на верх вашей библиотеки.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432419&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43fa4c2c-3735-4e40-aab0-4e37e173ef5c\', \'multiverseId\': 432419}, \'multiverseid\': 432419}, {\'name\': \'血河灵\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n灵技（每当你施放非生物咒语时，此生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。）\\n当血河灵进战场时，你可以将目标瞬间或法术牌从你的坟墓场置于你的牌库顶。\', \'type\': \'生物～元素\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432618&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25233d91-8a7c-47c8-85f8-db4d13b8f897\', \'multiverseId\': 432618}, \'multiverseid\': 432618}, {\'name\': \'血河靈\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n靈技（每當你施放非生物咒語時，此生物得+1/+1直到回合結束。）\\n當血河靈進戰場時，你可以將目標瞬間或巫術牌從你的墳墓場置於你的牌庫頂。\', \'type\': \'生物～元素\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432817&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17c7eee6-8c4e-46b8-bd70-e05aad12262a\', \'multiverseId\': 432817}, \'multiverseid\': 432817}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bontus letztes Gefecht\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre alle Kreaturen. Länder, die du kontrollierst, enttappen nicht während deines nächsten Enttappsegments.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Bontu starb, so wie er lebte: mit dem Blut der Feinde des Gott-Pharaos an den Händen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=430948&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f116ae30-2b52-4f2d-92a3-78bf77c0f43f\', \'multiverseId\': 430948}, \'multiverseid\': 430948}, {\'name\': \'Última tentativa de Bontu\', \'text\': \'Destruye todas las criaturas. Las tierras que controlas no se enderezarán durante tu próximo paso de enderezar.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Hasta el último instante, Bontu solo quería ser la primera de entre los súbditos del Dios Faraón.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431147&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e8462d6-e457-4247-9eaa-d8f3e7483f11\', \'multiverseId\': 431147}, \'multiverseid\': 431147}, {\'name\': \'Dernier jugement de Bontu\', \'text\': \'Détruisez toutes les créatures. Les terrains que vous contrôlez ne se dégagent pas pendant votre prochaine étape de dégagement.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Jusqu\'à la fin, Bontu ne chercha qu\'à être le premier des sujets du Dieu-Pharaon.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431346&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c17d2d0-5b2d-467a-aa9c-dfaffc2edcdd\', \'multiverseId\': 431346}, \'multiverseid\': 431346}, {\'name\': \'Ultima Sentenza di Bontu\', \'text\': \'Distruggi tutte le creature. Le terre che controlli non STAPpano durante il tuo prossimo STAP.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Fino alla fine, l\'unico desiderio di Bontu fu quello di essere prima tra i sudditi del Dio Faraone.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431545&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60380a61-59bc-41f6-bcae-08e0b272c305\', \'multiverseId\': 431545}, \'multiverseid\': 431545}, {\'name\': \'バントゥ最後の算段\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーをすべて破壊する。あなたがコントロールする土地は、あなたの次のアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'最後まで、バントゥは王神の関心事の筆頭であることのみを望んでいた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431744&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c883eb5-717a-44df-8d5c-59e4198e30f4\', \'multiverseId\': 431744}, \'multiverseid\': 431744}, {\'name\': \'본투의 마지막 심판\', \'text\': \'모든 생물을 파괴한다. 당신이 조종하는 대지들은 당신의 다음 언탭단에 언탭되지 않는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'마지막 순간까지 본투는 신 파라오의 신하 중 최고가 되기만을 원했다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431943&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a579f1c-29be-4d67-9723-81c8423d2db3\', \'multiverseId\': 431943}, \'multiverseid\': 431943}, {\'name\': \'Última Sentença de Bontu\', \'text\': \'Destrua todas as criaturas. Os terrenos que você controla não são desvirados durante sua próxima etapa de desvirar.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Até o fim, Bontu quis apenas ser a primeira entre os súditos do Faraó-Deus.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432142&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6b6df49-baff-46d9-bca4-ba34024307d8\', \'multiverseId\': 432142}, \'multiverseid\': 432142}, {\'name\': \'Последняя Расплата Бонту\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте все существа. Земли под вашим контролем не разворачиваются во время вашего следующего шага разворота.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'До последнего мига Бонту хотела лишь быть первой из подданных Бога-Фараона.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432341&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a86e611-41c0-482e-b76a-503ee72bb8d9\', \'multiverseId\': 432341}, \'multiverseid\': 432341}, {\'name\': \'芭图临终报复\', \'text\': \'消灭所有生物。由你操控的地于你的下一个重置步骤中不能重置。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'临终时，芭图只望成为法老神的第一批子民。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432540&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdd14a1f-2ab0-4705-89b5-82818b1227ca\', \'multiverseId\': 432540}, \'multiverseid\': 432540}, {\'name\': \'芭圖臨終報復\', \'text\': \'消滅所有生物。由你操控的地於你的下一個重置步驟中不能重置。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'臨終時，芭圖只望成為法老神的第一批子民。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432739&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c96eb00-2556-4435-9cf2-409798ed8f2a\', \'multiverseId\': 432739}, \'multiverseid\': 432739}]', '[{\'name\': \'Champion des Scharfsinns\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Champion des Scharfsinns ins Spiel kommt, kannst du so viele Karten ziehen, wie seine Stärke beträgt. Falls du dies tust, wirf zwei Karten ab.\\nVerewigen {5}{U}{U} ({5}{U}{U}, schicke diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil: Erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie von ihr ist, außer dass er ein 4/4 schwarzer Zombie-Naga-Zauberer ohne Manakosten ist. Spiele Verewigen wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Naga, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=430919&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3755f44-158a-4571-9447-3dbcd3e928a0\', \'multiverseId\': 430919}, \'multiverseid\': 430919}, {\'name\': \'Campeona del ingenio\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Campeona del ingenio entre al campo de batalla, puedes robar una cantidad de cartas igual a su fuerza. Si lo haces, descarta dos cartas.\\nEternizar {5}{U}{U}. ({5}{U}{U}, exiliar esta carta de tu cementerio: Crea una ficha que es una copia de esta carta, excepto que es un Hechicero Naga Zombie negro 4/4 sin coste de maná. Activa la habilidad de eternizar solo como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero naga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431118&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'551ee943-ac7b-499b-8fdb-c9bdf1bc8d68\', \'multiverseId\': 431118}, \'multiverseid\': 431118}, {\'name\': "Championne d\'esprits", \'text\': "Quand la Championne d\'esprits arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez piocher un nombre de cartes égal à sa force. Si vous faites ainsi, défaussez-vous de deux cartes.\\nÉternalisation {5}{U}{U} ({5}{U}{U}, exilez cette carte de votre cimetière : Créez un jeton qui en est une copie, excepté que c\'est un zombie et naga et sorcier 4/4 noir sans coût de mana. N\'utilisez l\'éternalisation que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Créature : naga et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431317&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cde0243-d25a-46e9-abe2-442c1a1399b6\', \'multiverseId\': 431317}, \'multiverseid\': 431317}, {\'name\': "Campionessa d\'Ingegno", \'text\': "Quando la Campionessa d\'Ingegno entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi pescare carte pari alla sua forza. Se lo fai, scarta due carte.\\nEternare {5}{U}{U} ({5}{U}{U}, Esilia questa carta dal tuo cimitero: Crea una pedina che è una copia della carta, tranne che è un Mago Naga Zombie 4/4 nero senza costo di mana. Eterna solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Naga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431516&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95f399d2-b4bd-4652-a6ce-f6b09a0a1758\', \'multiverseId\': 431516}, \'multiverseid\': 431516}, {\'name\': \'機知の勇者\', \'text\': \'機知の勇者が戦場に出たとき、あなたはこれのパワーに等しい枚数のカードを引いてもよい。そうしたなら、カード２枚を捨てる。\\n永遠{5}{U}{U}（{5}{U}{U}, あなたの墓地からこのカードを追放する：マナ・コストを持たない黒の４/４のゾンビ・ナーガ・ウィザードであることを除きこれのコピーであるトークンを１体生成する。永遠はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ナーガ・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431715&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df185e93-85e9-4f00-b3f3-eda60c26a38a\', \'multiverseId\': 431715}, \'multiverseid\': 431715}, {\'name\': \'기지의 투사\', \'text\': \'기지의 투사가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 기지의 투사의 공격력만큼 카드를 뽑을 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 카드 두 장을 버린다.\\n영생화 {5}{U}{U} ({5}{U}{U}, 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 추방한다: 이 카드의 복사본이지만 마나 비용이 없는 4/4 흑색 좀비 나가 마법사인 토큰 한 개를 만든다. 당신이 집중마법을 발동할 수 있는 시기에만 영생화를 할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 나가 마법사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431914&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5ec0c6f-c4d1-4dc9-adc5-143d39d609d5\', \'multiverseId\': 431914}, \'multiverseid\': 431914}, {\'name\': \'Campeã do Raciocínio\', \'text\': \'Quando Campeã do Raciocínio entra no campo de batalha, você pode comprar uma quantidade de cards igual ao seu poder. Se fizer isso, descarte dois cards.\\nEternizar {5}{U}{U} ({5}{U}{U}, exile este card de seu cemitério: Crie uma ficha que seja uma cópia dele, com a exceção de ser um Zumbi Naga Mago preto 4/4 sem custo de mana. Eternize somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Naga Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432113&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'220f099a-4778-43f9-b0aa-398fba7cf875\', \'multiverseId\': 432113}, \'multiverseid\': 432113}, {\'name\': \'Поборница Разума\', \'text\': \'Когда Поборница Разума выходит на поле битвы, вы можете взять количество карт, равное ее силе. Если вы это делаете, сбросьте две карты.\\nУвековечивание {5}{U}{U} ({5}{U}{U}, изгоните эту карту из вашего кладбища: создайте фишку, являющуюся ее копией, но при этом являющуюся черным Зомби Нагой Чародеем 4/4 без мана-стоимости. Увековечивайте только как волшебство.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Нага Чародей\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432312&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6159466e-6e83-4521-a233-7dd4741e7d4f\', \'multiverseId\': 432312}, \'multiverseid\': 432312}, {\'name\': \'聪智斗士\', \'text\': \'当聪智斗士进战场时，你可以抓若干牌，其数量等同于它的力量。若你如此作，则弃两张牌。\\n永生{5}{U}{U}（{5}{U}{U}，从你的坟墓场放逐此牌：派出一个衍生物，且为此牌的复制品，但它是4/4黑色灵俑／那伽／法术师，且没有法术力费用。永生的时机视同法术。）\', \'type\': \'生物～那伽／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432511&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25ccfa1d-11a9-4c0e-a9cb-990350505fb5\', \'multiverseId\': 432511}, \'multiverseid\': 432511}, {\'name\': \'聰智鬥士\', \'text\': \'當聰智鬥士進戰場時，你可以抽若干牌，其數量等同於它的力量。若你如此作，則棄兩張牌。\\n永生{5}{U}{U}（{5}{U}{U}，從你的墳墓場放逐此牌：派出一個衍生物，且為此牌的複製品，但它是4/4黑色殭屍／那伽／魔法師，且沒有魔法力費用。永生的時機視同巫術。）\', \'type\': \'生物～那伽／魔法師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432710&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d65bf36-6ee7-491f-b357-258ed67ed92e\', \'multiverseId\': 432710}, \'multiverseid\': 432710}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chandras Niederlage\', \'text\': \'Chandras Niederlage fügt einer roten Kreatur oder einem roten Planeswalker deiner Wahl 5 Schadenspunkte zu. Falls jene bleibende Karte ein Chandra-Planeswalker ist, kannst du eine Karte abwerfen. Falls du dies tust, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Feuer? Ist das dein einziger Trick, Chandra?" —Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=430974&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd907aaa-30b7-4e88-936e-6dd563188767\', \'multiverseId\': 430974}, \'multiverseid\': 430974}, {\'name\': \'Derrota de Chandra\', \'text\': \'La Derrota de Chandra hace 5 puntos de daño a la criatura roja o planeswalker rojo objetivo. Si ese permanente es una planeswalker Chandra, puedes descartar una carta. Si lo haces, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Fuego? ¿Es ese tu único truco, Chandra?" —Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431173&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cf99f1a-f02c-418c-bafe-4f4c7ca05f8c\', \'multiverseId\': 431173}, \'multiverseid\': 431173}, {\'name\': \'Défaite de Chandra\', \'text\': "La Défaite de Chandra inflige 5 blessures à une créature rouge ciblée ou un planeswalker rouge ciblé. Si ce permanent était un planeswalker Chandra, vous pouvez vous défausser d\'une carte. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Du feu ? C\'est donc tout ce que tu sais faire, Chandra ? » —Nicol Bolas", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431372&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc836e96-9af2-4461-8010-be674287d9b2\', \'multiverseId\': 431372}, \'multiverseid\': 431372}, {\'name\': \'Sconfitta di Chandra\', \'text\': \'La Sconfitta di Chandra infligge 5 danni a una creatura rossa o a un planeswalker rosso bersaglio. Se quel permanente è un planeswalker Chandra, puoi scartare una carta. Se lo fai, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Fuoco? È l\\\'unico trucco che conosci, Chandra?" —Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d6800cc-5b3c-41b1-a503-69f4b9b213be\', \'multiverseId\': 431571}, \'multiverseid\': 431571}, {\'name\': \'チャンドラの敗北\', \'text\': \'赤のクリーチャー１体か赤のプレインズウォーカー１体を対象とする。チャンドラの敗北はそれに５点のダメージを与える。そのパーマネントがチャンドラ・プレインズウォーカーであるなら、あなたはカード１枚を捨ててもよい。そうしたなら、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「炎か？チャンドラよ、お前の芸はそれだけか？」 ――ニコル・ボーラス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431770&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dea36730-3e7f-45e3-b6ee-5cc4dde3e052\', \'multiverseId\': 431770}, \'multiverseid\': 431770}, {\'name\': \'찬드라의 패배\', \'text\': \'적색 생물이나 적색 플레인즈워커를 목표로 정한다. 찬드라의 패배는 그 목표에게 피해 5점을 입힌다. 그 지속물이 찬드라 플레인즈워커라면, 당신은 카드 한 장을 버릴 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"화염? 그게 네가 가진 전부냐, 찬드라?" —니콜 볼라스\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431969&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45bcde67-224d-4863-bd9e-5397406fe07d\', \'multiverseId\': 431969}, \'multiverseid\': 431969}, {\'name\': \'Derrota de Chandra\', \'text\': \'Derrota de Chandra causa 5 pontos de dano à criatura vermelha ou ao planeswalker vermelho alvo. Se aquela permanente for uma planeswalker Chandra, você poderá descartar um card. Se fizer isso, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Fogo? É esse o seu único truque, Chandra?" — Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432168&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b703de0f-0dd0-4aed-83d7-b667d74bb202\', \'multiverseId\': 432168}, \'multiverseid\': 432168}, {\'name\': \'Поражение Чандры\', \'text\': \'Поражение Чандры наносит 5 повреждений целевому красному существу или красному planeswalker-у. Если тот перманент — planeswalker Чандра, то вы можете сбросить карту. Если вы это делаете, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Огонь? Это твой единственный трюк, Чандра?» — Никол Болас\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432367&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a67eff34-b531-401a-8a93-0a94b0052c7a\', \'multiverseId\': 432367}, \'multiverseid\': 432367}, {\'name\': \'茜卓败退\', \'text\': \'茜卓败退对目标红色生物或红色鹏洛客造成5点伤害。如果该永久物是茜卓鹏洛客，则你可以弃一张牌。若你如此作，则抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「火焰？茜卓，你就只会这点把戏？」 ～尼可波拉斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432566&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28edff41-dc3c-40d4-9906-6cfe69d28958\', \'multiverseId\': 432566}, \'multiverseid\': 432566}, {\'name\': \'茜卓敗退\', \'text\': \'茜卓敗退對目標紅色生物或紅色鵬洛客造成5點傷害。如果該永久物是茜卓鵬洛客，則你可以棄一張牌。若你如此作，則抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「火焰？茜卓，你就只會這點把戲？」 ～尼可波拉斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432765&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc88def1-6b8f-495c-a756-90cf798b6891\', \'multiverseId\': 432765}, \'multiverseid\': 432765}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chaosmaul\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Chaosmaul ins Spiel kommt, fügt es jeder anderen Kreatur 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Teufelsbraten\', \'flavor\': \'Das einzig wirksame, wenn auch etwas unhandliche Mittel bei einer Sandwurmplage.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=430975&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca3e41ed-d6d0-45da-9d38-c3cab00d4f73\', \'multiverseId\': 430975}, \'multiverseid\': 430975}, {\'name\': \'Fauces del caos\', \'text\': \'Cuando las Fauces del caos entren al campo de batalla, hacen 3 puntos de daño a cada otra criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Infernal\', \'flavor\': \'El último eslabón de la cadena alimentaria no son las sierpes de arena.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431174&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'019f4f34-ae54-42dc-902b-aff9be8118c5\', \'multiverseId\': 431174}, \'multiverseid\': 431174}, {\'name\': \'Gueule du chaos\', \'text\': \'Quand la Gueule du chaos arrive sur le champ de bataille, elle inflige 3 blessures à chaque autre créature.\', \'type\': \'Créature : monstruosité\', \'flavor\': "La chaîne alimentaire ne s\'arrête pas aux guivres des sables.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431373&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2852d9f9-dd67-4434-9d22-8ad64eb78a73\', \'multiverseId\': 431373}, \'multiverseid\': 431373}, {\'name\': \'Fauce del Caos\', \'text\': \'Quando la Fauce del Caos entra nel campo di battaglia, infligge 3 danni a ogni altra creatura.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Infernale\', \'flavor\': \'La catena alimentare non termina con i wurm sabbiosi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431572&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fbeba21-f8f9-495f-803c-737aebd1dcd3\', \'multiverseId\': 431572}, \'multiverseid\': 431572}, {\'name\': \'混沌の大口\', \'text\': \'混沌の大口が戦場に出たとき、これは他の各クリーチャーにそれぞれ３点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ヘリオン\', \'flavor\': \'食物連鎖はサンドワームで終わるわけではない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431771&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3002514a-3775-4223-9f81-e277698634e4\', \'multiverseId\': 431771}, \'multiverseid\': 431771}, {\'name\': \'혼돈의 아가리\', \'text\': \'혼돈의 아가리가 전장에 들어올 때, 혼돈의 아가리는 다른 각 생물들에게 피해 3점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 헬리온\', \'flavor\': \'먹이 사슬의 최상위 포식자는 모래웜이 아니다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431970&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2900a7ad-3fbf-4997-bc87-97989ac5299b\', \'multiverseId\': 431970}, \'multiverseid\': 431970}, {\'name\': \'Gorja do Caos\', \'text\': \'Quando Gorja do Caos entra no campo de batalha, ela causa 3 pontos de dano a cada outra criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Avernal\', \'flavor\': \'A cadeia alimentar não termina nos vormes da areia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432169&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'811a6fb6-5a96-4a6b-980c-e74f947bd540\', \'multiverseId\': 432169}, \'multiverseid\': 432169}, {\'name\': \'Утроба Хаоса\', \'text\': \'Когда Утроба Хаоса выходит на поле битвы, она наносит 3 повреждения каждому другому существу.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Геллион\', \'flavor\': \'Пищевая цепочка не заканчивается на песчаных вурмах.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432368&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f8ee60b-d8f9-474f-abb3-eb3fc6323098\', \'multiverseId\': 432368}, \'multiverseid\': 432368}, {\'name\': \'混沌喉怪\', \'text\': \'当混沌喉怪进战场时，它对每个其他生物各造成3点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物～地狱兽\', \'flavor\': \'处于食物链顶端的并不是沙丘亚龙。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432567&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7845e74-312b-4def-96f6-a628593a1476\', \'multiverseId\': 432567}, \'multiverseid\': 432567}, {\'name\': \'混沌喉怪\', \'text\': \'當混沌喉怪進戰場時，它對每個其他生物各造成3點傷害。\', \'type\': \'生物～地獄獸\', \'flavor\': \'處於食物鏈頂端的並不是沙丘亞龍。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432766&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57f905f7-50b8-4753-8b33-d82367d89f2d\', \'multiverseId\': 432766}, \'multiverseid\': 432766}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Heuschrecken-Gottheit\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn du eine Karte ziehst, erzeuge einen 1/1 blauen und roten Insekt-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit und Eile.\\n{2}{U}{R}: Ziehe eine Karte und wirf dann eine Karte ab.\\nWenn Die Heuschrecken-Gottheit stirbt, bringe sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Gott\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431027&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1f31841-2428-4500-bdbb-5cb69f79efc8\', \'multiverseId\': 431027}, \'multiverseid\': 431027}, {\'name\': \'El Dios Langosta\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que robes una carta, crea una ficha de criatura Insecto azul y roja 1/1 con las habilidades de volar y prisa.\\n{2}{U}{R}: Roba una carta, luego descarta una carta.\\nCuando El Dios Langosta muera, regrésalo a la mano de su propietario al comienzo del próximo paso final.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Deidad\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431226&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'007127a4-4463-4c6a-aaf1-ac6faf7ba2a8\', \'multiverseId\': 431226}, \'multiverseid\': 431226}, {\'name\': \'Le Dieu-Sauterelle\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que vous piochez une carte, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 bleue et rouge Insecte avec le vol et la célérité.\\n{2}{U}{R} : Piochez une carte, puis défaussez-vous d\'une carte.\\nQuand Le Dieu-Sauterelle meurt, renvoyez-le dans la main de son propriétaire au début de la prochaine étape de fin.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : dieu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431425&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9c6c61d-767b-44a0-8c83-feeb8881aba8\', \'multiverseId\': 431425}, \'multiverseid\': 431425}, {\'name\': \'La Locusta Divina\', \'text\': "Volare\\nOgniqualvolta peschi una carta, crea una pedina creatura Insetto 1/1 blu e rossa con volare e rapidità.\\n{2}{U}{R}: Pesca una carta, poi scarta una carta.\\nQuando La Locusta Divina muore, falla tornare in mano al suo proprietario all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Dio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431624&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03210dfd-d414-4813-a99e-90ba3cc08b2f\', \'multiverseId\': 431624}, \'multiverseid\': 431624}, {\'name\': \'蝗の神\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたがカードを１枚引くたび、飛行と速攻を持つ青であり赤である１/１の昆虫・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\\n{2}{U}{R}：カードを１枚引き、その後カード１枚を捨てる。\\n蝗の神が死亡したとき、次の終了ステップの開始時に、これをオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431823&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81d73b8f-2ea3-4a5b-b57f-ccceed4682d0\', \'multiverseId\': 431823}, \'multiverseid\': 431823}, {\'name\': \'메뚜기 신\', \'text\': \'비행\\n당신이 카드를 뽑을 때마다, 비행과 신속을 가진 1/1 청색 및 적색 곤충 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\\n{2}{U}{R}: 카드 한 장을 뽑은 후 카드 한 장을 버린다.\\n메뚜기 신이 죽을 때, 메뚜기 신을 다음 종료단 시작에 소유자의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 신\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432022&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f911a7a5-12f7-46ba-894d-42aa87cd8523\', \'multiverseId\': 432022}, \'multiverseid\': 432022}, {\'name\': \'O Deus Gafanhoto\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que você comprar um card, crie uma ficha de criatura azul e vermelha 1/1 do tipo Inseto com voar e ímpeto.\\n{2}{U}{R}: Compre um card e depois descarte um card.\\nQuando O Deus Gafanhoto morrer, devolva-o para a mão de seu dono no início da próxima etapa final.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Deus\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432221&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3caae57a-2250-4cbd-b145-20c5669b470c\', \'multiverseId\': 432221}, \'multiverseid\': 432221}, {\'name\': \'Бог-Саранча\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз, когда вы берете карту, создайте одну фишку существа 1/1 синее и красное Насекомое с Полетом и Ускорением.\\n{2}{U}{R}: возьмите карту, затем сбросьте карту.\\nКогда Бог-Саранча умирает, верните его в руку его владельца в начале следующего заключительного шага.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Бог\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432420&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f8aabbf-c70f-4b6a-97f3-9bde4c0e2fb7\', \'multiverseId\': 432420}, \'multiverseid\': 432420}, {\'name\': \'蝗虫神\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当你抓一张牌时，派出一个1/1蓝红双色，具飞行与敏捷异能的昆虫衍生生物。\\n{2}{U}{R}：抓一张牌，然后弃一张牌。\\n当蝗虫神死去，在下一个结束步骤开始时，将它移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物～神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432619&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efe27913-08b2-4937-8eff-bb1183953da9\', \'multiverseId\': 432619}, \'multiverseid\': 432619}, {\'name\': \'蝗蟲神\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n每當你抽一張牌時，派出一個1/1藍紅雙色，具飛行與敏捷異能的昆蟲衍生生物。\\n{2}{U}{R}：抽一張牌，然後棄一張牌。\\n當蝗蟲神死去，在下一個結束步驟開始時，將它移回其擁有者手上。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物～神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432818&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1a2a8bf-1511-4c2c-8e78-8b793b781550\', \'multiverseId\': 432818}, \'multiverseid\': 432818}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Skarabäen-Gottheit\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments verliert jeder Gegner X Lebenspunkte und du wendest Hellsicht X an, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Zombies ist, die du kontrollierst.\\n{2}{U}{B}: Schicke eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof ins Exil. Erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie von ihr ist, außer dass er ein 4/4 schwarzer Zombie ist.\\nWenn Die Skarabäen-Gottheit stirbt, bringe sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Gott\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431033&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a26cc01e-a6b1-4b5e-9776-cf232752a321\', \'multiverseId\': 431033}, \'multiverseid\': 431033}, {\'name\': \'El Dios Escarabajo\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, cada oponente pierde X vidas y tú adivinas X, donde X es la cantidad de Zombies que controlas.\\n{2}{U}{B}: Exilia la carta de criatura objetivo de un cementerio. Crea una ficha que es una copia de esa criatura, excepto que es un Zombie negro 4/4.\\nCuando El Dios Escarabajo muera, regrésalo a la mano de su propietario al comienzo del próximo paso final.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Deidad\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431232&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ee05966-9750-4a5f-856c-7393b2816636\', \'multiverseId\': 431232}, \'multiverseid\': 431232}, {\'name\': \'Le Dieu-Scarabée\', \'text\': "Au début de votre entretien, chaque adversaire perd X points de vie et vous appliquez regard X, X étant le nombre de zombies que vous contrôlez.\\n{2}{U}{B} : Exilez une carte de créature ciblée depuis un cimetière. Créez un jeton qui en est une copie, excepté que c\'est un zombie 4/4 noir.\\nQuand Le Dieu-Scarabée meurt, renvoyez-le dans la main de son propriétaire au début de la prochaine étape de fin.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : dieu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431431&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'144b320b-c489-4421-9f9b-e6107ba0bb2e\', \'multiverseId\': 431431}, \'multiverseid\': 431431}, {\'name\': \'Lo Scarabeo Divino\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, ogni avversario perde X punti vita e tu profetizzi X, dove X è il numero di Zombie che controlli.\\n{2}{U}{B}: Esilia una carta creatura bersaglio da un cimitero. Crea una pedina che è una copia della carta, tranne che è uno Zombie 4/4 nero.\\nQuando Lo Scarabeo Divino muore, fallo tornare in mano al suo proprietario all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Dio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431630&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e139e83-3c92-4813-ba01-d9e1f0895412\', \'multiverseId\': 431630}, \'multiverseid\': 431630}, {\'name\': \'スカラベの神\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、各対戦相手はそれぞれＸ点のライフを失い、あなたは占術Ｘを行う。Ｘはあなたがコントロールするゾンビの総数に等しい。\\n{2}{U}{B}：墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それを追放する。黒の４/４のゾンビであることを除きそれのコピーであるトークンを１体生成する。\\nスカラベの神が死亡したとき、次の終了ステップの開始時に、これをオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431829&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c25115f8-fa7c-4e39-9e51-744fafffdea5\', \'multiverseId\': 431829}, \'multiverseid\': 431829}, {\'name\': \'딱정벌레 신\', \'text\': \'당신의 유지단 시작에, 각 상대는 생명 X점을 잃고 당신은 점술 X를 한다. X는 당신이 조종하는 좀비의 개수다.\\n{2}{U}{B}: 무덤에 있는 생물 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 추방한다. 그 카드의 복사본이지만 4/4 흑색 좀비인 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\\n딱정벌레 신이 죽을 때, 딱정벌레 신을 다음 종료단 시작에 소유자의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 신\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432028&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62847856-9866-4c71-96f3-341cac793d01\', \'multiverseId\': 432028}, \'multiverseid\': 432028}, {\'name\': \'O Deus Escaravelho\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, cada oponente perde X pontos de vida e você usa vidência X, sendo X o número de Zumbis que você controla.\\n{2}{U}{B}: Exile o card de criatura alvo de um cemitério. Crie uma ficha que seja uma cópia dele, com a exceção de ser um Zumbi preto 4/4.\\nQuando O Deus Escaravelho morrer, devolva-o para a mão de seu dono no início da próxima etapa final.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Deus\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432227&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be58020f-4499-47de-87ec-b20fd7c4b9ef\', \'multiverseId\': 432227}, \'multiverseid\': 432227}, {\'name\': \'Бог-Скарабей\', \'text\': \'В начале вашего шага поддержки каждый оппонент теряет X жизней, а вы предсказываете X, где X — количество Зомби под вашим контролем.\\n{2}{U}{B}: изгоните целевую карту существа из кладбища. Создайте фишку, являющуюся ее копией, но при этом являющуюся черным Зомби 4/4.\\nКогда Бог-Скарабей умирает, верните его в руку его владельца в начале следующего заключительного шага.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Бог\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3166354-5d6a-4790-909d-8013d9a9c92c\', \'multiverseId\': 432426}, \'multiverseid\': 432426}, {\'name\': \'甲虫神\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，每位对手各失去X点生命且你占卜X，X为由你操控的灵俑数量。\\n{2}{U}{B}：将目标生物牌从坟墓场放逐。派出一个衍生物，该衍生物为所放逐之牌的复制品，但它是4/4黑色灵俑。\\n当甲虫神死去，在下一个结束步骤开始时，将它移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物～神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cc045bd-6187-4145-94f2-640b1a82effe\', \'multiverseId\': 432625}, \'multiverseid\': 432625}, {\'name\': \'甲蟲神\', \'text\': \'在你的維持開始時，每位對手各失去X點生命且你占卜X，X為由你操控的殭屍數量。\\n{2}{U}{B}：將目標生物牌從墳墓場放逐。派出一個衍生物，該衍生物為所放逐之牌的複製品，但它是4/4黑色殭屍。\\n當甲蟲神死去，在下一個結束步驟開始時，將它移回其擁有者手上。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物～神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432824&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd85d31f-c0a3-460f-8fcf-5dd681fa35dd\', \'multiverseId\': 432824}, \'multiverseid\': 432824}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Skorpion-Gottheit\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur, auf der mindestens eine -1/-1-Marke liegt, stirbt, ziehe eine Karte.\\n{1}{B}{R}: Lege eine -1/-1-Marke auf eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl.\\nWenn Die Skorpion-Gottheit stirbt, bringe sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Gott\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431034&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c18a63b5-9c0a-41cd-9027-c46bac85fb69\', \'multiverseId\': 431034}, \'multiverseid\': 431034}, {\'name\': \'El Dios Escorpión\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura con un contador -1/-1 sobre ella muera, roba una carta.\\n{1}{B}{R}: Pon un contador -1/-1 sobre otra criatura objetivo.\\nCuando El Dios Escorpión muera, regrésalo a la mano de su propietario al comienzo del próximo paso final.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Deidad\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431233&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f5a71fb-5d00-4b5f-a0b8-19fc6b3079ea\', \'multiverseId\': 431233}, \'multiverseid\': 431233}, {\'name\': \'Le Dieu-Scorpion\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature avec un marqueur -1/-1 sur elle meurt, piochez une carte.\\n{1}{B}{R} : Mettez un marqueur -1/-1 sur une autre créature ciblée.\\nQuand Le Dieu-Scorpion meurt, renvoyez-le dans la main de son propriétaire au début de la prochaine étape de fin.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : dieu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431432&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e58b6ff6-7daf-463e-a659-8623f75e16b0\', \'multiverseId\': 431432}, \'multiverseid\': 431432}, {\'name\': \'Lo Scorpione Divino\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta una creatura con un segnalino -1/-1 muore, pesca una carta.\\n{1}{B}{R}: Metti un segnalino -1/-1 su un\'altra creatura bersaglio.\\nQuando Lo Scorpione Divino muore, fallo tornare in mano al suo proprietario all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Dio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431631&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2166cd6a-1413-4045-b861-13e1c35b0c36\', \'multiverseId\': 431631}, \'multiverseid\': 431631}, {\'name\': \'蠍の神\', \'text\': \'－１/－１カウンターが置かれているクリーチャーが１体死亡するたび、カードを１枚引く。\\n{1}{B}{R}：他のクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それの上に－１/－１カウンターを１個置く。\\n蠍の神が死亡したとき、次の終了ステップの開始時に、これをオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431830&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'baf8c64f-a9d2-4701-802e-effb8f5adaa0\', \'multiverseId\': 431830}, \'multiverseid\': 431830}, {\'name\': \'전갈 신\', \'text\': \'-1/-1 카운터를 가진 생물이 죽을 때마다, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\\n{1}{B}{R}: 다른 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 -1/-1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\\n전갈 신이 죽을 때, 전갈 신을 다음 종료단 시작에 소유자의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 신\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432029&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3152675-ebe4-4581-8f9b-2508fb885efa\', \'multiverseId\': 432029}, \'multiverseid\': 432029}, {\'name\': \'O Deus Escorpião\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura com um marcador -1/-1 morrer, compre um card.\\n{1}{B}{R}: Coloque um marcador -1/-1 em outra criatura alvo.\\nQuando O Deus Escorpião morrer, devolva-o para a mão de seu dono no início da próxima etapa final.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Deus\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432228&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e72fe992-7f05-47b0-8f18-ca48d2871b49\', \'multiverseId\': 432228}, \'multiverseid\': 432228}, {\'name\': \'Бог-Скорпион\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда существо с жетоном -1/-1 на нем умирает, возьмите карту.\\n{1}{B}{R}: положите один жетон -1/-1 на другое целевое существо.\\nКогда Бог-Скорпион умирает, верните его в руку его владельца в начале следующего заключительного шага.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Бог\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432427&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'071de7e7-52ba-4580-bb01-114faad99cc8\', \'multiverseId\': 432427}, \'multiverseid\': 432427}, {\'name\': \'毒蝎神\', \'text\': \'每当一个其上有-1/-1指示物的生物死去时，抓一张牌。\\n{1}{B}{R}：在另一个目标生物上放置一个-1/-1指示物。\\n当毒蝎神死去，在下一个结束步骤开始时，将它移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物～神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432626&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8095c7ec-45e0-4597-a0d7-977758f26e0a\', \'multiverseId\': 432626}, \'multiverseid\': 432626}, {\'name\': \'毒蠍神\', \'text\': \'每當一個其上有-1/-1指示物的生物死去時，抽一張牌。\\n{1}{B}{R}：在另一個目標生物上放置一個-1/-1指示物。\\n當毒蠍神死去，在下一個結束步驟開始時，將它移回其擁有者手上。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物～神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432825&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23b32cc6-af8e-4a2e-866c-9d95f61258c3\', \'multiverseId\': 432825}, \'multiverseid\': 432825}]', "[{'name': 'Djeru der Geläuterte', 'text': 'Wachsamkeit\\nWenn Djeru der Geläuterte ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Planeswalker-Karte durchsuchen, sie offen vorzeigen, auf deine Hand nehmen und dann deine Bibliothek mischen.\\nFalls eine Quelle einem Planeswalker, den du kontrollierst, Schaden zufügen würde, verhindere 1 dieser Schadenspunkte.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=430898&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '551a80e8-72cf-4ce7-b66b-2abebf7db18f', 'multiverseId': 430898}, 'multiverseid': 430898}, {'name': 'Djeru, el de los Ojos Abiertos', 'text': 'Vigilancia.\\nCuando Djeru, el de los Ojos Abiertos entre al campo de batalla, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de planeswalker, mostrarla, ponerla en tu mano y luego barajar tu biblioteca.\\nSi una fuente fuera a hacer daño a un planeswalker que controlas, prevén 1 punto de ese daño.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Guerrero humano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431097&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '69835bc7-c836-4dd1-a09f-b8357734a125', 'multiverseId': 431097}, 'multiverseid': 431097}, {'name': 'Djeru, face à la vérité', 'text': 'Vigilance\\nQuand Djeru, face à la vérité arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque une carte de planeswalker, la révéler, la mettre dans votre main et mélanger ensuite votre bibliothèque.\\nSi une source devait infliger des blessures à un planeswalker que vous contrôlez, prévenez 1 de ces blessures.', 'type': 'Créature légendaire : humain et guerrier', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431296&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b263b621-c37f-4f15-af15-8662d9d46960', 'multiverseId': 431296}, 'multiverseid': 431296}, {'name': 'Djeru, dagli Occhi Aperti', 'text': 'Cautela\\nQuando Djeru, dagli Occhi Aperti entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta planeswalker, rivelarla e aggiungerla alla tua mano. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\\nSe una fonte sta per infliggere danni a un planeswalker che controlli, previeni 1 di quei danni.', 'type': 'Creatura Leggendaria — Guerriero Umano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431495&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aa5e0bbb-51c9-49d4-8db9-e056747ed09d', 'multiverseId': 431495}, 'multiverseid': 431495}, {'name': '目を開いた者、デジェル', 'text': '警戒\\n目を開いた者、デジェルが戦場に出たとき、あなたはあなたのライブラリーからプレインズウォーカー・カード１枚を探してもよい。そうしたなら、それを公開してあなたの手札に加え、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\\n発生源１つがあなたがコントロールするプレインズウォーカーにダメージを与えるなら、そのダメージを１点軽減する。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・戦士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431694&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dadc3f1d-4b27-4c00-b022-eeea3855063b', 'multiverseId': 431694}, 'multiverseid': 431694}, {'name': '눈을 뜬 제루', 'text': '경계\\n눈을 뜬 제루가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 당신의 서고에서 플레인즈워커 카드 한 장을 찾아 공개한 후 당신의 손으로 가져갈 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 당신의 서고를 섞는다.\\n어느 원천이 당신이 조종하는 플레인즈워커에게 피해를 입히려 한다면, 그 피해 중 1점을 방지한다.', 'type': '전설적 생물 — 인간 전사', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431893&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2c1f5e22-358b-4d70-8b15-894a627a596f', 'multiverseId': 431893}, 'multiverseid': 431893}, {'name': 'Djeru, de Olhos Abertos', 'text': 'Vigilância\\nQuando Djeru, de Olhos Abertos, entra no campo de batalha, você pode procurar um card de planeswalker em seu grimório, revelá-lo, colocá-lo na sua mão e depois embaralhar seu grimório.\\nSe uma fonte for causar dano a um planeswalker que você controla, previna 1 ponto daquele dano.', 'type': 'Criatura Lendária — Humano Guerreiro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432092&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a3ffddc5-0fd5-47ae-82c9-13402dc114f8', 'multiverseId': 432092}, 'multiverseid': 432092}, {'name': 'Джеру, Раскрывший Глаза', 'text': 'Бдительность\\nКогда Джеру, Раскрывший Глаза выходит на поле битвы, вы можете найти в вашей библиотеке карту planeswalker-а, показать ее, положить ее в вашу руку, затем перетасовать вашу библиотеку.\\nЕсли источник должен нанести повреждения planeswalker-у под вашим контролем, предотвратите 1 из этих повреждений.', 'type': 'Легендарное Существо — Человек Воин', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432291&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f64ce1b0-3a2c-46bb-95af-e38298ee40ed', 'multiverseId': 432291}, 'multiverseid': 432291}, {'name': '彻悟的杰鲁', 'text': '警戒\\n当彻悟的杰鲁进战场时，你可以从你牌库中搜寻一张鹏洛客牌，展示该牌，将它置于你手上，然后将你的牌库洗牌。\\n如果某来源将对任一由你操控的鹏洛客造成伤害，则防止该伤害中的1点。', 'type': '传奇生物～人类／战士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432490&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a2d77be4-641c-4ee0-8d14-120f7db441b0', 'multiverseId': 432490}, 'multiverseid': 432490}, {'name': '徹悟的傑魯', 'text': '警戒\\n當徹悟的傑魯進戰場時，你可以從你牌庫中搜尋一張鵬洛客牌，展示該牌，將它置於你手上，然後將你的牌庫洗牌。\\n如果某來源將對任一由你操控的鵬洛客造成傷害，則防止該傷害中的1點。', 'type': '傳奇生物～人類／戰士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432689&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '061f90ac-2ce8-465a-978c-15564a89f75b', 'multiverseId': 432689}, 'multiverseid': 432689}]", '[{\'name\': \'Djerus Abkehr\', \'text\': \'Tappe bis zu zwei Kreaturen deiner Wahl.\\nUmwandlung {W} ({W}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Mir wurde das Jenseits versprochen, nicht das hier. Samut hatte recht: Der Gott-Pharao hat uns alle betrogen." —Djeru, ehemaliger Geweihter der Tah-Saat\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=430899&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8ea1118-9957-40df-8ae1-7a6e0739e34b\', \'multiverseId\': 430899}, \'multiverseid\': 430899}, {\'name\': \'Renuncia de Djeru\', \'text\': \'Gira hasta dos criaturas objetivo.\\nCiclo {W}. ({W}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Se me prometió el más allá, no esto. Samut tenía razón. El Dios Faraón mintió". —Djeru, antiguo iniciado de la simiente Tah\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431098&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3101f5bd-87cb-40ee-b883-cc6b9dbebdb5\', \'multiverseId\': 431098}, \'multiverseid\': 431098}, {\'name\': \'Renonciation de Djeru\', \'text\': "Engagez jusqu\'à deux créatures ciblées.\\nRecyclage {W} ({W}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Ce n\'est pas l\'au-delà que l\'on m\'avait promis. Samut avait raison. Le Dieu-Pharaon a menti. » —Djeru, ancien adepte de la moisson Tah", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431297&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7542a287-be1a-4dbb-aa25-32ef1d46ae6c\', \'multiverseId\': 431297}, \'multiverseid\': 431297}, {\'name\': \'Rinuncia di Djeru\', \'text\': \'TAPpa fino a due creature bersaglio.\\nCiclo {W} ({W}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Mi era stato promesso l\\\'Aldilà, non questo. Samut aveva ragione: il Dio Faraone ha mentito." —Djeru, ex iniziato della messe Tah\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431496&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57155a99-75ad-431d-b7eb-cb8bf4496848\', \'multiverseId\': 431496}, \'multiverseid\': 431496}, {\'name\': \'デジェルの拒絶\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー最大２体を対象とし、それらをタップする。\\nサイクリング{W}（{W}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「私に約束されたのは来世だ。現世利益ではない。サムトは正しかった。王神は我々を騙したのだ。」 ――ター一門の元修練者、デジェル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431695&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32f62ff7-f360-48df-99cd-e91f30c104a9\', \'multiverseId\': 431695}, \'multiverseid\': 431695}, {\'name\': \'제루의 단념\', \'text\': \'생물을 최대 두 개까지 목표로 정한다. 그 생물들을 탭한다.\\n순환 {W} ({W}, 이 카드를 버린다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"내게 약속되었던 것은 이런 게 아니라 사후 세계였다. 사무트가 옳았어. 신 파라오가 우릴 속였다." —전 타 입문자 입회자 제루\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431894&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e630414-5111-499f-a16d-c2b883b84ee8\', \'multiverseId\': 431894}, \'multiverseid\': 431894}, {\'name\': \'Renúncia de Djeru\', \'text\': \'Vire até duas criaturas alvo.\\nReciclar {W} ({W}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Foi-me prometida a vida após a morte, não isso. Samut estava certa. O Faraó-Deus mentiu." — Djeru, ex-iniciado da safra Tah\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432093&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c442826-592e-46e9-909d-5ca9cfccf87b\', \'multiverseId\': 432093}, \'multiverseid\': 432093}, {\'name\': \'Отречение Джеру\', \'text\': \'Поверните не более двух целевых существ.\\nЦикл {W} ({W}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Мне обещали загробную жизнь, а не это. Самут была права. Бог-Фараон лгал нам». — Джеру, бывший послушник снопа Тах\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432292&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'943e5520-9b1a-4af4-94ec-79ccb17197a4\', \'multiverseId\': 432292}, \'multiverseid\': 432292}, {\'name\': \'杰鲁的决断\', \'text\': \'横置至多两个目标生物。\\n循环{W}（{W}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「他们口口声声说我赢得了来世，但我眼前只有末日。撒姆特没错。法老神在撒谎。」 ～原塔哈祀群祀徒杰鲁\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432491&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0cbbbf0-569f-4645-af13-774fe5278841\', \'multiverseId\': 432491}, \'multiverseid\': 432491}, {\'name\': \'傑魯的決斷\', \'text\': \'橫置至多兩個目標生物。\\n循環{W}（{W}，棄掉此牌：抽一張牌。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「他們口口聲聲說我贏得了來世，但我眼前只有末日。撒姆特沒錯。法老神在撒謊。」 ～原塔哈祀群祀徒傑魯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432690&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f7f6245-b34e-40fe-ac59-51c265eba7cd\', \'multiverseId\': 432690}, \'multiverseid\': 432690}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dolch der Ehrenhaften\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +2/+0 und hat Pestilenz 1. (Immer wenn sie geblockt wird, verliert der verteidigende Spieler 1 Lebenspunkt.)\\nAusrüsten {2} ({2}: Lege diese Karte an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431048&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e2d0525-9281-451b-8e67-a1fb569453fc\', \'multiverseId\': 431048}, \'multiverseid\': 431048}, {\'name\': \'Daga de los dignos\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +2/+0 y tiene la habilidad de afligir 1. (Siempre que esta criatura sea bloqueada, el jugador defensor pierde 1 vida.)\\nEquipar {2}. ({2}: Anexa este equipo a la criatura objetivo que controlas. Activa la habilidad de equipar como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431247&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b60c1ed6-192b-4026-b568-8aa07ceb9ca8\', \'multiverseId\': 431247}, \'multiverseid\': 431247}, {\'name\': \'Dague du Valeureux\', \'text\': "La créature équipée gagne +2/+0 et a affliction 1. (À chaque fois qu\'elle devient bloquée, le joueur défenseur perd 1 point de vie.)\\nÉquipement {2} ({2} : Attachez à la créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. N\'attachez l\'équipement que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431446&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34af0095-06bc-4d06-bae8-b1e3d8ccbe12\', \'multiverseId\': 431446}, \'multiverseid\': 431446}, {\'name\': \'Pugnale dei Prescelti\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +2/+0 e ha affliggere 1. (Ogniqualvolta viene bloccata, il giocatore in difesa perde 1 punto vita.)\\nEquipaggiare {2} ({2}: Assegna a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Equipaggia solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431645&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7264a6c0-5ce7-464d-8833-3740bc7a8b35\', \'multiverseId\': 431645}, \'multiverseid\': 431645}, {\'name\': \'蓋世の英雄の短剣\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋２/＋０の修整を受けるとともに加虐１を持つ。（それがブロックされた状態になるたび、防御プレイヤーは１点のライフを失う。）\\n装備{2}（{2}：あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とし、これをそれにつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431844&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e508429-8f05-4fd0-b9e9-069714b191a4\', \'multiverseId\': 431844}, \'multiverseid\': 431844}, {\'name\': \'자격있는 자의 단검\', \'text\': \'장착된 생물은 +2/+0을 받고 통증 1을 가진다. (이 생물이 방어될 때마다, 수비플레이어는 생명 1점을 잃는다.)\\n장착 {2} ({2}: 당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 이 장비를 부착한다. 당신이 집중마법을 발동할 수 있는 시기에만 장착할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'마법물체 — 장비\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432043&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4147b387-1d22-45f7-b1be-26f8a794364a\', \'multiverseId\': 432043}, \'multiverseid\': 432043}, {\'name\': \'Adaga dos Dignos\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada recebe +2/+0 e tem afligir 1. (Toda vez que ela se torna bloqueada, o jogador defensor perde 1 ponto de vida.)\\nEquipar {2} ({2}: Anexe à criatura alvo que você controla. Equipe somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432242&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa2bb2a2-4989-4cf8-ba54-fa053dc9f5c6\', \'multiverseId\': 432242}, \'multiverseid\': 432242}, {\'name\': \'Кинжал Достойных\', \'text\': \'Снаряженное существо получает +2/+0 и имеет Страдание 1. (Каждый раз, когда оно становится заблокированным, защищающийся игрок теряет 1 жизнь.)\\nСнарядить {2} ({2}: прикрепите к целевому существу под вашим контролем. Снаряжайте только как волшебство.)\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432441&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2d75fd3-d3c2-4169-be92-bdbab8348f2e\', \'multiverseId\': 432441}, \'multiverseid\': 432441}, {\'name\': \'豪英匕首\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物得+2/+0且具有折磨1。（每当它被阻挡时，防御牌手失去1点生命。）\\n佩带{2}（{2}：装备在目标由你操控的生物上。佩带的时机视同法术。）\', \'type\': \'神器～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432640&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37939489-6b90-4f7d-ac6b-dd644452387a\', \'multiverseId\': 432640}, \'multiverseid\': 432640}, {\'name\': \'豪英匕首\', \'text\': \'佩帶此武具的生物得+2/+0且具有折磨1。（每當它被阻擋時，防禦玩家失去1點生命。）\\n佩帶{2}（{2}：裝備在目標由你操控的生物上。佩帶的時機視同巫術。）\', \'type\': \'神器～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432839&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'808018c3-abf5-4b34-937a-907200330f79\', \'multiverseId\': 432839}, \'multiverseid\': 432839}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dorneneidechse\', \'text\': \'Bravour (Immer wenn du einen Nichtkreatur-Zauberspruch wirkst, erhält diese Kreatur +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.)\\nDie Dorneneidechse hat Erstschlag, solange sie angreift.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eidechse\', \'flavor\': \'Viele, die der Verwüstung Naktamuns entkommen waren, starben wenig später in den Fängen der Bestien der Splitterwüste.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=430996&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fba1242-01ec-4798-a6b7-7cfcb589f9fc\', \'multiverseId\': 430996}, \'multiverseid\': 430996}, {\'name\': \'Moloc espinoso\', \'text\': \'Destreza. (Siempre que lances un hechizo que no sea de criatura, esta criatura obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.)\\nEl Moloc espinoso tiene la habilidad de dañar primero mientras esté atacando.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lagarto\', \'flavor\': \'Los que huyeron de la destrucción de la ciudad se adentraron en el territorio de sus espinosos e irritables vecinos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431195&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f41572b3-2860-4770-a8b0-6aaa9ae49246\', \'multiverseId\': 431195}, \'multiverseid\': 431195}, {\'name\': \'Diable cornu épineux\', \'text\': "Prouesse (À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort non-créature, cette créature gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)\\nLe Diable cornu épineux a l\'initiative tant qu\'il attaque.", \'type\': \'Créature : lézard\', \'flavor\': \'Ceux qui fuyaient la destruction de la ville se retrouvèrent face à un problème épineux.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431394&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a38172f-9388-43fc-82d7-cdbfd9b7ca3d\', \'multiverseId\': 431394}, \'multiverseid\': 431394}, {\'name\': \'Moloc Spinoso\', \'text\': \'Prodezza (Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia non creatura, questa creatura prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.)\\nIl Moloc Spinoso ha attacco improvviso fintanto che è attaccante.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Lucertola\', \'flavor\': \'Coloro che fuggirono dalla distruzione della città incapparono nel territorio dei loro pungenti vicini.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431593&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f103d122-fbf5-46a3-9824-98695a4f994c\', \'multiverseId\': 431593}, \'multiverseid\': 431593}, {\'name\': \'棘モロク\', \'text\': \'果敢（あなたがクリーチャーでない呪文を１つ唱えるたび、ターン終了時まで、このクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。）\\n棘モロクが攻撃しているかぎり、これは先制攻撃を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — トカゲ\', \'flavor\': \'都市の崩壊から逃げ延びた人々は、トゲトゲしい隣人の縄張りに入り込むことになった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431792&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a22f1bb-abd9-4695-8413-cc0fb0e60f95\', \'multiverseId\': 431792}, \'multiverseid\': 431792}, {\'name\': \'가시돋친 도마뱀\', \'text\': \'기량 (당신이 생물이 아닌 주문을 발동할 때마다, 이 생물은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받는다.)\\n가시돋친 도마뱀은 자신이 공격하는 동안 선제공격을 가진다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 도마뱀\', \'flavor\': \'파괴되는 도시에서 탈출한 주민들은 의도치 않게 가시 돋친 녀석들의 영역으로 들어갔다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431991&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbc256dc-88b1-4318-9027-be2b2dbf9d62\', \'multiverseId\': 431991}, \'multiverseid\': 431991}, {\'name\': \'Moloch Espinhento\', \'text\': \'Destreza (Toda vez que você conjura uma mágica que não seja de criatura, esta criatura recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.)\\nMoloch Espinhento tem iniciativa enquanto estiver atacando.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lagarto\', \'flavor\': \'Os que fugiram da destruição da cidade acabaram no território de seus espinhosos vizinhos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432190&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2f9c244-c548-42c3-97ef-3948ee4d7b0b\', \'multiverseId\': 432190}, \'multiverseid\': 432190}, {\'name\': \'Шипастый Молох\', \'text\': \'Искусность (Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете не являющееся существом заклинание, это существо получает +1/+1 до конца хода.)\\nПока Шипастый Молох атакует, он имеет Первый удар.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ящер\', \'flavor\': \'Те, кто сбежал из рушащегося города, попали во владения его вспыльчивых соседей.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432389&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adb57361-8e19-4581-bacd-7d32e10296d7\', \'multiverseId\': 432389}, \'multiverseid\': 432389}, {\'name\': \'锐角棘蜥\', \'text\': \'灵技（每当你施放非生物咒语时，此生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。）\\n只要锐角棘蜥正进行攻击，它便具有先攻异能。\', \'type\': \'生物～蜥蜴\', \'flavor\': \'由于城市遭毁而出逃的人们又落入了他们多棘邻居的领地。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432588&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c389da57-cbbc-4dc9-a178-33be1d59c603\', \'multiverseId\': 432588}, \'multiverseid\': 432588}, {\'name\': \'銳角棘蜥\', \'text\': \'靈技（每當你施放非生物咒語時，此生物得+1/+1直到回合結束。）\\n只要銳角棘蜥正進行攻擊，它便具有先攻異能。\', \'type\': \'生物～蜥蜴\', \'flavor\': \'由於城市遭毀而出逃的人們又落入了他們多棘鄰居的領地。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432787&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7aeaf838-51ab-4c40-879e-955386fc1e1a\', \'multiverseId\': 432787}, \'multiverseid\': 432787}]', "[{'name': 'Dornenwurzelbehemoth', 'text': 'Verursacht Trampelschaden (Diese Kreatur kann beim Angreifen überschüssigen Kampfschaden dem verteidigenden Spieler oder Planeswalker zufügen.)', 'type': 'Kreatur — Elementarwesen', 'flavor': 'Das Leben findet immer einen Weg. Oder es bahnt sich einen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432891&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd72d0d1f-b4d0-4ec2-9a12-c017dad136bb', 'multiverseId': 432891}, 'multiverseid': 432891}, {'name': 'Behemot zarzaentramada', 'text': 'Arrolla. (Esta criatura puede hacer el daño de combate sobrante al jugador o planeswalker defensor mientras ataca.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Elemental', 'flavor': 'La vida encontrará el camino, o lo creará.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432901&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '09bf4491-c311-4a16-b652-8145382b6078', 'multiverseId': 432901}, 'multiverseid': 432901}, {'name': 'Béhémoth trameronces', 'text': 'Piétinement (Cette créature peut infliger son surplus de blessures de combat au joueur ou au planeswalker défenseur quand elle attaque.)', 'type': 'Créature : élémental', 'flavor': 'La vie trouvera son chemin, ou elle en créera un.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432911&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '26538be8-9b7a-4b37-9f78-b728e8ffb6a8', 'multiverseId': 432911}, 'multiverseid': 432911}, {'name': 'Behemoth Trama di Rovi', 'text': 'Travolgere (Questa creatura può infliggere il danno da combattimento in eccesso a un giocatore in difesa o a un planeswalker mentre attacca.)', 'type': 'Creatura — Elementale', 'flavor': 'Se la vita non riesce a trovare il suo corso, se ne creerà uno.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432921&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2ee3d1ee-bd1a-46a7-8f01-258d64f055d6', 'multiverseId': 432921}, 'multiverseid': 432921}, {'name': '茨織りのビヒモス', 'text': 'トランプル（攻撃しているこのクリーチャーは余剰の戦闘ダメージを防御プレイヤーかプレインズウォーカーに与えることができる。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エレメンタル', 'flavor': '生命は道を見つける。見つからなければ作り出す。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432931&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4db88746-336f-4980-aac4-80d1576be2a7', 'multiverseId': 432931}, 'multiverseid': 432931}, {'name': '덤불그물 거대괴수', 'text': '돌진 (이 생물은 공격할 때 수비플레이어 또는 플레인즈워커에게 여분의 피해를 입힌다.)', 'type': '생물 — 정령', 'flavor': '삶은 길을 찾을 것이다. 없다면 하나를 만들 것이다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432941&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6f227dc5-5e13-4215-843a-f123d031fef7', 'multiverseId': 432941}, 'multiverseid': 432941}, {'name': 'Behemoth Espinheiro', 'text': 'Atropelar (Esta criatura pode causar seu dano de combate excedente ao planeswalker ou jogador defensor ao atacar.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Elemental', 'flavor': 'A vida encontrará um jeito, ou inventará um.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432951&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '651975c2-bda2-4f5e-8fd5-3b72ed8a9222', 'multiverseId': 432951}, 'multiverseid': 432951}, {'name': 'Сплетенное из Колючек Чудище', 'text': 'Пробивной удар (Атакуя, это существо может нанести избыточные боевые повреждения защищающемуся игроку или planeswalker-у.)', 'type': 'Существо — Элементаль', 'flavor': 'Жизнь найдет дорогу — или проложит новую.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432961&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '110c24b5-aa41-4b34-b388-26c95b2a26cd', 'multiverseId': 432961}, 'multiverseid': 432961}, {'name': '纺棘贝西摩斯', 'text': '践踏（此生物攻击时造成之过量战斗伤害能对防御牌手或鹏洛客造成之。）', 'type': '生物～元素', 'flavor': '生命会自寻出路，否则便自辟蹊径。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432971&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '39e37072-3eb4-4ed5-b7bf-6ac7a0425e94', 'multiverseId': 432971}, 'multiverseid': 432971}, {'name': '紡棘貝西摩斯', 'text': '踐踏（此生物攻擊時造成之過量戰鬥傷害能對防禦玩家或鵬洛客造成之。）', 'type': '生物～元素', 'flavor': '生命會自尋出路，否則便自闢蹊徑。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432981&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ab9c728e-eca7-4f2c-8564-3d0b2ea39f85', 'multiverseId': 432981}, 'multiverseid': 432981}]", "[{'name': 'Drohender Untergang', 'text': 'Der Drohende Untergang kommt mit einer Verdammnismarke ins Spiel.\\nImmer wenn du einen Zauberspruch wirkst, dessen umgewandelte Manakosten gleich der Anzahl an Verdammnismarken auf dem Drohenden Untergang sind, fügt der Drohende Untergang einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl entsprechend viele Schadenspunkte zu. Lege dann eine Verdammnismarke auf den Drohenden Untergang.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=430986&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4f2ebf2d-fe06-41a2-88f7-fe004052cbc6', 'multiverseId': 430986}, 'multiverseid': 430986}, {'name': 'Destrucción inminente', 'text': 'La Destrucción inminente entra al campo de batalla con un contador de perdición sobre ella.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo con coste de maná convertido igual a la cantidad de contadores de perdición sobe la Destrucción inminente, la Destrucción inminente hace esa misma cantidad de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo. Luego, pon un contador de perdición sobre la Destrucción inminente.', 'type': 'Encantamiento', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431185&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2f6c61ea-6a4e-4a94-bb97-7836713f537c', 'multiverseId': 431185}, 'multiverseid': 431185}, {'name': 'Mort imminente', 'text': 'La Mort imminente arrive sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur « fatalité » sur elle.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort ayant un coût converti de mana égal au nombre de marqueurs « fatalité » sur la Mort imminente, la Mort imminente inflige autant de blessures à une cible, créature ou joueur. Mettez ensuite un marqueur « fatalité » sur la Mort imminente.', 'type': 'Enchantement', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431384&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4b943fc5-837f-4322-b905-e688ad96ca05', 'multiverseId': 431384}, 'multiverseid': 431384}, {'name': 'Fato Imminente', 'text': 'Il Fato Imminente entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino destino.\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia con costo di mana convertito pari al numero di segnalini destino sul Fato Imminente, il Fato Imminente infligge altrettanti danni a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio. Poi metti un segnalino destino sul Fato Imminente.', 'type': 'Incantesimo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431583&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '733c1169-106f-4128-b8bf-3fbcd3d0d9ec', 'multiverseId': 431583}, 'multiverseid': 431583}, {'name': '差し迫る破滅', 'text': '差し迫る破滅は破滅カウンターが１個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\nあなたが、点数で見たマナ・コストが差し迫る破滅の上に置かれている破滅カウンターの個数に等しい呪文を１つ唱えるたび、クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。差し迫る破滅はそれに、その呪文の点数で見たマナ・コストに等しい点数のダメージを与える。その後、差し迫る破滅の上に破滅カウンターを１個置く。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431782&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b512b2a7-9d73-4796-80f9-11083c4650a3', 'multiverseId': 431782}, 'multiverseid': 431782}, {'name': '임박한 파멸', 'text': '임박한 파멸은 종말 카운터 한 개를 가진 채로 전장에 들어온다.\\n당신이 임박한 파멸에 올려진 종말 카운터 개수와 전환마나비용이 동일한 주문을 발동할 때마다, 생물이나 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 임박한 파멸은 그 목표에게 그만큼의 피해를 입힌다. 그 후 임박한 파멸에 종말 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.', 'type': '부여마법', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431981&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3ed8b79c-61b7-44db-a177-d99f0e0757bf', 'multiverseId': 431981}, 'multiverseid': 431981}, {'name': 'Perdição Iminente', 'text': 'Perdição Iminente entra no campo de batalha com um marcador de perdição.\\nToda vez que você conjura uma mágica com custo de mana convertido igual ao número de marcadores de perdição em Perdição Iminente, Perdição Iminente causa uma quantidade equivalente de dano à criatura ou ao jogador alvo. Em seguida, coloque um marcador de perdição em Perdição Iminente.', 'type': 'Encantamento', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432180&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8c4b8e3b-54f1-4615-bada-6beb6b461c02', 'multiverseId': 432180}, 'multiverseid': 432180}, {'name': 'Неминуемая Гибель', 'text': 'Неминуемая Гибель выходит на поле битвы с одним жетоном погибели на ней.\\nКаждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете заклинание с конвертированной мана-стоимостью, равной числу жетонов погибели на Неминуемой Гибели, Неминуемая Гибель наносит такое же количество повреждений целевому существу или игроку. Затем положите на Неминуемую Гибель один жетон погибели.', 'type': 'Чары', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432379&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8a1f957d-2f78-4a76-bc27-c5db1caf0486', 'multiverseId': 432379}, 'multiverseid': 432379}, {'name': '灾祸临头', 'text': '灾祸临头进战场时上面有一个末日指示物。\\n每当你施放总法术力费用等同于灾祸临头上末日指示物数量的咒语时，灾祸临头对目标生物或牌手造成等量的伤害。然后在灾祸临头上放置一个末日指示物。', 'type': '结界', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432578&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a26f288e-ebe0-42f7-8019-4283fa8acae7', 'multiverseId': 432578}, 'multiverseid': 432578}, {'name': '災禍臨頭', 'text': '災禍臨頭進戰場時上面有一個末日指示物。\\n每當你施放總魔法力費用等同於災禍臨頭上末日指示物數量的咒語時，災禍臨頭對目標生物或玩家造成等量的傷害。然後在災禍臨頭上放置一個末日指示物。', 'type': '結界', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432777&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'effc1850-d29a-47e2-9a89-d96a112a43af', 'multiverseId': 432777}, 'multiverseid': 432777}]", '[{\'name\': \'Durchbohrender Treffer\', \'text\': \'Der Durchbohrende Treffer fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 5 Schadenspunkte zu. Falls die Kreatur in diesem Zug sterben würde, schicke sie stattdessen ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir haben unsere eigenen Götter sterben sehen. Warum nicht auch diese?" —Samut, ehemalige Geweihte der Tah-Saat\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=430994&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aeb28216-bcb1-488f-b273-8d5e71d8267f\', \'multiverseId\': 430994}, \'multiverseid\': 430994}, {\'name\': \'Golpe perforador\', \'text\': \'El Golpe perforador hace 5 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo. Si esa criatura fuese a morir este turno, en vez de eso, exíliala.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Ni el falso Dios Faraón ni sus insectos decidirán nuestro destino". —Samut, antigua iniciada de la simiente Tah\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431193&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0984c39-2d90-48bb-a635-f7a356d45249\', \'multiverseId\': 431193}, \'multiverseid\': 431193}, {\'name\': \'Coup perforant\', \'text\': \'Le Coup perforant inflige 5 blessures à une créature ciblée. Si cette créature devait mourir ce tour-ci, exilez-la à la place.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Ni le faux Dieu-Pharaon ni ses insectes ne décideront de notre sort. » —Samut, ancienne adepte de la moisson Tah\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431392&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bcaa4836-79fc-456c-9cd3-ee502aa7bcf4\', \'multiverseId\': 431392}, \'multiverseid\': 431392}, {\'name\': \'Colpo Perforante\', \'text\': \'Il Colpo Perforante infligge 5 danni a una creatura bersaglio. Se quella creatura sta per morire in questo turno, invece esiliala.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Non saranno né il falso Dio Faraone né i suoi scarafaggi a decidere del nostro destino." —Samut, ex iniziata della messe Tah\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431591&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'043c31f9-0aa7-48b0-8058-679dc5b26836\', \'multiverseId\': 431591}, \'multiverseid\': 431591}, {\'name\': \'穿刺の一撃\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。穿刺の一撃はそれに５点のダメージを与える。このターン、そのクリーチャーが死亡するなら、代わりにそれを追放する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「紛い物の王神やその子分の虫どもに、私たちの運命を決めさせるもんですか。」 ――ター一門の元修練者、サムト\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431790&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b128c6f-163b-42c5-b09b-01564970153f\', \'multiverseId\': 431790}, \'multiverseid\': 431790}, {\'name\': \'관통하는 일격\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 관통하는 일격은 그 생물에게 피해 5점을 입힌다. 그 생물이 이 턴에 죽게 된다면, 대신 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"가짜 신 파라오와 그의 벌레들이 우리 운명을 결정하게 내버려 두지 않을 거야." —전 타 입문자 입회자 사무트\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431989&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b76071f3-e568-4e21-83d8-0ec86441ce54\', \'multiverseId\': 431989}, \'multiverseid\': 431989}, {\'name\': \'Golpe Perfurante\', \'text\': \'Golpe Perfurante causa 5 pontos de dano à criatura alvo. Se aquela criatura for morrer neste turno, em vez disso, exile-a.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Nem o falso Faraó-Deus, nem seus insetos decidirão nosso destino." — Samut, ex-iniciada da safra Tah\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432188&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6aef6719-825a-4d2a-8124-3466b128ed7a\', \'multiverseId\': 432188}, \'multiverseid\': 432188}, {\'name\': \'Вскрывающий Удар\', \'text\': \'Вскрывающий Удар наносит 5 повреждений целевому существу. Если то существо должно умереть в этом ходу, изгоните его вместо этого.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Решать нашу судьбу не дано ни фальшивому Богу-Фараону, ни его ползучим тварям». — Самут, бывшая послушница снопа Тах\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432387&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'737eb112-6248-4e1c-8f36-80ea11c00c8d\', \'multiverseId\': 432387}, \'multiverseid\': 432387}, {\'name\': \'穿心一击\', \'text\': \'穿心一击对目标生物造成5点伤害。如果本回合中该生物将死去，则改为将它放逐。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「无论法老神还是他的那些害虫，都不能决定我们的命运。」 ～原塔哈祀群祀徒撒姆特\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432586&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eaab56db-7917-4240-b766-988814dcf0fc\', \'multiverseId\': 432586}, \'multiverseid\': 432586}, {\'name\': \'穿心一擊\', \'text\': \'穿心一擊對目標生物造成5點傷害。如果本回合中該生物將死去，則改為將它放逐。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「無論法老神還是他的那些害蟲，都不能決定我們的命運。」 ～原塔哈祀群祀徒撒姆特\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432785&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44fc32da-5874-4ba3-977b-e65d44cde731\', \'multiverseId\': 432785}, \'multiverseid\': 432785}]', '[{\'name\': \'Durchbrechen\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, verursachen Trampelschaden bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir müssen aus der Stadt raus, Djeru! Zusammen — niemand wird zurückgelassen!" —Samut, ehemalige Geweihte der Tah-Saat\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=430976&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14b90aa5-224c-44b5-8a20-f224d721f4cc\', \'multiverseId\': 430976}, \'multiverseid\': 430976}, {\'name\': \'Salir por la fuerza\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas que controlas ganan la habilidad de arrollar hasta el final del turno.\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Tenemos que salir de la ciudad, Djeru. ¡Todos nosotros! Reúne a tantos como puedas". —Samut, antigua iniciada de la simiente Tah\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431175&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac11b729-dcc4-4fec-8b18-3009ca83c60f\', \'multiverseId\': 431175}, \'multiverseid\': 431175}, {\'name\': \'Passer à travers\', \'text\': "Les créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nPiochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Nous devons quitter la ville, Djeru. Tous autant que nous sommes ! Rassemble tous ceux que tu pourras. » —Samut, ancienne adepte de la moisson Tah\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431374&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3379d6b5-bb54-4494-a5fd-367ae465f405\', \'multiverseId\': 431374}, \'multiverseid\': 431374}, {\'name\': \'Sfondare\', \'text\': \'Le creature che controlli hanno travolgere fino alla fine del turno.\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Dobbiamo scappare dalla città, Djeru. Tutti insieme! Raduna più gente che puoi." —Samut, ex iniziata della messe Tah\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431573&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc4353c8-8d9c-4c8a-b766-4d51a15b74b7\', \'multiverseId\': 431573}, \'multiverseid\': 431573}, {\'name\': \'突破\', \'text\': \'ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーはトランプルを得る。\\nカードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「街を出るのよ、デジェル。全員よ。できるかぎりの者を集めて。」 ――ター一門の元修練者、サムト\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431772&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c41b14c8-3ae5-4bb4-a258-20304c6b4534\', \'multiverseId\': 431772}, \'multiverseid\': 431772}, {\'name\': \'돌파\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 생물들은 턴종료까지 돌진을 얻는다.\\n카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"어서 이 도시에서 탈출해야 해, 제루. 우리 모두 말이야! 사람들을 가능한 한 많이 모아." —전 타 입문자 입회자 사무트\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431971&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2ea483c-cea4-4fa8-9729-8c13be27d250\', \'multiverseId\': 431971}, \'multiverseid\': 431971}, {\'name\': \'Irromper\', \'text\': \'As criaturas que você controla ganham atropelar até o final do turno.\\nCompre um card.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Temos de sair da cidade, Djeru. Todos nós! Reúna todos que puder." — Samut, ex-iniciada da safra Tah\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432170&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5526a806-7760-4dd7-aa83-ad830f87cacc\', \'multiverseId\': 432170}, \'multiverseid\': 432170}, {\'name\': \'Пробиться\', \'text\': \'Существа под вашим контролем получают Пробивной удар до конца хода.\\nВозьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Надо выбираться из города, Джеру. Нам всем нужно уходить! Собери всех, кого сможешь». — Самут, бывшая послушница снопа Тах\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432369&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'661e2aae-0eee-469c-9eeb-fe9447cc4194\', \'multiverseId\': 432369}, \'multiverseid\': 432369}, {\'name\': \'全力突破\', \'text\': \'由你操控的生物获得践踏异能直到回合结束。\\n抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「杰鲁，我们得离开这座城市。全得离开！尽可能召集更多的人。」 ～原塔哈祀群祀徒撒姆特\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60b342c5-3e6a-4cce-94d3-aa4b42610ba9\', \'multiverseId\': 432568}, \'multiverseid\': 432568}, {\'name\': \'全力突破\', \'text\': \'由你操控的生物獲得踐踏異能直到回合結束。\\n抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「傑魯，我們得離開這座城市。全得離開！盡可能召集更多的人。」 ～原塔哈祀群祀徒撒姆特\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432767&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8e1aa0c-1cd1-48d7-b5f1-57bb588122d3\', \'multiverseId\': 432767}, \'multiverseid\': 432767}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dämon der Apokalypse\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nStärke und Widerstandskraft des Dämons der Apokalypse sind gleich der Anzahl an Karten in deinem Friedhof.\\nTappe zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments den Dämon der Apokalypse, es sei denn, du opferst eine andere Kreatur.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dämon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=430946&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cadc3909-1758-4dc3-be44-8d2586c9bfc5\', \'multiverseId\': 430946}, \'multiverseid\': 430946}, {\'name\': \'Demonio del apocalipsis\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nTanto la fuerza como la resistencia del Demonio del apocalipsis son iguales a la cantidad de cartas que haya en tu cementerio.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, gira el Demonio del apocalipsis a menos que sacrifiques otra criatura\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demonio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431145&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cc423ca-8fc0-4270-8626-fc09005de029\', \'multiverseId\': 431145}, \'multiverseid\': 431145}, {\'name\': "Démon de l\'apocalypse", \'text\': "Vol\\nLa force et l\'endurance du Démon de l\'apocalypse sont chacune égales au nombre de cartes dans votre cimetière.\\nAu début de votre entretien, engagez le Démon de l\'apocalypse à moins que vous ne sacrifiiez une autre créature.", \'type\': \'Créature : démon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431344&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42edd6fe-f12e-4b9f-ad25-2f7a12c48954\', \'multiverseId\': 431344}, \'multiverseid\': 431344}, {\'name\': "Demone dell\'Apocalisse", \'text\': "Volare\\nLa forza e la costituzione del Demone dell\'Apocalisse sono pari al numero di carte nel tuo cimitero.\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, TAPpa il Demone dell\'Apocalisse a meno che non sacrifichi un\'altra creatura.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Demone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431543&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88a67be0-9770-42a4-a60d-3d9c7f35b995\', \'multiverseId\': 431543}, \'multiverseid\': 431543}, {\'name\': \'黙示録の悪魔\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n黙示録の悪魔のパワーとタフネスは、それぞれあなたの墓地にあるカードの総数に等しい。\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたが他のクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げないかぎり、黙示録の悪魔をタップする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デーモン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431742&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e228f2f9-0f42-4c34-ab6e-14e1bb5dbbe3\', \'multiverseId\': 431742}, \'multiverseid\': 431742}, {\'name\': \'종말의 악마\', \'text\': \'비행\\n종말의 악마의 공격력과 방어력은 각각 당신의 무덤에 있는 카드의 개수와 같다.\\n당신의 유지단 시작에, 당신이 다른 생물 한 개를 희생하지 않으면 종말의 악마를 탭한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 악마\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431941&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4965ee86-d05b-4e11-9231-f199963b3b7a\', \'multiverseId\': 431941}, \'multiverseid\': 431941}, {\'name\': \'Demônio do Apocalipse\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nO poder e a resistência de Demônio do Apocalipse são ambos iguais ao número de cards em seu cemitério.\\nNo início de sua manutenção, vire Demônio do Apocalipse, a menos que você sacrifique outra criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demônio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432140&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8dc43e9-d7ac-4f38-bf39-1419de3a78f7\', \'multiverseId\': 432140}, \'multiverseid\': 432140}, {\'name\': \'Демон Апокалипсиса\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nСила и выносливость Демона Апокалипсиса равны количеству карт на вашем кладбище.\\nВ начале вашего шага поддержки поверните Демона Апокалипсиса, если только вы не пожертвуете другое существо.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Демон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432339&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07a6eb15-e861-44d4-af17-9bea8119a1f9\', \'multiverseId\': 432339}, \'multiverseid\': 432339}, {\'name\': \'末日恶魔\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n末日恶魔的力量和防御力各等同于你坟墓场中牌的数量。\\n在你的维持开始时，除非你牺牲另一个生物，否则横置末日恶魔。\', \'type\': \'生物～恶魔\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432538&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c41aa98-43b8-41f0-b177-614acbad6abd\', \'multiverseId\': 432538}, \'multiverseid\': 432538}, {\'name\': \'末日惡魔\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n末日惡魔的力量和防禦力各等同於你墳墓場中牌的數量。\\n在你的維持開始時，除非你犧牲另一個生物，否則橫置末日惡魔。\', \'type\': \'生物～惡魔\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432737&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'010e946c-5eb3-452d-8abc-2489d8633300\', \'multiverseId\': 432737}, \'multiverseid\': 432737}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dünen der Toten\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {C}.\\nWenn die Dünen der Toten aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt werden, erzeuge einen 2/2 schwarzen Zombie-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Land — Wüste\', \'flavor\': \'Den Fluch des Umherirrens gab es bereits lange bevor Nicol Bolas Fuß auf Amonkhet setzte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431063&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6ae0739-7665-4be0-ad5e-8dce657dc497\', \'multiverseId\': 431063}, \'multiverseid\': 431063}, {\'name\': \'Dunas de los difuntos\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C} a tu reserva de maná.\\nCuando las Dunas de los difuntos vayan a un cementerio desde el campo de batalla, crea una ficha de criatura Zombie negra 2/2.\', \'type\': \'Tierra — Desierto\', \'flavor\': \'La maldición de los errantes ya impregnaba Amonkhet mucho antes de la llegada de Nicol Bolas. Él simplemente se aprovechó de ella.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431262&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a64fbb3-c525-4263-8f31-c4fb4c99c21c\', \'multiverseId\': 431262}, \'multiverseid\': 431262}, {\'name\': \'Dunes des morts\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C} à votre réserve.\\nQuand les Dunes des morts sont mises dans un cimetière depuis le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 noire Zombie.\', \'type\': \'Terrain : désert\', \'flavor\': "La Malédiction d\'errance existait sur Amonkhet bien avant l\'arrivée de Nicol Bolas. Il se contenta de l\'exploiter.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431461&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5cfea250-28a8-4395-8f6d-f4a70fb05c58\', \'multiverseId\': 431461}, \'multiverseid\': 431461}, {\'name\': \'Dune dei Defunti\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C} alla tua riserva di mana.\\nQuando le Dune dei Defunti vengono messe in un cimitero dal campo di battaglia, crea una pedina creatura Zombie 2/2 nera.\', \'type\': \'Terra — Deserto\', \'flavor\': "La Maledizione della Peregrinazione permeava Amonkhet molto prima dell\'arrivo di Nicol Bolas. Lui si limitò a sfruttarla.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431660&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32f84876-0b72-40c5-86e4-f9b5b299067f\', \'multiverseId\': 431660}, \'multiverseid\': 431660}, {\'name\': \'死者の砂丘\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{C}を加える。\\n死者の砂丘が戦場から墓地に置かれたとき、黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 砂漠\', \'flavor\': \'放浪の呪いは以前からアモンケットに広まっていた。ニコル・ボーラスは単にそれを利用したに過ぎない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431859&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'675aa67b-6275-430d-9ea1-2f894ce359fb\', \'multiverseId\': 431859}, \'multiverseid\': 431859}, {\'name\': \'망자의 사구\', \'text\': \'{T}: {C}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.\\n망자의 사구가 전장에서 무덤으로 들어갈 때, 2/2 흑색 좀비 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'대지 — 사막\', \'flavor\': \'방랑의 저주는 니콜 볼라스가 오기 훨씬 이전부터 아몬케트에 침투해 있었다. 그는 단지 이를 이용한 것뿐이었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432058&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22481415-f77e-4121-a545-110d46f25ecc\', \'multiverseId\': 432058}, \'multiverseid\': 432058}, {\'name\': \'Dunas dos Mortos\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C} à sua reserva de mana.\\nQuando Dunas dos Mortos for colocada no cemitério vinda do campo de batalha, crie uma ficha de criatura preta 2/2 do tipo Zumbi.\', \'type\': \'Terreno — Deserto\', \'flavor\': \'A Maldição da Errância permeava Amonkhet muito antes de Nicol Bolas. Ele simplesmente a aproveitou.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432257&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3d024ac-cfec-4a5e-9fb3-267651db3cb4\', \'multiverseId\': 432257}, \'multiverseid\': 432257}, {\'name\': \'Дюны Мертвецов\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C} в ваше хранилище маны.\\nКогда Дюны Мертвецов попадают с поля битвы на кладбище, создайте одну фишку существа 2/2 черный Зомби.\', \'type\': \'Земля — Пустыня\', \'flavor\': \'Проклятие Скитальцев существовало на Амонхете задолго до Никола Боласа. Он просто поставил его себе на службу.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432456&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbf67e58-e9f2-40f6-aaef-8f94e4e94fd6\', \'multiverseId\': 432456}, \'multiverseid\': 432456}, {\'name\': \'亡者沙丘\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}到你的法术力池中。\\n当亡者沙丘从战场进入坟墓场时，派出一个2/2黑色灵俑衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'地～沙漠\', \'flavor\': \'在尼可波拉斯来到阿芒凯之前，漂浪诅咒就已存在。他只不过是将之为己所用。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432655&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'731e9e31-30b3-46d1-b572-b148f6a6d20b\', \'multiverseId\': 432655}, \'multiverseid\': 432655}, {\'name\': \'亡者沙丘\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}到你的魔法力池中。\\n當亡者沙丘從戰場進入墳墓場時，派出一個2/2黑色殭屍衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'地～沙漠\', \'flavor\': \'在尼可波拉斯來到阿芒凱之前，漂浪詛咒就已存在。他只不過是將之為己所用。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432854&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45eb5bf7-5003-4e24-9b66-21d02d89ddd7\', \'multiverseId\': 432854}, \'multiverseid\': 432854}]', "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431073&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dc3d95af-f7b2-46de-8f4d-b72560cd86ca', 'multiverseId': 431073}, 'multiverseid': 431073}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431272&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '655e4c9b-4706-470b-9161-d8563186613c', 'multiverseId': 431272}, 'multiverseid': 431272}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431471&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3006d9be-2a69-4f6c-9ca9-6818a757bfe0', 'multiverseId': 431471}, 'multiverseid': 431471}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431670&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f3088fd3-cd56-40e0-a466-cf466f73d1b8', 'multiverseId': 431670}, 'multiverseid': 431670}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431869&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8d006310-dfd5-45fe-b4eb-a2e9525676bd', 'multiverseId': 431869}, 'multiverseid': 431869}, {'name': '들', 'type': '기본 대지 — 들', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432068&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'afb66f2f-a5bc-4ad4-b6a1-2a4c567ebeab', 'multiverseId': 432068}, 'multiverseid': 432068}, {'name': 'Planície', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Planície', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432267&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '75f8aea9-f878-4b1d-9c50-bea5e12d06f4', 'multiverseId': 432267}, 'multiverseid': 432267}, {'name': 'Равнина', 'type': 'Базовая Земля — Равнина', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432466&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd00ff2c6-211c-44d9-bc16-0f84e5f4765b', 'multiverseId': 432466}, 'multiverseid': 432466}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432665&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd0c4d06d-00e8-4cc7-8c3f-b4fe1bbdc538', 'multiverseId': 432665}, 'multiverseid': 432665}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432864&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b63777f2-2c68-43f1-97b1-e187362a248c', 'multiverseId': 432864}, 'multiverseid': 432864}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431078&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '835608b1-95de-408a-924c-4ea37f99e7e5', 'multiverseId': 431078}, 'multiverseid': 431078}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431277&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a7b38b8d-797e-42d0-8cc2-ae9c5df25770', 'multiverseId': 431277}, 'multiverseid': 431277}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431476&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ebc71112-a624-441e-88fa-6837ad1909ed', 'multiverseId': 431476}, 'multiverseid': 431476}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431675&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2dd049bc-ecf0-4392-a80d-5a44fe647074', 'multiverseId': 431675}, 'multiverseid': 431675}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431874&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '761d7cac-2c12-461a-ae29-35971d512893', 'multiverseId': 431874}, 'multiverseid': 431874}, {'name': '들', 'type': '기본 대지 — 들', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432073&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4bc36981-fbd8-4612-8fcc-8e212b5367d2', 'multiverseId': 432073}, 'multiverseid': 432073}, {'name': 'Planície', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Planície', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432272&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd96a83f1-82e2-4b1c-acfe-b03918b5e26a', 'multiverseId': 432272}, 'multiverseid': 432272}, {'name': 'Равнина', 'type': 'Базовая Земля — Равнина', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432471&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7fb70530-cf8e-489a-a3b5-f4ba49ef724f', 'multiverseId': 432471}, 'multiverseid': 432471}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432670&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ab8ac6fd-4233-4135-8b74-47dfe6df6479', 'multiverseId': 432670}, 'multiverseid': 432670}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432869&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '60653306-d496-4b0e-967e-bc4aa47e0b86', 'multiverseId': 432869}, 'multiverseid': 432869}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431079&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ca827d1b-ed5a-44a5-a7db-78bdca391b8c', 'multiverseId': 431079}, 'multiverseid': 431079}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431278&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '56a23fb0-755d-40e9-ae90-55e4f9fc07cd', 'multiverseId': 431278}, 'multiverseid': 431278}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431477&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5ae1b8ff-c88d-4889-b73a-9b3012ea5471', 'multiverseId': 431477}, 'multiverseid': 431477}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431676&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1c0e7d42-4783-4467-a36d-ef73dc034404', 'multiverseId': 431676}, 'multiverseid': 431676}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431875&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2ab473a6-a959-4a8d-ab32-e66fd80cd40b', 'multiverseId': 431875}, 'multiverseid': 431875}, {'name': '들', 'type': '기본 대지 — 들', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432074&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8ae18a98-8871-4729-9c0d-84a62ffc81bf', 'multiverseId': 432074}, 'multiverseid': 432074}, {'name': 'Planície', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Planície', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432273&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '70f8bcf2-1980-4e80-beea-471521e89101', 'multiverseId': 432273}, 'multiverseid': 432273}, {'name': 'Равнина', 'type': 'Базовая Земля — Равнина', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432472&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e313f8ef-fc65-4796-9225-6d52f517a695', 'multiverseId': 432472}, 'multiverseid': 432472}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432671&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '585dca70-8798-4694-b1f2-d89f4857cddc', 'multiverseId': 432671}, 'multiverseid': 432671}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432870&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8654d3c3-f1b3-40a9-93ec-30faa9d32fe8', 'multiverseId': 432870}, 'multiverseid': 432870}]", '[{\'name\': \'Eifrige Lebensspenderin\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {G} oder {U}. Falls du einen Nissa-Planeswalker kontrollierst, erhältst du 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Nissa hat mich gelehrt, dass es so etwas wie eine vollständige Vernichtung nicht gibt."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432890&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d46fed72-5da7-4e33-8037-6cafc305b5ef\', \'multiverseId\': 432890}, \'multiverseid\': 432890}, {\'name\': \'Recobradora ávida\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {G} o {U} a tu reserva de maná. Si controlas una planeswalker Nissa, ganas 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida humano\', \'flavor\': \'"No puede perderse todo. Esto lo aprendí de Nissa."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432900&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f299429-7575-400c-a847-efcfad0d8335\', \'multiverseId\': 432900}, \'multiverseid\': 432900}, {\'name\': \'Recouvreuse avide\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {U} à votre réserve. Si vous contrôlez un planeswalker Nissa, vous gagnez 2 points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et druide\', \'flavor\': "« Tout n\'est jamais perdu. C\'est ce que Nissa m\'a appris. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432910&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2998ea51-0870-4caa-b16a-e82f19d3f6d2\', \'multiverseId\': 432910}, \'multiverseid\': 432910}, {\'name\': \'Rivendicatrice Zelante\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {G} o {U} alla tua riserva di mana. Se controlli un planeswalker Nissa, guadagni 2 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Non può essere tutto perduto. Me l\\\'ha insegnato Nissa."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432920&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea15b729-2ae7-4c82-b1fa-7c7cfc5686e7\', \'multiverseId\': 432920}, \'multiverseid\': 432920}, {\'name\': \'熱心な回収者\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{G}か{U}を加える。あなたがニッサ・プレインズウォーカーをコントロールしているなら、あなたは２点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「何も失うわけにはいかない。ニッサがそれを教えてくれた。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432930&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4039eff1-437e-4969-ae3d-f2dfed02bbc4\', \'multiverseId\': 432930}, \'multiverseid\': 432930}, {\'name\': \'열렬한 탈환자\', \'text\': \'{T}: {G} 또는 {U}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다. 당신이 니사 플레인즈워커를 조종한다면, 당신은 생명 2점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 드루이드\', \'flavor\': \'"어느 것 하나 잃을 수 없다. 니사가 그걸 보여줬다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432940&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8ac2453-a9ac-42a6-9bca-0e671b27afdd\', \'multiverseId\': 432940}, \'multiverseid\': 432940}, {\'name\': \'Reivindicadora Ávida\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {G} ou {U} à sua reserva de mana. Se você controla uma planeswalker Nissa, você ganha 2 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Druida\', \'flavor\': \'"Não pode estar tudo perdido. Nissa me mostrou isso."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432950&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41b62445-48bd-4515-abdf-43dc643a0346\', \'multiverseId\': 432950}, \'multiverseid\': 432950}, {\'name\': \'Страстная Возродительница\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {G} или {U} в ваше хранилище маны. Если под вашим контролем есть planeswalker Нисса, вы получаете 2 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Друид\', \'flavor\': \'«Все до конца потерять невозможно. Нисса показала мне это».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432960&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0582db00-4577-4a2b-ae40-f2bca89a3734\', \'multiverseId\': 432960}, \'multiverseid\': 432960}, {\'name\': \'热切垦殖师\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{G}或{U}到你的法术力池中。如果你操控妮莎鹏洛客，则你获得2点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'「我们不会一无所有。妮莎向我证明了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432970&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a6af20f-28c1-45f4-b530-585d59871115\', \'multiverseId\': 432970}, \'multiverseid\': 432970}, {\'name\': \'熱切墾殖師\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{G}或{U}到你的魔法力池中。如果你操控妮莎鵬洛客，則你獲得2點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／德魯伊\', \'flavor\': \'「我們不會一無所有。妮莎向我證明了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432980&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acccaf43-d3b2-4668-a995-8068e482be32\', \'multiverseId\': 432980}, \'multiverseid\': 432980}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eingebildete Bedrohungen\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, die ein Gegner deiner Wahl kontrolliert, greifen in diesem Zug an, falls möglich. Kreaturen, die jener Spieler kontrolliert, enttappen nicht während seines nächsten Enttappsegments.\\nUmwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Nicht alles, was uns quält, ist real.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=430925&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b45722d-af82-482e-82ae-b02555913dde\', \'multiverseId\': 430925}, \'multiverseid\': 430925}, {\'name\': \'Amenazas imaginarias\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas que controla el oponente objetivo atacan este turno si pueden. Durante el próximo paso de enderezar de ese jugador, las criaturas que controla no se enderezan.\\nCiclo {2}. ({2}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Liliana siempre supo que las ilusiones de Jace serían de utilidad.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d89677b-ff55-4449-91e3-ddb8b672eca3\', \'multiverseId\': 431124}, \'multiverseid\': 431124}, {\'name\': \'Menaces imaginaires\', \'text\': "Les créatures qu\'un adversaire ciblé contrôle attaquent ce tour-ci si possible. Pendant la prochaine étape de dégagement de ce joueur, les créatures qu\'il contrôle ne se dégagent pas.\\nRecyclage {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'Liliana avait toujours su que les illusions de Jace seraient utiles.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431323&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7efc3d86-c928-4dd4-b4fa-85bb7d9a924c\', \'multiverseId\': 431323}, \'multiverseid\': 431323}, {\'name\': \'Minacce Immaginarie\', \'text\': \'Le creature controllate da un avversario bersaglio attaccano in questo turno, se possono farlo. Durante il prossimo STAP di quel giocatore, le creature che controlla non STAPpano.\\nCiclo {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Liliana aveva sempre saputo che le illusioni di Jace le sarebbero tornate utili.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431522&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7d2a036-5128-47e0-9d90-701e2da2e01d\', \'multiverseId\': 431522}, \'multiverseid\': 431522}, {\'name\': \'空想の脅威\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人を対象とする。このターン、そのプレイヤーがコントロールするクリーチャーは可能なら攻撃する。そのプレイヤーの次のアンタップ・ステップに、そのプレイヤーがコントロールするクリーチャーはアンタップしない。\\nサイクリング{2}（{2}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'リリアナには、ジェイスの幻影が役立つとわかっていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431721&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39665323-82de-4aa0-8268-73a183bcba90\', \'multiverseId\': 431721}, \'multiverseid\': 431721}, {\'name\': \'가상의 위협\', \'text\': \'상대를 목표로 정한다. 그 상대가 조종하는 생물들은 가능하면 이 턴에 공격해야 한다. 그 플레이어의 다음 언탭단에, 그 플레이어가 조종하는 생물들은 언탭되지 않는다.\\n순환 {2} ({2}, 이 카드를 버린다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'릴리아나는 제이스의 환영이 도움이 되리라는 것을 알고 있었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431920&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfa41ca8-5a74-4b78-8626-b8cbb636b565\', \'multiverseId\': 431920}, \'multiverseid\': 431920}, {\'name\': \'Ameaças Imaginárias\', \'text\': \'As criaturas que o oponente alvo controla atacam neste turno se estiverem aptas. Durante a próxima etapa de desvirar daquele jogador, as criaturas que ele controla não são desviradas.\\nReciclar {2} ({2}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Liliana sempre soube que as ilusões de Jace seriam úteis.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432119&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9d7a8fb-84f9-4f5b-acfc-2595cab4cfc2\', \'multiverseId\': 432119}, \'multiverseid\': 432119}, {\'name\': \'Воображаемые Угрозы\', \'text\': \'Существа под контролем целевого оппонента атакуют в этом ходу, если могут. Во время следующего шага разворота того игрока существа под его контролем не разворачиваются.\\nЦикл {2} ({2}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Лилиана всегда знала, что иллюзии Джейса обязательно пригодятся.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432318&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04bc3d60-0d97-4f72-8dc1-4695f043686f\', \'multiverseId\': 432318}, \'multiverseid\': 432318}, {\'name\': \'草木皆兵\', \'text\': \'由目标对手操控的生物本回合若能攻击，则必须攻击。由该牌手操控的生物于其下一个重置步骤中不能重置。\\n循环{2}（{2}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'莉莲娜一直都明白，杰斯的虚影早晚能派上用场。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432517&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d070fc1c-88fc-41ec-a154-802902ef2402\', \'multiverseId\': 432517}, \'multiverseid\': 432517}, {\'name\': \'草木皆兵\', \'text\': \'由目標對手操控的生物本回合若能攻擊，則必須攻擊。由該玩家操控的生物於其下一個重置步驟中不能重置。\\n循環{2}（{2}，棄掉此牌：抽一張牌。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'莉蓮娜一直都明白，傑斯的虛影早晚能派上用場。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432716&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40a319e1-1235-4379-a691-dd3854deef83\', \'multiverseId\': 432716}, \'multiverseid\': 432716}]', '[{\'name\': \'Einsames Kamel\', \'text\': \'Das Einsame Kamel hat Lebensverknüpfung, solange du eine Wüste kontrollierst oder sich eine Wüste-Karte in deinem Friedhof befindet. (Schaden, der von dieser Kreatur zugefügt wird, lässt dich ebenso viele Lebenspunkte dazuerhalten.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Kamel\', \'flavor\': \'Wüsten gelten als unbewohnbar, aber das weiß das Kamel zum Glück nicht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=430911&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d16dea3b-93f0-4e6f-a3e6-0f1f760c849a\', \'multiverseId\': 430911}, \'multiverseid\': 430911}, {\'name\': \'Dromedario solitario\', \'text\': \'El Dromedario solitario tiene la habilidad de vínculo vital mientras controles un Desierto o haya una carta de Desierto en tu cementerio. (El daño hecho por esta criatura también hace que ganes esa misma cantidad de vidas.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Camello\', \'flavor\': \'Los desiertos son inhóspitos, pero no inhabitables.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431110&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b695d3b-d413-4e08-b017-5518817379fa\', \'multiverseId\': 431110}, \'multiverseid\': 431110}, {\'name\': \'Dromadaire solitaire\', \'text\': "Le Dromadaire solitaire a le lien de vie tant que vous contrôlez un désert ou qu\'il y a une carte de désert dans votre cimetière. (Les blessures infligées par cette créature vous font aussi gagner autant de points de vie.)", \'type\': \'Créature : chameau\', \'flavor\': \'Le désert est inhospitalier, pas inhabitable.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431309&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b09a4ad-b6a4-43f0-ab97-3e7f8a854202\', \'multiverseId\': 431309}, \'multiverseid\': 431309}, {\'name\': \'Cammello Solitario\', \'text\': "Il Cammello Solitario ha legame vitale fintanto che controlli un Deserto o c\'è una carta Deserto nel tuo cimitero. (Il danno inflitto da questa creatura ti fa anche guadagnare altrettanti punti vita.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Cammello\', \'flavor\': \'I deserti sono inospitali, non inabitabili.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431508&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3bf85e86-1a35-481a-80da-b86c5a36ae45\', \'multiverseId\': 431508}, \'multiverseid\': 431508}, {\'name\': \'孤高のラクダ\', \'text\': \'あなたが砂漠をコントロールしているかあなたの墓地に砂漠・カードがあるかぎり、孤高のラクダは絆魂を持つ。（このクリーチャーがダメージを与えると、さらにあなたはその点数分のライフを得る。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ラクダ\', \'flavor\': \'砂漠は住みにくいが住めないわけではない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431707&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2dcbde9-5262-480a-9044-60b403e1ac6b\', \'multiverseId\': 431707}, \'multiverseid\': 431707}, {\'name\': \'고독한 낙타\', \'text\': \'당신이 사막을 조종하거나 당신의 무덤에 사막 카드가 있는 한, 고독한 낙타는 생명연결을 가진다. (이 생물이 피해를 입히면 당신은 그 피해만큼의 생명점을 얻는다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 낙타\', \'flavor\': \'사막은 매우 척박하지만, 그렇다고 아예 살 수 없는 곳은 아니다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431906&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32fe7109-9845-4b54-8598-087b22619b28\', \'multiverseId\': 431906}, \'multiverseid\': 431906}, {\'name\': \'Camelo Solitário\', \'text\': \'Camelo Solitário tem vínculo com a vida enquanto você controla um Deserto ou há um card de Deserto em seu cemitério. (O dano causado por esta criatura faz com que você ganhe uma quantidade equivalente de pontos de vida.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Camelo\', \'flavor\': \'Os desertos são inóspitos, não inabitáveis.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432105&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'410772b0-a228-4a8b-b435-34262f7cac48\', \'multiverseId\': 432105}, \'multiverseid\': 432105}, {\'name\': \'Одинокий Верблюд\', \'text\': \'Одинокий Верблюд имеет Цепь жизни, пока вы контролируете Пустыню или у вас на кладбище есть карта Пустыни. (Повреждения, наносимые этим существом, также заставляют вас получить такое же количество жизней.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Верблюд\', \'flavor\': \'Негостеприимность пустыни не значит необитаемость.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432304&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29e47aa0-c8b1-4799-a795-566020592ae4\', \'multiverseId\': 432304}, \'multiverseid\': 432304}, {\'name\': \'独行骆驼\', \'text\': \'只要你操控沙漠或你坟墓场中有沙漠牌，独行骆驼便具有系命异能。（此生物所造成的伤害会让你得到等量的生命。）\', \'type\': \'生物～骆驼\', \'flavor\': \'沙漠虽不宜居，但并非无法安身。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432503&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1d72336-4cb7-4ca6-93b0-0a9732c24a29\', \'multiverseId\': 432503}, \'multiverseid\': 432503}, {\'name\': \'獨行駱駝\', \'text\': \'只要你操控沙漠或你墳墓場中有沙漠牌，獨行駱駝便具有繫命異能。（此生物所造成的傷害會讓你得到等量的生命。）\', \'type\': \'生物～駱駝\', \'flavor\': \'沙漠雖不宜居，但並非無法安身。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432702&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60ceec1b-eccf-4792-9e0f-df7a0bcc2832\', \'multiverseId\': 432702}, \'multiverseid\': 432702}]', "[{'name': 'Endlose Sande', 'text': '{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, ins Exil.\\n{4}, {T}, opfere die Endlosen Sande: Bringe alle mit den Endlosen Sanden ins Exil geschickten Kreaturenkarten unter der Kontrolle ihrer Besitzer ins Spiel zurück.', 'type': 'Land — Wüste', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431064&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1efe9e88-12fa-4eef-a827-41e33924bd19', 'multiverseId': 431064}, 'multiverseid': 431064}, {'name': 'Arenas interminables', 'text': '{T}: Agrega {C} a tu reserva de maná.\\n{2}, {T}: Exilia la criatura objetivo que controlas.\\n{4}, {T}, sacrificar las Arenas interminables: Regresa cada carta de criatura exiliada con las Arenas interminables al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario.', 'type': 'Tierra — Desierto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431263&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1a845eaf-fd83-4917-b085-af998f7f51ff', 'multiverseId': 431263}, 'multiverseid': 431263}, {'name': 'Sables infinis', 'text': '{T} : Ajoutez {C} à votre réserve.\\n{2}, {T} : Exilez une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez.\\n{4}, {T}, sacrifiez les Sables infinis : renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, sous le contrôle de son propriétaire, chaque carte de créature exilée par les Sables infinis.', 'type': 'Terrain : désert', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431462&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f87cc30b-e67d-4782-b08e-a7cb90953c34', 'multiverseId': 431462}, 'multiverseid': 431462}, {'name': 'Sabbie Sconfinate', 'text': '{T}: Aggiungi {C} alla tua riserva di mana.\\n{2}, {T}: Esilia una creatura bersaglio che controlli.\\n{4}, {T}, Sacrifica le Sabbie Sconfinate: Rimetti sul campo di battaglia ogni carta creatura esiliata con le Sabbie Sconfinate sotto il controllo del suo proprietario.', 'type': 'Terra — Deserto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431661&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6d098bda-2d8b-47d2-8a91-0fcf1e6651ea', 'multiverseId': 431661}, 'multiverseid': 431661}, {'name': '終わりなき砂漠', 'text': '{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{C}を加える。\\n{2}, {T}：あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを追放する。\\n{4}, {T}, 終わりなき砂漠を生け贄に捧げる：終わりなき砂漠により追放した各クリーチャー・カードをそれぞれオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。', 'type': '土地 — 砂漠', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431860&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '12dc768c-fa4f-417a-8a71-945b9c93ad8f', 'multiverseId': 431860}, 'multiverseid': 431860}, {'name': '끝없는 모래', 'text': '{T}: {C}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.\\n{2}, {T}: 당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 추방한다.\\n{4}, {T}, 끝없는 모래를 희생한다: 끝없는 모래로 추방한 각 생물 카드를 소유자의 조종하에 전장으로 되돌린다.', 'type': '대지 — 사막', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432059&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7f8a4e06-e010-4a37-aa6e-d79addd00288', 'multiverseId': 432059}, 'multiverseid': 432059}, {'name': 'Areias Infinitas', 'text': '{T}: Adicione {C} à sua reserva de mana.\\n{2}, {T}: Exile a criatura alvo que você controla.\\n{4}, {T}, sacrifique Areias Infinitas: Devolva cada card de criatura exilado com Areias Infinitas ao campo de batalha sob o controle de seu dono.', 'type': 'Terreno — Deserto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432258&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '98e8d6af-b1bf-4f8b-8363-ce88b8647410', 'multiverseId': 432258}, 'multiverseid': 432258}, {'name': 'Бескрайние Пески', 'text': '{T}: добавьте {C} в ваше хранилище маны.\\n{2}, {T}: изгоните целевое существо под вашим контролем.\\n{4}, {T}, пожертвуйте Бескрайние Пески: верните каждую карту существа, изгнанную Бескрайними Песками, на поле битвы под контролем ее владельца.', 'type': 'Земля — Пустыня', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432457&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'de6113ce-758d-4d79-909e-16d82715f977', 'multiverseId': 432457}, 'multiverseid': 432457}, {'name': '无际沙漠', 'text': '{T}：加{C}到你的法术力池中。\\n{2}，{T}：放逐目标由你操控的生物。\\n{4}，{T}，牺牲无际沙漠：将所有以无际沙漠放逐的生物牌在其拥有者的操控下移回战场。', 'type': '地～沙漠', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432656&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ba211974-5c0c-49d8-9e83-7b026d291a75', 'multiverseId': 432656}, 'multiverseid': 432656}, {'name': '無際沙漠', 'text': '{T}：加{C}到你的魔法力池中。\\n{2}，{T}：放逐目標由你操控的生物。\\n{4}，{T}，犧牲無際沙漠：將所有以無際沙漠放逐的生物牌在其擁有者的操控下移回戰場。', 'type': '地～沙漠', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432855&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd9ac9944-6e98-4c4f-9b17-04662bc90cde', 'multiverseId': 432855}, 'multiverseid': 432855}]", '[{\'name\': \'Engel der Verdammnis\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Wachsamkeit\\n{2}{W}, {T}: Schicke eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl ins Exil. Bringe ihre Karte zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück.\\n{2}{W}, {T}, erschöpfe den Engel der Verdammnis: Schicke eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl ins Exil, bis der Engel der Verdammnis das Spiel verlässt. (Eine erschöpfte Kreatur enttappt nicht während deines nächsten Enttappsegments.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=430891&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cae4f242-14f8-4146-b57e-d06a383f4a9b\', \'multiverseId\': 430891}, \'multiverseid\': 430891}, {\'name\': \'Ángel de la condenación\', \'text\': \'Vuela, vigilancia.\\n{2}{W}, {T}: Exilia otra criatura objetivo. Regresa esa carta al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario al comienzo del próximo paso final.\\n{2}{W}, {T}, espolear al Ángel de la condenación: Exilia otra criatura objetivo hasta que el Ángel de la condenación deje el campo de batalla. (Una criatura espoleada no se enderezará durante tu próximo paso de enderezar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ángel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36d09ffa-d6ea-420b-ad07-6fd8f9b742f5\', \'multiverseId\': 431090}, \'multiverseid\': 431090}, {\'name\': \'Ange de la réprobation\', \'text\': "Vol, vigilance\\n{2}{W}, {T} : Exilez une autre créature ciblée. Renvoyez cette carte sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire au début de la prochaine étape de fin.\\n{2}{W}, {T}, surmenez l\'Ange de la réprobation : Exilez une autre créature ciblée jusqu\'à ce que l\'Ange de la réprobation quitte le champ de bataille. (Une créature surmenée ne se dégage pas pendant votre prochaine étape de dégagement.)", \'type\': \'Créature : ange\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431289&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'457b0db9-057c-4a99-b652-6c39c7a875c7\', \'multiverseId\': 431289}, \'multiverseid\': 431289}, {\'name\': \'Angelo della Condanna\', \'text\': "Volare, cautela\\n{2}{W}, {T}: Esilia un\'altra creatura bersaglio. Rimetti sul campo di battaglia quella carta sotto il controllo del suo proprietario all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.\\n{2}{W}, {T}, Strema l\'Angelo della Condanna: Esilia un\'altra creatura bersaglio finché l\'Angelo della Condanna non lascia il campo di battaglia. (Una creatura stremata non STAPpa durante il tuo prossimo STAP.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Angelo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431488&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99cff0e7-4b9b-4afa-a110-a14e3b8c0310\', \'multiverseId\': 431488}, \'multiverseid\': 431488}, {\'name\': \'糾弾の天使\', \'text\': \'飛行、警戒\\n{2}{W}, {T}：他のクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを追放する。次の終了ステップの開始時に、そのカードをオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。\\n{2}{W}, {T}, 糾弾の天使を督励する：他のクリーチャー１体を対象とし、糾弾の天使が戦場を離れるまでそれを追放する。（督励されたクリーチャーは、あなたの次のアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431687&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bf4cdaf-e525-4f65-833c-bd39c06a732e\', \'multiverseId\': 431687}, \'multiverseid\': 431687}, {\'name\': \'규탄의 천사\', \'text\': \'비행, 경계\\n{2}{W}, {T}: 다른 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 추방한다. 다음 종료단 시작에 그 카드를 소유자의 조종하에 전장으로 되돌린다.\\n{2}{W}, {T}, 규탄의 천사를 분전시킨다: 다른 생물을 목표로 정한다. 규탄의 천사가 전장을 떠날 때까지 그 생물을 추방한다. (분전한 생물은 당신의 다음 언탭단에 언탭되지 않는다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 천사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431886&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67bb9ab9-5113-4c13-8079-6808fcce9681\', \'multiverseId\': 431886}, \'multiverseid\': 431886}, {\'name\': \'Anjo da Condenação\', \'text\': \'Voar, vigilância\\n{2}{W}, {T}: Exile outra criatura alvo. Devolva aquele card ao campo de batalha sob o controle de seu dono no início da próxima etapa final.\\n{2}{W}, {T}, exaura Anjo da Condenação: Exile outra criatura alvo até que Anjo da Condenação deixe o campo de batalha. (Uma criatura exaurida não será desvirada durante sua próxima etapa de desvirar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anjo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432085&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4c3c876-189d-4c29-8cb8-45ae70533279\', \'multiverseId\': 432085}, \'multiverseid\': 432085}, {\'name\': \'Ангел Осуждения\', \'text\': \'Полет, Бдительность\\n{2}{W}, {T}: изгоните другое целевое существо. Верните ту карту на поле битвы под контролем ее владельца в начале следующего заключительного шага.\\n{2}{W}, {T}, подстегните Ангела Осуждения: изгоните другое целевое существо до тех пор, пока Ангел Осуждения не покинет поле битвы. (Подстегнутое существо не разворачивается во время вашего следующего шага разворота.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ангел\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432284&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13eee48e-4291-4bf2-920e-cbcb428dd52b\', \'multiverseId\': 432284}, \'multiverseid\': 432284}, {\'name\': \'判罪天使\', \'text\': \'飞行，警戒\\n{2}{W}，{T}：放逐另一个目标生物。在下一个结束步骤开始时，将所放逐的牌在其拥有者的操控下移回战场。\\n{2}{W}，{T}，耗竭判罪天使：放逐另一个目标生物，直到判罪天使离开战场为止。（已耗竭的生物于你的下一个重置步骤中不能重置。）\', \'type\': \'生物～天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432483&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eaa68f7d-70e6-4839-8ba2-b842599381c1\', \'multiverseId\': 432483}, \'multiverseid\': 432483}, {\'name\': \'判罪天使\', \'text\': \'飛行，警戒\\n{2}{W}，{T}：放逐另一個目標生物。在下一個結束步驟開始時，將所放逐的牌在其擁有者的操控下移回戰場。\\n{2}{W}，{T}，耗竭判罪天使：放逐另一個目標生物，直到判罪天使離開戰場為止。（已耗竭的生物於你的下一個重置步驟中不能重置。）\', \'type\': \'生物～天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432682&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24e38e32-3663-4d95-ba8e-92510596f535\', \'multiverseId\': 432682}, \'multiverseid\': 432682}]', "[{'name': 'Engel des Gott-Pharaos', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nUmwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Kreatur — Engel', 'flavor': 'Die Engel hatten nie behauptet, sie würden jemand anderem als dem Gott-Pharao dienen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=430892&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'be90f52c-1974-4e46-81ce-31fbb6472c79', 'multiverseId': 430892}, 'multiverseid': 430892}, {'name': 'Ángel del Dios Faraón', 'text': 'Vuela.\\nCiclo {2}. ({2}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Ángel', 'flavor': 'Los ángeles fueron honestos. Desde el principio, dejaron claro que su lealtad era solamente para el Dios Faraón.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431091&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fb30e6f7-524a-436a-9d41-0ed8d58a11de', 'multiverseId': 431091}, 'multiverseid': 431091}, {'name': 'Ange du Dieu-Pharaon', 'text': 'Vol\\nRecyclage {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)', 'type': 'Créature : ange', 'flavor': 'Les anges ne trompèrent personne. Dès le départ, ils affirmèrent accorder leur allégeance au seul Dieu-Pharaon.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431290&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd5d5ef4c-36f5-4a63-8fcc-a8f3463e765c', 'multiverseId': 431290}, 'multiverseid': 431290}, {'name': 'Angelo del Dio Faraone', 'text': 'Volare\\nCiclo {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)', 'type': 'Creatura — Angelo', 'flavor': 'Gli angeli non mentirono. Fin dal principio mostrarono chiaramente di essere fedeli al Dio Faraone e a nessun altro.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431489&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd4a494ef-0066-481e-8c69-6338fad5e017', 'multiverseId': 431489}, 'multiverseid': 431489}, {'name': '王神の天使', 'text': '飛行\\nサイクリング{2}（{2}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 天使', 'flavor': '天使たちは欺瞞したわけではない。王神のみに忠誠を捧げていることは、最初から公然たる事実であった。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431688&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '404b5920-ff59-47fe-a741-30ac079b1aa9', 'multiverseId': 431688}, 'multiverseid': 431688}, {'name': '신 파라오의 천사', 'text': '비행\\n순환 {2} ({2}, 이 카드를 버린다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.)', 'type': '생물 — 천사', 'flavor': '천사들은 기만하지 않았다. 그들은 처음부터 명백하게 오직 신 파라오에게만 충성을 맹세했다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431887&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '23fbddf5-80c2-443d-ad34-d21303452007', 'multiverseId': 431887}, 'multiverseid': 431887}, {'name': 'Anjo do Faraó-Deus', 'text': 'Voar\\nReciclar {2} ({2}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Anjo', 'flavor': 'Os anjos não mentiram. Desde o início deixaram claro que eram fiéis única e exclusivamente ao Faraó-Deus.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432086&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1cec1c45-6397-4745-839b-a0584d056fde', 'multiverseId': 432086}, 'multiverseid': 432086}, {'name': 'Ангел Бога-Фараона', 'text': 'Полет\\nЦикл {2} ({2}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)', 'type': 'Существо — Ангел', 'flavor': 'Ангелы не обманули. С самого начала они ясно дали понять, что верны лишь Богу-Фараону — и никому другому.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432285&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cc32dcac-a858-4055-b74c-1886c32e1c29', 'multiverseId': 432285}, 'multiverseid': 432285}, {'name': '法老神天使', 'text': '飞行\\n循环{2}（{2}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）', 'type': '生物～天使', 'flavor': '天使并未欺骗众生。他们自始至终都只效忠法老神。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432484&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a8e23e67-a145-4ebb-bce6-6c80b3ce75e1', 'multiverseId': 432484}, 'multiverseid': 432484}, {'name': '法老神天使', 'text': '飛行\\n循環{2}（{2}，棄掉此牌：抽一張牌。）', 'type': '生物～天使', 'flavor': '天使並未欺騙眾生。他們自始至終都只效忠法老神。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432683&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'de3b4e17-5f91-4f4d-86fb-4e25f59bbe4e', 'multiverseId': 432683}, 'multiverseid': 432683}]", '[{\'name\': \'Entfesselte Mumie\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}: Ein angreifender Zombie deiner Wahl erhält Lebensverknüpfung bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n{1}{B}: Ein angreifender Zombie deiner Wahl erhält Todesberührung bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir haben die Kontrolle verloren." —Elekh, Wesirin der Einbalsamierung\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431035&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b3d31c9-7851-434f-9c5d-e3bfc113bc13\', \'multiverseId\': 431035}, \'multiverseid\': 431035}, {\'name\': \'Momia desvendada\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}: El Zombie atacante objetivo gana la habilidad de vínculo vital hasta el final del turno.\\n{1}{B}: El Zombie atacante objetivo gana la habilidad de toque mortal hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"Ya no tenemos el control". —Elekh, visir del embalsamamiento\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431234&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8879a58-67ea-4791-940d-c050ea24dec2\', \'multiverseId\': 431234}, \'multiverseid\': 431234}, {\'name\': \'Momie détissée\', \'text\': "{1}{W} : Le zombie attaquant ciblé acquiert le lien de vie jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n{1}{B} : Le zombie attaquant ciblé acquiert le contact mortel jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : zombie\', \'flavor\': "« Nous ne les contrôlons plus. » —Elekh, vizir de l\'embaumement", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431433&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62aa479f-355c-4e73-a680-127245fb0535\', \'multiverseId\': 431433}, \'multiverseid\': 431433}, {\'name\': \'Mummia Sbendata\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}: Uno Zombie attaccante bersaglio ha legame vitale fino alla fine del turno.\\n{1}{B}: Uno Zombie attaccante bersaglio ha tocco letale fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"Non ne abbiamo più il controllo." —Elekh, visir dell\\\'imbalsamazione\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431632&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c895bf4-0692-48c0-be90-b2fbc3b540fd\', \'multiverseId\': 431632}, \'multiverseid\': 431632}, {\'name\': \'ほころびミイラ\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}：攻撃しているゾンビ１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは絆魂を得る。\\n{1}{B}：攻撃しているゾンビ１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは接死を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ\', \'flavor\': \'「もう制御できない。」 ――不朽の侍臣、エレク\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431831&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7153b846-413d-45e9-a27e-c3751c2d8ece\', \'multiverseId\': 431831}, \'multiverseid\': 431831}, {\'name\': \'풀어지는 미라\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}: 공격하는 좀비를 목표로 정한다. 그 좀비는 턴종료까지 생명연결을 얻는다.\\n{1}{B}: 공격하는 좀비를 목표로 정한다. 그 좀비는 턴종료까지 치명타를 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 좀비\', \'flavor\': \'"더는 통제할 수 없어." —방부처리 고관 엘레크\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccb7055d-a535-4336-93a1-7e04971b2cdb\', \'multiverseId\': 432030}, \'multiverseid\': 432030}, {\'name\': \'Múmia Desenrolada\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}: O Zumbi atacante alvo ganha vínculo com a vida até o final do turno.\\n{1}{B}: O Zumbi atacante alvo ganha toque mortífero até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi\', \'flavor\': \'"Não estamos mais no controle." — Elekh, vizir do embalsamamento\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432229&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acddbdc7-e4dd-4180-bd98-ab8936b90a4d\', \'multiverseId\': 432229}, \'multiverseid\': 432229}, {\'name\': \'Выпутавшаяся Мумия\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}: целевой атакующий Зомби получает Цепь жизни до конца хода.\\n{1}{B}: целевой атакующий Зомби получает Смертельное касание до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зомби\', \'flavor\': \'«Мы больше их не контролируем». — Элех, визирь бальзамирования\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432428&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7f5dfff-073f-4c7a-8dbe-5ef2ba432f64\', \'multiverseId\': 432428}, \'multiverseid\': 432428}, {\'name\': \'无拘木乃伊\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}：目标进行攻击的灵俑获得系命异能直到回合结束。\\n{1}{B}：目标进行攻击的灵俑获得死触异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～灵俑\', \'flavor\': \'「他们已经不听我们使唤。」 ～遗存维齐尔爱蕾柯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fd42f5c-a718-4503-9dcc-f4bcdfd6f2e2\', \'multiverseId\': 432627}, \'multiverseid\': 432627}, {\'name\': \'無拘木乃伊\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}：目標進行攻擊的殭屍獲得繫命異能直到回合結束。\\n{1}{B}：目標進行攻擊的殭屍獲得死觸異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～殭屍\', \'flavor\': \'「他們已經不聽我們使喚。」 ～遺存維齊爾愛蕾柯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432826&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e078df0-c0d3-4e0d-9697-d54e3cb523f3\', \'multiverseId\': 432826}, \'multiverseid\': 432826}]', '[{\'name\': \'Entschlossene Überlebende\', \'text\': \'Du kannst die Entschlossenen Überlebenden erschöpfen, sowie sie angreifen. (Sie enttappen nicht während deines nächsten Enttappsegments.)\\nImmer wenn du eine Kreatur erschöpfst, fügen die Entschlossenen Überlebenden jedem Gegner 1 Schadenspunkt zu und du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir gehören nicht mehr zur Saat. Erntet woanders."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431030&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec375d1d-f431-4d7c-a0ed-54efdee863fe\', \'multiverseId\': 431030}, \'multiverseid\': 431030}, {\'name\': \'Supervivientes resueltos\', \'text\': \'Puedes espolear a los Supervivientes resueltos en cuanto ataquen. (No se enderezarán durante tu próximo paso de enderezar.)\\nSiempre que espolees una criatura, los Supervivientes resueltos hacen 1 punto de daño a cada oponente y tú ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Ya no somos simientes. Ve a cosechar a otra parte".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431229&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36342ada-77bf-48e4-8427-c05b5279c246\', \'multiverseId\': 431229}, \'multiverseid\': 431229}, {\'name\': \'Survivants déterminés\', \'text\': \'Vous pouvez surmener les Survivants déterminés au moment où ils attaquent. (Ils ne se dégagent pas pendant votre prochaine étape de dégagement.)\\nÀ chaque fois que vous surmenez une créature, les Survivants déterminés infligent 1 blessure à chaque adversaire et vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'« Nous ne sommes plus des moissons. Allez faire vos récoltes ailleurs. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431428&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfa1750b-eaa6-40b7-9f56-a291cfd9a40c\', \'multiverseId\': 431428}, \'multiverseid\': 431428}, {\'name\': \'Superstiti Risoluti\', \'text\': \'Puoi stremare i Superstiti Risoluti mentre attaccano. (Non STAPperanno durante il tuo prossimo STAP.)\\nOgniqualvolta stremi una creatura, i Superstiti Risoluti infliggono 1 danno a ogni avversario e tu guadagni 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Non siamo più le messi di nessuno. Andate a falciare altrove."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68494f9b-a2a6-4aa1-badf-9dc8cf5e279a\', \'multiverseId\': 431627}, \'multiverseid\': 431627}, {\'name\': \'毅然たる生き残り\', \'text\': \'毅然たる生き残りが攻撃するに際し、あなたはこれを督励してもよい。（これはあなたの次のアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。）\\nあなたがクリーチャーを１体督励するたび、毅然たる生き残りは各対戦相手にそれぞれ１点のダメージを与え、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「私たちはもう一門ではないわ。他所へ行きなさい。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431826&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7688fb81-cd3c-412f-84a8-95ef84ae88fd\', \'multiverseId\': 431826}, \'multiverseid\': 431826}, {\'name\': \'단호한 생존자들\', \'text\': \'당신은 단호한 생존자들로 공격을 선언하면서 단호한 생존자들을 분전시킬 수 있다. (이 생물은 당신의 다음 언탭단에 언탭되지 않는다.)\\n당신이 생물을 분전시킬 때마다, 단호한 생존자들은 각 상대에게 피해 1점을 입히고 당신은 생명 1점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 전사\', \'flavor\': \'"우린 더 이상 입문자가 아니야. 다른 곳을 알아보시지."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432025&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8129d1a5-78a9-46b7-bfcc-0459e18a0392\', \'multiverseId\': 432025}, \'multiverseid\': 432025}, {\'name\': \'Sobreviventes Resolutos\', \'text\': \'Você pode exaurir Sobreviventes Resolutos conforme ele ataca. (Ele não será desvirado durante sua próxima etapa de desvirar.)\\nToda vez que você exaure uma criatura, Sobreviventes Resolutos causa 1 ponto de dano a cada oponente e você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Não somos mais safras. Vá colher em outro lugar."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432224&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0af7dcac-1359-4ac7-a040-f59fa3a1a089\', \'multiverseId\': 432224}, \'multiverseid\': 432224}, {\'name\': \'Решительные Уцелевшие\', \'text\': \'Вы можете подстегнуть Решительных Уцелевших в момент их атаки. (Они не развернутся во время вашего следующего шага разворота.)\\nКаждый раз, когда вы подстегиваете существо, Решительные Уцелевшие наносят 1 повреждение каждому оппоненту, а вы получаете 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Воин\', \'flavor\': \'«Мы больше не снопы. Ступай жать в другое место».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432423&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41d7b626-16be-4de4-b1f8-ed7cc7fa23c8\', \'multiverseId\': 432423}, \'multiverseid\': 432423}, {\'name\': \'坚毅遗民\', \'text\': \'你可以于坚毅遗民攻击时耗竭之。（它于其操控者的下一个重置步骤中不能重置。）\\n每当你耗竭一个生物时，坚毅遗民向每位对手各造成1点伤害且你获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「我们不再甘当祀品。去别处吧。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432622&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7056f02e-3840-4708-bca0-046ae671ccc2\', \'multiverseId\': 432622}, \'multiverseid\': 432622}, {\'name\': \'堅毅遺民\', \'text\': \'你可以於堅毅遺民攻擊時耗竭之。（它於其操控者的下一個重置步驟中不能重置。）\\n每當你耗竭一個生物時，堅毅遺民向每位對手各造成1點傷害且你獲得1點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'「我們不再甘當祀品。去別處吧。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432821&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8af73c58-6d3e-459e-8aaa-3c890859bd96\', \'multiverseId\': 432821}, \'multiverseid\': 432821}]', '[{\'name\': \'Entsorgungsmumie\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Entsorgungsmumie ins Spiel kommt, schicke eine Karte deiner Wahl aus dem Friedhof eines Gegners ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie, Schakal\', \'flavor\': \'Ohne die leitende Hand der Wesire begannen einige der Gesalbten, ihre Anweisungen etwas zu wörtlich zu nehmen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=430897&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f9fe43e-c7e8-4f1d-bdec-520b63694ca8\', \'multiverseId\': 430897}, \'multiverseid\': 430897}, {\'name\': \'Momia desechadora\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Momia desechadora entre al campo de batalla, exilia la carta objetivo del cementerio de un oponente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chacal zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Sin visires que supervisaran sus actos, algunos ungidos llegaron hasta el extremo para cumplir sus directrices.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431096&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc473f16-eb6c-4352-8f6c-e0280c0346ce\', \'multiverseId\': 431096}, \'multiverseid\': 431096}, {\'name\': \'Momie du rebut\', \'text\': "Quand la Momie du rebut arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez une carte ciblée depuis le cimetière d\'un adversaire.", \'type\': \'Créature : zombie et chacal\', \'flavor\': \'Sans la supervision des vizirs, certains consacrés prirent des mesures extrêmes pour accomplir leur devoir.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431295&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'236ab3b8-0222-4a6b-86fe-054129f97ba9\', \'multiverseId\': 431295}, \'multiverseid\': 431295}, {\'name\': \'Mummia Ripulitrice\', \'text\': \'Quando la Mummia Ripulitrice entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia una carta bersaglio dal cimitero di un avversario.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciacallo Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Senza i visir a sorvegliarne le azioni, alcuni consacrati si spinsero a misure estreme pur di rispettare gli ordini ricevuti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431494&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96d1d6b8-1540-4555-bb6d-8c25bc8f8931\', \'multiverseId\': 431494}, \'multiverseid\': 431494}, {\'name\': \'廃却するミイラ\', \'text\': \'廃却するミイラが戦場に出たとき、対戦相手の墓地からカード１枚を対象とし、それを追放する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・ジャッカル\', \'flavor\': \'選定された者の中には、行動を監視する侍臣なしには、指示の実行に極めて長い時間がかかる者もいる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431693&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08605cb5-16be-4201-b56d-9e40b770c271\', \'multiverseId\': 431693}, \'multiverseid\': 431693}, {\'name\': \'폐기처분 미라\', \'text\': \'폐기처분 미라가 전장에 들어올 때, 상대의 무덤에 있는 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 좀비 자칼\', \'flavor\': \'감독할 고관이 없으면 일부 세례받은 자들은 지시를 이행하기 위해 극단적인 행동도 마다치 않는다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431892&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbc03ca9-6c24-4c62-95c1-af241bec53a8\', \'multiverseId\': 431892}, \'multiverseid\': 431892}, {\'name\': \'Múmia Descartável\', \'text\': \'Quando Múmia Descartável entrar no campo de batalha, exile o card alvo do cemitério de um oponente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi Chacal\', \'flavor\': \'Sem os vizires para supervisionar suas ações, alguns ungidos tomaram medidas extremas para cumprir suas ordens.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432091&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'905e749e-d6f7-4811-a09c-9feae54da28c\', \'multiverseId\': 432091}, \'multiverseid\': 432091}, {\'name\': \'Сжигающая Мусор Мумия\', \'text\': \'Когда Сжигающая Мусор Мумия выходит на поле битвы, изгоните целевую карту из кладбища оппонента.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зомби Шакал\', \'flavor\': \'Оставшись без присматривавших за ними визирей, некоторые умащенные продолжали исполнять свои обязанности с невероятным усердием.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432290&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8909c400-0e40-4703-9515-a3b89fe4c43a\', \'multiverseId\': 432290}, \'multiverseid\': 432290}, {\'name\': \'弃伴木乃伊\', \'text\': \'当弃伴木乃伊进战场时，将目标牌从对手的坟墓场放逐。\', \'type\': \'生物～灵俑／豺狼\', \'flavor\': \'如果没有维齐尔盯着，有些圣洗者在执行指令时会走上极端。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432489&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae4a7448-8cb2-4688-a3ab-1b488d0fb149\', \'multiverseId\': 432489}, \'multiverseid\': 432489}, {\'name\': \'棄伴木乃伊\', \'text\': \'當棄伴木乃伊進戰場時，將目標牌從對手的墳墓場放逐。\', \'type\': \'生物～殭屍／豺狼\', \'flavor\': \'如果沒有維齊爾盯著，有些聖洗者在執行指令時會走上極端。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432688&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ee8ea8a-0ce7-4089-93a2-e91483fc6278\', \'multiverseId\': 432688}, \'multiverseid\': 432688}]', '[{\'name\': \'Entzündete Wut\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +1/+0 und Erstschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Sie bluten nicht und sie werden nicht müde. Sie haben die Schwächen der Sterblichkeit hinter sich gelassen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=430989&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bed00fc-2e12-4c9c-9d66-2d7b6747e603\', \'multiverseId\': 430989}, \'multiverseid\': 430989}, {\'name\': \'Furia encendida\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +1/+0 y gana la habilidad de dañar primero hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'El minotauro contempló al eterno que se le echaba encima; era la encarnación de la destreza letal que aspiró a poseer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431188&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91dea03f-48fe-42ce-8e65-7deb0c8f94ed\', \'multiverseId\': 431188}, \'multiverseid\': 431188}, {\'name\': \'Fureur embrasée\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée gagne +1/+0 et acquiert l\'initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Le minotaure regarda l\'Éternel qui fonçait sur lui, personnification des compétences mortelles qu\'il avait espéré devenir.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431387&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d00ae437-29da-44b8-8a69-2b5dbb804a46\', \'multiverseId\': 431387}, \'multiverseid\': 431387}, {\'name\': \'Furia Infuocata\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende +1/+0 e ha attacco improvviso fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Il minotauro fissò l\'Eterno che si lanciava su di lui, personificazione della letale abilità a cui aveva sempre aspirato.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431586&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5384636-8e88-4342-aa8b-cb68dc4693e9\', \'multiverseId\': 431586}, \'multiverseid\': 431586}, {\'name\': \'火をつける怒り\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋１/＋０の修整を受けるとともに先制攻撃を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'そのミノタウルスは、自分に向かって突進してくる永遠衆を凝視していた。その相手は彼が目標にしていた必殺術を体現していたのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431785&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2a7eb36-e4e8-4ae2-b007-fa08783052cb\', \'multiverseId\': 431785}, \'multiverseid\': 431785}, {\'name\': \'점화된 분노\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +1/+0을 받고 선제공격을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'미노타우로스는 자신에게 달려드는 영생자를 쳐다보았다. 그는 자신이 되고자 열망했던 궁극의 존재였다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431984&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'feb3220f-e715-43c2-98a3-44deb22db264\', \'multiverseId\': 431984}, \'multiverseid\': 431984}, {\'name\': \'Fúria Inflamada\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe +1/+0 e ganha iniciativa até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'O minotauro observou o Eterno que caía sobre ele, a personificação da perícia mortífera à qual ele aspirava.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432183&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e1b7144-3c94-491f-9c29-3e685947925b\', \'multiverseId\': 432183}, \'multiverseid\': 432183}, {\'name\': \'Вспыхнувшая Ярость\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо получает +1/+0 и Первый удар до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Минотавр глядел на надвигающегося на него вековечного — воплощение смертоносного мастерства, каким он стремился стать сам.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432382&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9af43ab4-4671-484f-b376-53adb4f10f3c\', \'multiverseId\': 432382}, \'multiverseid\': 432382}, {\'name\': \'点燃怒火\', \'text\': \'直到回合结束，目标生物得+1/+0且获得先攻异能。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'牛头怪怒目瞪视迎面而来的永生者～他梦寐以求之夺命技艺的真实具现。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432581&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f7a79f7-96ce-4363-8426-ce5d32dd82cb\', \'multiverseId\': 432581}, \'multiverseid\': 432581}, {\'name\': \'點燃怒火\', \'text\': \'直到回合結束，目標生物得+1/+0且獲得先攻異能。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'牛頭怪怒目瞪視迎面而來的永生者～他夢寐以求之奪命技藝的真實具現。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432780&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48df2557-a04d-48ca-948f-bc9b85147a80\', \'multiverseId\': 432780}, \'multiverseid\': 432780}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erdstoß-Khenra\', \'text\': \'Eile\\nWenn der Erdstoß-Khenra ins Spiel kommt, kann eine Kreatur deiner Wahl mit Stärke kleiner oder gleich der Stärke des Erdstoß-Khenras in diesem Zug nicht blocken.\\nVerewigen {4}{R}{R} ({4}{R}{R}, schicke diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil: Erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie von ihr ist, außer dass er ein 4/4 schwarzer Zombie-Schakal-Krieger ohne Manakosten ist. Spiele Verewigen wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Schakal, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=430978&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ebb5c85-f550-4497-80c5-b771b0f64791\', \'multiverseId\': 430978}, \'multiverseid\': 430978}, {\'name\': \'Khenra tiemblatierra\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\nCuando la Khenra tiemblatierra entre al campo de batalla, la criatura objetivo con fuerza menor o igual a la de la Khenra tiemblatierra no puede bloquear este turno.\\nEternizar {4}{R}{R}. ({4}{R}{R}, exiliar esta carta de tu cementerio: Crea una ficha que es una copia de esta carta, excepto que es un Guerrero Chacal Zombie negro 4/4 sin coste de maná. Activa la habilidad de eternizar solo como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero chacal\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431177&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1be8be5-3566-4f1e-80df-fc544961650c\', \'multiverseId\': 431177}, \'multiverseid\': 431177}, {\'name\': \'Khenra trembleterre\', \'text\': "Célérité\\nQuand la Khenra trembleterre arrive sur le champ de bataille, une créature ciblée avec une force inférieure ou égale à la force de la Khenra trembleterre ne peut pas bloquer ce tour-ci.\\nÉternalisation {4}{R}{R} ({4}{R}{R}, exilez cette carte de votre cimetière : Créez un jeton qui en est une copie, excepté que c\'est un zombie et chacal et guerrier 4/4 noir sans coût de mana. N\'utilisez l\'éternalisation que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Créature : chacal et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431376&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24e0a2b0-adb3-439b-a752-3cbbdcd2e63e\', \'multiverseId\': 431376}, \'multiverseid\': 431376}, {\'name\': \'Khenra Scuotiterra\', \'text\': \'Rapidità\\nQuando la Khenra Scuotiterra entra nel campo di battaglia, una creatura bersaglio con forza pari o inferiore a quella della Khenra Scuotiterra non può bloccare in questo turno.\\nEternare {4}{R}{R} ({4}{R}{R}, Esilia questa carta dal tuo cimitero: Crea una pedina che è una copia della carta, tranne che è un Guerriero Sciacallo Zombie 4/4 nero senza costo di mana. Eterna solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Sciacallo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431575&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a86b6e8c-942c-48a9-80a6-f026ae0b95a8\', \'multiverseId\': 431575}, \'multiverseid\': 431575}, {\'name\': \'地揺すりのケンラ\', \'text\': \'速攻\\n地揺すりのケンラが戦場に出たとき、地揺すりのケンラのパワー以下のパワーを持つクリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それではブロックできない。\\n永遠{4}{R}{R}（{4}{R}{R}, あなたの墓地からこのカードを追放する：マナ・コストを持たない黒の４/４のゾンビ・ジャッカル・戦士であることを除きこれのコピーであるトークンを１体生成する。永遠はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ジャッカル・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431774&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5970099-064c-472c-91b0-72c8b9a638a8\', \'multiverseId\': 431774}, \'multiverseid\': 431774}, {\'name\': \'대지를 뒤흔드는 켄라\', \'text\': \'신속\\n대지를 뒤흔드는 켄라가 전장에 들어올 때, 대지를 뒤흔드는 켄라의 공격력 이하의 공격력을 가진 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 이 턴에 방어할 수 없다.\\n영생화 {4}{R}{R} ({4}{R}{R}, 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 추방한다: 이 카드의 복사본이지만 마나 비용이 없는 4/4 흑색 좀비 자칼 전사인 토큰 한 개를 만든다. 당신이 집중마법을 발동할 수 있는 시기에만 영생화를 할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 자칼 전사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431973&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c9d6a1a-987f-42ef-bfe9-466454f36a0e\', \'multiverseId\': 431973}, \'multiverseid\': 431973}, {\'name\': \'Khenra Abala-terra\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto\\nQuando Khenra Abala-terra entra no campo de batalha, a criatura alvo com poder menor ou igual ao poder de Khenra Abala-terra não pode bloquear neste turno.\\nEternizar {4}{R}{R} ({4}{R}{R}, exile este card de seu cemitério: Crie uma ficha que seja uma cópia dele, com a exceção de ser um Zumbi Chacal Guerreiro preto 4/4 sem custo de mana. Eternize somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chacal Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432172&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6888446-1146-4390-a983-7827c24e6e77\', \'multiverseId\': 432172}, \'multiverseid\': 432172}, {\'name\': \'Сотрясающий Землю Хенра\', \'text\': \'Ускорение\\nКогда Сотрясающий Землю Хенра выходит на поле битвы, целевое существо, сила которого меньше или равна силе Сотрясающего Землю Хенры, не может блокировать в этом ходу.\\nУвековечивание {4}{R}{R} ({4}{R}{R}, изгоните эту карту из вашего кладбища: создайте фишку, являющуюся ее копией, но при этом являющуюся черным Зомби Шакалом Воином 4/4 без мана-стоимости. Увековечивайте только как волшебство.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Шакал Воин\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432371&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3337b6b8-d8ef-4202-837d-49d443d74400\', \'multiverseId\': 432371}, \'multiverseid\': 432371}, {\'name\': \'撼地胡狼人\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n当撼地胡狼人进战场时，目标力量等于或小于撼地胡狼人的生物本回合不能进行阻挡。\\n永生{4}{R}{R}（{4}{R}{R}，从你的坟墓场放逐此牌：派出一个衍生物，且为此牌的复制品，但它是4/4黑色灵俑／豺狼／战士，且没有法术力费用。永生的时机视同法术。）\', \'type\': \'生物～豺狼／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432570&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d9c9615-b618-4075-ba1e-97399facf2cb\', \'multiverseId\': 432570}, \'multiverseid\': 432570}, {\'name\': \'撼地胡狼人\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n當撼地胡狼人進戰場時，目標力量等於或小於撼地胡狼人的生物本回合不能進行阻擋。\\n永生{4}{R}{R}（{4}{R}{R}，從你的墳墓場放逐此牌：派出一個衍生物，且為此牌的複製品，但它是4/4黑色殭屍／豺狼／戰士，且沒有魔法力費用。永生的時機視同巫術。）\', \'type\': \'生物～豺狼／戰士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432769&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96930000-f87b-407f-a0df-b2b144e23019\', \'multiverseId\': 432769}, \'multiverseid\': 432769}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ergebene des Gott-Pharaos\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen blauen, schwarzen oder roten Zauberspruch wirkst, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Unsere letzte Prüfung ist gekommen! Erhebt euch — der Gott-Pharao weilt unter uns!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=430902&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8d0dabd-ae4e-4cb5-be90-d820579e9caa\', \'multiverseId\': 430902}, \'multiverseid\': 430902}, {\'name\': \'Creyente del Dios Faraón\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo azul, negro o rojo, ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Esta es la última prueba! ¡Regocíjense, pues el Dios Faraón vuela entre nosotros!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431101&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b588d76d-57f9-4d68-b394-6b5625374f03\', \'multiverseId\': 431101}, \'multiverseid\': 431101}, {\'name\': \'Fidèle du Dieu-Pharaon\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort bleu, noir ou rouge, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« Voici la dernière épreuve ! Réjouissons-nous, le Dieu-Pharaon s\'élève parmi nous ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431300&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a473531-ebbb-49bc-9caa-b4f9cf9f2e23\', \'multiverseId\': 431300}, \'multiverseid\': 431300}, {\'name\': \'Fedele del Dio Faraone\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia blu, nera o rossa, guadagni 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Questa è l\\\'ordalia finale! Gioite, poiché il Dio Faraone si erge tra noi!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431499&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'306efde1-780d-4ace-bad3-5b45d04d6008\', \'multiverseId\': 431499}, \'multiverseid\': 431499}, {\'name\': \'王神の信者\', \'text\': \'あなたが青か黒か赤である呪文を１つ唱えるたび、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「これは最後の試練よ！王神みずから飛翔ましますとは、なんとありがたいこと！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431698&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03dc4e62-c338-4531-b61d-f38e2f4afa1c\', \'multiverseId\': 431698}, \'multiverseid\': 431698}, {\'name\': \'신 파라오의 심복\', \'text\': \'당신이 청색, 흑색 또는 적색 주문을 발동할 때마다, 당신은 생명 1점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 마법사\', \'flavor\': \'"이제 마지막 시험이다! 기뻐하라, 신 파라오께서 우리 사이에 강림하시니!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431897&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5749e658-d81e-41a5-9aac-6c7449e56698\', \'multiverseId\': 431897}, \'multiverseid\': 431897}, {\'name\': \'Fiel do Faraó-Deus\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjura uma mágica azul, preta ou vermelha, você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Essa é a prova final. Regozijem-se, pois o Faraó-Deus voa entre nós!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432096&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcbc3e2f-0256-422f-aa1c-46ea52690bf9\', \'multiverseId\': 432096}, \'multiverseid\': 432096}, {\'name\': \'Служительница Бога-Фараона\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете синее, черное или красное заклинание, вы получаете 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'«Это — последнее испытание! Возрадуйтесь, ибо Бог-Фараон распростер над нами крылья!»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432295&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dab70b3f-bb55-493b-96cd-558c7a781050\', \'multiverseId\': 432295}, \'multiverseid\': 432295}, {\'name\': \'法老神的信徒\', \'text\': \'每当你施放蓝色，黑色或红色咒语时，你获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「这就是最终的祀炼！欢呼吧，法老神降临在我们身边！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432494&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60da1c90-a9d7-47c9-9018-d4c04ac95627\', \'multiverseId\': 432494}, \'multiverseid\': 432494}, {\'name\': \'法老神的信徒\', \'text\': \'每當你施放藍色，黑色或紅色咒語時，你獲得1點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／魔法師\', \'flavor\': \'「這就是最終的祀煉！歡呼吧，法老神降臨在我們身邊！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432693&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d969af05-7e4f-4ab2-b9c3-767b50837093\', \'multiverseId\': 432693}, \'multiverseid\': 432693}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erhabenheit\', \'text\': \'Spieler können keine Marken erhalten.\\nEs können keine Marken auf Artefakte, Kreaturen, Verzauberungen oder Länder gelegt werden.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Im Verrat durch den Gott-Pharao waren Götter und Sterbliche zum ersten Mal vollkommen gleich.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=430910&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edc56535-06d8-4946-b9b1-1675bdaf4a68\', \'multiverseId\': 430910}, \'multiverseid\': 430910}, {\'name\': \'Solemnidad\', \'text\': \'Los jugadores no pueden obtener contadores.\\nNo se pueden poner contadores sobre artefactos, criaturas, encantamientos o tierras.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'La llegada del Dios Faraón fue una traición tanto para dioses como para mortales.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431109&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ed3e923-04c2-4575-8a84-4be4ffda1aaf\', \'multiverseId\': 431109}, \'multiverseid\': 431109}, {\'name\': \'Solennité\', \'text\': \'Les joueurs ne peuvent pas gagner de marqueurs.\\nLes marqueurs ne peuvent pas être mis sur des artefacts, des créatures, des enchantements ou des terrains.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "L\'arrivée du Dieu-Pharaon signa sa trahison des dieux et des mortels.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431308&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adc3d924-6e97-4cd3-a1bd-acc6ac3feb10\', \'multiverseId\': 431308}, \'multiverseid\': 431308}, {\'name\': \'Solennità\', \'text\': \'I giocatori non possono ottenere segnalini.\\nNessun segnalino può essere messo su artefatti, creature, incantesimi o terre.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': "L\'avvento del Dio Faraone rappresentò un tradimento sia per i mortali che per gli dei.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431507&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a10edb16-7cad-4900-ab78-d6066dd27e0d\', \'multiverseId\': 431507}, \'multiverseid\': 431507}, {\'name\': \'厳粛\', \'text\': \'プレイヤーはカウンターを得られない。\\nアーティファクト、クリーチャー、エンチャント、土地の上にカウンターを置くことはできない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'王神の顕現により、神々と人々、双方への裏切りが明らかになった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431706&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14f237da-a0e2-4a59-bd6c-8fd8cff392c5\', \'multiverseId\': 431706}, \'multiverseid\': 431706}, {\'name\': \'침통함\', \'text\': \'플레이어는 카운터를 얻을 수 없다.\\n마법물체, 생물, 부여마법, 대지에 카운터가 놓일 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': \'신 파라오의 도래는 신과 필멸자 모두에게 배신을 알리는 전조였다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431905&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07d23232-21d0-4902-89cf-5eeeadb11e65\', \'multiverseId\': 431905}, \'multiverseid\': 431905}, {\'name\': \'Solenidade\', \'text\': \'Os jogadores não podem receber marcadores.\\nMarcadores não podem ser colocados em artefatos, criaturas, encantamentos ou terrenos.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'A chegada do Faraó-Deus representou uma traição tanto aos deuses quanto aos mortais.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432104&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'942994a8-f8b1-4534-9a3b-3755dfaa1245\', \'multiverseId\': 432104}, \'multiverseid\': 432104}, {\'name\': \'Торжественность\', \'text\': \'Игроки не могут получать жетоны.\\nЖетоны не могут быть положены на артефакты, существа, чары или земли.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'Явление Бога-Фараона ознаменовало собой предательство и богов, и смертных.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432303&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8c1c40e-5af7-4a28-8459-5f950b44e76f\', \'multiverseId\': 432303}, \'multiverseid\': 432303}, {\'name\': \'肃然致哀\', \'text\': \'牌手不能得到指示物。\\n不能在神器，生物，结界或地上放置指示物。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'法老神的到来标志着神明与凡人均遭背叛。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432502&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7748954-6221-45fd-bb13-3a1388060e63\', \'multiverseId\': 432502}, \'multiverseid\': 432502}, {\'name\': \'肅然致哀\', \'text\': \'玩家不能得到指示物。\\n不能在神器，生物，結界或地上放置指示物。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'法老神的到來標誌著神明與凡人均遭背叛。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432701&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95f4820f-1088-4f8f-a863-f90f4a501b6a\', \'multiverseId\': 432701}, \'multiverseid\': 432701}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feindliche Wüste\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {C}.\\n{2}, schicke eine Länderkarte aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil: Die Feindliche Wüste wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer 3/4 Elementarwesen-Kreatur. Sie ist immer noch ein Land.\', \'type\': \'Land — Wüste\', \'flavor\': \'Amonkhets Wüsten dürstet es nach Blut.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431066&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f37d223-4719-4c3a-9b5e-9f3d7ba59ce0\', \'multiverseId\': 431066}, \'multiverseid\': 431066}, {\'name\': \'Desierto hostil\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C} a tu reserva de maná.\\n{2}, exiliar una carta de tierra de tu cementerio: El Desierto hostil se convierte en una criatura Elemental 3/4 hasta el final del turno. Sigue siendo una tierra.\', \'type\': \'Tierra — Desierto\', \'flavor\': \'Las tierras áridas de Amonkhet están sedientas de sangre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431265&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'659d9a6b-a8cb-4f3d-84f5-773216e9d81e\', \'multiverseId\': 431265}, \'multiverseid\': 431265}, {\'name\': \'Désert hostile\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C} à votre réserve.\\n{2}, exilez une carte de terrain depuis votre cimetière : Le Désert hostile devient une créature 3/4 Élémental jusqu\'à la fin du tour. C\'est toujours un terrain.", \'type\': \'Terrain : désert\', \'flavor\': "La terre desséchée d\'Amonkhet a soif de sang.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431464&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a1d6c75-47ab-4fa4-a64c-9ca9332ad9ec\', \'multiverseId\': 431464}, \'multiverseid\': 431464}, {\'name\': \'Deserto Ostile\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C} alla tua riserva di mana.\\n{2}, Esilia una carta terra dal tuo cimitero: Il Deserto Ostile diventa una creatura Elementale 3/4 fino alla fine del turno. È ancora una terra.\', \'type\': \'Terra — Deserto\', \'flavor\': \'La terra riarsa di Amonkhet ha sete di sangue.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431663&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03f72844-f190-4819-a12d-ab636b4e7c20\', \'multiverseId\': 431663}, \'multiverseid\': 431663}, {\'name\': \'敵意ある砂漠\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{C}を加える。\\n{2}, あなたの墓地から土地・カード１枚を追放する：ターン終了時まで、敵意ある砂漠は３/４のエレメンタル・クリーチャーになる。これは土地でもある。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 砂漠\', \'flavor\': \'アモンケットの乾いた大地は血に飢えている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431862&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c713526-c801-4cd1-9570-d50bd83ceb4f\', \'multiverseId\': 431862}, \'multiverseid\': 431862}, {\'name\': \'적대적인 사막\', \'text\': \'{T}: {C}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.\\n{2}, 당신의 무덤에서 대지 카드 한 장을 추방한다: 적대적인 사막은 턴종료까지 3/4 정령 생물이 된다. 그 생물은 여전히 대지다.\', \'type\': \'대지 — 사막\', \'flavor\': \'아몬케트의 메마른 대지는 피를 갈구한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432061&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'742cb81b-2401-4614-ae25-968d2c6b3279\', \'multiverseId\': 432061}, \'multiverseid\': 432061}, {\'name\': \'Deserto Hostil\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C} à sua reserva de mana.\\n{2}, exile um card de terreno de seu cemitério: Deserto Hostil torna-se uma criatura 3/4 do tipo Elemental até o final do turno. Ela ainda é um terreno.\', \'type\': \'Terreno — Deserto\', \'flavor\': \'A terra seca de Amonkhet tem sede de sangue.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432260&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e76811aa-bfcb-4f50-8590-ef928fbef2b8\', \'multiverseId\': 432260}, \'multiverseid\': 432260}, {\'name\': \'Враждебная Пустыня\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C} в ваше хранилище маны.\\n{2}, изгоните карту земли из вашего кладбища: Враждебная Пустыня становится существом 3/4 Элементаль до конца хода. При этом она остается землей.\', \'type\': \'Земля — Пустыня\', \'flavor\': \'Иссушенная земля Амонхета жаждет крови.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432459&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1b4f523-b926-44b8-802d-eb16fe5757a8\', \'multiverseId\': 432459}, \'multiverseid\': 432459}, {\'name\': \'敌意沙漠\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}到你的法术力池中。\\n{2}，从你的坟墓场中放逐一张地牌：敌意沙漠成为3/4元素生物直到回合结束。它仍然是地。\', \'type\': \'地～沙漠\', \'flavor\': \'阿芒凯的干涸土地渴求鲜血滋养。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432658&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17e7fede-1691-4bfc-b08c-776d26961d5d\', \'multiverseId\': 432658}, \'multiverseid\': 432658}, {\'name\': \'敵意沙漠\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}到你的魔法力池中。\\n{2}，從你的墳墓場中放逐一張地牌：敵意沙漠成為3/4元素生物直到回合結束。它仍然是地。\', \'type\': \'地～沙漠\', \'flavor\': \'阿芒凱的乾涸土地渴求鮮血滋養。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432857&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18ca05f8-878e-4b76-b464-be7c13b2e9a1\', \'multiverseId\': 432857}, \'multiverseid\': 432857}]', "[{'name': 'Feld // Markt', 'text': 'Zerstöre eine angreifende oder blockende Kreatur deiner Wahl.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Feld', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431036&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5020c8d3-b1a0-48ad-8a3e-d82c8482d615', 'multiverseId': 431036}, 'multiverseid': 431036}, {'name': 'Labrar // Vender', 'text': 'Destruye la criatura atacante o bloqueadora objetivo.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Labrar', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431235&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '32a62901-11e0-406f-8963-a902d30e2cec', 'multiverseId': 431235}, 'multiverseid': 431235}, {'name': 'Exploitation // Marché', 'text': 'Détruisez la créature attaquante ou bloqueuse ciblée.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Exploitation', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431434&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5f3deadf-ef8c-406f-baf7-204860e60d1b', 'multiverseId': 431434}, 'multiverseid': 431434}, {'name': 'Raccolto // Mercato', 'text': 'Distruggi una creatura attaccante o bloccante bersaglio.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Raccolto', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431633&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1f93a550-7ecf-47a5-a5f1-7b1f0a51331f', 'multiverseId': 431633}, 'multiverseid': 431633}, {'name': '農場 // 市場', 'text': '攻撃かブロックしているクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': '農場', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431832&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0bcfc51c-c3db-4e11-bcef-fa9604633cc8', 'multiverseId': 431832}, 'multiverseid': 431832}, {'name': '농장 // 시장', 'text': '공격생물이나 방어생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 파괴한다.', 'type': '순간마법', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': '농장', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432031&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1d9f8b81-7fc5-499d-bffb-eee27eea2f7e', 'multiverseId': 432031}, 'multiverseid': 432031}, {'name': 'Plantar // Vender', 'text': 'Destrua a criatura atacante ou bloqueadora alvo.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Plantar', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432230&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f3da0ea6-bf5b-4ff7-9c4c-e1b878f18bfa', 'multiverseId': 432230}, 'multiverseid': 432230}, {'name': 'Ферма // Базар', 'text': 'Уничтожьте целевое атакующее или блокирующее существо.', 'type': 'Мгновенное заклинание', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Ферма', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432429&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ed0e386d-6946-4e69-960e-eecc44f8dfc6', 'multiverseId': 432429}, 'multiverseid': 432429}, {'name': '归田 // 市集', 'text': '消灭目标进行攻击或阻挡的生物。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': '归田', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432628&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6a80bc27-067e-4f69-af95-fb0b721c7afb', 'multiverseId': 432628}, 'multiverseid': 432628}, {'name': '歸田 // 市集', 'text': '消滅目標進行攻擊或阻擋的生物。', 'type': '瞬間', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': '歸田', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432827&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3e27fc12-7298-48e1-b4bd-c277642ee85c', 'multiverseId': 432827}, 'multiverseid': 432827}]", "[{'name': 'Feuer eröffnen', 'text': 'Feuer eröffnen fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'Die Khenra geben jedem ihrer Geschosse eine persönliche Note.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=430993&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fd5496b7-660f-4936-80ff-78c444ec9a66', 'multiverseId': 430993}, 'multiverseid': 430993}, {'name': 'Abrir fuego', 'text': 'Abrir fuego hace 3 puntos de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': 'Algunos arqueros khenra elaboran sus flechas dándoles un toque personal.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431192&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1ae2264b-01b6-43ef-8887-85ddc06d505c', 'multiverseId': 431192}, 'multiverseid': 431192}, {'name': 'Ouvrir le feu', 'text': 'Ouvrir le feu inflige 3 blessures à une cible, créature ou joueur.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': 'Certains archers khenra personnalisent leurs flèches.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431391&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ba0a5822-44aa-435d-be46-e57dedb19a60', 'multiverseId': 431391}, 'multiverseid': 431391}, {'name': 'Aprire il Fuoco', 'text': 'Aprire il Fuoco infligge 3 danni a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': 'Alcuni arcieri khenra costruiscono le proprie frecce con un tocco personale.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431590&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '42643c9b-390f-4119-87fb-b717c0403e0b', 'multiverseId': 431590}, 'multiverseid': 431590}, {'name': '発射', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。発射はそれに３点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': 'ケンラの射手の中には、自分の矢に個性を与える者もいる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431789&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0dffd2b4-4050-4655-a0b2-0daba188215b', 'multiverseId': 431789}, 'multiverseid': 431789}, {'name': '사격 개시', 'text': '생물이나 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 사격 개시는 그 목표에게 피해 3점을 입힌다.', 'type': '순간마법', 'flavor': '일부 켄라 궁수들은 자신만의 방식으로 개조한 화살을 사용했다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431988&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fbe43503-a1c6-4057-a928-a4e650567f35', 'multiverseId': 431988}, 'multiverseid': 431988}, {'name': 'Abrir Fogo', 'text': 'Abrir Fogo causa 3 pontos de dano à criatura ou ao jogador alvo.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': 'Alguns arqueiros khenras confeccionam suas flechas com um toque pessoal.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432187&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '17b08679-4b62-49ac-98e5-19d8de2fcb0a', 'multiverseId': 432187}, 'multiverseid': 432187}, {'name': 'Открыть Огонь', 'text': 'Открыть Огонь наносит 3 повреждения целевому существу или игроку.', 'type': 'Мгновенное заклинание', 'flavor': 'Некоторые лучники хенра украшают стрелы своими характерными штрихами.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432386&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3951dcd0-1b9a-4a80-ba74-2c915fb7e9d2', 'multiverseId': 432386}, 'multiverseid': 432386}, {'name': '开火', 'text': '开火对目标生物或牌手造成3点伤害。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '有些胡狼人弓箭手为自己的箭矢添上了个人特色。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432585&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd46a59e9-1f64-43bf-9bb3-e5a6991f8629', 'multiverseId': 432585}, 'multiverseid': 432585}, {'name': '開火', 'text': '開火對目標生物或玩家造成3點傷害。', 'type': '瞬間', 'flavor': '有些胡狼人弓箭手為自己的箭矢添上了個人特色。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432784&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dad89a0b-7d29-4997-ae02-8297d9e4da08', 'multiverseId': 432784}, 'multiverseid': 432784}]", '[{\'name\': \'Feuerfaust-Minotaurus\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag\\n{1}{R}, wirf eine Karte ab: Der Feuerfaust-Minotaurus erhält +2/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Minotaurus, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Es gibt kein Jenseits. Weder für dich, noch für mich. Also überleg dir gut, ob du dich mir in den Weg stellen willst."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=430973&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbdc2bae-94e9-4d80-be48-64ef2af2a34e\', \'multiverseId\': 430973}, \'multiverseid\': 430973}, {\'name\': \'Minotauro de puño ardiente\', \'text\': \'Daña primero.\\n{1}{R}, descartar una carta: El Minotauro de puño ardiente obtiene +2/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero minotauro\', \'flavor\': \'"No hay más allá, ni para ti ni para mí. Así que piénsatelo dos veces antes de interponerte en mi camino".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431172&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0407097-2667-44b7-8763-b4bf8fd5d835\', \'multiverseId\': 431172}, \'multiverseid\': 431172}, {\'name\': \'Minotaure brûlepoing\', \'text\': "Initiative\\n{1}{R}, défaussez-vous d\'une carte : Le Minotaure brûlepoing gagne +2/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : minotaure et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« Il n\'y a pas d\'au-delà. Ni pour moi, ni pour vous. Alors réfléchissez bien avant de vous mettre en travers de ma route. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431371&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5620fb8-0758-43f2-82f9-22f53c784639\', \'multiverseId\': 431371}, \'multiverseid\': 431371}, {\'name\': \'Minotauro Pugnorovente\', \'text\': \'Attacco improvviso\\n{1}{R}, Scarta una carta: Il Minotauro Pugnorovente prende +2/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Minotauro\', \'flavor\': \'"Non esiste alcun Aldilà, né per me, né per voi. Siete sicuri di volermi intralciare il passo?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431570&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4da8d86d-aec5-49b6-9d36-a702228b00fa\', \'multiverseId\': 431570}, \'multiverseid\': 431570}, {\'name\': \'燃え拳のミノタウルス\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃\\n{1}{R}, カード１枚を捨てる：ターン終了時まで、燃え拳のミノタウルスは＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ミノタウルス・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「来世などというものはないのだ。俺にも、お前にもな。俺の行く手を遮らずに考え直せ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431769&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3914dde9-5284-4c94-977d-88498d556ae4\', \'multiverseId\': 431769}, \'multiverseid\': 431769}, {\'name\': \'불주먹 미노타우로스\', \'text\': \'선제공격\\n{1}{R}, 카드 한 장을 버린다: 불주먹 미노타우로스는 턴종료까지 +2/+0을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 미노타우로스 마법사\', \'flavor\': \'"나에게도 네놈에게도 사후 세계 따윈 없다. 그러니 날 막기 전에 다시 생각해라."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431968&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3b9aad7-7ed9-474d-b653-2fad2efcf1ae\', \'multiverseId\': 431968}, \'multiverseid\': 431968}, {\'name\': \'Minotauro do Punho Flamejante\', \'text\': \'Iniciativa\\n{1}{R}, descarte um card: Minotauro do Punho Flamejante recebe +2/+0 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Minotauro Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Não há vida após a morte. Nem para mim, nem para vocês. Então pensem duas vezes antes de ficarem no meu caminho."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432167&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6caf614e-f777-41b1-b527-e6c6b69de352\', \'multiverseId\': 432167}, \'multiverseid\': 432167}, {\'name\': \'Минотавр Горящего Кулака\', \'text\': \'Первый удар\\n{1}{R}, сбросьте карту: Минотавр Горящего Кулака получает +2/+0 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Минотавр Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'«Загробной жизни нет. Ни для меня, ни для тебя. Так что подумай хорошенько, прежде чем вставать у меня на пути».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432366&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d9f9700-6ecc-42d2-8eed-d71084141620\', \'multiverseId\': 432366}, \'multiverseid\': 432366}, {\'name\': \'焰拳牛头怪\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n{1}{R}，弃一张牌：焰拳牛头怪得+2/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～牛头怪／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「哪有什么来世。我没有，你也不会有。所以在挡我道之前可得想清楚了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432565&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'002832ce-86b1-429f-9882-a44192198f29\', \'multiverseId\': 432565}, \'multiverseid\': 432565}, {\'name\': \'焰拳牛頭怪\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n{1}{R}，棄一張牌：焰拳牛頭怪得+2/+0直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～牛頭怪／魔法師\', \'flavor\': \'「哪有什麼來世。我沒有，你也不會有。所以在擋我道之前可得想清楚了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432764&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aab207d3-1e54-4c97-b796-a0126e6095e5\', \'multiverseId\': 432764}, \'multiverseid\': 432764}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flammenpfeil-Bogenschützin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Nichtkreatur-Zauberspruch wirkst, fügt die Flammenpfeil-Bogenschützin jedem Gegner 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Bogenschütze\', \'flavor\': \'Sie ist die flammende Rache der Bewohner Naktamuns.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=430980&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ce0b5f7-6d58-44bf-8e8c-053b4bf2d16b\', \'multiverseId\': 430980}, \'multiverseid\': 430980}, {\'name\': \'Arquera flamígera\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo que no sea de criatura, la Arquera flamígera hace 1 punto de daño a cada oponente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Arquero humano\', \'flavor\': \'Una palabra de venganza, y sus flechas despiertan envueltas en llamas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431179&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01e9d039-336b-4145-abd0-05500c0eb8d9\', \'multiverseId\': 431179}, \'multiverseid\': 431179}, {\'name\': \'Archère au brandon\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort non-créature, l\'Archère au brandon inflige 1 blessure à chaque adversaire.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et archer\', \'flavor\': "Une parole vindicative et ses flèches s\'embrasent.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431378&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8ec9a81-53d7-4574-9b79-4f7290356446\', \'multiverseId\': 431378}, \'multiverseid\': 431378}, {\'name\': \'Arciera Aizzatrice\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia non creatura, l\'Arciera Aizzatrice infligge 1 danno a ogni avversario.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Arciere Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Basta una parola di vendetta e le sue frecce guizzano di vita fiammante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431577&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12f9849c-ef95-45f4-a951-4c43417bfee0\', \'multiverseId\': 431577}, \'multiverseid\': 431577}, {\'name\': \'火付け射手\', \'text\': \'あなたがクリーチャーでない呪文を１つ唱えるたび、火付け射手は各対戦相手にそれぞれ１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・射手\', \'flavor\': \'復讐の言葉とともに、彼女の矢は炎に目覚めた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431776&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20b699a2-2b68-4bff-ada4-e38d2ba52e5f\', \'multiverseId\': 431776}, \'multiverseid\': 431776}, {\'name\': \'불화살 궁수\', \'text\': \'당신이 생물이 아닌 주문을 발동할 때마다, 불화살 궁수는 각 상대에게 피해 1점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 궁수\', \'flavor\': \'복수의 말 한마디와 함께 그녀의 화살에 불이 피어올랐다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431975&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18e60764-10a6-4666-b54f-70a9a2ac280a\', \'multiverseId\': 431975}, \'multiverseid\': 431975}, {\'name\': \'Arqueira Agitadora\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjura uma mágica que não seja de criatura, Arqueira Agitadora causa 1 ponto de dano a cada oponente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Arqueiro\', \'flavor\': \'Uma palavra de vingança e as flechas dela despertam em chamas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432174&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e64098e-8684-4fd8-8a79-d2262ea659c5\', \'multiverseId\': 432174}, \'multiverseid\': 432174}, {\'name\': \'Лучница Пожаров\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете не являющееся существом заклинание, Лучница Пожаров наносит 1 повреждение каждому оппоненту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Лучник\', \'flavor\': \'От слов о мести ее стрелы разгораются ярким огнем.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432373&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc80822c-6d6a-43ff-bf01-46b356af8458\', \'multiverseId\': 432373}, \'multiverseid\': 432373}, {\'name\': \'焰箭弓手\', \'text\': \'每当你施放非生物咒语时，焰箭弓手向每位对手各造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／弓箭手\', \'flavor\': \'一句复仇，她的箭矢便燃起了烈焰。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432572&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ae1c989-1bae-42ee-84b7-59b66b767f92\', \'multiverseId\': 432572}, \'multiverseid\': 432572}, {\'name\': \'焰箭弓手\', \'text\': \'每當你施放非生物咒語時，焰箭弓手向每位對手各造成1點傷害。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／弓箭手\', \'flavor\': \'一句復仇，她的箭矢便燃起了烈焰。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432771&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c09aa639-b8c7-4ec3-9dc9-682db5930bf3\', \'multiverseId\': 432771}, \'multiverseid\': 432771}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fliegender Wegefinder\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn der Fliegende Wegefinder angreift, erhält eine andere angreifende Kreatur deiner Wahl Flugfähigkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Sceada\', \'flavor\': \'„Kefnet lehrte uns, dass jedes Hindernis auch Möglichkeiten bereithält." —Neponem, Wesirin von Kefnet\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=430917&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50ad6ecc-5d72-43a7-831c-7d5a2495f361\', \'multiverseId\': 430917}, \'multiverseid\': 430917}, {\'name\': \'Guía aéreo\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que el Guía aéreo ataque, otra criatura atacante objetivo gana la habilidad de volar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Draco\', \'flavor\': \'"Kefnet nos enseñó a convertir los obstáculos en ventajas". —Neponem, visir de Kefnet\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431116&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ab8abf2-1cb8-4d75-8e99-6b7cb62e1e14\', \'multiverseId\': 431116}, \'multiverseid\': 431116}, {\'name\': \'Guide aérien\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que le Guide aérien attaque, une autre créature attaquante ciblée acquiert le vol jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : drakôn\', \'flavor\': \'« Kefnet nous a appris à transformer les obstacles en avantages. » —Neponem, vizir de Kefnet\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431315&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49ba990c-f62d-40e6-afc4-dbaf4894993a\', \'multiverseId\': 431315}, \'multiverseid\': 431315}, {\'name\': \'Guida Aerea\', \'text\': "Volare\\nOgniqualvolta la Guida Aerea attacca, un\'altra creatura attaccante bersaglio ha volare fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Draghetto\', \'flavor\': \'"Kefnet ci ha insegnato a trasformare gli ostacoli in vantaggi." —Neponem, visir di Kefnet\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431514&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdba8a15-3fc0-45f0-a601-d4cc0b88b32d\', \'multiverseId\': 431514}, \'multiverseid\': 431514}, {\'name\': \'空からの導き手\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n空からの導き手が攻撃するたび、他の攻撃クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは飛行を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドレイク\', \'flavor\': \'「ケフネト様は、障害を強みに変えよと教えてくださった。」 ――ケフネトの侍臣、ネポネム\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431713&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8502e203-c425-46aa-ba5e-43840870dbff\', \'multiverseId\': 431713}, \'multiverseid\': 431713}, {\'name\': \'공중 길잡이\', \'text\': \'비행\\n공중 길잡이가 공격할 때마다, 다른 공격생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 비행을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 드레이크\', \'flavor\': \'"케프넷께서 어려움을 기회로 바꾸는 법을 가르쳐 주셨다." —케프넷의 고관 네포넴\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431912&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e46cbd3-0627-48ff-af01-1524b073af3d\', \'multiverseId\': 431912}, \'multiverseid\': 431912}, {\'name\': \'Guia Aéreo\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que Guia Aéreo ataca, outra criatura atacante alvo ganha voar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragonete\', \'flavor\': \'"Kefnet nos ensinou a transformar obstáculos em vantagens." — Neponem, vizir de Kefnet\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432111&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9ddbde6-97fb-4f37-ba06-20b27b3be7bc\', \'multiverseId\': 432111}, \'multiverseid\': 432111}, {\'name\': \'Воздушный Проводник\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз, когда Воздушный Проводник атакует, другое целевое атакующее существо получает Полет до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дрейк\', \'flavor\': \'«Кефнет научил нас превращать препятствия в преимущества». — Непонем, визирь Кефнета\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432310&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d93fd20-03dc-48a2-a707-b4d6f54bdc8a\', \'multiverseId\': 432310}, \'multiverseid\': 432310}, {\'name\': \'翔空向导\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当翔空向导攻击时，另一个目标进行攻击的生物获得飞行异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～龙兽\', \'flavor\': \'「刻法涅教导我们把障碍化为优势。」 ～刻法涅维齐尔奈珀内\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432509&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d82c5ba-4efd-420d-a29f-b1e4afd49f40\', \'multiverseId\': 432509}, \'multiverseid\': 432509}, {\'name\': \'翔空嚮導\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n每當翔空嚮導攻擊時，另一個目標進行攻擊的生物獲得飛行異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～龍獸\', \'flavor\': \'「刻法涅教導我們把障礙化為優勢。」 ～刻法涅維齊爾奈珀內\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432708&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ef85000-a72e-43c6-ac2b-1c91767cf4d8\', \'multiverseId\': 432708}, \'multiverseid\': 432708}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fluchpeitschen-Zelotin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Fluchpeitschen-Zelotin ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine -1/-1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl legen.\\n{B}, opfere die Fluchpeitschen-Zelotin: Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, auf der mindestens eine -1/-1-Marke liegt.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Sollte ich heute sterben, dann garantiert nicht allein."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=430947&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8912b9ad-c3fb-4d9a-9c48-c9a476fd466f\', \'multiverseId\': 430947}, \'multiverseid\': 430947}, {\'name\': \'Castigadora del látigorruina\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Castigadora del látigorruina entre al campo de batalla, puedes poner un contador -1/-1 sobre la criatura objetivo.\\n{B}, sacrificar a la Castigadora del látigorruina: Destruye la criatura objetivo que tenga un contador -1/-1 sobre ella.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Si muero, no será sola".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431146&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'152784f4-0a5c-4172-9264-d0f9497e9b3e\', \'multiverseId\': 431146}, \'multiverseid\': 431146}, {\'name\': \'Châtieuse au fouet du fléau\', \'text\': \'Quand la Châtieuse au fouet du fléau arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez mettre un marqueur -1/-1 sur une créature ciblée.\\n{B}, sacrifiez la Châtieuse au fouet du fléau : Détruisez une créature ciblée qui a un marqueur -1/-1 sur elle.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'« Si je meurs, je ne serai pas la seule. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431345&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d1112be-5085-4df3-9b42-ac19ac9975e7\', \'multiverseId\': 431345}, \'multiverseid\': 431345}, {\'name\': \'Giustiziera Frustasventura\', \'text\': \'Quando la Giustiziera Frustasventura entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi mettere un segnalino -1/-1 su una creatura bersaglio.\\n{B}, Sacrifica la Giustiziera Frustasventura: Distruggi una creatura bersaglio con un segnalino -1/-1.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Se muoio, non me ne andrò da sola."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431544&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8af39a5-41e9-4455-bc32-c1da32935e6d\', \'multiverseId\': 431544}, \'multiverseid\': 431544}, {\'name\': \'禍鞭の懲罰者\', \'text\': \'禍鞭の懲罰者が戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたはそれの上に－１/－１カウンターを１個置いてもよい。\\n{B}, 禍鞭の懲罰者を生け贄に捧げる：－１/－１カウンターが置かれているクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「私は独りでは死なないわよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431743&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9df177aa-e02d-4aa5-a96a-e0d9a4485a71\', \'multiverseId\': 431743}, \'multiverseid\': 431743}, {\'name\': \'재앙채찍 처벌자\', \'text\': \'재앙채찍 처벌자가 전장에 들어올 때, 생물을 목표로 정한다. 당신은 그 생물에 -1/-1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓을 수 있다.\\n{B}, 재앙채찍 처벌자를 희생한다: -1/-1 카운터를 가진 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 전사\', \'flavor\': \'"죽더라도 절대 혼자 죽지는 않겠어."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431942&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'303dfbc3-c7cd-4906-8ebe-2f2da0dee162\', \'multiverseId\': 431942}, \'multiverseid\': 431942}, {\'name\': \'Castigadora do Chicote da Ruína\', \'text\': \'Quando Castigadora do Chicote da Ruína entra no campo de batalha, você pode colocar um marcador -1/-1 na criatura alvo.\\n{B}, sacrifique Castigadora do Chicote da Ruína: Destrua a criatura alvo que tenha um marcador -1/-1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Se eu morrer, não será sozinha."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432141&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50142a4c-ff56-4d80-b9a3-a94926471f1a\', \'multiverseId\': 432141}, \'multiverseid\': 432141}, {\'name\': \'Мучительница Гибельного Кнута\', \'text\': \'Когда Мучительница Гибельного Кнута выходит на поле битвы, вы можете положить один жетон -1/-1 на целевое существо.\\n{B}, пожертвуйте Мучительницу Гибельного Кнута: уничтожьте целевое существо, на котором есть жетон -1/-1.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Воин\', \'flavor\': \'«Если я умру, то умру не одна».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432340&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09035cf0-c68c-4613-b53a-0dc7c8274e9d\', \'multiverseId\': 432340}, \'multiverseid\': 432340}, {\'name\': \'驱邪鞭手\', \'text\': \'当驱邪鞭手进战场时，你可以在目标生物上放置一个-1/-1指示物。\\n{B}，牺牲驱邪鞭手：消灭目标其上有-1/-1指示物的生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「就算我死了，也会拖一个陪葬。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432539&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b8e28de-93b3-47cb-95a3-433a9060cd54\', \'multiverseId\': 432539}, \'multiverseid\': 432539}, {\'name\': \'驅邪鞭手\', \'text\': \'當驅邪鞭手進戰場時，你可以在目標生物上放置一個-1/-1指示物。\\n{B}，犧牲驅邪鞭手：消滅目標其上有-1/-1指示物的生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'「就算我死了，也會拖一個陪葬。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432738&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2dbdf901-a765-4e8e-aab5-d0d28cdfe2e2\', \'multiverseId\': 432738}, \'multiverseid\': 432738}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fluss-Wiedehopf\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{3}{G}{U}: Du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu und ziehst eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel\', \'flavor\': \'„Selbst der Gesang der Vögel hat seine Fröhlichkeit verloren." —Sana, ehemalige Geweihte der Ahn-Saat\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431031&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1043a944-d98e-4d9b-85b1-91da41321f96\', \'multiverseId\': 431031}, \'multiverseid\': 431031}, {\'name\': \'Abubilla de río\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{3}{G}{U}: Ganas 2 vidas y robas una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave\', \'flavor\': \'"Qué cruel es que una criatura tan colorida entone una canción tan triste". —Sana, antigua iniciada de la simiente Ahn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431230&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68c63eec-3af5-4c42-afcf-f3e899278be8\', \'multiverseId\': 431230}, \'multiverseid\': 431230}, {\'name\': \'Huppe fasciée du fleuve\', \'text\': \'Vol\\n{3}{G}{U} : Vous gagnez 2 points de vie et vous piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau\', \'flavor\': "« Quelle ironie qu\'un oiseau si coloré ait un chant si triste. » —Sana, ancienne adepte de la moisson Ahn", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431429&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f8237e9-14be-445e-bf0f-23d3fbbe171d\', \'multiverseId\': 431429}, \'multiverseid\': 431429}, {\'name\': \'Upupa di Fiume\', \'text\': \'Volare\\n{3}{G}{U}: Guadagni 2 punti vita e peschi una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Uccello\', \'flavor\': \'"È crudele donare un canto tanto triste a una creatura così colorata." —Sanah, ex iniziata della messe Ahn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8fa58ec-67b2-42c8-9001-33dbd8b8ea3c\', \'multiverseId\': 431628}, \'multiverseid\': 431628}, {\'name\': \'川ヤツガシラ\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{3}{G}{U}：あなたは２点のライフを得てカードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥\', \'flavor\': \'「この鳥はこれほど美しいのに、鳴き声はこれほど悲しい。なんてむごいことでしょう。」 ――アン一門の元修練者、サナ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431827&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a40e850b-26e8-46be-8af1-de7b508a0ed0\', \'multiverseId\': 431827}, \'multiverseid\': 431827}, {\'name\': \'강 오디새\', \'text\': \'비행\\n{3}{G}{U}: 당신은 생명 2점을 얻고 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 조류\', \'flavor\': \'"이렇게 화려한 생물이 이토록 슬피 우는 건 참으로 잔인한 일이다." —전 안 입문자 입회자 사나\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432026&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c69932bf-a921-4531-b4ee-de034a24da13\', \'multiverseId\': 432026}, \'multiverseid\': 432026}, {\'name\': \'Poupa-do-rio\', \'text\': \'Voar\\n{3}{G}{U}: Você ganha 2 pontos de vida e compra um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave\', \'flavor\': \'"É cruel dar um canto tão triste a uma criatura tão colorida." — Sana, ex-iniciada da safra Ahn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432225&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4835229b-2bf9-4731-8cfa-c9a9b1220e75\', \'multiverseId\': 432225}, \'multiverseid\': 432225}, {\'name\': \'Речной Удод\', \'text\': \'Полет\\n{3}{G}{U}: вы получаете 2 жизни и берете карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Птица\', \'flavor\': \'«Какая жестокость: дать столь печальный голос такому яркому созданию». — Сана, бывшая послушница снопа Ан\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432424&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea9e3e99-83fe-4d66-9c5c-20f83d5dc0a7\', \'multiverseId\': 432424}, \'multiverseid\': 432424}, {\'name\': \'沿河戴胜鸟\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n{3}{G}{U}：你获得2点生命且抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～鸟\', \'flavor\': \'「让此等华美生物聆听世间惨痛悲鸣，也可算是残忍。」 ～原阿恩祀群祀徒萨娜\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432623&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba5ad136-15a4-4044-9062-559611bfcc61\', \'multiverseId\': 432623}, \'multiverseid\': 432623}, {\'name\': \'沿河戴勝鳥\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{3}{G}{U}：你獲得2點生命且抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～鳥\', \'flavor\': \'「讓此等華美生物聆聽世間慘痛悲鳴，也可算是殘忍。」 ～原阿恩祀群祀徒薩娜\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432822&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3838c42-58ab-41f2-8994-94c3450f9983\', \'multiverseId\': 432822}, \'multiverseid\': 432822}]', '[{\'name\': \'Frontlinien-Zerstörerin\', \'text\': \'Pestilenz 2 (Immer wenn diese Kreatur geblockt wird, verliert der verteidigende Spieler 2 Lebenspunkte.)\\n{1}{R}: Die Frontlinien-Zerstörerin erhält +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie, Minotaurus, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Die Wohltaten des Gott-Pharaos machten die Bewohner Amonkhets blind für seine eigentlichen Pläne.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=430981&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c728c935-75bf-48cc-abc7-347d1eef6eff\', \'multiverseId\': 430981}, \'multiverseid\': 430981}, {\'name\': \'Devastadora de primera línea\', \'text\': \'Afligir 2. (Siempre que esta criatura sea bloqueada, el jugador defensor pierde 2 vidas.)\\n{1}{R}: La Devastadora de primera línea obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero minotauro zombie\', \'flavor\': \'La benevolencia del Dios Faraón ocultó la fábrica que creó para producir un ejército de eternos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431180&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'479896a5-8af1-4b06-854b-5c7371b207ac\', \'multiverseId\': 431180}, \'multiverseid\': 431180}, {\'name\': \'Dévastatrice du front\', \'text\': "Affliction 2 (À chaque fois que cette créature devient bloquée, le joueur défenseur perd 2 points de vie.)\\n{1}{R} : La Dévastatrice du front gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : zombie et minotaure et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "La bienveillance du Dieu-Pharaon dissimulait l\'usine qu\'il avait créée pour produire son armée d\'Éternels.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431379&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c77da1fc-a4bf-4521-9523-5daa2b201751\', \'multiverseId\': 431379}, \'multiverseid\': 431379}, {\'name\': \'Devastatrice in Prima Linea\', \'text\': \'Affliggere 2 (Ogniqualvolta questa creatura viene bloccata, il giocatore in difesa perde 2 punti vita.)\\n{1}{R}: La Devastatrice in Prima Linea prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Minotauro Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Dietro la benevolenza del Dio Faraone si celava la fabbrica da lui creata per produrre un esercito di Eterni.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431578&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c977ce5a-3b8f-4cb9-b598-180abc817de8\', \'multiverseId\': 431578}, \'multiverseid\': 431578}, {\'name\': \'前線の壊滅者\', \'text\': \'加虐２（このクリーチャーがブロックされた状態になるたび、防御プレイヤーは２点のライフを失う。）\\n{1}{R}：ターン終了時まで、前線の壊滅者は＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・ミノタウルス・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'王神はその深き慈愛により、永遠衆の軍勢を生み出す工廠を隠しておかれた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431777&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e760145-9c57-4e45-bf15-221d78c1c1a6\', \'multiverseId\': 431777}, \'multiverseid\': 431777}, {\'name\': \'최전방 파괴자\', \'text\': \'통증 2 (이 생물이 방어될 때마다, 수비플레이어는 생명 2점을 잃는다.)\\n{1}{R}: 최전방 파괴자는 턴종료까지 +1/+0을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 좀비 미노타우로스 전사\', \'flavor\': \'신 파라오의 자비심이 그가 영생자 군대를 양성하기 위해 세운 시설을 드러나지 않게 하였다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431976&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d16fe80c-75e5-4042-bfb3-dcec4546200b\', \'multiverseId\': 431976}, \'multiverseid\': 431976}, {\'name\': \'Devastadora da Linha de Frente\', \'text\': \'Afligir 2 (Toda vez que esta criatura se torna bloqueada, o jogador defensor perde 2 pontos de vida.)\\n{1}{R}: Devastadora da Linha de Frente recebe +1/+0 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi Minotauro Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'A benevolência do Faraó-Deus ocultava a fábrica que ele criara para produzir um exército de Eternos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432175&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f127ed8-7a20-4747-bcbe-ec8d48f9b678\', \'multiverseId\': 432175}, \'multiverseid\': 432175}, {\'name\': \'Опустошитель с Передовой\', \'text\': \'Страдание 2 (Каждый раз, когда это существо становится заблокированным, защищающийся игрок теряет 2 жизни.)\\n{1}{R}: Опустошитель с Передовой получает +1/+0 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зомби Минотавр Воин\', \'flavor\': \'За благосклонностью Бога-Фараона скрывалась его фабрика по производству армии вековечных.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432374&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a84c9495-c494-4b3f-bf52-18abc0a410e9\', \'multiverseId\': 432374}, \'multiverseid\': 432374}, {\'name\': \'前线夷毁怪\', \'text\': \'折磨2（每当此生物被阻挡时，防御牌手失去2点生命。）\\n{1}{R}：前线夷毁怪得+1/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～灵俑／牛头怪／战士\', \'flavor\': \'在法老神的恩赐之下，隐藏着他创造永生者大军的工厂。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432573&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c264a3b0-f5c7-4097-8f2b-d03cfa11ea3c\', \'multiverseId\': 432573}, \'multiverseid\': 432573}, {\'name\': \'前線夷毀怪\', \'text\': \'折磨2（每當此生物被阻擋時，防禦玩家失去2點生命。）\\n{1}{R}：前線夷毀怪得+1/+0直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～殭屍／牛頭怪／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'在法老神的恩賜之下，隱藏著他創造永生者大軍的工廠。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432772&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a4aa70f-c20c-43cf-bc02-3f5b7a09ce8f\', \'multiverseId\': 432772}, \'multiverseid\': 432772}]', '[{\'name\': \'Furchtloser Avior\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn der Furchtlose Avior angreift, enttappe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Es waren die Aviore, die den Leuten Hoffnung brachten und sie aus den Ruinen Naktamuns herausführten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=430895&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'601c8902-418b-44e6-abed-4bdc31997e58\', \'multiverseId\': 430895}, \'multiverseid\': 430895}, {\'name\': \'Aven audaz\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que el Aven audaz ataque, endereza la criatura objetivo que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero ave\', \'flavor\': \'En medio del caos que desataron los dioses nuevos, los aven de alas raudas actuaron como hallasendas, guiando a los últimos supervivientes lejos de las ruinas de Naktamun.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431094&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85241440-8cce-40b6-9602-8be5acd35c6a\', \'multiverseId\': 431094}, \'multiverseid\': 431094}, {\'name\': \'Avemain intrépide\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Avemain intrépide attaque, dégagez une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'Dans le chaos créé par les nouveaux dieux, les avemains aux ailes prestes guidaient les derniers habitants pour les éloigner des ruines de Naktamon.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431293&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73485c16-8430-44b8-82ce-4daa22ff23f1\', \'multiverseId\': 431293}, \'multiverseid\': 431293}, {\'name\': \'Aviano Intrepido\', \'text\': "Volare\\nOgniqualvolta l\'Aviano Intrepido attacca, STAPpa una creatura bersaglio che controlli.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Uccello\', \'flavor\': \'Nel mezzo del caos scatenato dalle nuove divinità, gli aviani dalle rapide ali fungevano da apripista per condurre gli ultimi sopravvissuti lontano dalle rovine di Naktamun.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431492&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15c62bf7-9430-4b05-a94b-a81b787fa210\', \'multiverseId\': 431492}, \'multiverseid\': 431492}, {\'name\': \'不屈のエイヴン\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n不屈のエイヴンが攻撃するたび、あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'新たな神々がもたらした混沌の渦中で、素早い翼を持つエイヴンは廃墟となったナクタムンから生き残った人々を連れ出す先導となった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431691&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67e9fed4-8be2-4297-a7fd-fb57e679e559\', \'multiverseId\': 431691}, \'multiverseid\': 431691}, {\'name\': \'불굴의 에이븐\', \'text\': \'비행\\n불굴의 에이븐이 공격할 때마다, 당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 언탭한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 조류 전사\', \'flavor\': \'재빠른 에이븐들은 새로운 신들이 불러온 혼돈 속에서 마지막 생존자들을 폐허가 된 나크타문 밖으로 안내하며 길잡이 역할을 했다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431890&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f0a6e22-f6bf-4a80-bdd7-0d44e6c12d6f\', \'multiverseId\': 431890}, \'multiverseid\': 431890}, {\'name\': \'Aviano Intrépido\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que Aviano Intrépido atacar, desvire a criatura alvo que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'No caos gerado pelos novos deuses, os avianos de asas velozes serviram como desbravadores, guiando as últimas pessoas para fora das ruínas de Nactamon.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432089&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'857ecaf3-af07-4b31-a25d-aff3ece4cb5b\', \'multiverseId\': 432089}, \'multiverseid\': 432089}, {\'name\': \'Неустрашимый Авен\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз, когда Неустрашимый Авен атакует, разверните целевое существо под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Птица Воин\', \'flavor\': \'В разразившемся с явлением новых богов хаосе быстрокрылые авены стали проводниками, выводящими последних жителей из развалин Нактамуна.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432288&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9fc7a34-d530-485a-9c02-b1a38741c23f\', \'multiverseId\': 432288}, \'multiverseid\': 432288}, {\'name\': \'不屈艾文\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当不屈艾文攻击时，重置目标由你操控的生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～鸟／战士\', \'flavor\': \'在新神降临引致的混乱之中，身手敏捷的艾文率先当起探路先锋，引导遗民逃离拿塔蒙废墟。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432487&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5722ab62-3c78-4aef-b3da-3d696712b36b\', \'multiverseId\': 432487}, \'multiverseid\': 432487}, {\'name\': \'不屈艾文\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當不屈艾文攻擊時，重置目標由你操控的生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～鳥／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'在新神降臨引致的混亂之中，身手敏捷的艾文率先當起探路先鋒，引導遺民逃離拿塔蒙廢墟。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432686&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17ab7533-971c-4d68-bb33-b56b9aba1cac\', \'multiverseId\': 432686}, \'multiverseid\': 432686}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gabe der Stärke\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +3/+3 und Reichweite bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Rhonas ist tot, aber seine Lehren leben weiter."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431005&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a273aa96-9332-4fa4-9619-d815294edada\', \'multiverseId\': 431005}, \'multiverseid\': 431005}, {\'name\': \'Don de la fuerza\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +3/+3 y gana la habilidad de alcance hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Qué mayor testimonio puede haber de las lecciones de Rhonas?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431204&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08ed68f3-ea30-4c16-809b-99b348dbb9f9\', \'multiverseId\': 431204}, \'multiverseid\': 431204}, {\'name\': \'Don de force\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée gagne +3/+3 et acquiert la portée jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Quel meilleur testament les enseignements de Rhonas auraient-ils pu nous livrer ? »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431403&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b24f6d8-e815-495f-8786-046b47ffc5b8\', \'multiverseId\': 431403}, \'multiverseid\': 431403}, {\'name\': \'Dono della Forza\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende +3/+3 e ha raggiungere fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Quale miglior testimonianza degli insegnamenti di Rhonas?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431602&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d0e7a04-1aeb-4ad8-bd6d-682958ba0542\', \'multiverseId\': 431602}, \'multiverseid\': 431602}, {\'name\': \'活力の贈り物\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋３/＋３の修整を受けるとともに到達を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「ロナス様の教えを上回る証などあるでしょうか？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431801&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bef5707-141e-44c7-920e-370b2b1d6c2f\', \'multiverseId\': 431801}, \'multiverseid\': 431801}, {\'name\': \'힘의 선물\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +3/+3을 받고 대공을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"로나스의 가르침을 보여주는 증거 중에서 이보다 더 위대한 것이 있을까?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432000&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d859e5ac-e52e-4483-adb7-297a2d842227\', \'multiverseId\': 432000}, \'multiverseid\': 432000}, {\'name\': \'Dádiva da Força\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe +3/+3 e ganha alcance até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Que testemunho maior pode haver das lições de Rhonas?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432199&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e1fdbb1-9016-4584-8118-1ab808e66373\', \'multiverseId\': 432199}, \'multiverseid\': 432199}, {\'name\': \'Дар Силы\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо получает +3/+3 и Захват до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Есть ли более веское доказательство истинности уроков Ронаса?»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432398&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4386e140-c5e9-48e6-acae-f1ef28e2acba\', \'multiverseId\': 432398}, \'multiverseid\': 432398}, {\'name\': \'力量赋礼\', \'text\': \'直到回合结束，目标生物得+3/+3且获得延势异能。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「还有什么能比罗纳斯的教诲更伟大？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432597&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6b89c87-66c3-44e7-a1f3-f7398a9493b5\', \'multiverseId\': 432597}, \'multiverseid\': 432597}, {\'name\': \'力量賦禮\', \'text\': \'直到回合結束，目標生物得+3/+3且獲得延勢異能。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「還有什麼能比羅納斯的教誨更偉大？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432796&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cbd01c59-38c4-4542-a819-45fc957dda60\', \'multiverseId\': 432796}, \'multiverseid\': 432796}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gabe des Gott-Pharaos\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug kannst du eine Kreaturenkarte aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil schicken. Falls du dies tust, erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie jener Karte ist, außer dass er ein 4/4 schwarzer Zombie ist. Er erhält Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431049&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31814a58-a3fe-4ef2-bd29-c79be38f9e2c\', \'multiverseId\': 431049}, \'multiverseid\': 431049}, {\'name\': \'Obsequio del Dios Faraón\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo del combate en tu turno, puedes exiliar una carta de criatura de tu cementerio. Si lo haces, crea una ficha que es una copia de esa carta, excepto que es un Zombie negro 4/4. Gana la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431248&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01e54620-7cb3-460f-9164-41d10a5e83cb\', \'multiverseId\': 431248}, \'multiverseid\': 431248}, {\'name\': \'Don du Dieu-Pharaon\', \'text\': "Au début du combat pendant votre tour, vous pouvez exiler une carte de créature depuis votre cimetière. Si vous faites ainsi, créez un jeton qui est une copie de cette carte, excepté que c\'est un zombie 4/4 noir. Il acquiert la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431447&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebf613a9-0993-43ea-a009-bf51ce818fec\', \'multiverseId\': 431447}, \'multiverseid\': 431447}, {\'name\': \'Dono del Dio Faraone\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, puoi esiliare una carta creatura dal tuo cimitero. Se lo fai, crea una pedina che è una copia della carta, tranne che è uno Zombie 4/4 nero. Ha rapidità fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431646&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b34b2bd2-3e1a-4254-bf9d-23b85361febe\', \'multiverseId\': 431646}, \'multiverseid\': 431646}, {\'name\': \'王神の贈り物\', \'text\': \'あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、あなたはあなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚を追放してもよい。そうしたなら、黒の４/４のゾンビであることを除きそのカードのコピーであるトークンを１体生成する。ターン終了時まで、それは速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431845&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9fa3b64-f983-47b7-b832-edff1dd12af7\', \'multiverseId\': 431845}, \'multiverseid\': 431845}, {\'name\': \'신 파라오의 선물\', \'text\': \'당신 턴의 전투 시작에, 당신은 당신의 무덤에서 생물 카드 한 장을 추방할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 그 카드의 복사본이지만 4/4 흑색 좀비인 토큰 한 개를 만든다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 신속을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432044&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72af5661-da8b-4712-b39a-3dd9e5878169\', \'multiverseId\': 432044}, \'multiverseid\': 432044}, {\'name\': \'Dádiva do Faraó-Deus\', \'text\': \'No início do combate no seu turno, você pode exilar um card de criatura de seu cemitério. Se fizer isso, crie uma ficha que seja uma cópia daquele card, com a exceção de ser um Zumbi preto 4/4. Ela ganha ímpeto até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432243&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e99f89e-ce10-426d-8845-d2ec981dc1a0\', \'multiverseId\': 432243}, \'multiverseid\': 432243}, {\'name\': \'Дар Бога-Фараона\', \'text\': \'В начале боя во время вашего хода вы можете изгнать карту существа из вашего кладбища. Если вы это делаете, создайте фишку, являющуюся копией той карты, но при этом являющуюся черным Зомби 4/4. Она получает Ускорение до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432442&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f100988-954f-488c-80bd-7990519f2fea\', \'multiverseId\': 432442}, \'multiverseid\': 432442}, {\'name\': \'法老神赋礼\', \'text\': \'在你回合的战斗开始时，你可以从你的坟墓场放逐一张生物牌。若你如此作，则派出一个衍生物，该衍生物为所放逐之牌的复制品，但它是4/4黑色灵俑。它获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432641&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d26d9ca-761c-4f07-8250-ccde069a3f31\', \'multiverseId\': 432641}, \'multiverseid\': 432641}, {\'name\': \'法老神賦禮\', \'text\': \'在你回合的戰鬥開始時，你可以從你的墳墓場放逐一張生物牌。若你如此作，則派出一個衍生物，該衍生物為所放逐之牌的複製品，但它是4/4黑色殭屍。它獲得敏捷異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432840&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'092217df-fa1b-4cc0-8988-9f4549f7cb30\', \'multiverseId\': 432840}, \'multiverseid\': 432840}]', "[{'name': 'Gebirge', 'type': 'Standardland — Gebirge', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431076&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6a05dcae-d34e-466e-80e5-1e9d9080b08e', 'multiverseId': 431076}, 'multiverseid': 431076}, {'name': 'Montaña', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Montaña', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431275&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7a05a455-1816-4741-b5bf-1c16c24641ed', 'multiverseId': 431275}, 'multiverseid': 431275}, {'name': 'Montagne', 'type': 'Terrain de base : montagne', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431474&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '27609a5c-991b-41fb-92ee-3c4a5961bf73', 'multiverseId': 431474}, 'multiverseid': 431474}, {'name': 'Montagna', 'type': 'Terra Base — Montagna', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431673&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2806c8ac-1314-491b-9e95-d3e93fb1e149', 'multiverseId': 431673}, 'multiverseid': 431673}, {'name': '山', 'type': '基本土地 — 山', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431872&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '814ceea1-aae1-4358-acf8-6f9a9c94f3c6', 'multiverseId': 431872}, 'multiverseid': 431872}, {'name': '산', 'type': '기본 대지 — 산', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432071&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '58dcceed-8063-4439-acea-03da1a6484bf', 'multiverseId': 432071}, 'multiverseid': 432071}, {'name': 'Montanha', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Montanha', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432270&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0bab8397-420c-4495-9f85-1af8b4155f96', 'multiverseId': 432270}, 'multiverseid': 432270}, {'name': 'Гора', 'type': 'Базовая Земля — Гора', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432469&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '28c13eba-dcb9-4889-90d6-f29ca71e455a', 'multiverseId': 432469}, 'multiverseid': 432469}, {'name': '山脉', 'type': '基本地～山脉', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432668&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '53f8aa20-671a-481d-8d8c-9616234a3b73', 'multiverseId': 432668}, 'multiverseid': 432668}, {'name': '山脈', 'type': '基本地～山脈', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432867&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fe286deb-fb08-4c02-9709-f943e2acdc91', 'multiverseId': 432867}, 'multiverseid': 432867}]", "[{'name': 'Gebirge', 'type': 'Standardland — Gebirge', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431084&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'abd847a7-e270-40e0-b250-b1a2a4bfcfd1', 'multiverseId': 431084}, 'multiverseid': 431084}, {'name': 'Montaña', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Montaña', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431283&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '99063adb-87b1-4711-919c-008a5b0bba74', 'multiverseId': 431283}, 'multiverseid': 431283}, {'name': 'Montagne', 'type': 'Terrain de base : montagne', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431482&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8ccedd84-936d-4b8f-a2a2-6ee21974b719', 'multiverseId': 431482}, 'multiverseid': 431482}, {'name': 'Montagna', 'type': 'Terra Base — Montagna', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431681&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e01928de-acdf-44fe-ab15-6f846df5ed61', 'multiverseId': 431681}, 'multiverseid': 431681}, {'name': '山', 'type': '基本土地 — 山', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431880&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '648ebb08-39f1-4db6-a3b4-3baf570b5bc2', 'multiverseId': 431880}, 'multiverseid': 431880}, {'name': '산', 'type': '기본 대지 — 산', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432079&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5fc52c71-a2c3-4bb3-9d9b-34e934154a0f', 'multiverseId': 432079}, 'multiverseid': 432079}, {'name': 'Montanha', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Montanha', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432278&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '03c5790a-0e95-4e82-8ac6-ffceaff4ea22', 'multiverseId': 432278}, 'multiverseid': 432278}, {'name': 'Гора', 'type': 'Базовая Земля — Гора', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432477&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eb6a9124-9456-47fd-9669-8a5da832ba0a', 'multiverseId': 432477}, 'multiverseid': 432477}, {'name': '山脉', 'type': '基本地～山脉', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432676&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6ff11e69-f745-4a8c-a31e-288eaf3ec553', 'multiverseId': 432676}, 'multiverseid': 432676}, {'name': '山脈', 'type': '基本地～山脈', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432875&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4f5d1693-fc78-49dd-a176-b0ef7df7d7e4', 'multiverseId': 432875}, 'multiverseid': 432875}]", "[{'name': 'Gebirge', 'type': 'Standardland — Gebirge', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431085&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e27bd907-03b5-48af-98e1-a68769836091', 'multiverseId': 431085}, 'multiverseid': 431085}, {'name': 'Montaña', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Montaña', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431284&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '43b885ec-73cd-4cde-af06-ca8f935a140f', 'multiverseId': 431284}, 'multiverseid': 431284}, {'name': 'Montagne', 'type': 'Terrain de base : montagne', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431483&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd0478d2e-cd11-4b0c-b4f5-5af227f2fa86', 'multiverseId': 431483}, 'multiverseid': 431483}, {'name': 'Montagna', 'type': 'Terra Base — Montagna', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431682&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5506c517-6eec-4200-b0f5-f3eab1fa4d73', 'multiverseId': 431682}, 'multiverseid': 431682}, {'name': '山', 'type': '基本土地 — 山', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431881&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2efb0b1a-a217-4039-92c8-9eba38a4a929', 'multiverseId': 431881}, 'multiverseid': 431881}, {'name': '산', 'type': '기본 대지 — 산', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432080&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '912ec741-de01-4108-ab5f-b11f49318e49', 'multiverseId': 432080}, 'multiverseid': 432080}, {'name': 'Montanha', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Montanha', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432279&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ba9b94b7-0b54-4ada-99aa-72f40c0870b8', 'multiverseId': 432279}, 'multiverseid': 432279}, {'name': 'Гора', 'type': 'Базовая Земля — Гора', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432478&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fda95224-1d15-4d15-a5ea-800694859de3', 'multiverseId': 432478}, 'multiverseid': 432478}, {'name': '山脉', 'type': '基本地～山脉', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432677&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'feb9750f-91be-48c0-976e-0482d7feb90b', 'multiverseId': 432677}, 'multiverseid': 432677}, {'name': '山脈', 'type': '基本地～山脈', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432876&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '238c6deb-26aa-4019-bca5-167d1049cae4', 'multiverseId': 432876}, 'multiverseid': 432876}]", '[{\'name\': \'Geschmückte Raubkatze\', \'text\': \'Doppelschlag\\nVerewigen {3}{W}{W} ({3}{W}{W}, schicke diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil: Erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie von ihr ist, außer dass er eine 4/4 schwarze Zombie-Katze ohne Manakosten ist. Spiele Verewigen wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=430890&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f951c54-6f26-4628-b0af-d342fcaed1f2\', \'multiverseId\': 430890}, \'multiverseid\': 430890}, {\'name\': \'Acechador ornamentado\', \'text\': \'Daña dos veces.\\nEternizar {3}{W}{W}. ({3}{W}{W}, exiliar esta carta de tu cementerio: Crea una ficha que es una copia de esta carta, excepto que es un Felino Zombie negro 4/4 sin coste de maná. Activa la habilidad de eternizar solo como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431089&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95a3f8fe-2f7e-433a-81c3-5c6c86757204\', \'multiverseId\': 431089}, \'multiverseid\': 431089}, {\'name\': \'Bondisseur paré\', \'text\': "Double initiative\\nÉternalisation {3}{W}{W} ({3}{W}{W}, exilez cette carte de votre cimetière : Créez un jeton qui en est une copie, excepté que c\'est un zombie et chat 4/4 noir sans coût de mana. N\'utilisez l\'éternalisation que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Créature : chat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431288&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a50eddcb-1f70-4038-93a9-a9074f937e36\', \'multiverseId\': 431288}, \'multiverseid\': 431288}, {\'name\': \'Assalitore Ornato\', \'text\': \'Doppio attacco\\nEternare {3}{W}{W} ({3}{W}{W}, Esilia questa carta dal tuo cimitero: Crea una pedina che è una copia della carta, tranne che è un Felino Zombie 4/4 nero senza costo di mana. Eterna solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431487&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74d330b7-a160-4f1d-8821-e01b66019fd4\', \'multiverseId\': 431487}, \'multiverseid\': 431487}, {\'name\': \'典雅な襲撃者\', \'text\': \'二段攻撃\\n永遠{3}{W}{W}（{3}{W}{W}, あなたの墓地からこのカードを追放する：マナ・コストを持たない黒の４/４のゾンビ・猫であることを除きこれのコピーであるトークンを１体生成する。永遠はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431686&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aab49f98-4e64-4491-a58c-ac769efd9b64\', \'multiverseId\': 431686}, \'multiverseid\': 431686}, {\'name\': \'치장한 맹수\', \'text\': \'이단공격\\n영생화 {3}{W}{W} ({3}{W}{W}, 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 추방한다: 이 카드의 복사본이지만 마나 비용이 없는 4/4 흑색 좀비 고양이인 토큰 한 개를 만든다. 당신이 집중마법을 발동할 수 있는 시기에만 영생화를 할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 고양이\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431885&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54c4f37d-c549-4ba6-9e4f-83cfd286a815\', \'multiverseId\': 431885}, \'multiverseid\': 431885}, {\'name\': \'Saltador Adornado\', \'text\': \'Golpe duplo\\nEternizar {3}{W}{W} ({3}{W}{W}, exile este card de seu cemitério: Crie uma ficha que seja uma cópia dele, com a exceção de ser um Zumbi Felino preto 4/4 sem custo de mana. Eternize somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432084&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d21230f-a07f-4457-b154-5fde79314706\', \'multiverseId\': 432084}, \'multiverseid\': 432084}, {\'name\': \'Украшенная Хищница\', \'text\': \'Двойной удар\\nУвековечивание {3}{W}{W} ({3}{W}{W}, изгоните эту карту из вашего кладбища: создайте фишку, являющуюся ее копией, но при этом являющуюся черной Зомби Кошкой 4/4 без мана-стоимости. Увековечивайте только как волшебство.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кошка\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432283&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdb09df5-5c5a-4e3e-8cb8-530dc5853ac8\', \'multiverseId\': 432283}, \'multiverseid\': 432283}, {\'name\': \'佩饰扑击猫\', \'text\': \'连击\\n永生{3}{W}{W}（{3}{W}{W}，从你的坟墓场放逐此牌：派出一个衍生物，且为此牌的复制品，但它是4/4黑色灵俑／猫，且没有法术力费用。永生的时机视同法术。）\', \'type\': \'生物～猫\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432482&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e012035f-cfb8-436b-8d94-8a5baf039c5e\', \'multiverseId\': 432482}, \'multiverseid\': 432482}, {\'name\': \'佩飾撲擊貓\', \'text\': \'連擊\\n永生{3}{W}{W}（{3}{W}{W}，從你的墳墓場放逐此牌：派出一個衍生物，且為此牌的複製品，但它是4/4黑色殭屍／貓，且沒有魔法力費用。永生的時機視同巫術。）\', \'type\': \'生物～貓\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432681&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f6f51bb-39d7-4f1c-8877-e4df8dbbb2d6\', \'multiverseId\': 432681}, \'multiverseid\': 432681}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gestreifte Flussschlange\', \'text\': \'Fluchsicher (Diese Kreatur kann nicht das Ziel von Zaubersprüchen oder Fähigkeiten sein, die deine Gegner kontrollieren.)\\nUmwandlung {U} ({U}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Schlange\', \'flavor\': \'Blut ergoss sich in den Luxa und seine Bewohner sahen rot.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=430936&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d588c6d-dfb4-4b7a-babf-707507a70d29\', \'multiverseId\': 430936}, \'multiverseid\': 430936}, {\'name\': \'Deslizador de río listado\', \'text\': \'Antimaleficio. (Esta criatura no puede ser objetivo de hechizos o habilidades que controlen tus oponentes.)\\nCiclo {U}. ({U}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Serpiente\', \'flavor\': \'Las corrientes de sangre enfurecieron a los habitantes del río Luxa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431135&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4e0fbd9-7fb4-4464-bbfc-d5e08f6d1022\', \'multiverseId\': 431135}, \'multiverseid\': 431135}, {\'name\': \'Crotale des rivières tigré\', \'text\': \'Défense talismanique (Cette créature ne peut pas être la cible de sorts ou de capacités que vos adversaires contrôlent.)\\nRecyclage {U} ({U}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : grand serpent\', \'flavor\': "Les occupants du Luxa s\'éveillèrent, furieux au cœur des courants ensanglantés.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431334&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14c8e092-d153-4ebe-87e7-bf61e5549c87\', \'multiverseId\': 431334}, \'multiverseid\': 431334}, {\'name\': \'Rivospiro Striato\', \'text\': \'Anti-malocchio (Questa creatura non può essere bersaglio di magie o abilità controllate dai tuoi avversari.)\\nCiclo {U} ({U}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Serpe\', \'flavor\': \'Le creature che popolavano il Luxa si risvegliarono furiose per le correnti di sangue.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431533&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69a550db-dc7a-4ca4-a967-ebb14b272511\', \'multiverseId\': 431533}, \'multiverseid\': 431533}, {\'name\': \'縞カワヘビ\', \'text\': \'呪禁（このクリーチャーは、対戦相手がコントロールする呪文や能力の対象にならない。）\\nサイクリング{U}（{U}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 海蛇\', \'flavor\': \'ルクサ川の生き物は、血の流れにより気が立っている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431732&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98a00bc3-ca1a-4bcc-8957-d623561c4e66\', \'multiverseId\': 431732}, \'multiverseid\': 431732}, {\'name\': \'줄무늬 구불이무기\', \'text\': \'방호 (이 생물은 상대가 조종하는 주문이나 능력의 목표로 정해질 수 없다.)\\n순환 {U} ({U}, 이 카드를 버린다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 이무기\', \'flavor\': \'럭사 강의 생물들이 피로 물든 강물 속에서 격노하며 깨어났다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431931&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a485360-52a6-4fca-a5fd-e8098c684b00\', \'multiverseId\': 431931}, \'multiverseid\': 431931}, {\'name\': \'Cascavel-do-rio Listrada\', \'text\': \'Resistência a magia (Esta criatura não pode ser alvo de mágicas ou habilidades controladas por seus oponentes.)\\nReciclar {U} ({U}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Serpente\', \'flavor\': \'Os habitantes do Rio Luxa despertaram furiosos nas correntes de sangue.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'deb70181-bf76-46a1-a8ef-9030201a671b\', \'multiverseId\': 432130}, \'multiverseid\': 432130}, {\'name\': \'Полосатый Речной Змей\', \'text\': \'Порчеустойчивость (Это существо не может быть целью заклинаний или способностей под контролем ваших оппонентов.)\\nЦикл {U} ({U}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Змей\', \'flavor\': \'Обитатели реки Лукса беснуются в ее кровавых водах.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432329&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e48db039-9ec0-41e5-a7a9-abfe81847dbe\', \'multiverseId\': 432329}, \'multiverseid\': 432329}, {\'name\': \'斑纹河蛇\', \'text\': \'辟邪（此生物不能成为由对手操控之咒语或异能的目标。）\\n循环{U}（{U}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）\', \'type\': \'生物～巨蛇\', \'flavor\': \'血腥的河水让罗夏河中的生物暴怒而醒。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432528&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e92233c1-fefb-4297-9545-5f5ca7650033\', \'multiverseId\': 432528}, \'multiverseid\': 432528}, {\'name\': \'斑紋河蛇\', \'text\': \'辟邪（此生物不能成為由對手操控之咒語或異能的目標。）\\n循環{U}（{U}，棄掉此牌：抽一張牌。）\', \'type\': \'生物～巨蛇\', \'flavor\': \'血腥的河水讓羅夏河中的生物暴怒而醒。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432727&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea3470e0-4bda-4f1d-852b-2ada514fd2c5\', \'multiverseId\': 432727}, \'multiverseid\': 432727}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gewundene Plänklerin\', \'text\': \'{U}: Die Gewundene Plänklerin erhält +1/-1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nVerewigen—{3}{U}{U}, wirf eine Karte ab. ({3}{U}{U}, wirf eine Karte ab, schicke diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil: Erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie von ihr ist, außer dass er ein 4/4 schwarzer Zombie-Naga-Krieger ohne Manakosten ist. Spiele Verewigen wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Naga, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=430933&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ec1872a-a799-4f85-87b3-79bd5adf7299\', \'multiverseId\': 430933}, \'multiverseid\': 430933}, {\'name\': \'Atacante sinuosa\', \'text\': \'{U}: La Atacante sinuosa obtiene +1/-1 hasta el final del turno.\\nEternizar — {3}{U}{U}, descartar una carta. ({3}{U}{U}, descartar una carta, exiliar esta carta de tu cementerio: Crea una ficha que es una copia de esta carta, excepto que es un Guerrero Naga Zombie negro 4/4 sin coste de maná. Activa la habilidad de eternizar solo como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero naga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431132&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7dd495a-0413-433b-ae11-5e764fed2f4a\', \'multiverseId\': 431132}, \'multiverseid\': 431132}, {\'name\': \'Frappeuse sinueuse\', \'text\': "{U} : La Frappeuse sinueuse gagne +1/-1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nÉternalisation — {3}{U}{U}, défaussez-vous d\'une carte. ({3}{U}{U}, défaussez-vous d\'une carte, exilez cette carte de votre cimetière : Créez un jeton qui en est une copie, excepté que c\'est un zombie et naga et guerrier 4/4 noir sans coût de mana. N\'utilisez l\'éternalisation que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Créature : naga et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431331&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'994a3009-a08e-4e4a-829b-74ea9c4aad25\', \'multiverseId\': 431331}, \'multiverseid\': 431331}, {\'name\': \'Assalitrice Sinuosa\', \'text\': "{U}: L\'Assalitrice Sinuosa prende +1/-1 fino alla fine del turno.\\nEternare—{3}{U}{U}, Scarta una carta. ({3}{U}{U}, Scarta una carta, Esilia questa carta dal tuo cimitero: Crea una pedina che è una copia di questa carta, tranne che è un Guerriero Naga Zombie 4/4 nero senza costo di mana. Eterna solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Naga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431530&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8ad097b-6364-4c5b-9083-0171c140cb22\', \'multiverseId\': 431530}, \'multiverseid\': 431530}, {\'name\': \'しなやかな打撃者\', \'text\': \'{U}：ターン終了時まで、しなやかな打撃者は＋１/－１の修整を受ける。\\n永遠―{3}{U}{U}, カード１枚を捨てる。（{3}{U}{U}, カード１枚を捨てる, あなたの墓地からこのカードを追放する：マナ・コストを持たない黒の４/４のゾンビ・ナーガ・戦士であることを除きこれのコピーであるトークンを１体生成する。永遠はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ナーガ・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431729&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58e5d1ab-72bf-4c38-8c2b-58debff7e502\', \'multiverseId\': 431729}, \'multiverseid\': 431729}, {\'name\': \'물결치는 타격수\', \'text\': \'{U}: 물결치는 타격수는 턴종료까지 +1/-1을 받는다.\\n영생화—{3}{U}{U}, 카드 한 장을 버린다. ({3}{U}{U}, 카드 한 장을 버린다, 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 추방한다: 이 카드의 복사본이지만 마나 비용이 없는 4/4 흑색 좀비 나가 전사인 토큰 한 개를 만든다. 당신이 집중마법을 발동할 수 있는 시기에만 영생화를 할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 나가 전사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431928&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25d9540f-ad60-481a-9eda-03583e68a3e4\', \'multiverseId\': 431928}, \'multiverseid\': 431928}, {\'name\': \'Golpeadora Sinuosa\', \'text\': \'{U}: Golpeadora Sinuosa recebe +1/-1 até o final do turno.\\nEternizar — {3}{U}{U}, descarte um card. ({3}{U}{U}, descarte um card, exile este card de seu cemitério: Crie uma ficha que seja uma cópia dele, com a exceção de ser um Zumbi Naga Guerreiro preto 4/4 sem custo de mana. Eternize somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Naga Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432127&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aed4651d-fad1-4b2c-bcd7-ff38a99cac0e\', \'multiverseId\': 432127}, \'multiverseid\': 432127}, {\'name\': \'Извилистая Воительница\', \'text\': \'{U}: Извилистая Воительница получает +1/-1 до конца хода.\\nУвековечивание — {3}{U}{U}, сбросьте карту. ({3}{U}{U}, сбросьте карту, изгоните эту карту из вашего кладбища: создайте фишку, являющуюся ее копией, но при этом являющуюся черным Зомби Нагой Воином 4/4 без мана-стоимости. Увековечивайте только как волшебство.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Нага Воин\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432326&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87d42501-5dd3-47a7-a2cf-faaa9489d4a0\', \'multiverseId\': 432326}, \'multiverseid\': 432326}, {\'name\': \'蜷曲打击手\', \'text\': \'{U}：蜷曲打击手得+1/-1直到回合结束。\\n永生～{3}{U}{U}，弃一张牌。（{3}{U}{U}，弃一张牌，从你的坟墓场放逐此牌：派出一个衍生物，且为此牌的复制品，但它是4/4黑色灵俑／那伽／战士，且没有法术力费用。永生的时机视同法术。）\', \'type\': \'生物～那伽／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432525&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6a4162d-07a7-4681-8a04-6d1b3499f36d\', \'multiverseId\': 432525}, \'multiverseid\': 432525}, {\'name\': \'蜷曲打擊手\', \'text\': \'{U}：蜷曲打擊手得+1/-1直到回合結束。\\n永生～{3}{U}{U}，棄一張牌。（{3}{U}{U}，棄一張牌，從你的墳墓場放逐此牌：派出一個衍生物，且為此牌的複製品，但它是4/4黑色殭屍／那伽／戰士，且沒有魔法力費用。永生的時機視同巫術。）\', \'type\': \'生物～那伽／戰士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432724&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'984b7482-4b67-4397-bcef-be21f5f5211a\', \'multiverseId\': 432724}, \'multiverseid\': 432724}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geübte Kämpferin\', \'text\': \'Verewigen {4}{U}{U} ({4}{U}{U}, schicke diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil: Erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie von ihr ist, außer dass er ein 4/4 schwarzer Zombie-Mensch-Krieger ohne Manakosten ist. Spiele Verewigen wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Ruhm wartet auf niemanden."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=430930&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41670b96-06e6-41fb-975c-75e0f658de7f\', \'multiverseId\': 430930}, \'multiverseid\': 430930}, {\'name\': \'Combatiente curtida\', \'text\': \'Eternizar {4}{U}{U}. ({4}{U}{U}, exiliar esta carta de tu cementerio: Crea una ficha que es una copia de esta carta, excepto que es un Guerrero Humano Zombie negro 4/4 sin coste de maná. Activa la habilidad de eternizar solo como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Es una insensatez hacer esperar a la gloria".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431129&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'602cedc3-286e-4b74-a8b9-30b378a4c14c\', \'multiverseId\': 431129}, \'multiverseid\': 431129}, {\'name\': \'Combattante éprouvée\', \'text\': "Éternalisation {4}{U}{U} ({4}{U}{U}, exilez cette carte de votre cimetière : Créez un jeton qui en est une copie, excepté que c\'est un zombie et humain et guerrier 4/4 noir sans coût de mana. N\'utilisez l\'éternalisation que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "« Il n\'est pas sage de faire attendre la gloire. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431328&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'361bc4e2-e162-4703-bc63-3d1d1491c876\', \'multiverseId\': 431328}, \'multiverseid\': 431328}, {\'name\': \'Combattente Provetta\', \'text\': \'Eternare {4}{U}{U} ({4}{U}{U}, Esilia questa carta dal tuo cimitero: Crea una pedina che è una copia della carta, tranne che è un Guerriero Umano Zombie 4/4 nero senza costo di mana. Eterna solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Non è saggio lasciar attendere la gloria."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431527&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f092726d-1e53-48ae-9aca-1b40a60af4d8\', \'multiverseId\': 431527}, \'multiverseid\': 431527}, {\'name\': \'実績ある戦闘員\', \'text\': \'永遠{4}{U}{U}（{4}{U}{U}, あなたの墓地からこのカードを追放する：マナ・コストを持たない黒の４/４のゾンビ・人間・戦士であることを除きこれのコピーであるトークンを１体生成する。永遠はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「栄光を先送りにするものじゃないわ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431726&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'582b02ca-5046-41be-8f5d-d4ca2c044657\', \'multiverseId\': 431726}, \'multiverseid\': 431726}, {\'name\': \'실력을 증명한 전투병\', \'text\': \'영생화 {4}{U}{U} ({4}{U}{U}, 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 추방한다: 이 카드의 복사본이지만 마나 비용이 없는 4/4 흑색 좀비 인간 전사인 토큰 한 개를 만든다. 당신이 집중마법을 발동할 수 있는 시기에만 영생화를 할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 전사\', \'flavor\': \'"영광을 기다리게만 하는 것은 현명하지 않다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431925&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5951f991-4dd2-4e00-bc17-7df17c12d373\', \'multiverseId\': 431925}, \'multiverseid\': 431925}, {\'name\': \'Combatente Incontestável\', \'text\': \'Eternizar {4}{U}{U} ({4}{U}{U}, exile este card de seu cemitério: Crie uma ficha que seja uma cópia dele, com a exceção de ser um Zumbi Humano Guerreiro preto 4/4 sem custo de mana. Eternize somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Não é sábio deixar a glória esperando."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e07d6a7-ea1d-4357-9e78-e83fb199be48\', \'multiverseId\': 432124}, \'multiverseid\': 432124}, {\'name\': \'Испытанная Воительница\', \'text\': \'Увековечивание {4}{U}{U} ({4}{U}{U}, изгоните эту карту из вашего кладбища: создайте фишку, являющуюся ее копией, но при этом являющуюся черным Зомби Человеком Воином 4/4 без мана-стоимости. Увековечивайте только как волшебство.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Воин\', \'flavor\': \'«Не стоит заставлять славу ждать».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432323&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'961b200f-62c5-4dd8-bfa1-92737638f71c\', \'multiverseId\': 432323}, \'multiverseid\': 432323}, {\'name\': \'历练战士\', \'text\': \'永生{4}{U}{U}（{4}{U}{U}，从你的坟墓场放逐此牌：派出一个衍生物，且为此牌的复制品，但它是4/4黑色灵俑／人类／战士，且没有法术力费用。永生的时机视同法术。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「让荣耀久等并不明智。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432522&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8eb31de3-1836-4cb1-bfd5-2aaec24ce349\', \'multiverseId\': 432522}, \'multiverseid\': 432522}, {\'name\': \'歷練戰士\', \'text\': \'永生{4}{U}{U}（{4}{U}{U}，從你的墳墓場放逐此牌：派出一個衍生物，且為此牌的複製品，但它是4/4黑色殭屍／人類／戰士，且沒有魔法力費用。永生的時機視同巫術。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'「讓榮耀久等並不明智。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432721&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'782bee95-e237-4af5-953f-f233cb3be131\', \'multiverseId\': 432721}, \'multiverseid\': 432721}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gideons Niederlage\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine angreifende oder blockende weiße Kreatur deiner Wahl ins Exil. Falls die Kreatur ein Gideon-Planeswalker war, erhältst du 5 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Gideon, wie wenig doch von dir übrig bleibt, wenn man dir die Illusion der Unantastbarkeit nimmt." —Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=430901&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37b0adc1-3ecd-4109-b1c4-47a48190112d\', \'multiverseId\': 430901}, \'multiverseid\': 430901}, {\'name\': \'Derrota de Gideon\', \'text\': \'Exilia la criatura blanca objetivo que esté atacando o bloqueando. Si era un planeswalker Gideon, ganas 5 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Gideon, qué fácil debe de ser jugar a ser el protector creyéndote intocable. Cuán equivocado estás". —Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431100&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74bd92d8-ed0b-4d80-a197-ed3b9ca3d3b0\', \'multiverseId\': 431100}, \'multiverseid\': 431100}, {\'name\': \'Défaite de Gideon\', \'text\': "Exilez une créature blanche ciblée qui attaque ou qui bloque. Si c\'était un planeswalker Gideon, vous gagnez 5 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Ah Gideon, qu\'il doit t\'être facile de jouer les protecteurs quand tu te crois invulnérable. Mais tu ne l\'es pas. » —Nicol Bolas", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431299&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54b72afd-3340-4075-9195-66671a5fb2b9\', \'multiverseId\': 431299}, \'multiverseid\': 431299}, {\'name\': \'Sconfitta di Gideon\', \'text\': \'Esilia una creatura bianca bersaglio attaccante o bloccante. Se era un planeswalker Gideon, guadagni 5 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Gideon, dev\\\'essere davvero facile giocare a fare il paladino quando ti credi intoccabile. Povero illuso." —Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431498&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45f5c3b0-27e2-407f-a607-567fd717b72e\', \'multiverseId\': 431498}, \'multiverseid\': 431498}, {\'name\': \'ギデオンの敗北\', \'text\': \'攻撃かブロックしている白のクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを追放する。それがギデオン・プレインズウォーカーであるなら、あなたは５点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「ギデオンよ。自分が無敵と思えば、庇護者を気取るのもたやすいだろう。愚かなことだ。」 ――ニコル・ボーラス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431697&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d03a70bf-af64-4cf2-8698-653574dff1b5\', \'multiverseId\': 431697}, \'multiverseid\': 431697}, {\'name\': \'기디온의 패배\', \'text\': \'공격하거나 방어하는 백색 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 추방한다. 그 생물이 기디온 플레인즈워커라면, 당신은 생명 5점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"기디온, 네게 범접할 존재가 없다고 생각하며 수호자 노릇을 할 때가 좋았겠지. 참으로 어리석은 생각이지 않았나." —니콜 볼라스\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431896&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d0495eb-630e-4761-bad8-5d72e1805572\', \'multiverseId\': 431896}, \'multiverseid\': 431896}, {\'name\': \'Derrota de Gideon\', \'text\': \'Exile a criatura branca alvo que esteja atacando ou bloqueando. Se ela era um planeswalker Gideon, você ganha 5 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Gideon, é muito fácil brincar de protetor quando você acredita ser intocável. Você não podia estar mais errado!" — Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432095&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5a5b902-90ca-4d8e-9e26-1fdb71fda289\', \'multiverseId\': 432095}, \'multiverseid\': 432095}, {\'name\': \'Поражение Гидеона\', \'text\': \'Изгоните целевое белое атакующее или блокирующее существо. Если это был planeswalker Гидеон, вы получаете 5 жизней.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Как, должно быть, легко было изображать защитника, когда ты думал, что неуязвим, Гидеон. И как же ты ошибался». — Никол Болас\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432294&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'899d4c6b-2ec8-4157-929b-f565b648b1e1\', \'multiverseId\': 432294}, \'multiverseid\': 432294}, {\'name\': \'基定败退\', \'text\': \'放逐目标进行攻击或阻挡的白色生物。如果它是基定鹏洛客，则你获得5点生命。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「基定，你以为没人能够伤你分毫，就能够去保护别人？大错特错。」 ～尼可波拉斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432493&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a72030b-b31c-4e7b-b442-a3774f5b9ced\', \'multiverseId\': 432493}, \'multiverseid\': 432493}, {\'name\': \'基定敗退\', \'text\': \'放逐目標進行攻擊或阻擋的白色生物。如果它是基定鵬洛客，則你獲得5點生命。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「基定，你以為沒人能夠傷你分毫，就能夠去保護別人？大錯特錯。」 ～尼可波拉斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432692&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a9968e9-dbf7-4b0d-ab87-dbc65cddf1d0\', \'multiverseId\': 432692}, \'multiverseid\': 432692}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gnadenloser Verewigter\', \'text\': \'Pestilenz 2 (Immer wenn diese Kreatur geblockt wird, verliert der verteidigende Spieler 2 Lebenspunkte.)\\n{2}{B}, wirf eine Karte ab: Der Gnadenlose Verewigte erhält +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Bewohner dieser Welt haben alles gegeben, was sie geben konnten. Vernichtet sie." —Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=430959&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d3365c3-91f9-48f9-b750-01629f39629a\', \'multiverseId\': 430959}, \'multiverseid\': 430959}, {\'name\': \'Eterno despiadado\', \'text\': \'Afligir 2. (Siempre que esta criatura sea bloqueada, el jugador defensor pierde 2 vidas.)\\n{2}{B}, descartar una carta: El Eterno despiadado obtiene +2/+2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"Mi trabajo aquí ha concluido. Todos han hecho lo que se les pedía". —Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431158&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'557439f6-a6f2-4766-b314-b472cef08f60\', \'multiverseId\': 431158}, \'multiverseid\': 431158}, {\'name\': \'Éternel impitoyable\', \'text\': "Affliction 2 (À chaque fois que cette créature devient bloquée, le joueur défenseur perd 2 points de vie.)\\n{2}{B}, défaussez-vous d\'une carte : L\'Éternel impitoyable gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : zombie et clerc\', \'flavor\': "« Mon travail ici est terminé. Le peuple a fait tout ce que j\'attendais de lui. » —Nicol Bolas", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431357&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30b7a3dd-3876-4ca6-ac4a-95a050b079d2\', \'multiverseId\': 431357}, \'multiverseid\': 431357}, {\'name\': \'Eterno Spietato\', \'text\': "Affliggere 2 (Ogniqualvolta questa creatura viene bloccata, il giocatore in difesa perde 2 punti vita.)\\n{2}{B}, Scarta una carta: L\'Eterno Spietato prende +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"La mia opera qui è compiuta. Il popolo ha fatto quanto gli era stato richiesto." —Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431556&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'986bfeac-5c06-4f57-83ad-145412346816\', \'multiverseId\': 431556}, \'multiverseid\': 431556}, {\'name\': \'無慈悲な永遠衆\', \'text\': \'加虐２（このクリーチャーがブロックされた状態になるたび、防御プレイヤーは２点のライフを失う。）\\n{2}{B}, カード１枚を捨てる：ターン終了時まで、無慈悲な永遠衆は＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'「ここでの我の仕事は終わった。ここの者どもの役目も終わった。」 ――ニコル・ボーラス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431755&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27e0ab0e-27df-4227-ac86-f18445a38272\', \'multiverseId\': 431755}, \'multiverseid\': 431755}, {\'name\': \'무자비한 영생자\', \'text\': \'통증 2 (이 생물이 방어될 때마다, 수비플레이어는 생명 2점을 잃는다.)\\n{2}{B}, 카드 한 장을 버린다: 무자비한 영생자는 턴종료까지 +2/+2를 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 좀비 성직자\', \'flavor\': \'"이곳에서의 내 과업은 완료되었다. 사람들이 그들이 해야 할 모든 것을 완수했다." —니콜 볼라스\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431954&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'454aaab8-8284-4607-bffd-befe08a7665a\', \'multiverseId\': 431954}, \'multiverseid\': 431954}, {\'name\': \'Eterno Impiedoso\', \'text\': \'Afligir 2 (Toda vez que esta criatura se torna bloqueada, o jogador defensor perde 2 pontos de vida.)\\n{2}{B}, descarte um card: Eterno Impiedoso recebe +2/+2 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi Clérigo\', \'flavor\': \'"Meu trabalho aqui está completo. O povo fez tudo o que lhe foi exigido." — Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432153&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'916542e2-f309-4268-adcd-0300300dcee1\', \'multiverseId\': 432153}, \'multiverseid\': 432153}, {\'name\': \'Безжалостный Вековечный\', \'text\': \'Страдание 2 (Каждый раз, когда это существо становится заблокированным, защищающийся игрок теряет 2 жизни.)\\n{2}{B}, сбросьте карту: Безжалостный Вековечный получает +2/+2 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зомби Священник\', \'flavor\': \'«Здесь мой труд завершен. Жители этого мира исполнили все, что от них требовалось». — Никол Болас\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432352&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8a220d0-4b40-4c1d-b72b-167b638d4a09\', \'multiverseId\': 432352}, \'multiverseid\': 432352}, {\'name\': \'无情永生者\', \'text\': \'折磨2（每当此生物被阻挡时，防御牌手失去2点生命。）\\n{2}{B}，弃一张牌：无情永生者得+2/+2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～灵俑／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'「我在这里的工作结束了。人们已经完成了我所交代的一切。」 ～尼可波拉斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432551&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19fce000-68c6-4c8b-84f8-523da4f9a9ed\', \'multiverseId\': 432551}, \'multiverseid\': 432551}, {\'name\': \'無情永生者\', \'text\': \'折磨2（每當此生物被阻擋時，防禦玩家失去2點生命。）\\n{2}{B}，棄一張牌：無情永生者得+2/+2直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～殭屍／僧侶\', \'flavor\': \'「我在這裡的工作結束了。人們已經完成了我所交代的一切。」 ～尼可波拉斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432750&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c59b810-18ba-4004-a972-5fe047c6d2db\', \'multiverseId\': 432750}, \'multiverseid\': 432750}]', '[{\'name\': \'Goldhorn-Cerodon\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn das Goldhorn-Cerodon angreift und falls du eine Wüste kontrollierst oder sich eine Wüste-Karte in deinem Friedhof befindet, kann eine Kreatur deiner Wahl in diesem Zug nicht blocken.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'Die größten Bullen werden von Hazoret mit goldenen Hörnern geehrt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=430982&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d03204ee-3fa2-4f90-8e57-354a2a1a8fe8\', \'multiverseId\': 430982}, \'multiverseid\': 430982}, {\'name\': \'Cerodonte de oropel\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Cerodonte de oropel ataque, si controlas un Desierto o hay una carta de Desierto en tu cementerio, la criatura objetivo no puede bloquear este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'El revestimiento de sus cuernos es una muestra de honor de Hazoret, que favorece a las criaturas con grandes corazones.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431181&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af0d8928-f9e8-40dc-8c1c-023929dfdce4\', \'multiverseId\': 431181}, \'multiverseid\': 431181}, {\'name\': \'Cérodon doré\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que le Cérodon doré attaque, si vous contrôlez un désert ou s\'il y a une carte de désert dans votre cimetière, la créature ciblée ne peut pas bloquer ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': "Le revêtement de ses cornes est un gage d\'honneur d\'Hazoret, qui préfère les créatures au grand cœur.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431380&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d73f7d9c-6d99-49ec-be65-4ea492fe7bd1\', \'multiverseId\': 431380}, \'multiverseid\': 431380}, {\'name\': \'Cornodonte Dorato\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta il Cornodonte Dorato attacca, se controlli un Deserto o c\'è una carta Deserto nel tuo cimitero, una creatura bersaglio non può bloccare in questo turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': "La placcatura delle sue corna è un pegno d\'onore di Hazoret, che predilige le creature dal cuore nobile.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431579&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e35a1d4-9f97-46b3-a949-14473e1299b1\', \'multiverseId\': 431579}, \'multiverseid\': 431579}, {\'name\': \'金色のセロドン\', \'text\': \'金色のセロドンが攻撃するたび、あなたが砂漠をコントロールしているかあなたの墓地に砂漠・カードがある場合、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それではブロックできない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'その角飾りはハゾレトが与えた栄誉の標章である。卓越した心の持ち主がハゾレトの好みなのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431778&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b5df83e-0393-409f-8c5d-452bfa4295ff\', \'multiverseId\': 431778}, \'multiverseid\': 431778}, {\'name\': \'금박 세로돈\', \'text\': \'금박 세로돈이 공격할 때마다, 당신이 사막을 조종하거나 당신의 무덤에 사막 카드가 있다면, 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 이 턴에 방어할 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 야수\', \'flavor\': \'금박 뿔은 하조렛에게 받은 명예의 징표다. 가장 용맹한 생물만 이 징표를 받을 수 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431977&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20ca7faf-4450-4664-ac0c-4f999f522350\', \'multiverseId\': 431977}, \'multiverseid\': 431977}, {\'name\': \'Dentócero Dourado\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Dentócero Dourado ataca, se você controla um Deserto ou há um card de Deserto em seu cemitério, a criatura alvo não pode bloquear neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta\', \'flavor\': \'O revestimento de seus chifres é uma honra concedida por Hazoret, que favorece criaturas com grandes corações.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432176&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6f17cf7-c03c-40f7-b4a8-59e5b2f87a65\', \'multiverseId\': 432176}, \'multiverseid\': 432176}, {\'name\': \'Золоченый Рогозуб\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Золоченый Рогозуб атакует, если вы контролируете Пустыню или у вас на кладбище есть карта Пустыни, то целевое существо не может блокировать в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зверь\', \'flavor\': \'Покрытие его рогов — знак милости Хазорет, благоволящей существам с большим сердцем.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432375&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae8e949d-ab60-4579-840d-f722e421b38f\', \'multiverseId\': 432375}, \'multiverseid\': 432375}, {\'name\': \'覆辉角牙兽\', \'text\': \'每当覆辉角牙兽攻击时，若你操控沙漠或你坟墓场中有沙漠牌，则目标生物本回合不能进行阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物～野兽\', \'flavor\': \'勇猛生物深得哈佐蕾青睐，其角上覆辉便是荣耀象征。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432574&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38ae07c4-3ac9-4310-8189-296e19ce5b7f\', \'multiverseId\': 432574}, \'multiverseid\': 432574}, {\'name\': \'覆輝角牙獸\', \'text\': \'每當覆輝角牙獸攻擊時，若你操控沙漠或你墳墓場中有沙漠牌，則目標生物本回合不能進行阻擋。\', \'type\': \'生物～野獸\', \'flavor\': \'勇猛生物深得哈佐蕾青睞，其角上覆輝便是榮耀象徵。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432773&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'294dc929-52a5-4ed3-9def-a53661168250\', \'multiverseId\': 432773}, \'multiverseid\': 432773}]', '[{\'name\': \'Granit-Titan\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich\\nUmwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': \'„Der ist nicht von mir. Rennt!" —Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=430983&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5362aaf7-4879-4f88-9196-d916241d184b\', \'multiverseId\': 430983}, \'multiverseid\': 430983}, {\'name\': \'Titán granítico\', \'text\': \'Amenaza.\\nCiclo {2}. ({2}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'"Ese no es mío. ¡Corran!" —Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431182&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a9d2b3d-5416-4019-9412-671d1066c938\', \'multiverseId\': 431182}, \'multiverseid\': 431182}, {\'name\': \'Titan de granit\', \'text\': \'Menace\\nRecyclage {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': "« Celui-ci n\'est pas à moi. Fuyez ! » —Nissa Revane", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431381&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b637ba76-29c3-4bae-9fa0-2f77c2535da0\', \'multiverseId\': 431381}, \'multiverseid\': 431381}, {\'name\': \'Titano Granitico\', \'text\': \'Minacciare\\nCiclo {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': \'"Quello non è mio. Scappate!" —Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431580&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04dd55ef-2753-4d20-8a44-07956db04ad9\', \'multiverseId\': 431580}, \'multiverseid\': 431580}, {\'name\': \'花崗岩のタイタン\', \'text\': \'威迫\\nサイクリング{2}（{2}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': \'「あれは私が呼んだんじゃない。逃げて！」 ――ニッサ・レヴェイン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431779&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55160397-30d9-4c96-a025-4d0c6e50dcdc\', \'multiverseId\': 431779}, \'multiverseid\': 431779}, {\'name\': \'화강암 거신\', \'text\': \'호전적\\n순환 {2} ({2}, 이 카드를 버린다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 정령\', \'flavor\': \'"저건 내가 부리는 녀석이 아니야. 도망쳐!" —니사 레베인\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431978&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'204f7ee7-fa9f-4e52-ae54-2459a0fa392b\', \'multiverseId\': 431978}, \'multiverseid\': 431978}, {\'name\': \'Titã Granítico\', \'text\': \'Ameaçar\\nReciclar {2} ({2}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'"Aquele não é meu. Corram!" — Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432177&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4ae064f-ea42-4537-9861-65a74551abc0\', \'multiverseId\': 432177}, \'multiverseid\': 432177}, {\'name\': \'Гранитный Титан\', \'text\': \'Угроза\\nЦикл {2} ({2}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль\', \'flavor\': \'«Это не мой. Бежим!» — Нисса Ревейн\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432376&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c685c163-61b1-4e40-a320-c24567c1523c\', \'multiverseId\': 432376}, \'multiverseid\': 432376}, {\'name\': \'花岗岩泰坦\', \'text\': \'威慑\\n循环{2}（{2}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）\', \'type\': \'生物～元素\', \'flavor\': \'「那不是我召来的。快逃！」 ～妮莎瑞文\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432575&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f33b4c9-3431-49eb-bbc4-669d5590bac1\', \'multiverseId\': 432575}, \'multiverseid\': 432575}, {\'name\': \'花崗岩泰坦\', \'text\': \'威懾\\n循環{2}（{2}，棄掉此牌：抽一張牌。）\', \'type\': \'生物～元素\', \'flavor\': \'「那不是我召來的。快逃！」 ～妮莎瑞文\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432774&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ae558ed-324f-4547-8504-7d73a351edfb\', \'multiverseId\': 432774}, \'multiverseid\': 432774}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grausige Überlebende\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du eine Karte umwandelst oder abwirfst, erhält die Grausige Überlebende +2/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Minotaurus, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Wer mit Ungeheuern kämpft, muss achtgeben, dabei nicht selbst zum Ungeheuer zu werden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=430952&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d2807b1-e8a8-44ac-adbf-0b9d5b98ff2c\', \'multiverseId\': 430952}, \'multiverseid\': 430952}, {\'name\': \'Superviviente macabra\', \'text\': \'Siempre que actives una habilidad de ciclo o descartes una carta, la Superviviente macabra obtiene +2/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero minotauro\', \'flavor\': \'Sin cartuchos que conseguir. Sin más allá que alcanzar. Solo la gloria de un golpe certero y una pila creciente de enemigos caídos a sus pies.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431151&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d61d4a2d-074f-4716-8eb9-7043e69948b0\', \'multiverseId\': 431151}, \'multiverseid\': 431151}, {\'name\': \'Survivant sinistre\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous recyclez ou vous défaussez d\'une carte, le Survivant sinistre gagne +2/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : minotaure et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "Aucun cartouche à mériter. Aucun au-delà auquel accéder. Seule la gloire d\'un coup bien asséné et d\'un tas grandissant de cadavres ennemis à ses pieds.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431350&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9dd4500-9ddf-4079-b063-960458151a42\', \'multiverseId\': 431350}, \'multiverseid\': 431350}, {\'name\': \'Superstite Macabra\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta cicli o scarti una carta, la Superstite Macabra prende +2/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Minotauro\', \'flavor\': \'Nessun cartiglio da ottenere, nessun Aldilà da raggiungere. Solo la gloria di un colpo ben assestato e un cumulo sempre più alto di nemici abbattuti ai suoi piedi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431549&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a07ed64-61e4-49a5-aae5-5f70db6e20b6\', \'multiverseId\': 431549}, \'multiverseid\': 431549}, {\'name\': \'忌まわしい生き残り\', \'text\': \'あなたがカードを１枚サイクリングするか捨てるたび、ターン終了時まで、忌まわしい生き残りは＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ミノタウルス・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'カルトーシュも来世もない。会心の一撃を誇りとし、倒した敵を足元に積み上げるのみ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431748&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'917d9ba8-595a-4848-916d-64c3d091728e\', \'multiverseId\': 431748}, \'multiverseid\': 431748}, {\'name\': \'잔혹한 생존자\', \'text\': \'당신이 카드를 순환하거나 버릴 때마다, 잔혹한 생존자는 턴종료까지 +2/+0을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 미노타우로스 전사\', \'flavor\': \'카르투슈를 얻지 못하면 사후 세계에 들어갈 수 없다. 적의 숨통을 끊는 공격과 그분의 발밑에 쌓여가는 적의 시체 더미만이 영광으로 이끌 것이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431947&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3a311e6-b76b-4b59-b4b2-bc07eb3f9e10\', \'multiverseId\': 431947}, \'multiverseid\': 431947}, {\'name\': \'Sobrevivente Macabra\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você recicla ou descarta um card, Sobrevivente Macabra recebe +2/+0 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Minotauro Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'Sem cártulas a conquistar. Sem vida após a morte para alcançar. Somente a glória de um golpe bem dado e a pilha crescente de inimigos jazendo a seus pés.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432146&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e33627f-b22c-4d15-9333-bb37d3cee39e\', \'multiverseId\': 432146}, \'multiverseid\': 432146}, {\'name\': \'Жуткая Уцелевшая\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы совершаете Цикл или сбрасываете карту, Жуткая Уцелевшая получает +2/+0 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Минотавр Воин\', \'flavor\': \'Ей не нужны картуши. Она не стремится к загробной жизни. Для нее — лишь радость от удачного удара и растущая груда убитых врагов под ногами.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432345&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcacb9da-b684-44a4-b2a3-d0c64c88147f\', \'multiverseId\': 432345}, \'multiverseid\': 432345}, {\'name\': \'凶恶遗民\', \'text\': \'每当你循环或弃一张牌时，凶恶遗民得+2/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～牛头怪／战士\', \'flavor\': \'没有魔符，没有来世，有的只是漂亮一击和脚下累累敌人尸首积攒起来的荣耀。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432544&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'991c9026-af53-47c9-a66e-9ef220fbad34\', \'multiverseId\': 432544}, \'multiverseid\': 432544}, {\'name\': \'凶惡遺民\', \'text\': \'每當你循環或棄一張牌時，凶惡遺民得+2/+0直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～牛頭怪／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'沒有魔符，沒有來世，有的只是漂亮一擊和腳下纍纍敵人屍首積攢起來的榮耀。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432743&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c8423ab-c6c9-4a76-a219-e720329b8cf4\', \'multiverseId\': 432743}, \'multiverseid\': 432743}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hashep-Oase\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {C}.\\n{T}, bezahle 1 Lebenspunkt: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {G}.\\n{1}{G}{G}, {T}, opfere eine Wüste: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +3/+3 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur zu einem Zeitpunkt, zu dem du auch eine Hexerei wirken könntest.\', \'type\': \'Land — Wüste\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431065&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1081350-932d-4779-8ce3-1d521aa5e51b\', \'multiverseId\': 431065}, \'multiverseid\': 431065}, {\'name\': \'Oasis de Hashep\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C} a tu reserva de maná.\\n{T}, pagar 1 vida: Agrega {G} a tu reserva de maná.\\n{1}{G}{G}, {T}, sacrificar un Desierto: La criatura objetivo obtiene +3/+3 hasta el final del turno. Activa esta habilidad solo cuando puedas lanzar un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Tierra — Desierto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431264&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13c4c47a-db39-448f-b239-c9e1d3e73b6b\', \'multiverseId\': 431264}, \'multiverseid\': 431264}, {\'name\': "Oasis d\'Hashep", \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C} à votre réserve.\\n{T}, payez 1 point de vie : Ajoutez {G} à votre réserve.\\n{1}{G}{G}, {T}, sacrifiez un désert : La créature ciblée gagne +3/+3 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. N\'activez cette capacité que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Terrain : désert\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431463&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a24ba289-3b6f-4e81-b8e9-87f011e57882\', \'multiverseId\': 431463}, \'multiverseid\': 431463}, {\'name\': \'Oasi Hashep\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C} alla tua riserva di mana.\\n{T}, Paga 1 punto vita: Aggiungi {G} alla tua riserva di mana.\\n{1}{G}{G}, {T}, Sacrifica un Deserto: Una creatura bersaglio prende +3/+3 fino alla fine del turno. Attiva questa abilità solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.\', \'type\': \'Terra — Deserto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431662&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14afeb1d-ed01-47d2-bfca-d57fa22a6c94\', \'multiverseId\': 431662}, \'multiverseid\': 431662}, {\'name\': \'ハシェプのオアシス\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{C}を加える。\\n{T}, １点のライフを支払う：あなたのマナ・プールに{G}を加える。\\n{1}{G}{G}, {T}, 砂漠１つを生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋３/＋３の修整を受ける。この能力は、あなたがソーサリーを唱えられるときにのみ起動できる。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 砂漠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431861&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbbbcc3f-1915-4c06-a36a-d013adaf76fe\', \'multiverseId\': 431861}, \'multiverseid\': 431861}, {\'name\': \'하시엡 오아시스\', \'text\': \'{T}: {C}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.\\n{T}, 생명 1점을 지불한다: {G}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.\\n{1}{G}{G}, {T}, 사막 한 개를 희생한다: 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +3/+3을 받는다. 당신이 집중마법을 발동할 수 있는 시기에만 이 능력을 활성화할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'대지 — 사막\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432060&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f711709a-9118-4d94-9d29-71b9a2e49efe\', \'multiverseId\': 432060}, \'multiverseid\': 432060}, {\'name\': \'Oasis de Hashep\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C} à sua reserva de mana.\\n{T}, pague 1 ponto de vida: Adicione {G} à sua reserva de mana.\\n{1}{G}{G}, {T}, sacrifique um Deserto: A criatura alvo recebe +3/+3 até o final do turno. Ative esta habilidade somente nos momentos em que poderia conjurar um feitiço.\', \'type\': \'Terreno — Deserto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432259&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12c6166e-d22e-4d77-952e-d749cdefd551\', \'multiverseId\': 432259}, \'multiverseid\': 432259}, {\'name\': \'Оазис Хашеп\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C} в ваше хранилище маны.\\n{T}, заплатите 1 жизнь: добавьте {G} в ваше хранилище маны.\\n{1}{G}{G}, {T}, пожертвуйте Пустыню: целевое существо получает +3/+3 до конца хода. Активируйте эту способность только при возможности разыгрывать волшебство.\', \'type\': \'Земля — Пустыня\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432458&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7c3ae25-49b6-4d4e-88dd-eff7b26e4511\', \'multiverseId\': 432458}, \'multiverseid\': 432458}, {\'name\': \'哈什普绿洲\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}到你的法术力池中。\\n{T}，支付1点生命：加{G}到你的法术力池中。\\n{1}{G}{G}，{T}，牺牲一个沙漠：目标生物得+3/+3直到回合结束。只可以于你能施放法术的时机下起动此异能。\', \'type\': \'地～沙漠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432657&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dab33a82-9c5e-4e2f-ad29-638994acc37e\', \'multiverseId\': 432657}, \'multiverseid\': 432657}, {\'name\': \'哈什普綠洲\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}到你的魔法力池中。\\n{T}，支付1點生命：加{G}到你的魔法力池中。\\n{1}{G}{G}， {T}，犧牲一個沙漠：目標生物得+3/+3直到回合結束。只可以於你能施放巫術的時機下起動此異能。\', \'type\': \'地～沙漠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432856&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b423cb50-dafd-4888-b1f6-d487c411af9f\', \'multiverseId\': 432856}, \'multiverseid\': 432856}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hazorets entfesselter Zorn\', \'text\': \'Mische deine Bibliothek und schicke dann die obersten vier Karten ins Exil. Du kannst davon eine beliebige Anzahl an Karten mit umgewandelten Manakosten von 5 oder weniger, die keine Länder sind, wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Länder, die du kontrollierst, enttappen nicht während deines nächsten Enttappsegments.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=430984&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95d6b09a-55ff-4fd0-a9c8-ba8737b1800a\', \'multiverseId\': 430984}, \'multiverseid\': 430984}, {\'name\': \'Furia inmortal de Hazoret\', \'text\': \'Baraja tu biblioteca, luego exilia las cuatro primeras cartas. Puedes lanzar cualquier cantidad de cartas que no sean tierra con coste de maná convertido de 5 o menos que se encuentren entre ellas sin pagar sus costes de maná. Las tierras que controlas no se enderezarán durante tu próximo paso de enderezar.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431183&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'741e275f-75a0-4d46-b347-2aeadabd82c0\', \'multiverseId\': 431183}, \'multiverseid\': 431183}, {\'name\': "Fureur immortelle d\'Hazoret", \'text\': "Mélangez votre bibliothèque, puis exilez les quatre cartes du dessus. Vous pouvez lancer n\'importe quel nombre de cartes non-terrain avec un coût converti de mana inférieur ou égal à 5 parmi elles sans payer leur coût de mana. Les terrains que vous contrôlez ne se dégagent pas pendant votre prochaine étape de dégagement.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431382&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54a24188-a61f-4143-9a33-8a8ca82194a5\', \'multiverseId\': 431382}, \'multiverseid\': 431382}, {\'name\': \'Furia Imperitura di Hazoret\', \'text\': \'Rimescola il tuo grimorio, poi esilia le prime quattro carte. Puoi lanciare un qualsiasi numero di carte non terra con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore a 5 scelte tra esse senza pagare il loro costo di mana. Le terre che controlli non STAPpano durante il tuo prossimo STAP.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431581&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91c3592a-c22d-471c-a6c3-0d8ceb22ead1\', \'multiverseId\': 431581}, \'multiverseid\': 431581}, {\'name\': \'ハゾレトの終わりなき怒り\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーを切り直し、その後一番上からカードを４枚追放する。あなたは、その中から点数で見たマナ・コストが５以下で土地でないカードを、それらのマナ・コストを支払うことなく望む枚数唱えてもよい。あなたがコントロールする土地は、あなたの次のアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431780&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'104b4a7f-b5f8-4eaf-bc68-ad34b1e87c77\', \'multiverseId\': 431780}, \'multiverseid\': 431780}, {\'name\': \'하조렛의 영원한 분노\', \'text\': \'당신의 서고를 섞은 후, 맨 위의 카드 네 장을 추방한다. 당신은 그중 전환마나비용이 5 이하이며 대지가 아닌 카드를 원하는 만큼 마나 비용을 지불하지 않고 발동할 수 있다. 당신이 조종하는 대지들은 당신의 다음 언탭단에 언탭되지 않는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431979&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7362cf91-ffe3-49b8-8d6c-d84b6c538745\', \'multiverseId\': 431979}, \'multiverseid\': 431979}, {\'name\': \'Fúria Infindável de Hazoret\', \'text\': \'Embaralhe seu grimório. Em seguida, exile os quatro cards do topo. Você pode conjurar qualquer número de cards que não sejam terrenos com custo de mana convertido igual ou inferior a 5 dentre eles sem pagar seus custos de mana. Os terrenos que você controla não são desvirados durante sua próxima etapa de desvirar.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432178&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24733ef6-235a-44b4-9c8c-12a437b5a39e\', \'multiverseId\': 432178}, \'multiverseid\': 432178}, {\'name\': \'Неугасимая Ярость Хазорет\', \'text\': \'Перетасуйте вашу библиотеку, затем изгоните четыре верхние карты. Вы можете разыграть любое количество находящихся среди них не являющихся землями карт с конвертированной мана-стоимостью не более 5 без уплаты их мана-стоимости. Земли под вашим контролем не разворачиваются во время вашего следующего шага разворота.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432377&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1bd6a6be-ad8a-4529-ae70-68322bb3a330\', \'multiverseId\': 432377}, \'multiverseid\': 432377}, {\'name\': \'哈佐蕾无尽怒火\', \'text\': \'将你的牌库洗牌，然后放逐顶上四张牌。你可以施放其中任意数量总法术力费用等于或小于5的非地牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。由你操控的地于你的下一个重置步骤中不能重置。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432576&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8124fdc-818d-4502-852c-63b45c27cf04\', \'multiverseId\': 432576}, \'multiverseid\': 432576}, {\'name\': \'哈佐蕾無盡怒火\', \'text\': \'將你的牌庫洗牌，然後放逐頂上四張牌。你可以施放其中任意數量總魔法力費用等於或小於5的非地牌，且不需支付其魔法力費用。由你操控的地於你的下一個重置步驟中不能重置。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432775&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8a5ebce-4af3-4972-bc5c-ceb9314a422c\', \'multiverseId\': 432775}, \'multiverseid\': 432775}]', '[{\'name\': \'Heldentat\', \'text\': \'Enttappe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Sie erhält +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges und kann in diesem Zug eine zusätzliche Kreatur blocken.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Es gibt zwei Sorten von Menschen: solche, die vor Gefahren wegrennen, und solche, die auf sie zustürmen." —Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=430889&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b70c521-c6eb-406b-95d3-69a965c0b4ee\', \'multiverseId\': 430889}, \'multiverseid\': 430889}, {\'name\': \'Acto de heroísmo\', \'text\': \'Endereza la criatura objetivo. Obtiene +2/+2 hasta el final del turno y puede bloquear a una criatura adicional este turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"En todos los planos, hay quienes se arrojan al peligro". —Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431088&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12dffbdb-d9a9-4092-92c5-17564628b37a\', \'multiverseId\': 431088}, \'multiverseid\': 431088}, {\'name\': \'Acte héroïque\', \'text\': "Dégagez la créature ciblée. Elle gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour et peut bloquer une créature supplémentaire ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Sur chaque plan, il y en a toujours qui vont au-devant du danger. » —Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431287&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3367a0d1-d324-4bd7-89f6-a676723c0719\', \'multiverseId\': 431287}, \'multiverseid\': 431287}, {\'name\': \'Atto di Eroismo\', \'text\': \'STAPpa una creatura bersaglio. Prende +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno e può bloccare una creatura addizionale in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Su ogni piano troverai sempre qualcuno che corre a capofitto verso il pericolo." —Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431486&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d74cdd68-c5ad-452d-b999-1a54efb8d797\', \'multiverseId\': 431486}, \'multiverseid\': 431486}, {\'name\': \'英雄的行動\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをアンタップする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋２の修整を受けるとともに、このターン、それは追加で１体のクリーチャーをブロックできる。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「どの次元にも、危険に立ち向かう者は必ずいる。」 ――ギデオン・ジュラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431685&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03382710-be14-4e49-b115-e9f149b70671\', \'multiverseId\': 431685}, \'multiverseid\': 431685}, {\'name\': \'영웅적인 행동\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 언탭한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +2/+2를 받으며, 이 턴에 생물 한 개를 추가로 방어할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"모든 차원에는 위험을 불사하는 자들이 있다." —기디온 주라\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431884&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eba82a08-9e5b-451d-b0ee-ce766aecaf0c\', \'multiverseId\': 431884}, \'multiverseid\': 431884}, {\'name\': \'Ato de Heroísmo\', \'text\': \'Desvire a criatura alvo. Ela recebe +2/+2 até o final do turno e pode bloquear uma criatura adicional neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Em todo plano há os que correm rumo ao perigo." — Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432083&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f42e191-5bb4-422e-b1e2-d81ecce1b387\', \'multiverseId\': 432083}, \'multiverseid\': 432083}, {\'name\': \'Героический Подвиг\', \'text\': \'Разверните целевое существо. Оно получает +2/+2 до конца хода и может блокировать дополнительное существо в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«В каждом мире есть те, кто бросается опасности навстречу». — Гидеон Джура\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432282&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06779499-dfb1-472f-bd80-af3ad2897e49\', \'multiverseId\': 432282}, \'multiverseid\': 432282}, {\'name\': \'英勇义举\', \'text\': \'重置目标生物。它得+2/+2直到回合结束，且本回合可以额外多阻挡一个生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「每个时空都有不惧危难之人。」 ～基定尤拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432481&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3e5916b-ddd3-425b-aeb3-1e733c4669ee\', \'multiverseId\': 432481}, \'multiverseid\': 432481}, {\'name\': \'英勇義舉\', \'text\': \'重置目標生物。它得+2/+2直到回合結束，且本回合可以額外多阻擋一個生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「每個時空都有不懼危難之人。」 ～基定尤拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432680&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce69fbda-de16-43c7-8cbf-f95f47d06786\', \'multiverseId\': 432680}, \'multiverseid\': 432680}]', "[{'name': 'Herrscher des Rudels', 'text': 'Der Herrscher des Rudels erhält +1/+1 für jede andere Katze, die du kontrollierst.\\n{W}, {T}, erschöpfe den Herrscher des Rudels: Erzeuge zwei 1/1 weiße Katze-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Lebensverknüpfung. (Eine erschöpfte Kreatur enttappt nicht während deines nächsten Enttappsegments.)', 'type': 'Kreatur — Katze', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431014&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '973f6660-3847-48c3-b0d2-4b14d27e1d83', 'multiverseId': 431014}, 'multiverseid': 431014}, {'name': 'Soberano de la manada', 'text': 'El Soberano de la manada obtiene +1/+1 por cada otro Felino que controlas.\\n{W}, {T}, espolear al Soberano de la manada: Crea dos fichas de criatura Felino blancas 1/1 con la habilidad de vínculo vital. (Una criatura espoleada no se enderezará durante tu próximo paso de enderezar.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Felino', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431213&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ce0eb3c3-aae7-4db8-a234-99e76b09929c', 'multiverseId': 431213}, 'multiverseid': 431213}, {'name': 'Souverain de la bande', 'text': 'Le Souverain de la bande gagne +1/+1 pour chaque autre chat que vous contrôlez.\\n{W}, {T}, surmenez le Souverain de la bande : Créez deux jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Chat avec le lien de vie. (Une créature surmenée ne se dégage pas pendant votre prochaine étape de dégagement.)', 'type': 'Créature : chat', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431412&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b630fcb2-c404-4fce-92dc-a2f9a281baee', 'multiverseId': 431412}, 'multiverseid': 431412}, {'name': 'Sovrano del Branco', 'text': 'Il Sovrano del Branco prende +1/+1 per ogni altro Felino che controlli.\\n{W}, {T}, Strema il Sovrano del Branco: Crea due pedine creatura Felino 1/1 bianche con legame vitale. (Una creatura stremata non STAPpa durante il tuo prossimo STAP.)', 'type': 'Creatura — Felino', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431611&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b5426a93-3a06-4bbc-b851-528daae1db81', 'multiverseId': 431611}, 'multiverseid': 431611}, {'name': '誇り高き君主', 'text': '誇り高き君主は、あなたがコントロールする他の猫１体につき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n{W}, {T}, 誇り高き君主を督励する：絆魂を持つ白の１/１の猫・クリーチャー・トークンを２体生成する。（督励されたクリーチャーは、あなたの次のアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 猫', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431810&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0d0e4de0-44a4-4b8f-84df-c7a05cb6ada9', 'multiverseId': 431810}, 'multiverseid': 431810}, {'name': '사자무리 지배자', 'text': '사자무리 지배자는 당신이 조종하는 다른 고양이 하나당 +1/+1을 받는다.\\n{W}, {T}, 사자무리 지배자를 분전시킨다: 생명연결을 가진 1/1 백색 고양이 생물 토큰 두 개를 만든다. (분전한 생물은 당신의 다음 언탭단에 언탭되지 않는다.)', 'type': '생물 — 고양이', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432009&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b3fd3fe4-117f-4444-9316-5b2185913410', 'multiverseId': 432009}, 'multiverseid': 432009}, {'name': 'Soberano do Bando', 'text': 'Soberano do Bando recebe +1/+1 para cada outro Felino que você controla.\\n{W}, {T}, exaura Soberano do Bando: Crie duas fichas de criatura branca 1/1 do tipo Felino com vínculo com a vida. (Uma criatura exaurida não será desvirada durante sua próxima etapa de desvirar.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Felino', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432208&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '19c1673a-10af-4061-a607-e36e12dbd7ac', 'multiverseId': 432208}, 'multiverseid': 432208}, {'name': 'Владыка Прайда', 'text': 'Владыка Прайда получает +1/+1 за каждую другую Кошку под вашим контролем.\\n{W}, {T}, подстегните Владыку Прайда: создайте две фишки существа 1/1 белая Кошка с Цепью жизни. (Подстегнутое существо не разворачивается во время вашего следующего шага разворота.)', 'type': 'Существо — Кошка', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432407&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5624b6c8-f2af-441a-b07f-390a9506124f', 'multiverseId': 432407}, 'multiverseid': 432407}, {'name': '兽群君王', 'text': '你每操控一个其他的猫，兽群君王便得+1/+1。\\n{W}，{T}，耗竭兽群君王：派出两个1/1白色，具系命异能的猫衍生生物。（已耗竭的生物于你的下一个重置步骤中不能重置。）', 'type': '生物～猫', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432606&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bb673ce3-aff1-4203-b865-7e58224deef8', 'multiverseId': 432606}, 'multiverseid': 432606}, {'name': '獸群君王', 'text': '你每操控一個其他的貓，獸群君王便得+1/+1。\\n{W}，{T}，耗竭獸群君王：派出兩個1/1白色，具繫命異能的貓衍生生物。（已耗竭的生物於你的下一個重置步驟中不能重置。）', 'type': '生物～貓', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432805&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3fc2c9e4-2221-4969-a612-12b291b5ef72', 'multiverseId': 432805}, 'multiverseid': 432805}]", '[{\'name\': \'Höchster Wille\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl, es sei denn, sein Beherrscher bezahlt {3}.\\n• Schaue dir die obersten vier Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Nimm eine davon auf deine Hand und lege den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=430937&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc7cef39-fb03-4040-a146-7d710f3f4b22\', \'multiverseId\': 430937}, \'multiverseid\': 430937}, {\'name\': \'Voluntad suprema\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo a menos que su controlador pague {3}.\\n• Mira las cuatro primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Pon una de ellas en tu mano y el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en cualquier orden.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431136&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'990e65e4-64bc-408c-b7a4-8606f3edb5aa\', \'multiverseId\': 431136}, \'multiverseid\': 431136}, {\'name\': \'Volonté suprême\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Contrecarrez le sort ciblé à moins que son contrôleur ne paie {3}.\\n• Regardez les quatre cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez l\'une d\'elles dans votre main et le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque, dans l\'ordre de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431335&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62dbfbbe-4a93-4b5a-94ba-f70f5eea2d16\', \'multiverseId\': 431335}, \'multiverseid\': 431335}, {\'name\': \'Volontà Suprema\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Neutralizza una magia bersaglio a meno che il suo controllore non paghi {3}.\\n• Guarda le prime quattro carte del tuo grimorio. Aggiungi una di quelle carte alla tua mano e metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431534&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5772817-b933-4a15-9e2c-e057be668c8c\', \'multiverseId\': 431534}, \'multiverseid\': 431534}, {\'name\': \'至高の意志\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• 呪文１つを対象とする。それのコントローラーが{3}を支払わないかぎり、それを打ち消す。\\n• あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを４枚見る。そのうち１枚をあなたの手札に加え、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に望む順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431733&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e10faf4-cae2-4a9b-a338-bb56357cf8ac\', \'multiverseId\': 431733}, \'multiverseid\': 431733}, {\'name\': \'지고한 의지\', \'text\': \'하나를 선택한다 —\\n• 주문을 목표로 정한다. 그 주문의 조종자가 {3}을 지불하지 않으면 그 주문을 무효화한다.\\n• 당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 네 장을 본다. 그중 한 장을 당신의 손으로 가져가고 나머지 카드들은 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 원하는 순서로 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431932&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7451dfe-5242-4ce7-815b-f7f4721f2253\', \'multiverseId\': 431932}, \'multiverseid\': 431932}, {\'name\': \'Vontade Suprema\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• Anule a mágica alvo, a menos que seu controlador pague {3}.\\n• Olhe os quatro cards do topo do seu grimório. Coloque um deles na sua mão e os restantes no fundo do seu grimório em qualquer ordem.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6519931c-53de-4ece-a175-6d3d0c99908d\', \'multiverseId\': 432131}, \'multiverseid\': 432131}, {\'name\': \'Высшая Воля\', \'text\': \'Выберите одно —\\n• Отмените целевое заклинание, если только контролирующий его игрок не заплатит {3}.\\n• Посмотрите четыре верхние карты вашей библиотеки. Положите одну из них в вашу руку, а остальные — в низ вашей библиотеки в любом порядке.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432330&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c5ef2cb-ef62-4726-81e1-8aacfa85a45b\', \'multiverseId\': 432330}, \'multiverseid\': 432330}, {\'name\': \'最高意志\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•除非目标咒语的操控者支付{3}，否则反击之。\\n•检视你牌库顶的四张牌。将其中一张置于你手上，其余的牌则以任意顺序置于你的牌库底。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432529&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b23aa17-103f-4620-a845-52e84639e00c\', \'multiverseId\': 432529}, \'multiverseid\': 432529}, {\'name\': \'最高意志\', \'text\': \'選擇一項～\\n‧除非目標咒語的操控者支付{3}，否則反擊之。\\n•檢視你牌庫頂的四張牌。將其中一張置於你手上，其餘的牌則以任意順序置於你的牌庫底。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432728&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48a1c57d-c3ef-4655-a02e-e7b655f9f6d9\', \'multiverseId\': 432728}, \'multiverseid\': 432728}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ifnir-Ödnis\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {C}.\\n{T}, bezahle 1 Lebenspunkt: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {B}.\\n{2}{B}{B}, {T}, opfere eine Wüste: Lege zwei -1/-1-Marken auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur zu einem Zeitpunkt, zu dem du auch eine Hexerei wirken könntest.\', \'type\': \'Land — Wüste\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431067&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b69eb2d-9dad-46ba-b26f-26b9ede6ebb7\', \'multiverseId\': 431067}, \'multiverseid\': 431067}, {\'name\': \'Tierras muertas de Ifnir\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C} a tu reserva de maná.\\n{T}, pagar 1 vida: Agrega {B} a tu reserva de maná.\\n{2}{B}{B}, {T}, sacrificar un Desierto: Pon dos contadores -1/-1 sobre la criatura objetivo que controla un oponente. Activa esta habilidad solo cuando puedas lanzar un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Tierra — Desierto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431266&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c68d8b05-3f53-4cf3-80c7-3c69eb87fd28\', \'multiverseId\': 431266}, \'multiverseid\': 431266}, {\'name\': "Morteterres d\'Ifnir", \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C} à votre réserve.\\n{T}, payez 1 point de vie : Ajoutez {B} à votre réserve.\\n{2}{B}{B}, {T}, sacrifiez un désert : Mettez deux marqueurs -1/-1 sur une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle. N\'activez cette capacité que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Terrain : désert\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431465&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e6f4568-5d3d-47e9-8935-b40db798fc72\', \'multiverseId\': 431465}, \'multiverseid\': 431465}, {\'name\': \'Terre Morte di Ifnir\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C} alla tua riserva di mana.\\n{T}, Paga 1 punto vita: Aggiungi {B} alla tua riserva di mana.\\n{2}{B}{B}, {T}, Sacrifica un Deserto: Metti due segnalini -1/-1 su una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario. Attiva questa abilità solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.\', \'type\': \'Terra — Deserto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431664&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'550e05ce-a3ca-4ab4-a0f2-c8ace853dfab\', \'multiverseId\': 431664}, \'multiverseid\': 431664}, {\'name\': \'イフニルの死界\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{C}を加える。\\n{T}, １点のライフを支払う：あなたのマナ・プールに{B}を加える。\\n{2}{B}{B}, {T}, 砂漠１つを生け贄に捧げる：対戦相手がコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それの上に－１/－１カウンターを２個置く。この能力は、あなたがソーサリーを唱えられるときにのみ起動できる。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 砂漠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431863&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a077908e-c11d-4bd7-97db-735cd5d4b2a9\', \'multiverseId\': 431863}, \'multiverseid\': 431863}, {\'name\': \'이프니어 불모지\', \'text\': \'{T}: {C}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.\\n{T}, 생명 1점을 지불한다: {B}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.\\n{2}{B}{B}, {T}, 사막 한 개를 희생한다: 상대가 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 -1/-1 카운터 두 개를 올려놓는다. 당신이 집중마법을 발동할 수 있는 시기에만 이 능력을 활성화할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'대지 — 사막\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432062&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48ebf2ea-da4d-4217-8d8c-4468bf9db5b6\', \'multiverseId\': 432062}, \'multiverseid\': 432062}, {\'name\': \'Terras Mortas de Ifnir\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C} à sua reserva de mana.\\n{T}, pague 1 ponto de vida: Adicione {B} à sua reserva de mana.\\n{2}{B}{B}, {T}, sacrifique um Deserto: Coloque dois marcadores -1/-1 na criatura alvo que um oponente controla. Ative esta habilidade somente nos momentos em que poderia conjurar um feitiço.\', \'type\': \'Terreno — Deserto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432261&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b014f9e8-1029-4afa-b390-bf3ea93ca336\', \'multiverseId\': 432261}, \'multiverseid\': 432261}, {\'name\': \'Гиблые Земли Ифнира\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C} в ваше хранилище маны.\\n{T}, заплатите 1 жизнь: добавьте {B} в ваше хранилище маны.\\n{2}{B}{B}, {T}, пожертвуйте Пустыню: положите два жетона -1/-1 на целевое существо под контролем оппонента. Активируйте эту способность только при возможности разыгрывать волшебство.\', \'type\': \'Земля — Пустыня\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432460&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17aa0846-9bc4-433a-bc8e-a984b88b65b3\', \'multiverseId\': 432460}, \'multiverseid\': 432460}, {\'name\': \'依法尼秽壤\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}到你的法术力池中。\\n{T}，支付1点生命：加{B}到你的法术力池中。\\n{2}{B}{B}，{T}，牺牲一个沙漠：在目标由对手操控的生物上放置两个-1/-1指示物。只可以于你能施放法术的时机下起动此异能。\', \'type\': \'地～沙漠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432659&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f7768e6-7407-4bbb-8c74-a0f66d3e0918\', \'multiverseId\': 432659}, \'multiverseid\': 432659}, {\'name\': \'依法尼穢壤\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}到你的魔法力池中。\\n{T}，支付1點生命：加{B}到你的魔法力池中。\\n{2}{B}{B}，{T}，犧牲一個沙漠：在目標由對手操控的生物上放置兩個-1/-1指示物。只可以於你能施放巫術的時機下起動此異能。\', \'type\': \'地～沙漠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432858&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e28a6e0-cf85-4faf-b3be-2e71b0eecfea\', \'multiverseId\': 432858}, \'multiverseid\': 432858}]', '[{\'name\': \'Inbrünstige Schmerzmagierin\', \'text\': \'{T}: Die Inbrünstige Schmerzmagierin fügt einem Spieler deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\\n{T}, erschöpfe die Inbrünstige Schmerzmagierin: Die Inbrünstige Schmerzmagierin fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu. (Eine erschöpfte Kreatur enttappt nicht während deines nächsten Enttappsegments.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir haben ein Leben lang für einen falschen Gott gekämpft. Kämpfen wir ein letztes Mal für uns selbst."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=430979&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6263fac1-e09d-48c6-9199-bc18a93d1566\', \'multiverseId\': 430979}, \'multiverseid\': 430979}, {\'name\': \'Causatormento ferviente\', \'text\': \'{T}: La Causatormento ferviente hace 1 punto de daño al jugador objetivo.\\n{T}, espolear a la Causatormento ferviente: Hace 1 punto de daño a la criatura objetivo. (Una criatura espoleada no se enderezará durante tu próximo paso de enderezar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Aquí todos somos luchadores expertos. Responderemos de la única manera que sabemos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431178&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bab36cd-e270-4023-8ff0-cffbb9d1e051\', \'multiverseId\': 431178}, \'multiverseid\': 431178}, {\'name\': \'Lancedouleur fervente\', \'text\': \'{T} : La Lancedouleur fervente inflige 1 blessure au joueur ciblé.\\n{T}, surmenez la Lancedouleur fervente : Elle inflige 1 blessure à une créature ciblée. (Une créature surmenée ne se dégage pas pendant votre prochaine étape de dégagement.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'« Chacun ici est un combattant émérite. Nous riposterons de la seule manière que nous connaissons. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431377&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6738c5e5-cca4-4c2d-9f60-952f210fb369\', \'multiverseId\': 431377}, \'multiverseid\': 431377}, {\'name\': \'Scagliadolore Fervente\', \'text\': \'{T}: La Scagliadolore Fervente infligge 1 danno a un giocatore bersaglio.\\n{T}, Strema la Scagliadolore Fervente: Infligge 1 danno a una creatura bersaglio. (Una creatura stremata non STAPpa durante il tuo prossimo STAP.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Tutti qui siamo guerrieri esperti. Risponderemo nell\\\'unico modo che conosciamo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431576&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fba69893-7751-4156-9168-13edc200bfce\', \'multiverseId\': 431576}, \'multiverseid\': 431576}, {\'name\': \'熱烈の苦悶術師\', \'text\': \'{T}：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。熱烈の苦悶術師はそのプレイヤーに１点のダメージを与える。\\n{T}, 熱烈の苦悶術師を督励する：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。これはそれに１点のダメージを与える。（督励されたクリーチャーは、あなたの次のアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「ここにいるのは鍛え上げた戦士ばかりでしょ。対処できることに対処し続けるだけよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431775&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1b88f5e-d24a-4d06-aeae-958d94ab1175\', \'multiverseId\': 431775}, \'multiverseid\': 431775}, {\'name\': \'열렬한 고통술사\', \'text\': \'{T}: 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 열렬한 고통술사는 그 플레이어에게 피해 1점을 입힌다.\\n{T}, 열렬한 고통술사를 분전시킨다: 생물을 목표로 정한다. 열렬한 고통술사는 그 생물에게 피해 1점을 입힌다. (분전한 생물은 당신의 다음 언탭단에 언탭되지 않는다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 마법사\', \'flavor\': \'"여기에 있는 자는 모두 노련한 전사들이다. 우리는 우리가 알고 있는 유일한 방식으로 상대할 것이다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431974&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afcffd96-9f50-4e81-8a02-1dd656ab9509\', \'multiverseId\': 431974}, \'multiverseid\': 431974}, {\'name\': \'Conjuradora de Dor Fervorosa\', \'text\': \'{T}: Conjuradora de Dor Fervorosa causa 1 ponto de dano ao jogador alvo.\\n{T}, exaura Conjuradora de Dor Fervorosa: Ela causa 1 ponto de dano à criatura alvo. (Uma criatura exaurida não será desvirada durante sua próxima etapa de desvirar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Todos aqui são lutadores experientes. Responderemos da única forma que sabemos."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432173&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c86b1099-7ec7-4941-a4c0-c9027addc991\', \'multiverseId\': 432173}, \'multiverseid\': 432173}, {\'name\': \'Пылкая Волшебница Боли\', \'text\': \'{T}: Пылкая Волшебница Боли наносит 1 повреждение целевому игроку.\\n{T}, подстегните Пылкую Волшебницу Боли: она наносит 1 повреждение целевому существу. (Подстегнутое существо не разворачивается во время вашего следующего шага разворота.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'«Все здесь — опытные воители. Мы ответим единственным известным нам способом».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432372&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e700e633-d091-481b-a782-f150a11645ef\', \'multiverseId\': 432372}, \'multiverseid\': 432372}, {\'name\': \'狂热致痛师\', \'text\': \'{T}：狂热致痛师对目标牌手造成1点伤害。\\n{T}，耗竭狂热致痛师：它对目标生物造成1点伤害。（已耗竭的生物于你的下一个重置步骤中不能重置。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「这里每个人都是百炼成钢的战士。我们会以自己掌握的唯一手段作出回应。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2dbb865a-bf48-4d64-908b-44a1cc95c5bb\', \'multiverseId\': 432571}, \'multiverseid\': 432571}, {\'name\': \'狂熱致痛師\', \'text\': \'{T}：狂熱致痛師對目標玩家造成1點傷害。\\n{T}，耗竭狂熱致痛師：它對目標生物造成1點傷害。（已耗竭的生物於你的下一個重置步驟中不能重置。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／魔法師\', \'flavor\': \'「這裡每個人都是百煉成鋼的戰士。我們會以自己掌握的唯一手段作出回應。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432770&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d27983ff-c7aa-4e67-9f85-b5681d214e04\', \'multiverseId\': 432770}, \'multiverseid\': 432770}]', '[{\'name\': \'Inferno-Strahl\', \'text\': \'Der Inferno-Strahl fügt einem Gegner deiner Wahl 6 Schadenspunkte zu.\\nUmwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn die ganze Welt verrückt spielt, ist es schön zu wissen, dass es noch Dinge gibt, auf die man sich verlassen kann."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=430987&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60d88070-96df-4883-a424-fdcccb018f24\', \'multiverseId\': 430987}, \'multiverseid\': 430987}, {\'name\': \'Llamas propulsoras\', \'text\': \'Las Llamas propulsoras hacen 6 puntos de daño al oponente objetivo.\\nCiclo {2}. ({2}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Cuando el mundo entero se vuelve loco, es importante encontrar algo en lo que puedes confiar".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431186&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'232b8dbd-fd6d-4cb8-8f1c-330444f80e99\', \'multiverseId\': 431186}, \'multiverseid\': 431186}, {\'name\': \'Jet de la fournaise\', \'text\': \'Le Jet de la fournaise inflige 6 blessures à un adversaire ciblé.\\nRecyclage {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Quand le monde entier devient fou, il est important de trouver une chose sur laquelle compter. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431385&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'719fb082-ee53-4fec-aa13-e2bfe662ffa7\', \'multiverseId\': 431385}, \'multiverseid\': 431385}, {\'name\': \'Getto Infernale\', \'text\': \'Il Getto Infernale infligge 6 danni a un avversario bersaglio.\\nCiclo {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando il mondo impazzisce, è importante trovare qualcosa su cui poter fare affidamento."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431584&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd90a661-2e21-4567-af5a-cc9c102276ef\', \'multiverseId\': 431584}, \'multiverseid\': 431584}, {\'name\': \'業火の噴流\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人を対象とする。業火の噴流はそのプレイヤーに６点のダメージを与える。\\nサイクリング{2}（{2}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「世界全体がおかしくなってる。何か信頼できるものをみつけなくちゃ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431783&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fc97d8e-528d-4580-8a6c-1847e297dbf9\', \'multiverseId\': 431783}, \'multiverseid\': 431783}, {\'name\': \'지옥불 분출\', \'text\': \'상대를 목표로 정한다. 지옥불 분출은 그 상대에게 피해 6점을 입힌다.\\n순환 {2} ({2}, 이 카드를 버린다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"온 세상이 광기로 뒤덮였을 때에는 뭔가 믿을 만한 걸 찾는 게 중요하지."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431982&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38dd788c-5602-41b7-a533-ec479d1909e5\', \'multiverseId\': 431982}, \'multiverseid\': 431982}, {\'name\': \'Jato Infernal\', \'text\': \'Jato Infernal causa 6 pontos de dano ao oponente alvo.\\nReciclar {2} ({2}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando o mundo todo está louco, é importante achar alguma coisa em que se possa confiar."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432181&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5eca2391-ccb2-4042-9a40-28ae32866da2\', \'multiverseId\': 432181}, \'multiverseid\': 432181}, {\'name\': \'Струя Пламени\', \'text\': \'Струя Пламени наносит 6 повреждений целевому оппоненту.\\nЦикл {2} ({2}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Когда весь мир сошел с ума, важно найти что-то, на что ты сможешь положиться».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432380&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d1f5812-d2db-451a-9c80-01d03856ccba\', \'multiverseId\': 432380}, \'multiverseid\': 432380}, {\'name\': \'狱火飞射\', \'text\': \'狱火飞射向目标对手造成6点伤害。\\n循环{2}（{2}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「整个世界都陷入疯狂之时，找到能够仰仗的东西就显得十分重要。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432579&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f59a8247-bb19-4ec1-94b7-12a65d4ee30c\', \'multiverseId\': 432579}, \'multiverseid\': 432579}, {\'name\': \'獄火飛射\', \'text\': \'獄火飛射向目標對手造成6點傷害。\\n循環{2}（{2}，棄掉此牌：抽一張牌。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「整個世界都陷入瘋狂之時，找到能夠仰仗的東西就顯得十分重要。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432778&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e13d99ef-5341-49ff-8d0f-ea3e33a8ddb8\', \'multiverseId\': 432778}, \'multiverseid\': 432778}]', "[{'name': 'Insel', 'type': 'Standardland — Insel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431074&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c2549ba0-a945-4b2b-9e23-630544135849', 'multiverseId': 431074}, 'multiverseid': 431074}, {'name': 'Isla', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Isla', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431273&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9127658b-4c81-42f1-9c97-72621204b896', 'multiverseId': 431273}, 'multiverseid': 431273}, {'name': 'Île', 'type': 'Terrain de base : île', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431472&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'daf98428-ebd7-4f22-9b80-c537eb07cbd9', 'multiverseId': 431472}, 'multiverseid': 431472}, {'name': 'Isola', 'type': 'Terra Base — Isola', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431671&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '69041798-30cd-468b-8f97-cce268505c68', 'multiverseId': 431671}, 'multiverseid': 431671}, {'name': '島', 'type': '基本土地 — 島', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=431870&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '32d48572-479c-478b-9c80-b57d31db7afc', 'multiverseId': 431870}, 'multiverseid': 431870}, {'name': '섬', 'type': '기본 대지 — 섬', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=432069&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a5a1bfa3-dc52-4e24-a59f-f394df6dd206', 'multiverseId': 432069}, 'multiverseid': 432069}, {'name': 'Ilha', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Ilha', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?mul